-- SKquests: traducción al español de la guía (generada por reglas)
-- Los nombres de quest se mantienen en inglés para poder identificarlas in-game.
SKquests_GuideES = { Alliance = {}, Horde = {} }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[1] = {title = [[Human - Northshire Abbey]], text = [[
01) Justo afuera de Northshire Abbey's entrance, de Deputy Willem, entrega "Brotherhood of Thieves" 48.44.  Acepta "Milly Osworth" y "Bounty on Garrick Padfoot".
02) Justo afuera de Northshire Abbey asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en 47.42.
03) Entra en Echo Ridge Mine al norte (entrada en 48.32) y haz "Skirmish at Echo Ridge": mata Kobold Laborers.
04) Ve a the NE afuera of Northshire Abbey (junto a establos/carreta) y entrega "Milly Osworth" 51.39, acepta "Milly's Harvest".
05) Ve al este cruzando el río hacia Northshire Vineyards alrededor de 54.49 y haz "Milly's Harvest": lootea Milly's Harvest (cajas) del suelo alrededor de la granja.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
06) Justo al este de the Northshire Vineyards do "Bounty on Garrick Padfoot": mata y lootea a Garrick Padfoot /target (frente a shack, 57.48).
07) Asegúrate de ser nivel 5.  Muere a propósito y revive en el espíritu, luego ve a the NE afuera of Northshire Abbey (junto a establos/carreta) y entrega "Milly's Harvest" 51.39 (#4 on map), acepta "Grape Manifest".
08) Frente a Northshire Abbey's entrance, de Deputy Willem, entrega "Bounty on Garrick Padfoot" 48.44 (#1 on map).
09) Justo dentro de Northshire Abbey, entrega "Skirmish at Echo Ridge" 49.42.  Acepta "Report to Goldshire".
10) Gira a la derecha dentro de of Northshire Abbey, luego ve up a través de escalera de caracol entrance 50.41 hasta lo alto de the Abbey y entrega "Grape Manifest" 49.42.
11) Sal afuera of Northshire Abbey y asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en 47.42 (#2 on map).
12) Sal de Northshire Valley yendo hacia SW exit 47.48.
13) Frente a fuente del león, acepta "Rest and Relaxation" 46.48.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[2] = {title = [[11 Goldshire]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal sur to Goldshire y asegúrate de estar al menos a 325 XP away de nivel 6 (2,475 XP into lvl 5) para nuevas habilidades/hechizos (puedes farmear enemigos oeste de main path), luego ve a Goldshire y frente a refinería, entrega "Report to Goldshire" 42.66, acepta "The Fargodeep Mine".
02) Entra en Goldshire's Posada (entrada en 43.66).  Gira cerrado a la izquierda y acepta "Kobold Candles" 43.66.
03) Next to you at Innkeeper Farley 44.66, entrega "Rest and Relaxation".  Also make Goldshire your new home for your Hearthstone de the Innkeeper.  Make sure you are resupplied.
04) Get your nivel 6 spells/abilities at Goldshire.
05) If you have an extra silver to spare:  Upstairs en Posada y en middle room de the Physician 43.66, learn Apprentice First Aid.
06) On the sur side of Goldshire by the carreta, acepta "Gold Dust Exchange" 42.67.
07) Ve SW to The Stonefield Farm y junto a house, acepta "Lost Necklace" 34.84 y "Princess Must Die!" 35.84.  ALSO:  While de camino, start mata/looting boars to recoge  Chunk of Boar Meats (for a future misión), y don't sell them to a vendedor!
08) Ve este to The Maclure Vineyards y frente a barn entrega "Lost Necklace" 43.86, acepta "Pie for Billy".
09) Ve sur in The Maclure Vineyards y en small house, acepta "Young Lovers" 43.90.
10) Stop en vendedor /target 42.89 to get resupplied.  NOTE:  remember not to sell your Chunk of Boar Meats!
11) Ve oeste to The Stonefield Farm (watch out for lvl 9 bears) y junto a river entrega "Young Lovers" 30.86, acepta "Speak with Gramma".  ALSO:  While de camino, farmea on Boars to recoge 4 Chunk of Boar Meats (for a future misión), y don't sell them to a vendedor!
12) All alrededor de southern Elwynn Forest alrededor de 33.85 do "Pie for Billy": mata y lootea a Boars.  NOTE:  You may already have the 4 Chunk of Boar Meats by grinding previously!
13) At the small house in The Stonefield Farm, junto a well (35.84, #7 on map), entrega "Pie for Billy", acepta "Back to Billy".
14) In the small house este in The Stonefield Farm, entrega "Speak with Gramma" (35.84, #7 on map), acepta "Note to William".
15) Ve este to The Maclure Vineyards y frente a barn entrega "Back to Billy" (43.86, #8 on map), acepta "Goldtooth".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[3] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) Ve NW to Fargodeep Mine y take the upper mine entrance 39.82.  Keep hugging the left side of la mina until you get to Goldtooth /target 42.78 y mata y lootea a him for "Goldtooth".  Luego make sure "Gold Dust Exchange" along with "Kobold Candles" is finished by mata/looting the Kobolds dentro de or afuera la mina.
02) Exit la mina exit 39.82, luego ve entrega "Goldtooth" 35.84.
03) Vendor, 2a) Stop en Fruit Seller /target 34.83 to sell your junk.
04) Farmea your way back to Goldshire, asegúrate de estar al menos a 2,680 XP into nivel 7 before getting there.  Luego by the carreta, entrega "Gold Dust Exchange" 42.67, acepta "A Fishy Peril".
05) Frente a refinería, entrega "The Fargodeep Mine" 42.66, acepta "The Jasperlode Mine".  And entrega "A Fishy Peril", acepta "Further Concerns".
06) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied (en refinería) 42.66.
07) In the Posada, cerca de entrance, entrega "Kobold Candles" 43.66, acepta "Shipment to Stormwind".  Also entrega "Note to William", acepta "Collecting Kelp".
08) First Aid? 6a) It's wise now to make sure you get Apprentice First Aid if you haven't yet:  Ve upstairs en Posada y en middle room de the Physician 43.66, learn Apprentice First Aid.
09) Get your nivel 8 spells/abilities at Goldshire.
10) Ve este a bit to Crystal Lake alrededor de 56.69 y haz "Collecting Kelp": mata y lootea a the murlocs alrededor de el lago.  TIP: Avoid going hacia el islands in el lago, stay alrededor de the perimeter of el lago for easy spaced out targets.
11) Ve NE y entra en Jasperlode Mine (entrada en 62.53) y haz "The Jasperlode Mine": work your way into la mina until you get it scouted.
12) Ve SE to el puente where the main path y el río meet y luego entrega "Further Concerns" 74.72, acepta "Find the Lost Guards" y "Protect the Frontier".
13) Ve NE a bit to Eastvale Logging Camp en small house y acepta "Red Linen Goods" 80.69.
14) NE a bit more, junto a carreta, acepta "A Bundle of Trouble" 81.66.
15) Just este, you can ve a the Bowyer 83.66 to get repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[4] = {title = [[Alliance - Westfall]], text = [[
01) Ve just norte of Eastvale Logging Camp alrededor de 80.61 y start working on "Protect the Frontier" y "A Bundle of Trouble": mata Prowlers (wolves) y Young Forest Bears.  Also lootea the Bundle of Wood alrededor de the trees.  Work your way hacia el next paso:
02) Farmea NW hacia el shore y click on A half-eaten body 73.60 to entrega "Find the Lost Guards", acepta "Discover Rolf's Fate".
03) Ve NE junto a murloc camp (watch out para multiple murlocs) y click on Rolf's corpse 80.55 to entrega "Discover Rolf's Fate", acepta "Report to Thomas".
04) Make sure "A Bundle of Trouble" is finished by looting the Bundle of Wood alrededor de the trees norte of Eastvale Logging Camp.  Also finish "Protect the Frontier" by killing Prowlers (wolves, #1 on map) y Young Forest Bears.
05) Ve a the middle of Eastvale Logging Camp, junto a carreta y entrega "A Bundle of Trouble" 81.66.
06) You can go este a bit hacia el Bowyer 83.66 to get repaired/resupplied.
07) Ve a where the main path y el río meets 74.72 y entrega "Protect the Frontier" y "Report to Thomas", acepta "Deliver Thomas' Report".  Also acepta "Report to Gryan Stoutmantle".
08) Ve SW to Brackwell Pumpkin Patch alrededor de 70.79 y haz "Red Linen Goods": mata y lootea a the Defias enemigos para bandanas alrededor de la granja.  NOTE:  Any de Defias enemigos has a very low chance to drop an item called Westfall Deed, which starts "Furlbrow's Deed" (acepta it if you are able to find it).  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
09) At Brackwell Pumpkin Patch, attempt "Princess Must Die!": try to mata y lootea a Princess /target.  This lvl 9 boar patrols alrededor de la granja y has two lvl 7 bodyguards.  TIPS: If you can get help cerca de by, do so.  You can usa el/la fences to jump alrededor de them as the boars will keep running alrededor de them.  If you did not succeed, you will be able to solo this later.  Don't worry about dying because that is what we will want to do next anyways.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[5] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) At the small house at Eastvale Logging Camp, entrega "Red Linen Goods" 79.69.
02) Usa la piedra de hogar a Goldshire.
03) In the Posada, cerca de entrance, entrega "Collecting Kelp" 43.66.  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "The Escape".
04) Justo afuera de the Posada, frente a refinería 42.66, entrega "The Jasperlode Mine" y "Deliver Thomas' Report", acepta "Cloth and Leather Armor".  Also acepta "Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!".
05) Entra en refinería junto a you y acepta "Elmore's Task" 42.66.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
06) Ve sur to The Maclure Vineyards y en small house, entrega "The Escape" 43.90.
07) Ve oeste to The Stonefield Farm y frente a small house, entrega (if you did it) "Princess Must Die!" 35.84.
08) Ve NW to Westbrook Garrison y frente a garrison's entrance, de the Wanted Poster 25.75, acepta "Wanted:  "Hogger".
09) Next to you, turn in "Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!" 24.74, accept "Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[6] = {title = [[11 Westfall + Stormwind]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal oeste to entra en Westfall, y just off to your right junto a carreta, entrega (if you have it) "Furlbrow's Deed" (60.19 in Westfall).  Next to you, acepta "Westfall Stew".
02) Sigue el camino principal sur y off to your right entra en house at Saldean's Farm y entrega "Westfall Stew" 56.30, SKIP the next part.
03) Ve sur to Sentinel Hill at la torre y entrega "Report to Gryan Stoutmantle" 56.47, SKIP "The People's Militia".
04) Back dentro de tower, acepta "A Swift Message" 57.47.
05) Justo al sur de la torre, en Gryphon Master 57.53, entrega "A Swift Message", acepta "Continue to Stormwind".  Luego take a flight to Stormwind, Elwynn.
06) In Stormwind, ve a Old Town y en Limited Immunity, entrega "Continue to Stormwind" 77.61, acepta "Dungar Longdrink".
07) Near la entrada in Stormwind, entra en Pestle's Apothecary y entrega "Shipment to Stormwind" 63.74.
08) Slightly norte, you can go in Weller's Arsenal y de the Weapon Master 64.69, you can learn new weapon possibilities if you can afford to.
09) Ve este hacia el Gryphon Master 71.73 in Stormwind y entrega "Dungar Longdrink", acepta "Return to Lewis".  Luego vuela a Sentinel Hill, Westfall.
10) In Westfall, go norte a bit dentro de tower y entrega "Return to Lewis" (57.47, #3 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[7] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) 12 Elwynn Forest
02) Ve a Forest's Edge alrededor de 27.86 y haz "Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty": mata y lootea a Riverpaw gnolls.  NOTES:  While doing this misión any de gnolls has a very small chance of dropping an item called Gold Pickup Schedule, which starts "The Collector", acepta it if you are able to find it.  A rare mob named Gruff Swiftbite /target has a 100% drop rate for that item, so keep an eye out for him.  Also, while doing this misión you can recolecta a group y luego work your way to do the next misión:
03) If you have a group you can try to do "Wanted:  "Hogger": kill/loot Hogger /target (lvl 11 Elite gnoll).  If you don't have a group, you can attempt to solo him if you dare, if not it can be skipped.
04) Go north to Westbrook Garrison and in front of the entrance, turn in "Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty" 24.74.
05) Die on purpose (res at spirit) to get back to Goldshire and in front of the refinery 42.66, turn in (if you have it) "The Collector" and (if you did it) "Wanted:  "Hogger".  If it's available, acepta "Manhunt".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied en refinería.
06) Ve este en main path y at el puente/river acepta "Bounty on Murlocs" 74.72.
07) Do (if you have it) "Manhunt": go SW to Brackwell Pumpkin Patch y en small house mata y lootea a Morgan the Collector 71.81.  ALSO:  If you haven't yet, at Brackwell Pumpkin Patch you can try to do "Princess Must Die!": mata y lootea a Princess /target.  This lvl 9 boar patrols alrededor de la granja y has two lvl 7 bodyguards.  Try to team up with someone en area if you can or you can try to solo it.  If you can't do it, luego skip it.
08) Do "Bounty on Murlocs": mata y lootea a Murlocs along la costa of el río sur running through Elwynn Forest alrededor de 70.84.
09) Vuelve a el puente where the main path y el río meet y entrega "Bounty on Murlocs" (74.72, #5 on map).
10) Ve NE to Eastvale Logging Camp y en small house entrega "Cloth and Leather Armor" 80.69.
11) Sigue el camino principal este into Redridge Mountains (94.72 in Elwynn Forest).
12) Sigue el camino principal este y en first intersection, acepta "Encroaching Gnolls" (15.71 in Redridge).
13) Ve NE y on your left before el puente entrega "Encroaching Gnolls" 31.60, acepta "Assessing the Threat".
14) Next to you, get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master 31.59.
15) If you need to entrega either "Manhunt" or "Princess Must Die!" luego Usa la piedra de hogar a Goldshire.  If you cannot hearth luego vuela a Stormwind, drop en water to die on purpose, y res at spirit to get back to Goldshire.  If you DONT need to entrega either of those misiones luego just vuela a Stormwind, Elwynn y skip hacia el next section below.
16) Upgrade First Aid en Posada (if you need to), luego exit the Posada, y frente a refinería entrega "Manhunt" (42.66, #4 on map).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
17) If you did "Princess Must Die!", go SW to The Stonefield Farm y frente a small house 35.84, turn it in.  Afterwards go este a bit y die on purpose hacia el kobolds alrededor de 37.83, luego res at spirit.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[8] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) 12 Ironforge + Dun Morogh
02) If you still have any de following misiones in your questbook, they can be Abandoned:  "Wanted: "Hogger" and "Princess Must Die!".
03) Go north to enter Stormwind, then go to the Dwarven District and turn in "Elmore's Task" 60.34.  Accept "Stormpike's Delivery".
04) Go NE in the Dwarven District to enter the Deeprun Tram 69.31.  Then wait for the tram ride to show up and it will take you to Ironforge's side of the Deeprun Tram.
05) Once at the other side of the Deeprun Tram, accept "Deeprun Rat Roundup" (this is accepted between the two Tram tracks).
06) Just around the immediate area do "Deeprun Rat Roundup": use the Rat Catcher's Flute quest item on the Deeprun Rats.
07) Go back between the two tracks at the Deeprun Tram, and turn in "Deeprun Rat Roundup".  NOTE:  "Me Brother, Nipsy" will be skipped for now.
08) Exit the Deeprun Tram by heading north through the tunnel..
09) In the middle of Ironforge at The Great Forge, get the Flight Path there from the Gryphon Master 56.48.
10) First Aid? 08a) You can upgrade First Aid up in Ironforge Physician, entrance at 55.57.
11) Go SW to leave Ironforge (exit at 15.86).
12) In Dun Morogh, follow the main path east to Gol'Bolar Quarry and accept "The Public Servant" 69.56.
13) Next to you, behind the tent, accept "Those Blasted Troggs!" 69.56.
14) Drop down in the Quarry and enter the mine (entrance at 71.56) and do "The Public Servant" along with "Those Blasted Troggs!": kill Rockjaw Skullthumpers and Rockjaw Bonesnappers (only in mine).  Focus inside the mine more, as both of the these mobs are found in there.
15) Go back up and turn in "The Public Servant" (69.56, #10 on map).
16) Next to you, behind the tent, turn in "Those Blasted Troggs!" 69.56.
17) Sigue el camino principal este to entra en Loch Modan (entrada en 86.51)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[9] = {title = [[Alliance - Loch Modan]], text = [[
01) 13 Loch Modan
02) Once you entra en Loch Modan you will arrive at Valley of Kings, y frente a watchtower, acepta "In Defense of the King's Lands" (22.73 in Loch Modan).
03) Ve up en watchtower frente a you y acepta "The Trogg Threat" 23.74.
04) Sigue el camino principal NE, luego make a right to ve a Stonesplinter Valley alrededor de 32.73 y haz "In Defense of the King's Lands" along with "The Trogg Threat": mata 10 Stonesplinter Troggs y 10 Stonesplinter Scouts, y lootea them para Stone Tooth.
05) Vuelve oeste to Valley of Kings y entrega "In Defense of the King's Lands" (22.73, #1 on map).
06) Ve up en watchtower y entrega "The Trogg Threat" 23.74.
07) Ve norte to Thelsamar alrededor de 34.48 y find Mountaineer Kadrell /target (he patrols alrededor de town) y acepta "Rat Catching" y "Mountaineer Stormpike's Task".
08) Entra en Posada (the building con big barriles alrededor de it) y the first NPC you see (Innkeeper Hearthstove, 35.48), talk to him to make this Posada your new home.
09) At the bar, de Vidra Hearthstove, acepta "Thelsamar Blood Sausages" 35.49.  Make sure you are resupplied.  If you need 6 slot bags, you can purchase them de the General Supplies vendedor en Posada (if you can afford them).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[10] = {title = [[Alliance - Loch Modan]], text = [[
01) While working your way norte hacia el next pasos, also start working on "Rat Catching" by mata/looting Tunnel Rat enemigos (kobolds) along the oeste side de main path (#3 on map).  Also start working on "Thelsamar Blood Sausages" by killing boars, bears y spiders (en open fields of Loch Modan, #1 on map):
02) Farmea norte to Algaz Station, go up en watchtower y entrega "Stormpike's Delivery".  And entrega "Mountaineer Stormpike's Task" 25.18, acepta "Stormpike's Order".  Acepta "Filthy Paws".  NOTE:  You can get repaired/resupplied al fondo de the watchtower but do not sell your "Thelsamar Blood Sausages" misión items to a vendedor!
03) Ve este to Silver Stream Mine alrededor de 35.19 y finish "Rat Catching": mata y lootea a the Tunnel Rat enemigos (kobolds) afuera of la mina.  And if you have a group, do "Filthy Paws": lootea the Miner's League Crates dentro de mine.  You can skip the misión if you cannot get a group (but keep it accepted, as you will be able to solo it later).
04) If you did "Filthy Paws " go oeste y entrega up en watchtower at Algaz Station, (25.18, #2 on map).
05) Finish "Thelsamar Blood Sausages": mata boars, bears y spiders (en open fields of Loch Modan, #1 on map).
06) Hearth (if you can) to Stoutlager Posada (Thelsamar) y en Posada en bar, entrega "Thelsamar Blood Sausages" 35.49.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) In Thelsamar, find Mountaineer Kadrell /target (he patrols back y forth en town alrededor de 34.48) y entrega "Rat Catching".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[11] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) You should be nivel 12 now, if not farmea to it.
02) Sur en town, ve a the Gryphon Master 34.51 y take a flight to Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
03) Get your nivel 12/14 spells/abilities.
04) You can upgrade First Aid upstairs en Ironforge Physician 55.58..
05) If you can afford to, you can learn new weapon possibilities sur en two Weapon Masters dentro de Timberline Arms 62.89.
06) WOTLK, 10a) Ve a través de Deeprun Tram 77.51.
07) WOTLK, 10b) Luego take one de two Deeprun Trams to take you to Stormwind City...
08) WOTLK, 10c) Once you arrive en other side de Deeprun Tram, go norte a través de tunnel to get into Stormwind City.
09) WOTLK, 10d) At Stormwind City, ve a Stormwind Harbor y get en boat 23.56 to take you to Darkshore.
10) Once at Auberdine, follow the docks este, y on your right acepta "For Love Eternal" (en dock, 36.44).
11) Continue este en dock hacia the Posada, but go upstairs y acepta "Buzzbox 827" 37.44.
12) Justo al sur de the Posada, go up en platform y de the Hippogryph Master (36.46 in Darkshore), get the Flight Path.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[12] = {title = [[Night Elf]], text = [[
01) 6 Shadowglen (Teldrassil)
02) First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!!
03) Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, WotLK, or SoM)
04) Frente a you de Conservator Ilthalaine, acepta "The Balance of Nature" 59.45.
05) Start working on "The Balance of Nature": mata Young Nightsabers y Young Thistle Boars alrededor de the immediate area.  Work your way hacia el next pasos while doing this:
06) Ve este to la entrada of Aldrassil y acepta "The Woodland Protector" 60.42.
07) Near where you started de, en Dryad Tarindrella, entrega "The Woodland Protector" 58.45, acepta the next part.
08) Ve just oeste hacia el Grell camps alrededor de 56.46 y haz "The Woodland Protector": mata y lootea a Grell y Grellkin.
09) Back en Dryad Tarindrella, entrega "The Woodland Protector" (58.45 #4 on map).
10) Make sure "The Balance of Nature" is finished, luego turn it in (en starting spot 59.45, #1 on map).  Acepta "The Balance of Nature" (Part2).
11) Ve cerca de entrance of Aldrassil, junto a Cauldron y acepta "A Good Friend" 61.42.
12) Ve in Aldrassil to get repaired/resupplied 59.41.
13) Ve a the oeste side of Aldrassil al fondo de the ramp entrance y acepta "Webwood Venom" 58.42.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[13] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Farmea NW to Iverron (sitting between some mountains) y entrega "A Good Friend" 55.33, acepta "A Friend in Need".
02) Justo al este de you, do "Webwood Venom": mata y lootea a Webwood Spiders.  A lot of spiders can be found afuera of la cueva y more dentro de 57.32.
03) All alrededor de the norte side of Shadowglen, do "The Balance of Nature": mata Mangy Nightsabers y Thistle Boars.
04) Die on purpose, luego res at Spirit Healer.
05) Ve sur hacia el starting spot y de Conservator Ilthalaine, entrega "The Balance of Nature" 59.45.
06) Ve este cerca de entrance of Aldrassil, junto a Cauldron y entrega "A Friend in Need" 61.42, acepta "Iverron's Antidote".
07) Ve in Aldrassil to get repaired/resupplied 59.41.
08) Ve a the oeste side of Aldrassil al fondo de the ramp entrance y entrega "Webwood Venom" 58.42, acepta "Webwood Egg".
09) Ve oeste hacia el Grellkin camp alrededor de 55.39 y haz part of "Iverron's Antidote": mata y lootea a Grellkin or Grell para Hyacinth Mushrooms.  NOTES:   You can also find these de Hyacinth Mushroom objects alrededor de the trees & mountains all alrededor de Shadowglen, but focus on mata/looting the Grellkin for faster leveling.
10) Ve este hacia el two small ponds alrededor de 58.38 y haz part of "Iverron's Antidote": lootea the Moonpetal Lily (yellow flowers) alrededor de the ponds.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[14] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Ve NW to Shadowthread Cave entrance 57.32 y haz "Webwood Egg" along with finishing "Iverron's Antidote": mata y lootea a the spiders while working your way NW in la cueva to eventually lootea a Webwood Egg.
02) Usa your Hearthstone to usa la piedra de hogar a the starting spot.
03) Ve este cerca de entrance of Aldrassil, junto a Cauldron y entrega "Iverron's Antidote" 61.42, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  Work somewhat quickly to do the next pasos as this misión is on a 5 min timer.
04) Ve in Aldrassil to get repaired/resupplied 59.41.
05) Ve a the oeste side of Aldrassil al fondo de the ramp entrance y entrega "Webwood Egg" 58.42.  Acepta "Tenaron's Summons".
06) Sube por ramp junto a you, hacia el very top y luego entrega "Tenaron's Summons" 59.39, acepta "Crown of the Earth".
07) Ve NW to Iverron (sitting between some mountains) y entrega "Iverron's Antidote" 55.33.
08) Ve este hacia el Moonwell 60.33 y haz "Crown of the Earth": usa el/la Crystal Phial misión item en Moonwell.
09) Die on purpose, luego res at Spirt Healer.
10) Ve hasta lo alto de Aldrassil (ramp entrada en 58.41, #5 on map) y entrega "Crown of the Earth", acepta the next part.
11) Sigue el camino principal sur to sal de Shadowglen y de camino out, acepta "Dolanaar Delivery" 61.48.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[15] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) 10 Dolanaar
02) Sigue el camino principal to Dolanaar y de camino there, off to your right, de Zenn Foulhoof, acepta "Zenn's Bidding" 60.56.
03) Keep going oeste to Dolanaar y asegúrate de estar al menos a 340 XP away de nivel 6 before getting there para nuevas habilidades/hechizos.  Once at Dolanaar, al fondo de la torre entrance, acepta "Denalan's Earth" 56.58.
04) Just up the ramp, acepta "A Troubling Breeze" 56.57.
05) If you have 6 or more silver:  Just dentro de tower, de the First Aid Trainer 55.57, learn Apprentice First Aid.  NOTE:  If not, you will want to make sure you save your money for spells/abilities which is more important.
06) Next to you, sube por ramp hacia el very top of la torre y acepta "Twisted Hatred" y "The Emerald Dreamcatcher" 55.57.
07) Drop down y entra en Posada to get repaired/resupplied 56.59.
08) Sube por ramp hacia el Innkeeper y entrega "Dolanaar Delivery" 56.60.  Also make Dolanaar your new home for your piedra de hogar.
09) Ve sur in Dolanaar hacia el Moonwell y entrega "Crown of the Earth" 56.62, acepta the next part.   NOTE:  If you are already lvl 6 right now, luego do the next paso first before doing this!
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[16] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Ve SE hacia el small camp at Lake Al'Ameth y entrega "Denalan's Earth" 61.68.  Acepta "Timberling Seeds" y "Timberling Sprouts".
02) All alrededor de Lake Al'Ameth do "Timberling Seeds" along with "Timberling Sprouts": mata y lootea a Timberling enemigos y also lootea the Timberling Sprouts en ground.
03) Vuelve a the small camp at Lake Al'Ameth y entrega "Timberling Seeds" (61.68, #1 on map), acepta "Rellian Greenspyre".  Also entrega "Timberling Sprouts".
04) Start working on "Zenn's Bidding": mata y lootea a nightsabers (cats), spiders y owls.  While working on this, work your way hacia el next pasos:
05) Ve NE hacia el Moonwell at Starbreeze Village y haz "Crown of the Earth": usa el/la Jade Phial misión item en Moonwell 63.58.
06) Sigue el camino este y go up en first building on your right y entrega "A Troubling Breeze" 66.59, acepta "Gnarlpine Corruption".
07) Entra en este most building at Starbreeze Village y haz "The Emerald Dreamcatcher": lootea Tallonkai's Dresser 68.60.
08) Finish "Zenn's Bidding": mata y lootea a nightsabers (cats), spiders y owls alrededor de the open fields of Teldrassil (#4 on map).
09) Ve a Zenn Foulhoof norte de main path between Dolanaar y Starbreeze Village y entrega "Zenn's Bidding" 60.56.  NOTE:  Make sure you save the misión reward item for later, do not sell it to a vendedor!
10) Ve oeste to Dolanaar y al fondo de la torre entrance, acepta "Seek Redemption!" 56.58.  NOTE:  Save any Small Spider Legs you have as you will use them for a later misión.
11) Just up the ramp, entrega "Gnarlpine Corruption" 56.57,
12) First Aid? 11b) If you have 6 or more silver (y haven't yet):  Just dentro de tower, de the First Aid Trainer 55.57, learn Apprentice First Aid.  NOTE:  You can also get resupplied in la torre.  You will want to make sure you save your money for spells/abilities which is more important.
13) Ve sur en Posada to get repaired/resupplied 56.59.
14) Ve sur in Dolanaar hacia el Moonwell y entrega "Crown of the Earth" 56.62, acepta the next part.
15) Justo al este de you en Cauldron, Learn Apprentice Cook de the Cook 57.61.  Luego acepta "Recipe of the Kaldorei" (cooking misión).  Luego as you are doing the next sections start working on this by mata/looting any spiders por el camino y haz not sell the Small Spider Legs to a vendedor.  Also turn this in once you get all the legs.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[17] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Do "Seek Redemption!": lootea 3 Fel Cones.  These are found alrededor de the trees of Teldrassil.  See map for locations.
02) Ve norte de main path between Dolanaar y Starbreeze Village at Zenn Foulhoof 60.56 y entrega "Seek Redemption!".
03) If you happen to have a group, continue on con next pasos (even if you are lvl 7).  If you are going solo, asegúrate de ser nivel 8 before proceeding, farmea on any enemigos en immediate area to nivel 8.
04) Ve a Dolanaar y en Posada, get repaired/resupplied 56.59.
05) If you are nivel 8, get new spells/abilities at your class entrenador (if you haven't yet).
06) Ve just norte to Fel Rock (cueva entrada en 55.52), entra en la cueva y haz "Twisted Hatred": keep hugging the right side of la cueva y luego make a left after el río, luego see if Lord Melenas /target 52.50 (an orange satyr) is standing en edge y mata y lootea a him.  If he is not there, continue hugging the right side of la cueva y you will eventually get to him.  This mob can be hard to solo so be prepared.  Usa el/la Severed Voodoo Claw to help you mata him.  If you cannot do it, luego skip it.  Luego exit la cueva yendo hacia SE.
07) Ve a the bottom de tree tower at Dolanaar 55.57 to get resupplied at Danlyia, luego ve up hasta lo alto de la torre y entrega "Twisted Hatred" y "The Emerald Dreamcatcher", acepta "Ferocitas the Dream Eater".
08) Ve NE of Starbreeze Village y haz "Ferocitas the Dream Eater": mata 7 Gnarlpine Mystics y mata y lootea a Ferocitas the Dream Eater (grey color furblog at 69.53), luego lootea the Gnarlpine Necklace that drops (in your inventory).
09) Usa la piedra de hogar a Dolanaar.
10) In the Posada, get repaired/resupplied y get lvl 8 spells/abilities if you haven't yet.
11) Ve hasta lo alto de the tree tower at Dolanaar 55.57 (#7 on map) y entrega "Ferocitas the Dream Eater".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[18] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #06]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal oeste until you corre into 3 nightelfs on their mounts (no further than 50.54), y de Moon Priestess Amara, acepta "The Road to Darnassus".
02) Drop down to Ban'ethil Hollow alrededor de 47.53 y haz "The Road to Darnassus": mata 6 Gnarlpine Ambushers.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[19] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Ve SW hacia el Pools of Arlithrien y haz "Crown of the Earth": usa el/la Tourmaline Phial misión item en Moonwell there 42.67.
02) SoM/WotLK, 1a) Ve sur to Gnarlpine Hold y de the Strange Fruited Plant 43.76, acepta "The Glowing Fruit".
03) Farmea your way back hacia Dolanaar y asegúrate de estar al menos a 4,250 XP into lvl 9 before doing the next pasos (or 5,050 into lvl 9 if you didn't do the Den).  You can farmea on Furblogs just oeste of Dolanaar, or any enemigos en open fields of Teldrassil.
04) Ve norte hacia el main path until you corre into 3 nightelfs on their mounts (no further oeste than 50.54), y de Moon Priestess Amara, entrega "The Road to Darnassus".
05) 
06) Ve sur to Dolanaar's Posada to get repaired/resupplied 56.59.
07) Sur en Moonwell at Dolanaar, entrega "Crown of the Earth" 56.62, acepta the next part.
08) You should be nivel 10 right now, if not farmea to it.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[20] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) 12 Teldrassil
02) N/A
03) N/A
04) In western Teldrassil, follow the main path norte to The Oracle Glade y en end of el camino, off to your right, acepta "The Enchanted Glade" (junto a Moonwell, 38.34 in Teldrassil).
05) Next to you, do "Crown of the Earth": usa el/la Amethyst Phial misión item en Moonwell there.
06) As you do the following pasos start working on "Tumors" by mata/looting the Timberling enemigos (#6 on map):
07) Ve este past el río y see if Blackmoss the Fetid /target is there (a lvl 13 rare at alrededor de 44.30 with a 2 hour respawn) y try to mata y lootea a this mob. He drops an item, which starts "The Moss-twined Heart", acepta it.  This elemental could also be NW of el río también (at alrededor de 43.27).  NOTE:  If you cannot find him, luego my guide will remind you later to try again.
08) Ve norte y haz "Tears of the Moon": mata y lootea a Lady Sathrah /target (lvl 12 grey spider, has 2 spawn locations (either este 48.25 or oeste 39.25, see map).
09) Just oeste at Wellspring River (alrededor de 43.28, #6 on map), finish "Tumors": mata y lootea a Timberling enemigos.
10) Ve oeste y de the Strange Fronded Plant (glowing red tree, 35.29), acepta "The Shimmering Frond".
11) In the immediate area do "The Enchanted Glade": mata y lootea a the Bloodfeather harpies.  While doing this, work your way hacia el next paso:
12) Back en harpy camp there is a black panther named Mist 32.32 that starts an escolta a misión "Mist", acepta it.
13) Make sure "The Enchanted Glade" is finished, luego lead Mist hacia el Moonwell at The Oracle Glade (38.34, #4 on map) y luego entrega "The Enchanted Glade" y "Mist".  Acepta "Teldrassil".
14) If you need to, check again to see if Blackmoss the Fetid /target is there (a lvl 13 rare at alrededor de 44.30 or alrededor de 43.27 #7 on map).  Try to mata y lootea a this mob, he drops an item, which starts "The Moss-twined Heart", acepta it.  NOTES:  This mob has a 2 hour respawn, if you cannot mata him, luego it can be skipped.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[21] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste de main path at The Oracle Glade alrededor de 37.38, luego die on purpose to get to Darnassus.
02) In Darnassus, go NW to Cenarion Enclave y entrega "Tumors" (38.22 in Darnassus), acepta "Return to Denalan".
03) Sigue el camino straight forward y go up en tree tower y entrega "Teldrassil" 35.9, acepta "Grove of the Ancients".
04) Ve sur in Darnassus to entra en Temple de Moon, sube por ramp, luego entrega "Tears of the Moon" 37.86, acepta "Sathrah's Sacrifice".
05) Next to you, do "Sathrah's Sacrifice": drop down y usa el/la Sathrah's Sacrifice misión item en fuente en middle de temple.
06) Vuelve up the ramp en Temple de Moon y entrega "Sathrah's Sacrifice" (37.86, #4 on map).
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Dolanaar.
08) In the Posada, get repaired/resupplied.
09) N/A
10) Ve sur hacia el Moonwell at Dolanaar y entrega "Crown of the Earth" 56.62, acepta the next part.  Also entrega "Recipe of the Kaldorei" en Cook 57.61 if its finished.  If you turned nivel 12, luego get new spells abilities.
11) Ve SE hacia el small camp at Lake Al'Ameth 61.68 y entrega (if you have it) "The Moss-twined Heart", acepta (if it's available) "Planting the Heart".
12) Next to you, click on Denalan's Planter to entrega (if you have it) "Planting the Heart" 61.69.
13) Also entrega "The Glowing Fruit", "The Shimmering Frond" y "Return to Denalan" 61.68, acepta "Oakenscowl".  Luego, junto a you, click en Sprouted Frond en planter to completa "The Sprouted Fronds".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[22] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste hacia el small cueva at Lake Al'Ameth y do "Oakenscowl": mata y lootea a Oakenscowl (lvl 9 at 54.75).
02) If you did "Oakenscowl", vuelve este hacia el small camp at Lake Al'Ameth y turn it in 61.68.
03) You should be nivel 12 by now, if not farmea on enemigos sur of Lake Al'Ameth until you are.  Luego die on purpose (or corre back) to Dolanaar to get new spells/abilities & repaired/resupplied.
04) First Aid? 3b) Just dentro de tower, upgrade First Aid de the First Aid Trainer 55.57.
05) Sigue el camino principal oeste y luego just past the blue bridge alrededor de 43.51, die on purpose to get to Darnassus quicker.
06) Ve NW in Darnassus y go up hasta lo alto de the tree tower y entrega "Crown of the Earth" 35.9.
07) Ve sur in Darnassus y entra en the red glowing teleporter 28.42.
08) Once at Rut'theran Village, baja por path y entrega "Nessa Shadowsong" (56.92 in Teldrassil), acepta "The Bounty of Teldrassil".
09) Ve este on el puente hacia el Hippogryph Master y entrega "The Bounty of Teldrassil" 58.94, acepta "Flight to Auberdine".  Luego take a ride to Auberdine, Darkshore.
10) Ve down en Posada at Auberdine y entrega "Flight to Auberdine" 37.44, acepta "Return to Nessa".
11) Vuelve up hacia el Hippogryph Master 36.46 at Auberdine y vuela a Rut'theran Village, Teldrassil.
12) Ve oeste past el puente a bit y entrega "Return to Nessa" (56.92 in Teldrassil).
13) Vuelve este on el puente hacia el Hippogryph Master 58.94 y vuela a Auberdine, Darkshore.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[23] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf]], text = [[
01) 6 Coldridge Valley (Dun Morogh)
02) First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!!
03) Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, WOTLK, or SoM)
04) Frente a you de Sten Stoutarm, acepta "Dwarven Outfitters" 30.72.
05) Just hacia el sur of you, do "Dwarven Outfitters": mata y lootea a wolves alrededor de 29.74.
06) Vendor, 2a) Vuelve a the starting spot y get resupplied (vende la basura) 30.72.
07) Next to you, acepta "A New Threat" 30.71.
08) As you do the following pasos start working on "A New Threat": mata Rockjaw Troggs y Burly Rockjaw Troggs:
09) Ve SW en small camp/tent y entrega "Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery" 23.71, acepta the next part.  Also acepta "The Boar Hunter".
10) Just oeste y norte of you do "The Boar Hunter": mata Small Crag Boars.
11) Vuelve a the small camp/tent y entrega "The Boar Hunter" (23.71, #6 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[24] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal SE hacia el small dwarf camp y entrega "Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery" 25.76, acepta "The Troll Cave".
02) Around southern Coldridge Valley, start working on "The Troll Cave": mata Frostmane Troll Whelps.  There is a lot in la cueva al sur (entrada en 27.80).  As soon as you hit nivel 4, stop what you are doing y go do the following pasos:
03) Ve a the dwarf camp sur en main path y acepta "Scalding Mornbrew Delivery" 25.76.  NOTE:  This misión has a 5 min time limit, as long as you do not go AFK or something you should have plenty of time to get this in.
04) Usa la piedra de hogar a the starting spot.
05) Ve norte y entra en Anvilmar luego acepta "A Refugee's Quandary" patrols a bit 29.68.  Next to you, asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en 29.68.
06) Ve norte in Anvilmar y entrega "Scalding Mornbrew Delivery" 29.66.  Acepta "Bring Back the Mug".
07) In Anvilmar, get your nivel 4 class's spells/abilities.
08) Exit Anvilmar sur, luego finish "A New Threat": mata Rockjaw Troggs (mostly este alrededor de 31.75) y Burly Rockjaw Troggs (mostly oeste).
09) At the starting spot, entrega "A New Threat" 30.71.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied (de the blue shirted dwarf under red tent) 30.72.
10) Ve sur hacia el small dwarf camp en end de main path y entrega "Bring Back the Mug" (25.76, #3 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[25] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste y haz "A Refugee's Quandary": lootea the 3 objects en troll camps.  First lootea Felix's Box (frente a Campfire, 21.76).  See next pasos para other two:
02) Lootea Felix's Chest (junto a Campfire, 23.80).
03) Lootea Felix's Bucket of Bolts (frente a Campfire, 26.79).
04) Around southern Coldridge Valley, finish "The Troll Cave": mata Frostmane Troll Whelps.  There is a lot in la cueva al sur (entrada en 27.80).
05) Vuelve a the dwarf camp sur en main path y entrega "The Troll Cave" 25.76, acepta "The Stolen Journal".
06) Ve SE y entra en the troll cueva (entrada en 27.80, #4 on map) y haz "The Stolen Journal": keep hugging the left side of la cueva until you get to Grik'nir the Cold /target 30.80 y mata y lootea a this troll.
07) Ve NW hacia el small dwarf camp en end de main path y entrega "The Stolen Journal" (25.76, #5 on map), acepta "Senir's Observations".
08) Hearth (if you can), or die on purpose to get hacia el starting spot.
09) Ve norte to entra en Anvilmar luego entrega "A Refugee's Quandary" patrols a bit 29.68.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 29.68.
10) Exit Anvilmar (sur) luego head este en main path to la entrada of Coldridge Pass y entrega "Senir's Observations" 33.72, acepta the next part.
11) Just junto a you up the hill, acepta "Supplies to Tannok" 34.72.
12) Entra en Coldridge Pass junto a you (entrada en 34.71) y work your way through it.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[26] = {title = [[8 Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Ve NE to Kharanos y asegúrate de estar al menos a 450 XP away de lvl 6 before getting there para nuevas habilidades/hechizos.  Just sur in Kharanos, off to your right, entrega "Senir's Observations" 46.54.
02) Ve norte into Kharanos y off to your right, acepta "Beer Basted Boar Ribs" 47.52.
03) Next to you, entra en Thunderbrew Distillery (the Posada) y entrega "Supplies to Tannok" 47.52.
04) Junto a fireplace, de the Physician, learn Apprentice First Aid 47.53.
05) Next to you by the bar, de Innkeeper Belm 47.53, talk to him to make Thunderbrew Distillery your new home for your Hearthstone.  Make sure you are resupplied.  NOTE:  Do not sell any Crag Boar Ribs you may have.
06) Across de Thunderbrew Distillery, at la entrada de blacksmith shop, acepta "Tools for Steelgrill" 46.52.
07) Ve NE to Steelgrill's Depot 49.48 y acepta "Stocking Jetsteam", y junto a you "The Grizzled Den".
08) Just hacia el este between the two huts, acepta "Ammo for Rumbleshot" 50.49.
09) Frente a hut, entrega "Tools for Steelgrill" 50.49.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[27] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) As you work en following pasos also start working on "Beer Basted Boar Ribs" along with "Stocking Jetsteam" by mata/looting boars y bears scattered all alrededor de Dun Morogh (also do not sell the misión items to a vendedor!):
02) SW of Kharanos, do "Ammo for Rumbleshot": lootea the Ammo Crate junto a tent/Campfire 44.57.
03) Ve norte a bit y haz "The Grizzled Den": mata y lootea a Yetis.  You can find a lot more en Den (entrada en 42.54).
04) Ve sur hacia el small dwarf camp along the main path y entrega "Ammo for Rumbleshot" 41.65.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  Do NOT sell your misión items!
05) Just norte en open fields of Dun Morogh, finish "Beer Basted Boar Ribs" along with "Stocking Jetsteam": mata y lootea a boars y bears.  Focus mostly en Crag Boars.  NOTE:  You will get the Rhapsody Malt later.
06) Make sure you are at least 625 XP away de nivel 7, luego usa la piedra de hogar a Thunderbrew Distellery (or corre back if you are already close).
07) De Innkeeper Belm 47.52, purchase a Rhapsody Malt de him for "Beer Basted Boar Ribs".  Make sure you are resupplied (Do NOT sell your misión items!).
08) Justo afuera de the Posada, entrega "Beer Basted Boar Ribs" 47.52.  You should be lvl 7 now, if not farmea to it.
09) Sur of Kharanos, junto a tent/carreta, acepta "Frostmane Hold" 47.54.
10) Norte in Kharanos, down en goblin hut, acepta "Operation Recombobulation" 46.49.
11) Ve este to Steelgrill's Depot 49.48 y entrega "Stocking Jetsteam", acepta "Evershine".  And junto a you entrega "The Grizzled Den".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[28] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste (take the sur route) y sube por mountain (entrada en 36.53)..
02) Up the mountain, acepta "Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash" 35.52.
03) Ve este back down the mountain y try to do "Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash": In la cueva lootea MacGrann's Meat Locker 38.51 y watch out para lvl 11 patrolling elite yeti.  You can simply wait for this elite yeti to sal de la cueva luego corre in there to lootea it, although he stays in la cueva for several minutes at a time.  Try to group if you can to take him on, or you can skip it or try later (as you will pass this spot a few more times later) y it gets turned in back up the hill junto a cueva.
04) Back up the mountain, entrega (if you did it) "Tundra MacGrann's Stolen Stash" (35.52, #2 on map).
05) Ve NW to Brewnall Village y entrega "Evershine" 30.46, acepta "A Favor for Evershine".  Also acepta "The Perfect Stout".
06) Next to you, acepta "Bitter Rivals" 30.24.
07) You can get resupplied de Keeg Gibn under the red canopy 30.45.
08) While doing the next pasos, start working on "A Favor for Evershine" by killing the Ice Claw Bears, Elder Crag Boars y Snow Leopards alrededor de the western open fields of Dun Morogh:
09) Ve NE up to Shimmer Ridge (entrada en 38.42) y haz "The Perfect Stout": mata y lootea a Frostmane Seers y lootea Shimmerweed Baskets.
10) Ve oeste to Brewnall Village y entrega "The Perfect Stout" (30.46, #5 on map), luego if you are lvl 8 acepta "Shimmer Stout".  And get resupplied.
11) All alrededor de western Dun Morogh (past Iceflow Lake) continue working on "A Favor for Evershine" by killing the Ice Claw Bears, Elder Crag Boars y Snow Leopards (#7 on map).  Once you hit nivel 8, Hearth, or just vuelve a Kharanos.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[29] = {title = [[10 Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) In Thunderbrew Distillery (the Posada), at Innkeeper Belm 47.52, purchase a Thunder Ale.  Make sure you are resupplied.
02) Baja por pasos in Thunderbrew Distillery hacia el room with all the barriles 48.53 y haz "Bitter Rivals": talk to Jarven Thunderbrew junto a you to give him the Thunder Ale.  Wait a few seconds, luego click en Unguarded Thunder Ale Barrel to entrega "Bitter Rivals", acepta "Return to Marleth".
03) Find your class entrenador alrededor de Kharanos y learn your nivel 8 spells/abilities.
04) Ve oeste to Brewnall Village 30.46 y entrega "Return to Marleth".  Also acepta (if you haven't yet) "Shimmer Stout".
05) Ve SW to entra en Frostmane Hold (entrada en 25.51)..
06) Do "Frostmane Hold": work your way hacia el middle of la cueva 23.52 to get it explored.  Also mata 5 Frostmane Headhunters.
07) Sal de la cueva luego ve al norte to la entrada of Gnomeregan alrededor de 25.44 y haz "Operation Recombobulation": mata y lootea a the Leper Gnomes.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[30] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) All alrededor de western Dun Morogh (past Iceflow Lake) finish "A Favor for Evershine": mata Ice Claw Bears, Elder Crag Boars y Snow Leopards alrededor de the open fields of Dun Morogh.
02) Ve a Brewnall Village y entrega "A Favor for Evershine" 30.46, acepta "Return to Bellowfiz".
03) Ve to Kharanos y sur en town, entrega "Frostmane Hold" 47.54, acepta "The Reports".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) Norte in Kharanos, down en goblin hut, entrega "Operation Recombobulation" 46.49.
05) Ve NE to Steelgrill's Depot y entrega "Return to Bellowfiz" 49.48.
06) At this point it is wise to get your nivel 10 spells/abilities before continuing, so farmea on any enemigos en open fields of Dun Morogh until you are nivel 10.  If you still have a ways to go before 10, you can go este y acepta the two misiones "The Public Servant" y "Those Blasted Troggs!" 69.56 y start working on them by killing the Rockjaw Skullthumpers at Gol'Bolar Quarry alrededor de 68.59 .  You can also try to mata the Rockjaw Bonesnappers in la cueva (entrada en 71.56).  Turn these in if you completa them.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[31] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) 11 Dun Morogh
02) Sigue el camino principal este to Gol'Bolar Quarry y finish (if you still need to) "Those Blasted Troggs!" by killing the Rockjaw Skullthumpers at Gol'Bolar Quarry alrededor de 68.59 y "The Public Servant" by killing Rockjaw Bonesnappers in la cueva (entrada en 71.56).  These misiones are accepted en Quarry there!
03) Vuelve up y entrega "The Public Servant" 69.56.
04) Next to you, detrás de tent, entrega "Those Blasted Troggs!" 69.56.
05) Ve norte to Amberstill Ranch y acepta "Protecting the Herd" 63.50.
06) Just hacia el oeste of you is a hidden path that leads up the mountain, go up it luego head norte y haz "Protecting the Herd": mata y lootea a Vagash /target alrededor de 62.34.  This lvl 11 Yeti patrols up alrededor de the mountain ledges.  This can be skipped if it gives you troubles.
07) Back at Amberstill Ranch, entrega "Protecting the Herd" (63.50, #4 on map).
08) Sigue el camino NE to Norte Gate Outpost y acepta "The Lost Pilot" 84.39.
09) Ve NW a bit y click on A Dwarven Corpse to entrega "The Lost Pilot" 80.36, acepta "A Pilot's Revenge".
10) Ve just SW up el camino a bit y haz "A Pilot's Revenge": mata y lootea a Mangeclaw /target 78.38.
11) Back este en Outpost entrega "A Pilot's Revenge" (84.39, #7 on map).
12) Ve a the Sur Gate Outpost y entrega "Shimmer Stout" 86.49, acepta "Stout to Kadrell".
13) Entra en Sur Gate Pass (entrada en 17.59) y go through it to get to Loch Modan..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[32] = {title = [[12 Loch Modan]], text = [[
01) Once you entra en Loch Modan you will arrive at Valley of Kings, y frente a watchtower, acepta "In Defense of the King's Lands" (22.73 in Loch Modan).
02) Ve up en watchtower frente a you y acepta "The Trogg Threat" 23.74.
03) Sigue el camino principal NE, luego make a right to ve a Stonesplinter Valley alrededor de 32.73 y haz "In Defense of the King's Lands" along with "The Trogg Threat": mata 10 Stonesplinter Troggs y 10 Stonesplinter Scouts, y lootea them para Stone Tooth.
04) Vuelve oeste to Valley of Kings y entrega "In Defense of the King's Lands" (22.73, #1 on map).
05) Ve up en watchtower y entrega "The Trogg Threat" 23.74.
06) Ve norte to Thelsamar alrededor de 34.48 y find Mountaineer Kadrell (he patrols back y forth en town) y entrega "Stout to Kadrell".  De him acepta "Rat Catching" y "Mountaineer Stormpike's Task".
07) Entra en Posada (the building con big barriles alrededor de it), (entrada en 35.48).. y the first NPC you see (Innkeeper Hearthstove, 35.48), talk to him to make this Posada your new home.
08) At the bar, de Vidra Hearthstove, acepta "Thelsamar Blood Sausages" 35.49.  Make sure you are resupplied.  If you need 6 slot bags, you can purchase them de the General Supplies vendedor en Posada (if you can afford them).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[33] = {title = [[Alliance - Loch Modan]], text = [[
01) While working your way norte hacia el next pasos, also start working on "Rat Catching" by mata/looting Tunnel Rat enemigos (kobolds) along the oeste side de main path (#3 on map).  Also start working on "Thelsamar Blood Sausages" by killing boars, bears y spiders (en open fields of Loch Modan, #1 on map):
02) Farmea norte to Algaz Station, go up en watchtower y entrega "Mountaineer Stormpike's Task" 25.18, Acepta "Stormpike's Order".  Also acepta "Filthy Paws".  NOTE:  You can get repaired/resupplied al fondo de the watchtower but do not sell your "Thelsamar Blood Sausages" misión items to a vendedor!
03) Ve este to Silver Stream Mine alrededor de 35.19 y finish "Rat Catching": mata y lootea a the Tunnel Rat enemigos (kobolds) afuera of la mina.  And if you have a group, do "Filthy Paws": lootea the Miner's League Crates dentro de mine.  You can skip the misión if you cannot get a group (but keep it accepted, as you will be able to solo it later).
04) If you did "Filthy Paws " go oeste y entrega up en watchtower at Algaz Station, (25.18, #2 on map).
05) Finish "Thelsamar Blood Sausages": mata boars, bears y spiders (en open fields of Loch Modan, #1 on map).
06) Hearth (if you can) to Stoutlager Posada (Thelsamar) y en Posada en bar, entrega "Thelsamar Blood Sausages" 35.49.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) In Thelsamar, find Mountaineer Kadrell (he patrols back y forth en town) y entrega "Rat Catching".
08) Este in Thelsamar, down en hut, acepta "Honor Students" 37.48 .
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[34] = {title = [[17 Darkshore]], text = [[
01) You should be nivel 12 now, if not farmea to it.
02) Sur en town, ve a the Gryphon Master 34.51 y entrega "Honor Students", acepta "Ride to Ironforge".  Luego take a flight to Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
03) In Ironforge, go norte to Deep Mountain Mining Guild y entrega "Ride to Ironforge" 51.26, acepta "Gryth Thurden".
04) Ve a the Gryphon Master 55.48 y entrega "Gryth Thurden", acepta "Return to Brock".  Luego take a flight to Thelsamar, Loch Modan.
05) Este in Thelsamar, down en hut, entrega "Return to Brock" 37.48.
06) Sur en town, ve a the Gryphon Master (34.51, #2 on map) y take a flight to Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
07) You can upgrade First Aid upstairs en Ironforge Physician 55.58..
08) If you can afford to, you can learn new weapon possibilities sur en two Weapon Masters dentro de Timberline Arms 62.89.
09) WOTLK, 13a) Ve a través de Deeprun Tram 77.51, y luego between the two Tram track acepta "Deeprun Rat Roundup".
10) WOTLK, 13b) Just alrededor de the immediate area do "Deeprun Rat Roundup": usa el/la Rat Catcher's Flute misión item en Deeprun Rats.
11) WOTLK, 13c) Vuelve between the two tracks en Deeprun Tram, y entrega "Deeprun Rat Roundup", acepta "Me Brother, Nipsy".
12) WOTLK, 13d) Luego take one de two Deeprun Trams to take you to Stormwind City.
13) WOTLK, 13e) Once you arrive en other side de Deeprun Tram, entrega "Me Brother, Nipsy" between the two tram tracks.  Luego ve norte a través de tunnel to get into Stormwind City.
14) WOTLK, 13f) At Stormwind City, ve a Stormwind Harbor y get en boat 23.56 to take you to Darkshore.
15) Once at Auberdine, follow the docks este, y on your right acepta "For Love Eternal" (en dock, 36.44).
16) Continue este en dock hacia the Posada, but go upstairs y acepta "Buzzbox 827" 37.44.
17) Justo al sur de the Posada, go up en platform y de the Hoppogryph Master (36.46 in Darkshore), get the Flight Path.
18) 12+
19) First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!!
20) Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)
21) At Auberdine en Hippogryph dock, acepta "Washed Ashore" 37.46.
22) Entra en Posada y de Innkeeper Shaussiy 37.44, make Auberdine your new home.  NOTE:  De the Fish Vendor /target en Posada you can purchase Longjaw Mud Snapper, which is a cheap tier 2 food.
23) NIGHT ELF ONLY (other races should have already did this):  Ve oeste de Posada en long docks y acepta "For Love Eternal" 36.44.
24) NIGHT ELF ONLY (other races should have already did this):  Vuelve hacia the Posada, but go upstairs y acepta "Buzzbox 827" 37.44.
25) Justo afuera de the Posada, junto a mailbox, acepta "Cave Mushrooms" 37.44.
26) Just cruzando path de you cerca de moonwell, acepta "The Red Crystal" 38.43.
27) Ve norte cruzando bridge y into the merchant building luego acepta "Bashal'Aran" y "Tools of the Highborne" 37.40.
28) GET BAGS:  At this point if you do not have all 6 slot bags it is highly recommended to compra them de the General Goods (37.40, /target) vendedor en merchant building, as long as you can afford them.
29) Take the SE bridge hacia el other building y at la entrada, acepta "Plagued Lands" 39.43.
30) Ve dentro de building y acepta "How Big a Threat?" 39.43.
31) Work your way al sur along the shore while doing "Buzzbox 827": mata y lootea a crabs.  Work your way hacia el Beached Sea Creature 36.51 y click on it to lootea the Sea Creature Bones for "Washed Ashore".
32) Vuelve norte to Auberdine y junto a Hippogryph dock, off en grass, de Buzzbox 827 (37.46, #1 on map), entrega "Buzzbox 827", acepta "Buzzbox 411".
33) On the Hippogryph dock, entrega "Washed Ashore" 37.46, acepta the next part.
34) Ve oeste out en sea y haz "Washed Ashore": lootea the Skeletal Sea Turtle's head 32.46.
35) Around en sea do "Buzzbox 411": mata y lootea a Darkshore Threshers /target.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[35] = {title = [[Alliance - Darkshore]], text = [[
01) Vuelve a Auberdine en Hippogryph dock y entrega "Washed Ashore" 37.46.
02) In the town, get repaired/resupplied 37.44.
03) Ve norte hacia el shore, en Beached Sea Creature 42.31 y click on it to acepta "Beached Sea Creature".
04) Ve norte along the shore y at Buzzbox 411 42.29, entrega "Buzzbox 411", acepta "Buzzbox 323".
05) As you work your way to do the next pasos, start working on "Buzzbox 323" by mata/looting the Moonstalkers (cats):
06) Ve sur to Bashal'Aran, up en hill, en blue mist, entrega "Bashal'Aran" 44.36, acepta the next part.
07) Justo al sur de where you are at alrededor de 45.37, do "Bashal'Aran": mata y lootea a Vile Sprites y Wild Grell.
08) Vuelve up en hill at Bashal'Aran, en blue mist, entrega "Bashal'Aran" (44.36, #6 on map), acepta the next part.
09) Justo al sur de where you are at alrededor de 45.37, do "Bashal'Aran": mata y lootea a Deth'ryll Satyr /target (orange colored patrolling satyr).
10) Vuelve up en hill at Bashal'Aran, en blue mist, entrega "Bashal'Aran" (44.36, #6 on map), acepta the next part.
11) Farmea al sur y on top de hill, simply corre up close hacia el Mysterious Red Crystal 47.49 for "The Red Crystal".
12) Ve oeste cruzando main path into the furbolg camp 40.54 to simply get it discovered for "How Big a Threat?".
13) Ve al sur en main path y acepta "The Fall of Ameth'Aran" 40.60.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[36] = {title = [[Alliance - Darkshore]], text = [[
01) Ve este at Ameth'Aran y start working on "Tools of the Highborne": mata y lootea a the Highborne enemigos (apparitions).  While doing this, also work your way to do the next pasos:
02) Do part of "The Fall of Ameth'Aran": junto a old dark gazebo, click The Lay of Ameth'Aran 43.59 white tablet laying en ground.
03) Ve sur hacia el other gazebo y haz "Bashal'Aran": click en Ancient Flame 42.62.  Also do "For Love Eternal": find y mata y lootea a Anaya Dawnrunner /target, she patrols clockwise alrededor de this gazebo.
04) Ve sur a bit more y haz the last part of "The Fall of Ameth'Aran": click en The Fall of Ameth'Aran tablet standing upright 43.63.
05) Make sure "Tools of the Highborne" is finished:  mata y lootea a the Highborne enemigos (apparitions, #1 on map) alrededor de Ameth'Aran.
06) Make sure you are at least 6,000 XP into nivel 13 before continuing.  Farmea on Highborne enemigos (apparitions) alrededor de Ameth'Aran until you are.
07) Ve oeste hacia el main path y entrega "The Fall of Ameth'Aran" 40.60.
08) To the oeste de main path do "Plagued Lands": use Tharnariun's Hope misión item on a Rabid Thistle Bear /target alrededor de 39.60.  NOTE:  Make sure you are in range y in clear view de mob when using the misión item, otherwise you might miss y will have to vuelve a Auberdine to get a new one.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[37] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Auberdine.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) Ve oeste de Posada en long docks y entrega "For Love Eternal" 36.44.
03) Justo afuera de the Posada y cruzando path by the moonwell, entrega "The Red Crystal" 38.43, acepta "As Water Cascades".
04) Usa el/la Empty Water Tube misión item en moonwell junto a you 38.44.
05) Ve este cruzando bridge y at la entrada hacia el building, entrega "Plagued Lands" 39.43, acepta "Cleansing of the Infected".
06) Entra en building y entrega "How Big a Threat?" 39.43, acepta the next part.  Also acepta "Thundris Windweaver".
07) Ve up en building y acepta "The Tower of Althalaxx" 39.44.
08) Take el puente going norte y en dwarf area by the carreta, acepta "Deep Ocean, Vast Sea" 38.41.
09) Entra en merchant building junto a you 37.40 y entrega "Tools of the Highborne" y "Thundris Windweaver", acepta "The Cliffspring River".
10) Ve a the Hippogryph dock (sur de Posada) y entrega "Beached Sea Creature" 37.46.
11) You should be nivel 14 now.  If you are a Mage, Paladin, Hunter, Priest, Rogue or Warrior y could benefit de getting your nivel 14 spells/abilities, luego you can do that now in Darnassus.    The other classes can toma el barco 32.44 to Stormwind to get their spells/abilities.  So if you can benefit de getting your lvl 14 abilities, Night Elves can take a Hippogryph ride de the Hippogryph Master junto a you.  If you are dwarf, gnome or human you will have to take the Boat to Teldrassil 33.40, luego to get back to Auberdine take the punto de vuelo (at 58.94 in Teldrassil).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[38] = {title = [[Alliance - Darkshore]], text = [[
01) As you work en following pasos start working on "Cleansing of the Infected" by killing the Rabid Thistle Bears.  Also continue working on "Buzzbox 323" by mata/looting the Moonstalkers (cats):
02) Ve norte to Bashal'Aran, up en hill, en blue mist, entrega "Bashal'Aran" 44.36.
03) Ve NW out en sea y haz "Deep Ocean, Vast Sea": lootea the two chests en two sunken boats.  First one, go under the boat y entra en the crack en bottom de boat (entrada en 39.29), luego head NW en boat y lootea the Silver Dawning's Lockbox 38.29:
04) Head NE y entra en the bottom de other boat 40.27, luego head oeste en boat y lootea the Mist Veil's Lockbox 40.27.
05) Ve NE en shore y click en Beached Sea Turtle's arm 44.21 to acepta "Beached Sea Turtle".
06) Justo al sur de you en open fields of Darkshore, finish "Buzzbox 323" by mata/looting the Moonstalkers /target (cats, #1 on map).
07) Sigue el camino principal este y just past el puente on your left is Buzzbox 323 51.25, de it entrega "Buzzbox 323", acepta "Buzzbox 525".
08) Next to you, drop down al fondo de the waterfall y haz "The Cliffspring River": usa el/la Empty Sampling Tube misión item al fondo de the waterfall 51.26.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[39] = {title = [[Alliance - Darkshore]], text = [[
01) Ve sur y up en hill, click en Mysterious Red Crystal 47.49 to entrega "As Water Cascades", acepta "The Fragments Within".
02) Ve SW past the main path hacia el furbolg camp alrededor de 40.54 y haz "How Big a Threat?": mata the required amount of Blackwood furbolgs.
03) Work your way al sur while killing Rabid Thistle Bears (#7 on map) for "Cleansing of the Infected".  Eventually make your way hacia el shoreline en Beached Sea Turtle 37.62 y click on its head to acepta "Beached Sea Turtle".
04) Continue al sur while killing Rabid Thistle Bears (#7 on map) for "Cleansing of the Infected".  Eventually make your way hacia el shoreline en Beached Sea Creature 36.71 y click the body to acepta "Beached Sea Creature".
05) Ve sur hacia el Beached Sea Creature 33.81 y click where the neck meets the body to acepta "Beached Sea Creature".
06) If you have "Grove of the Ancients":  Turn this in at Onu big tree NPC, 44.76.
07) Este of you alrededor de the open fields of Darkshore alrededor de 38.71 finish "Cleansing of the Infected": mata Rabid Thistle Bears.  Also start working on "Buzzbox 525" by mata/looting Grizzled Thistle Bears.
08) Ve al sur alrededor de 40.81 y finish "Buzzbox 525": mata y lootea a Grizzled Thistle Bears (#7 on map).
09) Just right off the main path ve a Buzzbox 525 41.81 y entrega "Buzzbox 525".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[40] = {title = [[Alliance - Darkshore]], text = [[
01) Keep grinding until you are 6,370 XP3,550 XP into nivel 15, luego Usa la piedra de hogar a Auberdine.
02) Ve a the Hippogryph dock (sur de Posada, 37.46) y entrega ALL "Beached Sea" misiones you may have.
03) Ve below the Hippogryph dock, junto a shore y acepta "Fruit of the Sea" 36.45.  NOTE:  "The Family and the Fishing Pole" is a fishing misión that takes too much time for XP y I recommend skipping it.  If you are bored y want to learn fishing or do something different you can give it a try.
04) Just cruzando path de you, cerca de moonwell, entrega "The Fragments Within" 38.43.
05) Take el puente norte y justo afuera de the merchant building (to your left), acepta "The Absent Minded Prospector" 37.42.
06) Entra en merchant building junto a you y entrega "The Cliffspring River" 37.40, acepta "The Blackwood Corrupted" (requires lvl 15).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) Justo afuera de the building en dwarf camp junto a carreta, entrega "Deep Ocean, Vast Sea" 38.41.
08) Take the SE bridge hacia el other building y at la entrada, entrega "Cleansing of the Infected" 39.43, acepta "Tharnariun's Hope".
09) Entra en building y entrega "How Big a Threat?" 39.43.  Acepta "A Lost Master".
10) Ve a the moonwell in Auberdine y use your Empty Cleansing Bowl misión item in it 38.44.
11) You should be nivel 16 by now:  If you are a Mage, Paladin, Druid, Priest, Rogue or Warrior y could benefit de getting your nivel 16 spells/abilities, you can do that now in Darnassus.  The other classes can toma el barco 32.44 to Stormwind to get their spells/abilities.  So if you can benefit de getting your lvl 16 abilities, you can take a Hippogryph ride de the Hippogryph Master 36.46 or you might need to toma el barco en docks.  Luego hearth (or fly back) to Auberdine.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[41] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #07]], text = [[
01) Ve NE y haz part of "The Blackwood Corrupted": lootea the Blackwood Grain Stores 51.35.
02) Ve up hacia el small cueva (path entrada en 53.37).  Once up there do "Tharnariun's Hope": mata Den Mother.
03) Ve NE a bit hacia el other furbolg camp y finish "The Blackwood Corrupted": lootea the Blackwood Nut Stores 52.33.  See next pasos for what else to do:
04) On the other side of this camp, lootea the Blackwood Fruit Stores 53.33.
05) Usa el/la Filled Cleansing Bowl misión item en Bonfire en middle of el campamento 52.33.  Mata Xabraxxis (lvl 19) that spawns, luego lootea Xabraxxis' Demon Bag that spawns en ground.  NOTES: You can usa el/la Filled Cleansing Bowl 20 yards away de the Bonfire y when you do it will make you friendly with all the furblogs at el campamento for a minute giving you an easier chance to mata the lvl 19 satyr.
06) Ve sur, luego up y a través de waterfall frente a cueva (path entrada en 55.32) y haz "Cave Mushrooms": lootea the mushrooms en ground in la cueva.  NOTE:  This can be hard to solo for some classes (rogues, warriors, etc), in that case try to get help or the guide will remind you once more to come back here once you are stronger later on (but it will be a tad off route).
07) Ve NE y just off the main path junto a a rock, entrega "The Tower of Althalaxx" 55.25, acepta the next part.
08) Ve SE a bit (alrededor de la torre, 55.27) y haz "The Tower of Althalaxx": mata y lootea a Dark Strand Fanatics (female humans).  Warning:  Do NOT go dentro de tower, as there is higher nivel enemigos in there!
09) Back just off the main path junto a a rock, entrega "The Tower of Althalaxx" (55.25, #7 on map), acepta the next part.
10) Ve norte hacia el shore y click en Beached Sea Turtle's head 53.18 to acepta "Beached Sea Turtle".
11) Work your way oeste along the shore y haz "Fruit of the Sea": mata y lootea a Encrusted Tide Crawlers (higher lvl crabs) y Reef Crawlers (lower lvl crabs more oeste).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[42] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Auberdine.  If piedra de hogar is still on a cooldown, luego die on purpose, res at spirit, luego ve to Auberdine.  If you died on purpose, luego entrega the following 5 misiones in reverse:
02) Ve below the Hippogryph dock, junto a shore y entrega "Fruit of the Sea" 36.45.
03) Ve a the Hippogryph dock (sur de Posada) y entrega "Beached Sea Turtle" 37.46.
04) Justo afuera de the Posada, junto a mailbox, entrega "Cave Mushrooms" 37.44, acepta "Onu".
05) Take the norte bridge y en merchant building, entrega "The Blackwood Corrupted" 37.40.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
06) Take the SE bridge hacia el other building y at la entrada, entrega "Tharnariun's Hope" 39.43.
07) Out en long docks, toma el barco to Stormwind City 32.44.
08) The goal now is to get to Loch Modan to continue questing.  If you are a Dwarf, Gnome or Human luego ve a the Gryphon Master 71.73 y vuela a Thelsamar, Loch Modan, luego skip hacia el Loch Modan section below!  Night Elves will have a much longer journey, so if you are a Night Elf, follow the pasos below:
09) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Ve NE en Dwarven District to entra en the Deeprun Tram 69.31.  Luego wait para tram ride to show up y it will take you to Ironforge's side de Deeprun Tram.
10) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Once en other side de Deeprun Tram, acepta "Deeprun Rat Roundup" (this is accepted between the two Tram tracks).
11) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Just alrededor de the immediate area do "Deeprun Rat Roundup": usa el/la Rat Catcher's Flute misión item en Deeprun Rats.
12) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Vuelve between the two tracks en Deeprun Tram, y entrega "Deeprun Rat Roundup".  NOTE:  "Me Brother, Nipsy" will be skipped for now.
13) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Exit the Deeprun Tram yendo hacia norte a través de tunnel..
14) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  At Ironforge get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master 55.48.
15) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Exit Ironforge sur 16.85.
16) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Corre all the way este through Dun Morogh hacia el Sur Gate Pass 82.53 y go through it. Luego ve a través de other tunnel de Sur Gate Pass 17.59.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[43] = {title = [[18 Loch Modan]], text = [[
01) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Ve NE to Thelsamar, find Mountaineer Kadrell (he patrols back y forth en town alrededor de 35.47) y de him acepta "Mountaineer Stormpike's Task".
02) NIGHT ELF ONLY:  Sur en town, ve a the Gryphon Master 34.51 y get the FP.
03) At Thelsamar, go down en eastern most hut y acepta "Ironband's Excavation" (37.47 in Loch Modan).
04) Ve este to Ironband's Excavation Site y entrega "Ironband's Excavation" 65.67, acepta "Gathering Idols".
05) Across el campamento, acepta "Excavation Progress Report" 66.66.
06) Just hacia el este of you alrededor de the Excavation Site alrededor de 67.63, do "Gathering Idols": mata y lootea a the troggs.
07) Vuelve a the small camp en Excavation Site y entrega "Gathering Idols" (65.67, #5 on map).
08) Ve este to entra en The Farstrider Lodge (entrance en este side de lodge), make a right, luego acepta "Crocolisk Hunting" 82.62.
09) At the other side de lodge, acepta "A Hunter's Boast" 83.65.  NOTE:  This misión is on a 15 min timer, so work somewhat quickly before it expires.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[44] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #11]], text = [[
01) Justo al oeste de The Farstrider Lodge alrededor de 77.73, do "A Hunter's Boast": mata 6 Mountain Buzzards.
02) Vuelve a The Farstrider Lodge, make a left y entrega "A Hunter's Boast" 83.65, acepta "A Hunter's Challenge".  NOTE: This misión is on a timer, so work somewhat quickly before it expires.
03) Ve NW (starting at starting at 76.46) y haz "A Hunter's Challenge": mata 5 Elder Mountain Boars.
04) Vuelve a The Farstrider Lodge, make a left y entrega "A Hunter's Challenge" (83.65, #2 on map).
05) In the middle de lodge, acepta "Vyrin's Revenge" 82.64.
06) Ve NW junto a lake y acepta "Bingles' Missing Supplies" 64.48.
07) Along the eastern shore of The Loch lake y en two smaller islands in el lago do "Crocolisk Hunting": mata y lootea a Loch Crocolisks.
08) Ve al norte hacia el bigger island, starting en bottom eastern part y haz "Bingles' Missing Supplies": lootea the 4 misión objects en ground.  First one, lootea Bingles's Blastencapper junto a hut 54.27.  See next pasos para other 3 to lootea:
09) Ve oeste y lootea Bingles's Toolbucket (wrench) junto a shore 49.30.
10) Ve NE a bit y lootea Bingles's Toolbucket (hammer) junto a light colored carreta 52.24.
11) Ve NW a bit y lootea Bingles's Toolbucket (screwdriver) en trogg camp 48.20.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[45] = {title = [[Alliance - Loch Modan]], text = [[
01) Ve NW to la entrada of Stonewrought Dam, go dentro de y you can get repaired/resupplied 41.13.  Be careful not to sell your Crocolisk Meat to a vendedor!
02) Ve SE en Dam y luego under the tent, acepta "A Dark Threat Looms" 46.14.
03) Ve este to exit the Dam, luego en afuera entrance de Dam, you will see two Dark Iron Sappers.  They are guarding a Suspicious Barrel 56.13, click it to entrega "A Dark Threat Looms", acepta the next part.
04) Ve oeste back onto the Dam y under the tent, entrega "A Dark Threat Looms" (46.14, #2 on map), SKIP the next part.
05) Ve oeste to Silver Stream Mine entrance 35.19 y haz (if you haven't yet) "Filthy Paws": lootea the Miner's League Crates dentro de mine.  NIGHT ELVES:  You will not have this, so skip this paso!
06) Entrega (if you need to) "Filthy Paws" up in la torre (oeste at 25.18).  And for Night Elves: You won't have "Filthy Paws" misión, but do entrega "Mountaineer Stormpike's Task", acepta "Stormpike's Order".
07) NOTE: You can get repaired/resupplied down below in la torre de Gothor Brumn 24.18.
08) Sigue el camino principal sur to Thelsamar y go down en eastern most hut y entrega "Excavation Progress Report" 37.47, acepta "Report to Ironforge".
09) Ve SE alrededor de 43.65 y try to do "Vyrin's Revenge": mata y lootea a Ol' Sooty /target (lvl 20 at 3 different spawns, see map).
10) Ve NE junto a lake y entrega "Bingles' Missing Supplies" 64.48.
11) Ve este to The Farstrider Lodge, make a right en lodge, luego entrega "Crocolisk Hunting" 82.62.
12) At the other side de lodge, entrega "Vyrin's Revenge" 83.65, acepta the next part.
13) Entrega "Vyrin's Revenge" en middle de lodge 82.64.
14) First asegúrate de ser nivel 20 (farmea on any enemigos until you are), luego Vuelve to Thelsamar.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[46] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Ve a the Gryphon Master 34.51 sur in Thelsamar y take a flight to Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
02) You can upgrade First Aid up en building de Nissa Firestone 55.58.
03) Ve NE in Ironforge y entrega "Report to Ironforge" 75.12, SKIP "Powder to Ironband".
04) Find your class entrenador y get new spells/abilities (if you need to).  Also, If you can afford it, you can visit the Weapon Masters at Timberline Arms 62.89 to learn new weapon possibilities.
05) Ve este to Tinker Town y acepta "Speak with Shoni" 69.51.
06) Ve este to entra en The Deeprun Tram 75.51.  Take the Tram ride y once you get hacia el other side exit norte a través de tunnel.
07) Once at Stormwind, just SW, entrega "Speak with Shoni" 63.34, SKIP "Underground Assault" (Dungeon).
08) Ve just SE a bit y entrega "Stormpike's Order" 65.37.
09) You can stop en Weapon Master (at The Trade District, 64.69) y learn new weapon possibilities if you can afford to.
10) N/A
11) 11a) Ve NW to The Park y acepta "The Corruption Abroad" 21.5636.68.
12) Nivel 20 Mounts, 11b)  At nivel 20 mounts become available.  If you happen to be nivel 20 y if you have the gold luego get your mount ASAP.  It differs depending on your class & race y it costs roughly 5 gold.  Check out my Mount Guide on where to find your mount entrenador & vendedor.
13) N/A
14) NIGHT ELF, GNOME & DWARF ONLY: SE in The Trade District, get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master (71.73, #12 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[47] = {title = [[21 Darkshore]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Auberdine.
02) Justo afuera de the Posada, de the WANTED: Murkdeep! sign, acepta "WANTED: Murkdeep!" 37.44.
03) Este in Auberdine, under the gazebo, entrega "The Corruption Abroad" 38.43 , SKIP "Researching the Corruption" (Dungeon).
04) Cave Mushrooms, 03b) IF YOU STILL NEED TO DO "Cave Mushrooms": Ve NE, luego up y a través de waterfall frente a cueva (path entrada en 55.32 ) y lootea the mushrooms en ground in la cueva.
05) Cave Mushrooms, 03c) IF YOU STILL NEED TO DO "Cave Mushrooms": Hearth (or vuelve) to Auberdine, y justo afuera de the Posada, junto a mailbox, entrega "Cave Mushrooms" 37.44, acepta "Onu".
06) Sigue el camino principal sur hacia el Grove de Ancients y de Onu big tree NPC, 44.76, entrega "Onu", acepta "The Master's Glaive".
07) As you work en following pasos also start working on "A Lost Master" by mata/looting Moonstalker Sires y Moonstalker Matriarch (cats) sur in Darkshore:
08) Ve SW to The Master's Glaive (the big glowing sword 39.86) y get it discovered for "The Master's Glaive".  Luego usa el/la Phial of Scrying misión item to spawn a Scrying Bowl junto a you, luego entrega "The Master's Glaive", acepta "The Twilight Camp".
09) At The Master's Glaive there are two books alrededor de the altar (table), click en Twilight Tome 39.86 en norte side de altar to entrega "The Twilight Camp", acepta "Return to Onu".
10) Ve sur a bit detrás de big glowing sword y acepta y haz the escolta a "Therylune's Escape" 39.87.  This escolta a only takes a couple minutes y leads hacia el main path este.  NOTE:  While mata/looting the Twilight enemigos in this area you have a chance to get an item, that starts "The Powers Below", acepta it if you were able to find it.
11) Ve oeste to Remtravel's Excavation y entrega "The Absent Minded Prospector" 36.84.  Acepta y haz the next part (escolta a).  Simply escolta a him alrededor de the Excavation site.  Try to keep aggro off of Prospector Remtravel /target, as he has low HP y can die easily.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[48] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #02]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste hacia el shore en small Greymist murloc camp 37.77 y haz "WANTED: Murkdeep!": clear all the murlocs en small camp, luego mata the two Greymist Warriors that spawn, luego mata Murkdeep that spawns after that.  NOTE:  These enemigos spawn en sea y corre onto la costa.
02) Ve sur along the shore a bit more y click en Beached Sea Turtle's arm 32.84 to acepta "Beached Sea Turtle"
03) Ve sur along the shore a bit more y click en Beached Sea Turtle's head 31.86 to acepta "Beached Sea Turtle"
04) Sur a bit more, click en Beached Sea Creature where the neck meets the body 31.87 to acepta "Beached Sea Creature".
05) Ve NE hacia el Grove de Ancients y de Onu (big tree NPC, 44.76), entrega "Return to Onu".  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "Mathystra Relics".
06) Next to you, get resupplied 44.76.  NOTE:  At this point you no longer need the Phial of Scrying misión item.  This can be destroyed to save bag space.
07) At the Grove de Ancients, acepta y haz the escolta a "The Sleeper Has Awakened" 44.76.  First thing to do is lootea Kerlonian's Chest junto a you to get the Horn of Awakening.  Kerlonian Evershade /target falls asleep periodically y you will need to use this horn to wake him up, so keep an eye out for him.  Lead him hacia el next paso:
08) Ve sur a along the main path y right before entering Ashenvale make a left on el camino into some mountains y de Sentinel Aynasha 46.90 /target, acepta y haz the escolta a "One Shot. One Kill." (no exclamation mark): simply wait right there y mata several waves of furblogs.
09) Keep escorting Kerlonian Evershade sur into Ashenvale... 27.37
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[49] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #03]], text = [[
01) 22 Ashenvale
02) Lead Kerlonian Evershade /target sur into Ashenvale to Maestra's Post.  Keep aggro off of Kerlonian Evershade as he can die easily.  As you work your way sur, there will be several tough spawns along the main path that can be avoided by staying away de the main path by at least 30 yards.  I recommend traveling just este de main path starting at 27.25, luego work your way sur a través de wilderness to avoid the tough spawns.  Right at la entrada hacia el hut, entrega "One Shot. One Kill." 27.37.  Luego ve en hut y entrega (if you succeeded with it) "The Sleeper Has Awakened" 27.36.  If you failed the escolta a you will have another chance later en guide to try again.
03) Just sur at Maestra's Post, entrega "The Tower of Althalaxx" 26.39, acepta the next part.
04) Next to you, acepta "Bathran's Hair" 26.39.
05) N/A
06) Ve norte to The Ruins of Ordil' Aran alrededor de 30.32 y haz "The Tower of Althalaxx": keep killing the enemigos there until the Glowing Soul Gem drops (very low drop rate).  If you have not found the item y the area is clear, luego you can do the next paso y come back to do this afterwards:
07) Ve norte to Bathran's Haunt alrededor de 31.26 y haz "Bathran's Hair": lootea the Plant Bundles alrededor de the area.  They are kind of hard to see.
08) Ve sur in Maestra's Post y entrega "Bathran's Hair" (26.39, #2 on map), acepta "Orendil's Cure".
09) Next to you, entrega "The Tower of Althalaxx" 26.39, acepta the next part.
10) Ve sur to The Shrine of Aessina y entrega "Therylune's Escape" 23.52.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[50] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #04]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal este into Astranaar, make a left after the blue bridge y get the Flight Path de the Hippogryph Master 34.48.
02) Along the main path as you entra en the town, acepta "The Zoram Strand" 35.49.
03) Ve a the first house on your right y acepta "On Guard in Stonetalon" 35.50.  NOTE: Skip "A Helping Hand" (for now).
04) Entra en house to get repaired/resupplied 35.50.  NOTE:  You can sell all the Shredder Operating Manuals you find in Ashenvale as my guide will not tell you to do that misión.
05) Across el camino, junto a glowing gazebo, acepta "Journey to Stonetalon Peak" 36.49.
06) Entra en Posada just SE of you y acepta "Raene's Cleansing" y "Culling the Threat" 37.50.  Also entrega (if you have it) "Onward to Ashenvale".
07) Sube por ramp, luego talk hacia el Innkeeper 37.49 to make Astranaar your new home.
08) At the SE most hut at Astranaar, entrega "Orendil's Cure" 37.52.  Wait a few seconds luego acepta "Elune's Tear".
09) Sigue el camino principal oeste, luego norte, luego ve oeste hacia The Zoram Strand y en small camp, acepta "The Ancient Statuette" 15.31.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[51] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #05]], text = [[
01) Along The Zoram Strand start working on "The Zoram Strand": mata y lootea a the Wrathtail naga while working your way to do the next pasos:
02) Ve al norte along the shore y haz "The Ancient Statuette": lootea the Ancient Statuette (white statue laying en ground, 14.21).
03) Vuelve sur hacia el small camp y entrega "The Ancient Statuette" 15.31, wait a few seconds luego acepta "Ruuzel".
04) Ve a the small island NW in The Zoram Strand y haz "Ruuzel": mata y lootea a Ruuzel /target.  She patrols clockwise alrededor de the small island with two bodyguards alrededor de 7.13.
05) Make sure "The Zoram Strand" is finished: mata y lootea a the Wrathtail naga alrededor de The Zoram Strand (#1 on map).  Finish this as you work your way hacia el next paso:
06) Ve SE hacia el small camp y entrega "Ruuzel" (15.31, #3 on map).
07) Ve SE hacia el little island en middle of Lake Falathim y entrega "Raene's Cleansing" 20.42, acepta the next part.
08) In the immediate area alrededor de Lake Falathim, do "Raene's Cleansing": mata y lootea a the Saltspittle murlocs until the Glowing Gem drops.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[52] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #06]], text = [[
01) Hearth to Astranaar.
02) In the Posada, down the ramp, entrega "Raene's Cleansing" 37.50.  Acepta "Raene's Cleansing" y "An Aggressive Defense".  Make sure you are resupplied.  NOTE:  The misión item Teronis' Journal can be destroyed as it is no longer used.
03) NW in Astranaar, entrega "The Zoram Strand" 35.49, acepta "Pridewings of Stonetalon".
04) Ve NE to Iris Lake (path entrada en 43.46)..
05) At the middle of Iris Lake, do "Elune's Tear": lootea an Elune's Tear (white ball) en ground 46.46.
06) Ve este at Iris Lake y sube por mountains 47.49 to take a shortcut to go este..
07) Ve NE hacia el Moonwell y entrega "Raene's Cleansing" 54.46, acepta the next part.
08) Hearth (or corre back if its still on a cooldown) to Astranaar.
09) At the SE most hut at Astranaar, entrega "Elune's Tear" 37.52.  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "The Ruins of Stardust".
10) Ve al sur to The Ruins of Stardust (the island en middle of el lago alrededor de 34.67) y haz "The Ruins of Stardust": lootea Stardust Covered Bushes.
11) Ve este to The Talondeep Path (cueva entrada en 82.30) y go through it to get to Stonetalon Mountains..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[53] = {title = [[23 Stonetalon Mountains]], text = [[
01) Farmea SW hacia el goblin en hut y acepta "Super Reaper 6000" 59.63.  NOTE:  Start working on "Pridewings of Stonetalon" by mata/looting any Pridewing enemigos (wyverns, #7 on map) you see por el camino.
02) Ve sur a bit y up en hill, entrega "On Guard in Stonetalon" 60.67, acepta the next part.
03) Next to you, entrega "On Guard in Stonetalon" 60.67, acepta "A Gnome's Respite".
04) All alrededor de Windshear Crag do "Super Reaper 6000" along with "A Gnome's Respite": mata y lootea a the Venture Co. Operators until the Blueprints drop (its a low drop rate).  Also mata 10 Loggers /target y Deforesters /target (scattered all alrededor de Windshear Crag).  NOTE:  There are a lot of operators en big tank shredder 63.54, y more alrededor de other structures en area.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
05) There is a goblin merchant 58.52 hacia el oeste in Windshear Crag that you can get repaired/resupplied at.
06) Vuelve SW hacia el goblin en hut y entrega "Super Reaper 6000" (59.63, #1 on map), SKIP "Further Instructions".
07) Ve sur a bit y up en hill, entrega "A Gnome's Respite" (60.67, #2 on map).  Acepta "An Old Colleague" y "A Scroll from Mauren".
08) Sigue el camino principal norte to Mirkfallon Lake starting alrededor de 50.43 y haz "Pridewings of Stonetalon": mata y lootea a Pridewing wyverns alrededor de el lago.  There is a large concentration of these enemigos (NE alrededor de 53.38).
09) Ve norte to Stonetalon Peak y frente a Moonwell entrega "Journey to Stonetalon Peak" 37.8, SKIP "Reclaiming the Charred Vale".
10) Junto a Moonwell, ve a the Hippogryph Master 36.7 y vuela a Auberdine, Darkshore..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[54] = {title = [[24 Darkshore]], text = [[
01) Next to you when you land en hippogryph dock at Auberdine, entrega ALL Beached Sea misiones you may have 37.46.
02) Entra en Posada y de Innkeeper Shaussiy 37.44, talk to her to make Auberdine your new home.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Justo afuera de the Posada, junto a Moonwell, entrega "WANTED: Murkdeep!" 38.43.
04) Ve norte cruzando bridge in Auberdine y justo afuera de the merchant building, entrega "The Absent Minded Prospector" 37.42, acepta the next part.
05) Take a shortcut straight a través de merchant building luego ve NE to Ruins of Mathystra alrededor de 58.23 y haz "Mathystra Relics": lootea the Mathystra Relics en ground.
06) Ve norte hacia el shore y acepta "Gyromast's Retrieval" (en small hill 57.13).
07) Around the immediate area do part of "Gyromast's Retrieval": mata y lootea a the Raging Reef Crawlers until the Bottom of Gelkak's Key drops.  This key can also drop de the Encrusted Tide Crawlers just SW.
08) Ve norte a bit into the water alrededor de the sunken ship alrededor de 55.12 y haz part of "Gyromast's Retrieval": mata y lootea a the murlocs until the Middle of Gelkak's Key drops.
09) Ve norte en open fields of Darkshore alrededor de 61.12 y finish "Gyromast's Retrieval": mata y lootea a Giant Foreststriders para Top of Gelkak's Key.  Also in this same area, finish "A Lost Master": mata y lootea a Moonstalkers (cats), there is only 7 spawns al norte in Darkshore.
10) Vuelve a the shore y entrega "Gyromast's Retrieval" (en small hill 57.13, #6 on map), acepta "Gyromast's Revenge".
11) Ve sur a bit along the shore y haz "Gyromast's Revenge": talk to The Threshwackonator 4100 56.18 to Insert key into it, luego lead him hacia el next paso:
12) Vuelve norte hacia el small hill (57.13, #6 on map) y luego mata The Threshwackonator 4100.  Luego entrega "Gyromast's Revenge".  NOTE:  Do NOT sell the reward received: Elixir of Water Breathing (you will be using this later).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[55] = {title = [[Alliance - Darkshore]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Auberdine.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  NOTE:  The misión item Gyromast's Key is no longer used for anything y can be destroyed to free bag space.
02) Ve este in Auberdine y en building, entrega "A Lost Master" 39.43.  Acepta the next part.
03) Sigue el camino principal sur to Grove de Ancients y de Onu (big tree NPC 44.76), entrega "Mathystra Relics".  If you still need to do the escolta a "The Sleeper Has Awakened" 44.76, luego you can acepta y try it again, remember to first lootea Kerlonian's Chest junto a him to get the Horn of Awakening.  Kerlonian Evershade /target falls asleep periodically y you will need to use this horn to wake him up.  You will need to do the next few pasos while on this también.
04) Ve sur hacia el small cueva at Blackwood Den y entrega "A Lost Master" 45.85.
05) Acepta y haz the escolta a "Escape Through Force".  This leads oeste hacia el main path at Grimclaw 42.82.
06) If you are on "The Sleeper Has Awakened", luego lead Kerlonian Evershade /target sur into Ashenvale.  Keep aggro off of Kerlonian Evershade as he can die easily.  As you work your way sur, there will be several tough spawns along the main path that can be avoided by staying away de the main path by at least 20 yards.  I recommend traveling just off the main path starting at 27.25, luego work your way sur a través de wilderness to avoid the tough spawns.  Luego ve en hut at Maestra's Post y entrega "The Sleeper Has Awakened" 27.36, if you fail again, luego skip it.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[56] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Hearth (or corre back if its still on a cooldown) to Auberdine.  If you can't hearth y are close to Astranaar, luego ve a the Hippogryph Master (34.48 in Ashenvale) y vuela a Auberdine, Darkshore.
02) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Ve este in Auberdine y en building, entrega "Escape Through Force" (39.43, #2 on map).  Wait a few seconds, luego junto a you acepta "Trek to Ashenvale".
04) Ve a the Hippogryph Master (sur de Posada 36.46) y vuela a Rut'theran Village, Teldrassil.  NOTE:  If you do not have the punto de vuelo for Rut'theran Village, luego you will have to get en boat en docks 33.40.
05) Sube por path to entra en Darnassus a través de red portal 56.89.
06) In Darnassus, go sur y justo afuera de The Temple de Moon, entrega "The Absent Minded Prospector" 31.85, acepta the next part.
07) Get New Abilities, 6b)   NOTE:  You can learn new weapon possibilities de the Weapon Master 58.47.
08) Upgrade First Aid if you need to de the First Aid Trainer 52.12.
09) Ve a Darnassus's Bank 40.42 y put the following items into it:  5 Elixir of Water Breathing (y if you have it) Book: The Powers Below.
10) Vuelve a través de red portal in Darnassus 29.41.
11) Ve a the Hippogryph Master 58.94 en dock y vuela a Astranaar, Ashenvale.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[57] = {title = [[24 Ashenvale]], text = [[
01) In Astranaar, en main path, junto a direction sign, entrega "Pridewings of Stonetalon" 35.49, SKIP "Kayneth Stillwind" (for now).
02) Entra en Posada y entrega "Trek to Ashenvale" 37.50.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) At the SE most hut at Astranaar, entrega "The Ruins of Stardust" 37.52.  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "Fallen Sky Lake".
04) Ve SW to Fire Scar Shrine y ve a el camino at 26.63..
05) Sube por path y haz "The Tower of Althalaxx": mata y lootea a Ilkrud Magthrull /target 25.61.
06) Farmea your way norte through Thistlefur Village y luego do "Culling the Threat": mata y lootea a Dal Bloodclaw /target (grey furblog patrols alrededor de 38.35).
07) Keep grinding on furblogs in Thistlefur Village until you are at least a 1/4 way into nivel 24.
08) Ve oeste to Maestra's Post y entrega "The Tower of Althalaxx" 26.39, acepta the next part.
09) Next to you, I recommend skipping the escolta a "Supplies to Auberdine" (overall) unless you have help.  This difficult escolta a leads norte hacia el border of Darkshore y Ashenvale y does not yield any crazy XP/time, but it is worth it if it can be done en first try.  If you do go for it, keep all aggro off of Delgren the Purifier /target as he is very fragile y will die quickly.  There are several waves of tough enemigos y you have very little opportunity to eat/drink as he runs quick.  If you did succeed with it, luego turn it in at Maestra's Post (26.39 in Ashenvale, #8 on map) when done.
10) N/A
11) Ve a Astranaar y en Posada, entrega "Culling the Threat" (37.50, #2 on map).   Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
12) 11b) Ve SE hacia el furbolg camp 51.60 y haz "An Aggressive Defense": mata the required amount of Foulweald furblogs.
13) Ve a Silverwind Refuge y acepta "Elemental Bracers" 50.67.
14) NOTE: You can purchase Healing Potions y Lesser Mana Potions (in limited supply) de the Alchemy Supplies 51.67 vendedor en Refuge.
15) Justo al sur de you at Mystral Lake do "Elemental Bracers": mata y lootea a the Befouled Water Elementals for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, luego usa el/la Divining Scroll misión item to completa the misión.
16) Vuelve a Silverwind Refuge y entrega "Elemental Bracers" (50.67, #12 on map), SKIP "Mage Summoner" acepta "Mage Summoner".
17) Hardcore, 15a) Do "Mage Summoner": go all the way into The Barrens entrance 48.5 (follow main path), luego up a long mountain slope starting at 49.15, luego mata y lootea a Sarilus Foulborne 48.19.
18) Hardcore, 15b) Vuelve a Ashenvale Entrance 48.5 y entrega "Mage Summoner" 50.67.  IMPORTANT: The misión reward Light of Elune is very special for Hardcore because it can keep you alive easily with one use!  Please read the comments on WowHead for a very useful macro this item can be used with.  This can save your life under most circumstances (but with only a single use).
19) 15c) Vuelve NW to Astranaar y en Posada, entrega "An Aggressive Defense" 37.50 (#1 on map).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
20) Usa la piedra de hogar a Auberdine.
21) Ve out en long docks at Auberdine y get en boat to Stormwind City 32.44.
22) WOTLK, 17a) Ve a the Gryphon Master 71.73and vuela a Ironforge.   DRAENEI ONLY:  Draenei who did Bloodmyst Isle will only be able to get the Flight Path right now.  You will luego need to take The Deeprun Tram ride 69.31 in order to get to Ironforge.  Luego once you arrive at Ironforge, make a left y entrega "An Old Colleague" 72.52.  Luego get the Flight Path at Ironforge de the Gryphon Master56.48.
23) WOTLK, 17b) It is now time to travel to Menethil Harbor, Wetlands.  We will take the big shortcut oeste in Dun Morogh.  First sal de Ironforge SW (exit at 15.86).  NOTE: The normal route to get there would be to take the punto de vuelo to Thelsamar luego ve norte through Dun Algaz to get to Menethil, but we wont be doing this!
24) WOTLK, 17c) Ve oeste in Dun Morogh y above Brewnall Village take the hidden ramp up the mountains (starting at 31.33).  This is kind of hard to find, See Video.
25) WOTLK, 17d) Continue norte up the mountains, you will need to corre for about 45 seconds luego jump off the big mountain to your left about here 44.59to die on purpose.  This should take you hacia el graveyard at Baradin Bay, res at spirit.
26) WOTLK, 17e) Ve SW to entra en Menethil Harbor y de the Gryphon Master (9.60 in Wetlands), get the Flight Path.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[58] = {title = [[27 Wetlands]], text = [[
01) On the docks at Menethil Harbor, acepta "Claws from the Deep" 8.59.
02) Ve norte cerca de establos y acepta "Young Crocolisk Skins" 8.56.
03) On the southern part de town, junto a mailbox/Posada, acepta "The Third Fleet" y "The Greenwarden" 11.60.
04) Entra en Posada junto a you y talk hacia el Innkeeper (by the bar 11.61) to make Deepwater Tavern (Menethil Harbor) your new home.  Also de the Innkeeper, purchase a Flagon of Dwarven Honeymead for "The Third Fleet".  If you are lvl 25 remember to upgrade hacia el lvl 25 food/water!
05) Ve upstairs en Posada (en middle room) y entrega "The Absent Minded Prospector" 11.60, acepta the next part.
06) Please note that there is a First Aid Trainer 11.61 upstairs en Posada that you can use to upgrade First Aid.
07) Justo afuera de the Posada, entrega "The Third Fleet" (11.60, #3 on map), acepta "The Cursed Crew".
08) On the este side of town frente a small house, acepta "Digging Through the Ooze" 12.58.
09) Entra en the Fortress, make two lefts y at Neal Allen 11.57, see if you can purchase a Bronze Tube y a Gyrochronatom de him (if you haven't yet elsewhere), these are used for later misiones.  If you did, you can store them en mailbox by sending them to your ALT y return them back to you.
10) Ve cerca de top de fortress y acepta "War Banners" 10.57.
11) As you exit Menethil Harbor NE on el puente, acepta "In Search of The Excavation Team" 12.52.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[59] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #13]], text = [[
01) Justo al norte de the main path do "Claws from the Deep": mata 12 Bluegill Murlocs /target y mata y lootea a Gobbler /target (he patrols alrededor de 18.40).
02) SE below the main path, entra en Whelgar's Excavation Site entrance 34.42..
03) Next ve a el camino that leads up the mountain side ramp entrance 37.44..
04) Sube por path y right before the small cueva, acepta "Ormer's Revenge" 38.51.
05) Entra en small cueva y entrega "In Search of The Excavation Team" 39.52, acepta the next part.
06) Next to you en ground, lootea Flagongut's Fossil 39.52 for part of "The Absent Minded Prospector".
07) Exit Whelgar's Excavation Site (exit at 34.41, #2 on map)..
08) Sur de main path at Black Channel Marsh alrededor de 23.50 do "Ormer's Revenge": mata 10 Mottled Raptors /target y 10 Mottled Screechers /target.
09) Make sure you are at least 1,900 XP away de nivel 25 before continuing, farmea on any enemigos en immediate area until you are, y work your way hacia el next paso while accomplishing this:
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[60] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #14]], text = [[
01) SE below the main path, entra en Whelgar's Excavation Site entrance 35.42..
02) Ve a el camino that leads up the mountain side ramp entrance 37.44..
03) Sube por path y before the small cueva, entrega "Ormer's Revenge" 38.51, acepta the next part.
04) Entra en small cueva y acepta "Uncovering the Past" 39.52.  Requires lvl 25.
05) Around Whelgar's Excavation Site, do "Ormer's Revenge": mata Mottled Scytheclaws y Mottled Razormaws.  While doing this also do "Uncovering the Past": lootea the four fragments.  The fragments have random spawns alrededor de the Excavation Site.  Here is a few of them: 37.42, 35.44, 34.44, 35.47 34.49.
06) -Loose Soil contains the Neru Fragment.
07) -Ancient Relic (large vase) contains the Golm Fragment.  This could be up en mountain 33.51.
08) -Ancient Relic (slim vase) contains the Modr Fragment.
09) -Ancient Relic (tomb) contains the Ados Fragment.
10) Once done with "Ormer's Revenge", ve a el camino that leads up the mountain side (ramp entrance 37.44, #2 on map)..
11) Sube por path y before the small cueva, entrega "Ormer's Revenge" (38.51, #3 on map), acepta the next part.
12) Entra en small cueva y entrega "Uncovering the Past" (39.52, #4 on map).
13) At the Excavation Site do "Ormer's Revenge": mata y lootea a Sarltooth /target (lvl 29 blue raptor).  This raptor stays up en oeste ledge entrance 32.50 for awhile luego vees down y patrols alrededor de the Excavation Site.  He's not too hard but be prepared.
14) Ve a el camino that leads up the mountain side (ramp entrance 37.44, #2 on map)..
15) Sube por path y before the small cueva, entrega "Ormer's Revenge" (38.51, #3 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[61] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) Ve norte to exit the Whelgar's Excavation Site exit 34.41..
02) Make sure "The Absent Minded Prospector" is finished by mata/looting the raptors alrededor de 24.47 para Stone of Relu.
03) Ve este to Angerfang Encampment alrededor de 43.43 y haz "War Banners": mata y lootea a the orcs en area.
04) Ve norte hacia el main path's intersection y acepta "Daily Delivery" 50.39.
05) You can get resupplied en goblin 50.38 junto a bridge.  NOTE: This goblin might sell Healing Potions.
06) As you work en rest of this section start working on "Young Crocolisk Skins" by mata/looting the Young Wetlands Crocolisk (found mostly along the rivers).
07) Ve este to The Green Belt (past the main path a bit) y entrega "The Greenwarden" 56.40, SKIP "Tramping Paws".
08) N/A
09) N/A
10) At Ironbeard's Tomb alrededor de 44.26 do "Digging Through the Ooze": mata y lootea a the oozes (any type) until you get Sida's Bag (low drop rate).
11) Make sure "Young Crocolisk Skins" is finished by mata/looting the Young Wetlands Crocolisk (found mostly along the rivers, #6 on map).
12) Usa la piedra de hogar a Deepwater Tavern (Menethil Harbor).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  Remember to upgrade to lvl 25 food/water if you haven't yet.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[62] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) Ve upstairs en Posada (en middle room) y entrega "The Absent Minded Prospector" 11.60.  REMINDER:  The First Aid Trainer 11.61 is en other room upstairs if you need to upgrade First Aid.
02) Ve oeste hacia el docks y entrega "Claws from the Deep" 8.59, acepta "Reclaiming Goods".
03) Ve norte cerca de establos 9.56 y entrega "Daily Delivery" y "Young Crocolisk Skins", acepta "Apprentice's Duties".
04) Ve upstairs en fortress y entrega "War Banners" 10.57, acepta "Nek'Rosh's Gambit".
05) At the house este de fortress, entrega "Digging Through the Ooze" 12.58.
06) As you exit Menethil Harbor NE on el puente, entrega "In Search of The Excavation Team" 12.52.
07) Justo al norte de the main path above Menethil Harbor, click en Damaged Crate 14.41 to entrega "Reclaiming Goods", acepta "The Search Continues".
08) Ve norte a bit hacia el next small murloc camp y click en Sealed Barrel 14.38 en ground to entrega "The Search Continues", acepta "Search More Hovels".
09) Ve norte a bit more hacia el next small murloc camp y click en Half-buried Barrel 14.35 to entrega "Search More Hovels", acepta "Return the Statuette".
10) Ve al norte hacia el sunken ships y haz "The Cursed Crew": go down en southern boat y mata y lootea a First Mate Snellig /target (down at 14.30).  Also mata 13 Cursed Sailors y 5 Cursed Marines.  There are more of these enemigos al norte en other sunken boat alrededor de 15.24.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[63] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) Justo al este de you alrededor de Sundown Marsh (starting at 18.27, luego work este) do "Apprentice's Duties": mata y lootea a Giant Wetlands Crocolisks /target.  There is only 13 spawns NW in Wetlands.  If you corre out of enemigos do the next few pasos luego come back to this area to completa it.
02) You can stop at 26.26 to get repaired/resupplied.  NOTE:  At this small camp, you can have another chance to purchase a Gyrochronatom y a Bronze Tube de the NPC there (if you haven't yet elsewhere), these are used for later misiones.  If you did, you can store them en mailbox by sending them to your ALT (next time you ve a town) y return them back to you.
03) N/A
04) N/A
05) Ve a the este of you y keep grinding on dragon whelps until your Hearthstone cooldown is at least 1.5 minutes left, luego do next paso:
06) Ve norte onto Thandol Span bridge y en middle of el puente where the two doors are at jump into the water en oeste side of el puente y under the water (44.93 in Arathi Highlands) click en Waterlogged Letter (See Image) to lootea an item which starts "Sully Balloo's Letter", acepta it.
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Deepwater Tavern (Menethil Harbor).
08) Justo afuera de the Posada, entrega "The Cursed Crew" 11.60, acepta "Lifting the Curse".
09) At the oeste side de fortress, cerca de establos, entrega "Apprentice's Duties" 9.56.
10) On the docks, entrega "Return the Statuette" 8.59.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[64] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) Ve a the Gryphon Master 9.60 y vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
02) At Ironforge, ve a the bank 35.61 y put the following item into it:  Dwarven Tinder.  Get the following items out de bank:  (If you have them) 4 Minor Mana Potions y 2 Elixir of Minor Fortitude.  Also get out (if you have it) a Bronze Tube (could be in your mailbox).  You can also check the AH 25.73 for these items.  Also, de the bank, get your Book: The Powers Below out también (if you have it).
03) GET NEW ABILITIES, 2c) Get new spells/abilities in Ironforge.
04) If you have the Book: The Powers Below, go norte y entrega "The Powers Below" 51.6.
05) Ve este in Ironforge y entrega (Draenei may have already turned this in) "An Old Colleague" 72.52, y if you have 4 Minor Mana Potions y 2 Elixir of Minor Fortitude with you, acepta y entrega "Ineptitude + Chemicals = Fun", SKIP the next part.
06) Ve sur to The Military Ward y entrega "Sully Balloo's Letter" 63.67.  Wait a few seconds luego acepta "Sara Balloo's Plea".
07) Ve NW to The High Seat y entrega "Sara Balloo's Plea" 39.56, acepta "A King's Tribute".
08) Ve sur in Ironforge y entrega "A King's Tribute" 39.88, acepta the next part.
09) Ve a the Gryphon Master 56.48 y vuela a Stormwind, Elwynn.
10) N/A
11) Ve a The Mage Quarter y entrega "A Scroll from Mauren" 53.87, SKIP "Devils in Westfall".
12) Ve oeste down in The Slaughtered Lamb 40.84 y acepta "A Noble Brew" 40.85.
13) Sigue el camino principal este through Elwynn Forest all the way to Redridge Mountains y get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master 31.59.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[65] = {title = [[30 Duskwood]], text = [[
01) In Duskwood, sigue el camino SW, luego sur to Manor Mistmantle y haz part of "A Noble Brew": lootea the Tear of Tilloa (78.36 in Duskwood) en middle de fenced area.
02) Ve sur to Darkshire y en first house on your left 76.45, acepta "The Legend of Stalvan" y "The Totem of Infliction".
03) Just cruzando path, junto a directional sign, entra en Posada y talk hacia el Innkeeper 74.44 to make Darkshire your new home.
04) As you exit the Posada, on your right, stop en mailbox 74.46 y get out (if you have it)  Bronze Tube.  Luego junto a you acepta "The Night Watch" 74.47.
05) Just dentro de Town Hall junto a you, entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 73.47, acepta the next part.
06) Justo afuera de the house junto a blacksmith shop, acepta "Worgen in the Woods" 76.48 (patrols a bit).
07) Ve dentro de house junto a you y acepta "Raven Hill", "The Hermit" y "Deliveries to Sven" 75.49.
08) If you do not have a Bronze Tube or a Gyrochronatom yet:  SE in Darkshire, you will see a gnome dressed in blue y red named Herble Baubbletump 78.48 /target standing afuera, de him see if you can purchase a Bronze Tube (if one is not already in your inventory).  De this NPC, you also have another chance to purchase a Gyrochronatom de him (if you haven't yet elsewhere), this is used for a later misión.  If you did, you can store it by sending it to your ALT a través de mailbox.  NOTE:  These items are on a random respawn timer de him, so they may not be available.
09) Ve just norte of el camino in Darkshire y de the Gryphon Master 77.44, get the Flight Path.
10) Ve SE a bit, y up en small house, acepta y luego entrega "Look To The Stars" 80.48, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  If you didn't have a Bronze Tube you will have to skip this entire misión chain!
11) Ve sur of Darkshire hacia el small house y entrega "Look To The Stars" 82.59, acepta the next part.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[66] = {title = [[Alliance - Duskwood]], text = [[
01) Ve sur to Tranquil Gardens Cemetery y haz "The Night Watch": mata 8 Skeletal Warriors y 6 Skeletal Mages.  Also do "Look To The Stars": mata y lootea a Insane Ghoul /target (usually en church 80.71, or could be patrolling alrededor de the cemetery).
02) Ve oeste to The Rotting Orchard alrededor de 66.66 y haz "Worgen in the Woods": mata 6 Nightbane Shadow Weavers /target.
03) Ve NE to Darkshire y frente a Town Hall, entrega "The Night Watch" 74.47, acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) Sur of la carretera, frente a house entrega "Worgen in the Woods" 76.48, acepta the next part.
05) In the small house este in Darkshire, entrega "Look To The Stars" 80.48, acepta the next part.
06) Ve oeste of Darkshire alrededor de 64.51 y haz "Worgen in the Woods": mata 12 Nightbane Dark Runners /target.
07) Vuelve a Darkshire y frente a house sur of la carretera, entrega "Worgen in the Woods" (76.48 (patrols a bit), #4 on map), acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
08) Ve sur to Roland's Doom mine entrance 73.76 y haz "Worgen in the Woods": mata 8 Nightbane Vile Fangs (afuera la mina) y 8 Nightbane Tainted Ones (dentro de mine).
09) Ve SW to Vul'Gol Ogre Mound cueva entrance 34.78 y haz "Look To The Stars": sur in la cueva, mata y lootea a Zzarc' Vul /target (lvl 30 ogre 37.84).  He could spawn in another part in la cueva.
10) Ve NW to Raven Hill y entrega "Raven Hill" 18.56.  Acepta "Jitters' Growling Gut" (no exclamation mark).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[67] = {title = [[Alliance - Duskwood]], text = [[
01) Ve norte to Raven Hill Cemetery alrededor de 21.47 y haz "The Night Watch": mata 15 Skeletal Fiends /target y 15 Skeletal Horrors /target.  These skeletons are found en southern part de cemetery.  Before leaving the southern cemetery, make sure you have all 10 Skeleton Fingers for "The Totem of Infliction" de the skeleton enemigos.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
02) In the northern part of Raven Hill Cemetery alrededor de 24.37 finish "The Totem of Infliction": mata y lootea a the ghouls para Ghoul Fangs y spiders para Vial of Spider Venom.  You can find a lot of spiders este de cemetery.  Also make sure you obtain 6 Gooey Spider Legs for a later misión, y haz not sell them to a vendedor!  They can drop de any spider.
03) Ve NE in Raven Hill Cemetery y en small shack, entrega "The Hermit" 28.31.  Acepta "Supplies from Darkshire".
04) Ve oeste y de A Weathered Grave 18.29, acepta "The Weathered Grave".
05) Ve oeste a bit more hacia el small camp by el río y entrega "Deliveries to Sven" 8.34.  Acepta "Sven's Revenge".
06) Usa la piedra de hogar a Darkshire.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[68] = {title = [[Alliance - Duskwood]], text = [[
01) In the Posada's kitchen, entrega "Jitters' Growling Gut" patrols a bit 74.44.  Also, acepta y entrega "Dusky Crab Cakes".  Acepta "Return to Jitters" (no exclamation mark).
02) As you exit the Posada, frente a Town Hall, entrega "The Night Watch" 74.47, SKIP the next part.
03) Entra en Town Hall junto a you y entrega "The Weathered Grave" 73.48, acepta "Morgan Ladimore".
04) Justo afuera de the Town Hall (#3 on map), entrega "Morgan Ladimore" 74.47, acepta "Mor'Ladim".  NOTE:  The misión reward item The Story of Morgan Ladimore can be destroyed as it's not used for anything.
05) Entra en house norte of el camino in Darkshire 76.45 y entrega "The Totem of Infliction" y "Supplies from Darkshire", acepta "Ghost Hair Thread".
06) Frente a other house cruzando road, entrega "Worgen in the Woods" 76.48 (patrols a bit), acepta the next part.
07) Entra en house junto a you y entrega "Worgen in the Woods" 75.49.
08) Vendor, 8b) Make sure you are resupplied de Herble Baubbletump 78.48 /target.  De this NPC, you also have another chance to purchase a Gyrochronatom de him (if you haven't yet elsewhere), this is used for a later misión.  If you did, you can store it by sending it to your ALT a través de mailbox.  NOTE:  These items are on a random respawn timer de him, so they may not be available.
09) Ve este in Darkshire hacia el small house y entrega "Look To The Stars" 80.48.
10) Ve sur hacia el small house y entrega "Ghost Hair Thread" 82.59, acepta "Return the Comb".
11) Vuelve a Darkshire y en house norte of el camino, entrega "Return the Comb" (76.45, #6 on map), acepta "Deliver the Thread".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[69] = {title = [[Alliance - Westfall]], text = [[
01) Ve SW to The Yorgen Farmstead y between the two buildings, click en Mound of loose dirt 50.78 to entrega "Sven's Revenge", acepta "Sven's Camp".
02) Ve NW to Raven Hill y entrega "Return to Jitters" 18.56.
03) NE in Raven Hill Cemetery, en shack, entrega "Deliver the Thread" 28.31, acepta "Zombie Juice".
04) GROUP (or soloable?):  If you have a group you can Try to do "Mor'Ladim": mata y lootea a Mor'Ladim /target (lvl 30 Elite undead), he patrols alrededor de the afuera cemetery.  BIG TRICK: There is a big trick where you can kite him alrededor de one de big trees en area while doing damage to him, to mata him easily.  If the tree trick is to difficult for you luego skip it.
05) Ve oeste hacia el small camp by el río y entrega "Sven's Camp" 8.34, acepta "The Shadowy Figure".
06) NON HUMANS:  Ve oeste to Westfall at Sentinel Hill y ve a the Gryphon Master (57.53 in Westfall) y get the Flight Path.
07) Ve oeste into Westfall, y entra en old Town Hall at Moonbrook y click the Old Footlocker to entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" (42.67 in Westfall), acepta the next part.
08) Usa la piedra de hogar a Darkshire.  If Hearthstone is still on a cooldown, go NE to Westfall at Sentinel Hill y ve a the Gryphon Master (57.53 in Westfall, #6 on map) y vuela a Darkshire, Duskwood.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[70] = {title = [[Alliance - Westfall]], text = [[
01) In the Posada, entrega "Zombie Juice" 74.44, SKIP "Gather Rot Blossoms".
02) Justo afuera de the Posada 74.47, entrega IF YOU DID IT:  entrega "Mor'Ladim", acepta "The Daughter Who Lived", luego find Watcher Ladimore /target (she patrols alrededor de town) y entrega "The Daughter Who Lived", acepta "A Daughter's Love".
03) Entra en house norte of el camino in Darkshire y entrega "The Shadowy Figure" 76.45, acepta "The Shadowy Search Continues".
04) Entra en Town Hall building y entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 73.47, acepta the next part.  Also entrega "The Shadowy Search Continues", acepta "Inquire at the Inn".
05) In the Posada, entrega "Inquire at the Inn" 74.44, acepta "Finding the Shadowy Figure".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
06) Ve just NE of el camino in Darkshire y de the Gryphon Master up at 77.44, vuela a Sentinel Hill, Westfall.
07) Ve este into Duskwood to Raven Hill y entrega "Finding the Shadowy Figure" (18.56 in Duskwood), acepta "Return to Sven".
08) Ve NW hacia el small camp by el río y entrega "Return to Sven" 8.34, acepta "Proving Your Worth".
09) IF YOU HAVE "A Daughter's Love", turn this in este at A Weathered Grave 18.29.
10) At the NW side of Raven Hill Cemetery do "Proving Your Worth": mata 15 Skeletal Raiders /target, 3 Skeletal Healers y 3 Skeletal Warders (the warders are only found en catacombs entrance 16.39).
11) Ve NW hacia el small camp by el río y entrega "Proving Your Worth" (8.34, #8 on map), acepta "Seeking Wisdom".
12) Usa la piedra de hogar a Darkshire, or go oeste to Westfall at Sentinel Hill y ve a the Gryphon Master (57.53 in Westfall) y vuela a Darkshire, Duskwood.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[71] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) Steps #1 - #8 will be skipped for SoM/WotLK due to faster leveling rate.  Asegúrate de ser nivel 30 now, if not farmea until you are.
02) Ve just NE of el camino in Darkshire y de the Gryphon Master up at 77.44, vuela a Stormwind, Elwynn.  Do next paso while flying:
03) While questing in Duskwood you may have came across an item, which starts "An Old History Book" (acepta it if you can).  Also if "Mor'Ladim" is still in your questbook you can abandon it.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[72] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) Inside Cathedral Square, de the Altar Boy patrolling alrededor de 51.47, acepta "The Missing Diplomat".
02) De Brother Sarno en cathedral, acepta "Tinkmaster Overspark" 51.48.
03) In the cathedral, entrega "Seeking Wisdom" 50.46 patrols a bit, acepta "The Doomed Fleet".
04) Ve NE to Stormwind Keep y entrega "The Missing Diplomat" 80.44, acepta the next part.
05) Norte en Royal Library, entrega "An Old History Book" 77.30, acepta "Southshore".
06) Ve este in Stormwind City (cerca de entrance de city) y entrega "The Missing Diplomat" 76.85, acepta the next part.
07) Ve SE into Elwynn Forest to Lion's Pride Posada y de Innkeeper Farley 44.66 entrega "The Legend of Stalvan", acepta the next part.
08) Ve upstairs en Posada, make a right y back between the two beds do "The Legend of Stalvan": lootea the Storage Chest 44.66.
09) Ve NW to Stormwind y upstairs in Trias' Cheese, entrega "The Missing Diplomat" (66.74 in Stormwind), acepta the next part.
10) Ve a the bank 63.78 y put the following items in your bank:  Tear of Tilloa, An Undelivered Letter y Sealed Note to Watcher Backus.
11) Ve a the Gryphon Master 71.73 y vuela a Menethil Harbor, Wetlands.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[73] = {title = [[30 Wetlands - First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!! - Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)]], text = [[
01) In Deepwater Tavern Posada, entrega "The Doomed Fleet" 11.61, acepta "Lightforge Iron".  NOTE:  You can upgrade First Aid upstairs de the First Aid Trainer (if you have not learned Silk Bandage yet).
02) Ve just sur of Menethil Harbor, hacia el wrecked boat en water y de the Waterlogged Chest 12.64, entrega "Lightforge Iron", acepta "The Lost Ingots".
03) In the immediate area, do "The Lost Ingots": mata y lootea a Bluegill Raiders.  These enemigos extend al sur to 10.72.
04) Vuelve en Deepwater Tavern Posada y entrega "The Lost Ingots" (11.61, #1 on map), acepta "Blessed Arm".
05) Ve sur en docks at Menethil Harbor to get en boat to ve a Theramore, Dustwallow 5.64.
06) At Theramore, ve a the Gryphon Master 67.51 y vuela a Astranaar, Ashenvale.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[74] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #01]], text = [[
01) 30 Ashenvale
02) At Astranaar, acepta "Kayneth Stillwind" (junto a directional sign 35.49).
03) 01b) At la entrada hacia el building, acepta "A Helping Hand" 35.50.
04) Ve up en Posada y de the Innkeeper make Astranaar your new home 37.49.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) Head NE to Forest Song y de the patrolling Ancient of War alrededor de 85.46 acepta "Reclaiming Felfire Hill".
06) Ve up y get the Flight Path de the Hippogryph Master 85.43.
07) Ve down y entrega "Kayneth Stillwind" 85.45.  Acepta "Forsaken Diseases" y "The Lost Chalice".
08) In the middle of town 86.44 acepta "The Howling Vale" y junto a you "Agents of Destruction". SKIP "Report from the Northern Front".
09) Acepta "Destroy the Legion" 86.44.
10) Acepta "Vile Satyr! Dryads in Danger!" 87.43.
11) Entrega "A Helping Hand", acepta "A shameful Waste" 87.45.
12) Ve sur to Warsong Lumber Camp y haz "Agents of Destruction" y part of "A shameful Waste": mata the required amount of enemigos, Overseer Gorthak is up en burrow 89.60.  And pick up 15 Warsong Lumber (the wood will be obtained later).
13) Ve SW to Felfire Hill alrededor de 81.66 y haz "Destroy the Legion" y "Reclaiming Felfire Hill": mata the required amount of demons y click en Fertile Dirt Mounds.
14) Ve NW to entra en the Night Corre 64.44..
15) Sur in Night Corre do part of "The Tower of Althalaxx": click en Circle of Imprisonment (en ground 67.57).
16) Exit Night Corre NW y starting at 60.39 do "Raene's Cleansing": work your way NW hacia el next paso while mata/looting the Crazed Ancients y Withered Ancients for a Wooden Key (goes in keyring):
17) Once you got the Wooden Key, lootea the Worn Chest (on a cement block 54.35).
18) Ve oeste up a path starting at 54.33 luego through a small cueva y haz "The Howling Vale": click en Tome of Mel'Thandris (on a small table 50.39).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[75] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #02]], text = [[
01) Ve SW hacia el Moonwell y entrega "Raene's Cleansing" 54.46, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  You will have to go all the way alrededor de the mountains to get to it, I found no shortcut.
02) Ve este to Xavian (follow path on map), clear the Satyrs en area, luego entrega "Vile Satyr! Dryads in Danger!" 78.45, acepta "The Branch of Cenarius".
03) Work your way norte in Xavian y haz "The Branch of Cenarius": mata y lootea a Geltharis /target (purple satyr, 78.42).
04) Ve este to Forest Song y de the patrolling Ancient of War alrededor de 85.46 entrega "Reclaiming Felfire Hill".
05) In the middle of town entrega "The Howling Vale" 86.44, acepta "Velinde Starsong".  Next to you entrega "Agents of Destruction".
06) Entrega "Destroy the Legion" 86.44.
07) Entrega "The Branch of Cenarius" 87.43 (this dryad could be patrolling alrededor de the area).  Acepta "Satyr Slaying!".
08) Ve oeste to Satyrnaar y haz "The Lost Chalice": lootea the Chalice of Elune en red temple's ledge 81.49.  Or this could be en other side de temple at 81.49.
09) Next to you do the last part of "The Tower of Althalaxx": click en Circle of Imprisonment (en ground, 82.49).
10) At Satyrnaar finish "Satyr Slaying!" y "A shameful Waste": mata y lootea a any satyr demons para 16 horns.  And pick up 5 Satyrnaar Fel Wood.
11) Ve sur of Splintertree Post (horde town) y haz "Forsaken Diseases": lootea a Bottle of Disease on either the table or barrel 75.72.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
12) All alrededor de this area 73.74 do "Raene's Cleansing": mata y lootea a Rotting Slimes until you get the Iron Pommel.  You can also find this en Rusty Chests that drop de the slimes.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[76] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #03]], text = [[
01) Ve SW hacia el small island at Fallen Sky Lake y haz "Fallen Sky Lake": mata y lootea a Shadethicket Oracle /target (swamp elemental) 67.82.
02) Ve NE to Forest Song y entrega "Forsaken Diseases" 85.45 y "The Lost Chalice".  SKIP "Insane Druids".
03) TBC, 2a) Este in Forest Song entrega "Satyr Slaying!" (this dryad could be patrolling alrededor de the area) 87.43.  Also de the patrolling Ancient of War entrega "A shameful Waste".
04) N/A
05) Usa la piedra de hogar a Astranaar.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
06) In the small house este in Astranaar, entrega "Fallen Sky Lake" 37.52.
07) Ve NE hacia el Moonwell y entrega "Raene's Cleansing" 54.46.  Wait a few seconds luego acepta the next part.
08) Ve a el camino starting at 56.51 y work your way up el camino hacia el next paso:
09) At the top of el camino click en Hidden Shrine 56.49 to entrega "Raene's Cleansing", acepta the next part.
10) Vuelve NW hacia el Moonwell y entrega "Raene's Cleansing" (54.46, #9 on map), acepta the next part.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[77] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Hearth, or corre back to Astranaar y down en Posada entrega "Raene's Cleansing" 37.50, acepta the next part.
02) Ve SE y use your Dartol's Rod of Transformation misión item to entrega "Raene's Cleansing" 51.75, acepta next part.
03) Ve SE a bit y haz "Raene's Cleansing": mata y lootea a Ran Bloodtooth at 55.80 y 4 Bloodtooth Guards.
04) Vuelve NW a bit (use your Dartol's Rod of Transformation) to entrega "Raene's Cleansing" (51.75, #2 on map) acepta next part.
05) Jump in el lago junto a you y luego die on purpose y res at spirit so you can get back to Astranaar.
06) Hearth (or vuelve) to Astranaar.
07) In the Posada at Astranaar entrega "Raene's Cleansing" (37.50, #1 on map).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  NOTE: You can destroy the Dartol's Rod of Transformation as its no longer used for anything else.
08) N/A
09) Ve NW on el camino to Maestra's Post y entrega "The Tower of Althalaxx" 26.39, SKIP the next part.
10) Hearth (if you can), or corre back to Astranaar.
11) Ve a the Hippogryph Master 34.48 y vuela a Rut'theran, Teldrassil.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[78] = {title = [[Darnassus]], text = [[
01) At Rut'theran, sube por red portal 56.89 to get to Darnassus.
02) Ve a Darnassus's Bank 40.42 y get the following item out of your bank: Dwarven Tinder.  And if you have them, get out Hillman's Cloak & Bolt of Woolen Cloth, Swiftness Potion, also a Nada Speed Potion.  You can check the AH for these items on a few pasos below y remember not to sell these items to a vendedor!
03) Ve este y acepta "Klockmort's Essentials" 60.45.  NOTE:  Next to you in that same area you can visit the Weapon Master 58.47 to learn any new weapons.
04) Este up the ramp, entrega "Velinde Starsong" 62.39, acepta "Velinde's Effects".
05) You can stop en AH at 57.53 y you can see if you can get (if you still need to):  Hillman's Cloak & Bolt of Woolen Cloth.  Also see if you can get 4 Lesser Bloodstone Ore y keep that in your mailbox/bank for now.
06) Ve sur y entra en Mail Armor / Shields building entrance 57.78, go up y cross el puente hacia el next paso..
07) Up en building do "Velinde's Effects": lootea Velinde's Locker 62.83.
08) Vuelve norte y entrega "Velinde's Effects" (62.39, #4 on map), acepta "The Barrens Port".
09) Vuelve a través de red portal to exit Darnassus 29.41.
10) At Rut'theran, go out en docks hacia el Hippogryph Master 58.94 y vuela a Theramore, Dustwallow.
11) At Theramore, go en docks to get en boat to take you to Menethil Harbor 72.56.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[79] = {title = [[31 Wetlands]], text = [[
01) Ve in Deepwater Tavern Posada y make it your new home 11.61.
02) Ve norte hacia el northern sunken boat en water y haz "Lifting the Curse": mata y lootea a Captain Halyndor /target (on top de boat 15.24).
03) Ve underneath the boat (crack entrada en 14.24) y click en Intrepid's Locked Strongbox (en grassy area) to entrega "Lifting the Curse" 14.24, acepta "The Eye of Paleth".
04) Ve SE to Angerfang Encampment y click en Dragonmaw Catapult 47.47 to entrega "Nek'rosh's Gambit", acepta "Defeat Nek'rosh".
05) Ve SE en Angerfang Encampment y do "Defeat Nek'rosh": mata y lootea a Chieftain Nek'rosh /target 53.55.
06) Ve SE just past el río y haz the last part of "A Noble Brew": lootea the Musquash Root 65.75.  It looks like a thorn al fondo de the waterfall.
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Deepwater Tavern (if you can) , luego continue on:
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[80] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) In the Posada, entrega "The Eye of Paleth" 11.61, acepta "Cleansing the Eye".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) At the fortress entrance, acepta "Fall of Dun Modr" 11.56.  Accepted de Harlo Barnaby /target laying down (no exclamation mark).
03) Entrega (if you did it) "Defeat Nek'rosh" up en Keep 10.57, if not, you can abandon the misión.
04) Ve NE to Dun Modr y entrega "Fall of Dun Modr" 50.18.
05) Next to you, acepta "The Thandol Span" 50.18.
06) Ve norte on el puente y half-way cruzando bridge you will see two doors on both sides of el puente, take either door (51.8 in Wetlands), y baja por stairs.  Once down there, click on Ebenezer Rustlocke's Corpse 51.8 to entrega "The Thandol Span", acepta the next part.
07) Vuelve sur to Dun Modr y entrega "The Thandol Span" (50.18, #4 on map), acepta the next part.
08) Ve norte y just past el puente on your right is a wooden bridge (entrada en 46.88 in Arathi Highlands).  Ve cruzando bridge y haz "The Thandol Span": just past the wooden bridge, click en Cache of Explosives 49.88.
09) Vuelve sur to Dun Modr y entrega "The Thandol Span" (50.18, #4 on map), acepta "Plea To The Alliance".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[81] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #10]], text = [[
01) SWIFTNESS POTION ONLY (or try a difficult jump):   (See Video Guide for this misión) Ve norte cruzando bridge y luego make a left, luego another left to a broken bridge (at 43.91 in Arathi Highlands).  Make sure you have a Swiftness Potion y/or your mount on, luego use that extra speed boost to take a jump onto the next structure en middle de water.  Once over there, acepta "MacKreel's Moonshine" 43.93.  NOTE:  This misión is on a 15 minute timer, so work quickly to do the next few pasos:
02) Nada este (use a Nada Speed Potion if you have one) to get en mountain ramp (starting at 53.90 in Arathi) to get back up the land.
03) Ve norte to Refuge Pointe y entrega "Plea To The Alliance" 46.48.
04) You can get repaired/resupplied de Jannos Ironwill 46.48 junto a Bonfire.
05) De the Gryphon Master 46.46 get the Flight Path.
06) N/A
07) N/A
08) Head NW into Hillsbrad Foothills (20.29 in Arathi Highlands)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[82] = {title = [[32 Hillsbrad Foothills]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) Just oeste frente a small house at Southshore, entrega "Southshore" 51.57, SKIP "Preserving Knowledge" (for now).
03) Just oeste en bigger house, ONLY acepta "Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak" 49.56 if you have the Hillman's Cloak y Bolt of Woolen Cloth items with you.
04) Ve sur y on your left entra en the Posada y de the Innkeeper 51.59 make Southshore your new home.
05) At the bar, acepta "Down the Coast" 51.58.
06) IF YOU ARE ON "MacKreel's Moonshine": Ve down en Posada's basement y entrega "MacKreel's Moonshine" 52.59.
07) TBC, 6a) In the Posada acepta "Missing Crystals" 51.59.
08) NOTE:  Sometimes you will see a pack of Shadowy Assassins attacking the guardias frente a Town Hall.  If you manage to mata y lootea a one of them, you will be able to lootea an item, which starts "Assassin's Contract", acepta it if you can.  If you were able to do it luego turn it in (dentro de town hall 48.59), SKIP "Baron's Demise" (for now).
09) Ve a the shore SW of Southshore (starting at 48.64 y work your way oeste along the shore) y haz "Down the Coast": mata 10 Torn Fin Tidehunters y 10 Torn Fin Oracles.
10) Entra en Posada at Southshore y en bar entrega "Down the Coast" (51.58, #4 on map), acepta "Farren's Proof".
11) Vuelve a the shore SW of Southshore (starting at 48.64 y work your way oeste along the shore, #9 on map) y haz "Farren's Proof": mata y lootea a murlocs.  Any of them can drop the heads you need.
12) Entra en Posada at Southshore y en bar entrega "Farren's Proof" (51.58, #4 on map), acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[83] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #12]], text = [[
01) Justo afuera de the Posada, frente a Town Hall, entrega "Farren's Proof" 49.59, acepta the next part.
02) Back en Posada en bar, entrega "Farren's Proof" 51.58, acepta "Stormwind Ho!".
03) Ve SE hacia el shore starting at 53.65 y work your way este along the shore y haz "Stormwind Ho!": mata 10 Daggerspine Shorehunters y 10 Daggerspine Sirens.
04) Vuelve a the Posada at Southshore y en bar entrega "Stormwind Ho!" (51.58, #2 on map), acepta "Reassignment".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) TBC, 4a) Ve norte y dentro de tower do "Missing Crystals": lootea the Unopened Crate 56.35.
06) Ve NW hacia el Yeti cueva entrance 46.32 y haz "A King's Tribute": lootea 5 Alterac Granite along la cueva walls.  And if you have the Hillman's Cloak & Bolt of Woolen Cloth items with you along con misión "Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak", luego mata y lootea a yeti for 10 Yeti Furs.
07) NOTE, 5b) Steps 6 - 8 will be skipped for SoM/WotLK.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[84] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #13]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) N/A
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a Southshore.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) TBC, 3a) In the Posada entrega "Missing Crystals" 51.59.
05) N/A
06) N/A
07) If you were able to work on "Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak", luego ve cruzando path into the big house y en lower floor de the Trade Goods vendedor 49.55, purchase a Fine Thread.  Luego, justo afuera de the house, entrega "Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak" 49.56.
08) N/A
09) Ve oeste cruzando path hacia el Gryphon Master 49.52 y vuela a Refuge Pointe, Arathi.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[85] = {title = [[32 Arathi Highlands]], text = [[
01) At Refuge Pointe, junto a tents, acepta "Northfold Manor" 46.48.
02) Ve NW to Northfold Manor alrededor de 33.30 y haz "Northfold Manor": mata 10 Syndicate Highwayman /target y 6 Syndicate Mercenary /target.
03) Die on purpose, res luego ve NW a bit back to Refuge Pointe y entrega "Northfold Manor" (46.48, #1 on map), SKIP "Stromgarde Badges" (for now).
04) You can get repaired/resupplied de Jannos Ironwill 46.48 junto a Bonfire.
05) De the Gryphon Master 46.46, vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[86] = {title = [[Ironforge]], text = [[
01) NOTE:  You can entrega cloth donations at 43.32 para Dwarf faction.  You would need 60 Wool Cloth, luego 60 Silk Cloth.  You can compra the cloth de the AH también.
02) GET NEW ABILITIES, 1b) Get new spells/abilities in Ironforge.
03) N/A
04) N/A
05) If you have extra cloth luego ve sur to Tinker Town y make a left, you can entrega cloth donations para Gnome faction 74.48.
06) At Tinker Town, entrega "Klockmort's Essentials" 68.46, SKIP "Essential Artificials" (Dungeon).
07) In the same room, entrega "Tinkmaster Overspark" 70.50.  NOTE:  Most de misiones you obtain de Tinker Town are done en Gnomeregan (29-38 five-man Dungeon) found oeste in Dun Morogh y can be optionally done if you have a group, but my guide will not cover them.
08) Ve SE at The Military Ward y acepta "The Brassbolts Brothers" 73.94.
09) Ve middle-sur of Ironforge y entrega "A King's Tribute" 39.88.  Luego wait for this dwarf to go down stairs luego back up y luego acepta the next part.
10) Ve norte to The High Seat y entrega "A King's Tribute" 39.56.
11) Ve a the middle of Ironforge hacia el Gryphon Master 56.48 y vuela a Stormwind, Elwynn.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[87] = {title = [[Stormwind]], text = [[
01) At Stormwind City, entra en Posada (The Gilded Rose) y en Innkeeper 60.75, make Stormwind City your new home.
02) Ve a bank 63.78 y get the following items out: An Undelivered Letter, Tear of Tilloa, Sealed Note to Watcher Backus.  Put in your bank:  Crate of Crash Helmets.
03) Ve SW to The Mage Quarter y de Archmage Malin 50.87, acepta "Malin's Request".
04) Ve oeste down the pasos 40.84 in The Slaughtered Lamb y entrega "A Noble Brew" 40.85, acepta the next part.
05) Ve norte at The canals y entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 43.72, acepta next part.
06) Next to you, click en Sealed Crate to entrega "The Legend of Stalvan", acepta the next part.
07) Ve norte hacia el Cathedral of Light y entrega "Cleansing the Eye" 50.46.
08) Ve NE hacia el Dwarven District y entrega "Blessed Arm" 60.34, SKIP "Armed and Ready".
09) Ve NE to Stormwind Keep (en Petitioner's Chamber) y entrega "A Noble Brew" 78.49.
10) Norte in Stormwind Keep, entrega "Reassignment" 76.37.
11) Ve a the Gryphon Master 71.73 y vuela a Lakeshire, Redridge.
12) Ve SW into Elwynn Forest to Eastvale Logging Camp y entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" (85.69 in Elwynn), acepta the next part.
13) Do "The Legend of Stalvan": go upstairs en house junto a you y lootea Marshal Haggard's Chest (by the bed 86.70).
14) Just afuera the house, entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 85.69, acepta the next part.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[88] = {title = [[Alliance - Duskwood]], text = [[
01) Ve sur into Duskwood, y just norte of Darkshire en main path find Watcher Backus (he patrols de Darkshire up to 73.33).  De him, entrega "The Missing Diplomat", SKIP the next part.
02) Entra en Posada at Darkshire y entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 74.44, acepta the next part.
03) Frente a Town Hall, entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 74.47, acepta the next part.
04) Just en Town Hall, entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 73.47, acepta the next part.
05) Frente a Town Hall, entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 74.47, acepta the next part.
06) Ve norte, luego este to Manor Mistmantle y haz "The Legend of Stalvan": en small house, mata y lootea a Stalvan Mistmantle /target 77.36.
07) Vuelve a Darkshire y en big house norte of el camino, entrega "The Legend of Stalvan" 76.45.
08) Sigue el camino principal sur to ve a Stranglethorn Vale (45.89 in Duskwood)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[89] = {title = [[33 Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) In STV, sigue el camino oeste luego norte to get hacia el Rebel Camp  y get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master 38.4.
02) Acepta "The Second Rebellion" y "Bad Medicine" 38.3.
03) Also at el campamento, acepta "Krazek's Cookery" 38.3.
04) Next to you, make sure you are resupplied 38.3.
05) As you sal de sur de el campamento, y if a friendly NPC named Private Thorsen /target is patrolling or attacking enemigos, follow y protect him, luego acepta "Jungle Secrets" (this would be at 40.8).  If you were able to acepta this, luego turn this in back norte en Rebel Camp (38.3, #1 on map) y acepta "Bookie Herod".  If you were not able to do this right now, keep this in mind in case when you corre across this spot en future.
06) Ve SE to Kurzen's Compound y haz "The Second Rebellion" y "Bad Medicine": mata 15 Kurzen Jungle Fighters /target, mata y lootea a the enemigos para Jungle Remedy y lootea a Kurzen Supplies (cajas).  Also IF you have the "Bookie Herod" misión:  Upstairs en house, click en Bookie Herod's Records to entrega "Bookie Herod" 44.9, acepta "The Hidden Key".
07) Vuelve NW hacia el Rebel Camp y entrega "The Second Rebellion" y "Bad Medicine" (38.3, #1 on map), acepta "Special Forces".
08) Ve SW past el río to Nesingwary's Expedition y acepta "Welcome to the Jungle" 36.11.
09) Next to you, entrega "Welcome to the Jungle" 36.11.  NOTE: For SoM/WotLK we will skip all Nesingwary hunting misión due hacia el faster leveling rate.
10) NOTE:  The "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn" misión requires that you save any Green Hills of Stranglethorn pages you find.  These pages can drop de any humanoid mob in STV.  You will need one of each de following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  I recommend mailing them to your alt for storage.  Once your alt collects all the pages, mail them back to your main.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.  You don't need to acepta the misión to get the page drops, so acepta y turn this in if you get all the pages.  You will regresa a STV numerous times en future for more chances to find the pages.
11) At el campamento get repaired/resupplied de Jaquilina Dramet 36.11.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[90] = {title = [[NOTE, 8b) Steps 1-8 will be skipped for SoM/WotLK due hacia el faster leveling rate.]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) Ve sur to entra en Booty Bay, y up en Posada, entrega "Krazek's Cookery" 27.77, SKIP "Favor for Krazek" (for now).  Also acepta "The Haunted Isle".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[91] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Just junto a you up en boat-deck, entrega "The Haunted Isle" 27.77, SKIP "The Stone of the Tides" (for now).
02) It's a bit hard to find, but stay up y go slightly sur over hacia el ledge to get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master 28.78.
03) Ve a the end de docks 26.73 at Booty Bay to get en boat to take you to Ratchet.
04) At Ratchet, right when you get off the boat, entrega "The Barrens Port" 63.38, SKIP "Passage to Booty Bay" (for now).
05) Get the Flight Path at Ratchet de the Flight Master 63.37.
06) Ve a the bank junto a you 63.37 y get out your Crate of Crash Helmets.
07) Next to Ratchet's bank, entra en Ironzar's Imported Weaponry to get repaired/resupplied 62.37.
08) Now travel all the way sur through The Barrens to The Great Lift (44.92 in The Barrens).  Watch out for Horde players!
09) Baja por Lift y you will see a dwarf corpse laying en ground holding a journal (31.24 in Thousand Needles), lootea it, y de it, acepta "Lonebrow's Journal".
10) Head oeste in Thousand Needles to Thalanaar (90.47 in 1k Needles) y entrega "Lonebrow's Journal", SKIP "The Crone of the Kraul" (Dungeon).
11) Just este in Thalanaar get the Flight Path de the Hippogryph Master (89.46 in Feralas).
12) Ve SE all the way to The Shimmering Flats (78.77 in 1k Needles)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[92] = {title = [[34 Thousand Needles (Shimmering Flats)]], text = [[
01) At Mirage Raceway, entrega "The Brassbolts Brothers" 78.77.  Acepta "Hardened Shells".  And junto a you acepta "Salt Flat Venom".  Next to you de the dwarf, acepta "Rocket Car Parts" 78.77.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) Este en Goblin's side of Mirage Raceway acepta "Load Lightening" 80.76.
03) SE in Mirage Raceway by the starting line acepta "A Bump in the Road" 82.78.
04) Do The Shimmering Flats farmea.  Do the following 5 pasos below (in any order) all together alrededor de The Shimmering Flats:
05) "Rocket Car Parts": pick up Rocket Car Rubble de the ground.  These are scattered all alrededor de The Shimmering Flats.
06) "Hardened Shells": mata y lootea a turtles all over The Shimmering Flats.  ALSO:  Make sure you recoge 10 Turtle Meat for a later misión at Southshore in Hillsbrad, y haz not sell them to a vender!  You can get the Turtle Meat de any turtle at The Shimmering Flats y there is a large amount al norte alrededor de 83.55.
07) "Load Lightening": mata y lootea a vultures (Salt Flats Scavengers & Salt Flats Vultures).  There is a lot alrededor de 88.65.
08) "Salt Flat Venom": mata y lootea a scorpids (Scorpid Reavers & Scorpid Terrors).  Large amount alrededor de 72.73.
09) "A Bump in the Road": mata basilisks.  Saltstone Basilisks are NW, Saltstone Crystalhides are everywhere but NW, y the Saltstone Gazers /target are sur at Tahonda Ruins alrededor de 77.86.
10) Once all done, vuelve a Mirage Raceway (en gnomes section) y de the dwarf (at 78.77, #1 on map) entrega "Rocket Car Parts".  Acepta "Wharfmaster Dizzywig" y "Hemet Nesingwary".  Luego junto a you 78.77, entrega "Salt Flat Venom" y "Hardened Shells".  SKIP "Martek the Exiled" (for now).
11) Este en goblin section de Mirage Raceway entrega "Load Lightening" (80.76, #2 on map), acepta "Goblin Sponsorship".
12) SE in Mirage Raceway by the starting line entrega "A Bump in the Road" (82.78, #3 on map).
13) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  Also asegúrate de ser nivel 34, farmea on any enemigos until you are.
14) Ve sur to el camino that leads into Tanaris (starting at 74.94)...
15) Sigue el camino sur to Gadgetzan y en SE corner de town, entra en bank (hut at 52.29 in Tanaris) y put the following items in there:  stack of 10 Turtle Meat.  Get out the follow item:   (if you have it) 4 Lesser Bloodstone Ore (or could be in mailbox).
16) At the Gryphon Master 51.29 vuela a Ratchet, The Barrens.
17) At Ratchet, entra en engineering building y entrega "Goblin Sponsorship" 63.36, acepta the next part.
18) Ve a the goblin en docks y entrega "Wharfmaster Dizzywig" 63.38, acepta "Parts for Kravel".  Also acepta "Passage to Booty Bay".
19) At the end de docks 64.39, get en boat to take you to Booty Bay.  NOTE: If you could benefit de getting new spells/abilities luego usa la piedra de hogar a Stormwind, get new abilities, luego vuela a Booty Bay, STV.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[93] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #22]], text = [[
01) NOTE: The 34-36 Desolace section will be skipped for SoM/WotLK, so most de pasos here will be removed.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[94] = {title = [[37 Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) As soon as you get off the boat entrega "Goblin Sponsorship" 26.74, acepta the next part.
02) Continue en lower docks y entrega "Passage to Booty Bay" 27.74, SKIP "The Caravan Road".
03) Entra en Posada y make BB your new home 27.77.  Next to you en Posada, acepta "Singing Blue Shards".
04) Ve upstairs en Posada y acepta "Bloodscalp Ears", "Hostile Takeover", "Supplies to Private Thorsen", "Investigate the Camp"
05) If you have 4 Lesser Bloodstone Ore with you, acepta y entrega "Favor For Krazek", luego acepta (if you can) "Return to Corporal Kaleb".
06) Sube por pasos to Baron Revilgaz 27.77 en boat-deck y entrega "Goblin Sponsorship", acepta the next part.  Also acepta "The Stone of the Tides".
07) Stay up en top de docks y over past the FP to Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks, acepta "Supply and Demand" 28.78, (this may not have an exclamation mark).
08) REMINDER:  The "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn" misión requires that you save any Green Hills of Stranglethorn pages you find.  These pages can drop de any humanoid mob in STV.  You will need one of each de following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  I recommend mailing them to your alt for storage.  Once your alt collects all the pages, mail them back to your main.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.  You don't need to acepta the misión to get the page drops, so acepta y turn this in at Nesingwary's Expedition 36.11 if you get all the pages.  You will regresa a STV numerous times en future for more chances to find the pages.
09) NOTE:  You can destroy the Library Scrip as it's not used for gaining XP (or bank it if you are not in a hurry).
10) N/A
11) N/A
12) Ve NW hacia el Venture Co. Operations Center entrance 42.18 y haz "Hostile Takeover": mata y lootea a the Venture Co. Geologist /target scattered alrededor de the Operations para crystals.  Also do the first part of "Goblin Sponsorship": work your way hasta lo alto de the Operations Center y luego mata y lootea a Foreman Cozzle (en control room 43.18).  See next paso for where to use Cozzle's Key at:
13) Finish "Goblin Sponsorship": lootea Cozzle's Footlocker (en small house 43.20).  NOTE:  Your key will disappear as soon as you click the cofre, so make sure you have room in your bags para Blueprints first.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[95] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #28]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) N/A
03) Ve SW at Bal'lal Ruins alrededor de 30.19 y finish "Bloodscalp Ears": mata y lootea a any Bloodscalp trolls para ears.  If you corre out of enemigos, you can do the next paso y come back:
04) Ve a the ledges along the shore 27.19 y start working on "Singing Blue Shards": mata y lootea a Crystal Spine Basilisks.  80% drop rate.  There's only 9 mob spawns en area, so if you corre out, just continue on con next paso:
05) Ve oeste out hacia el island y haz "The Stone of the Tides": simply go onto the island to get it discovered 21.23.
06) You can vuelve a the ledges along the shore (25.17, #8 on map) y continue working on "Singing Blue Shards": mata y lootea a Crystal Spine Basilisks.  There is more later en guide that you can mata, so if you corre out just continue on:
07) Ve este to Nesingwary's Expedition y entrega "Hemet Nesingwary" (36.11, # on map).
08) At el campamento get repaired/resupplied de Jaquilina Dramet 36.11.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[96] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) At el río hacia el este of you alrededor de 35.10 do "Supply and Demand": mata y lootea a River Crocolisk /target.
02) Entra en The Stockpile (cueva entrada en 46.8) y haz "Special Forces": mata 10 Kurzen Commandos y 6 Kurzen Headshrinkers.  If you have "The Hidden Key", luego turn it in by hugging the right side of la cueva until you get to an area with lots of boxes y click on Bookie Herod's Strongbox (50.8 in la cueva) to turn it in, acepta "The Spy Revealed!".
03) If you still need to finish "Singing Blue Shards": exit la cueva (turn alrededor de y hug the left side), go este (afuera of la cueva) y mata y lootea a Crystal Spine Basilisks (up alrededor de the ledges 49.9).
04) Muere a propósito y revive en el espíritu.
05) Entrega "Supplies to Private Thorsen" 40.8.  If he is not there, luego he could be back en Rebel Camp 38.3.  He patrols back y forth between these two spots.  Also de him, acepta (if you haven't yet) "Jungle Secrets", if you were able to acepta this, luego turn this in back norte en Rebel Camp (38.3, #1 on map) y acepta "Bookie Herod".
06) Next to you, entrega (if you have it) "Return to Corporal Kaleb" 38.3.
07) Back in el campamento, entrega "Special Forces" 38.3, SKIP "Colonel Kurzen" (for now).  And entrega (if you have it) "The Spy Revealed!", acepta "Patrol Schedules".  Also entrega (if you haven't yet) "Jungle Secrets", SKIP (if available) "Bookie Herod" (for now).
08) Next to you at el campamento, entrega (if you have it) "Patrol Schedules" 38.3, acepta "Report to Doren".
09) Back in el campamento, entrega (if you have it) "Report to Doren" 38.3.
10) Next to you, make sure you are resupplied.
11) Usa la piedra de hogar a Booty Bay.   If piedra de hogar is still on a cooldown, fly there de the Gryphon Master en Rebel Camp 38.4.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[97] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Next to you al fondo de the Posada, entrega "Singing Blue Shards" 27.77, SKIP "Venture Company Mining" (for now).
02) Ve hasta lo alto de the Posada y entrega "Bloodscalp Ears", "Hostile Takeover" y (junto a you) "Investigate the Camp".
03) Next to you up the pasos en boat-deck, de Baron Revilgaz 27.77, entrega "The Stone of the Tides", SKIP "Water Elementals" (for now).  And entrega "Goblin Sponsorship", acepta the next part.
04) Stay up en docks y over past the FP to Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks y entrega "Supply and Demand" 28.78, acepta "Some Assembly Required".
05) Ve up hacia el Gryphon Master 28.78 y vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
06) At Ironforge, ve a the bank 35.61 y get the following items out:  Stack of 10 Turtle Meat, your stack of Elixir of Water Breathing potions y any Nada Speed Potions you may have.  Put in your bank:  Kravel's Parts y Fuel Regulator Blueprints.
07) GET NEW ABILITIES, 07) Get new spells/abilities in Ironforge.
08) N/A
09) Ve norte a bit more 75.12 y acepta "Ironband Wants You!".
10) Ve a the middle of Ironforge hacia el Gryphon Master 55.48 y vuela a Southshore, Hillsbrad.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[98] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #31]], text = [[
01) 37 Alterac Mountains ( log )
02) N/A
03) Entra en Posada y de the Innkeeper 51.59, make Southshore your new home.
04) Back en Posada's kitchen, acepta y entrega (no exclamation mark) "Soothing Turtle Bisque" 52.59.
05) N/A
06) N/A
07) N/A
08) N/A
09) Justo afuera de the Posada, acepta "Hints of a New Plague?" 50.59.
10) Ve norte a bit (en oeste side of el camino) hacia el Gryphon Master 49.52 y vuela a Refuge Pointe, Arathi.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[99] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #32]], text = [[
01) 38 Arathi Highlands ( log )
02) At Refuge Pointe, entrega "Malin's Request" 47.47.
03) Junto a Bonfire, acepta "Worth Its Weight in Gold" 46.48.
04) Ve NE y click en Shards of Myzrael 62.34 to acepta "The Princess Trapped".
05) Ve este of Hammerfall (Horde town, corre sur alrededor de it) y haz "The Princess Trapped": mata y lootea a the Kobolds, in y afuera of la cueva entrance 83.36.  TIP:  Look para tree y rock 81.40, it shows you where the hidden path is to la cueva.  NOTE:  If you have mining, luego mine as many Lesser Bloodstone Deposits as you can.  These are used for an Alliance misión only at STV or sell good en AH.
06) Once done, ve a the Iridescent Shards (en end of la cueva 84.31) y entrega "The Princess Trapped", acepta "Stones of Binding".
07) Exit la cueva, luego ve oeste hacia el Circle of Este Binding (go sur of Hammerfall) y haz part of "Stones of Binding": lootea the Stone of Este Binding 67.30 para Cresting Key.
08) Ve sur to Ve'Shek Farm y up en ledge, entrega "Hints of a New Plague?" 60.54, acepta the next part.
09) NOTE:  The next part of "Hints of a New Plague?" involves mata/looting the Forsaken Courier /target (lvl 35 with four lvl 35 bodyguards).  This NPC patrols en main path between Ve'Shek Farm y Tarren Mill (Horde town in Hillsbrad).  So if you corre into him go ahead y try to mata y lootea a him for this misión, but just continue on:
10) Ve SE to Witherbark Village alrededor de 63.67 y haz "Worth Its Weight in Gold": mata y lootea a the trolls alrededor de the village.  The tusks can drop de any of them, the Witherbark Medicine Pouch drops only de Witherbark Witch Doctors, y the Shadow Hunter Knife drops only de the Witherbark Shadow Hunters (found only in la cueva entrance 68.76).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[100] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #33]], text = [[
01) Ve NW y haz part of "Stones of Binding": click en Stone of Outer Binding 52.51 para Thundering Key.
02) Ve oeste to Refuge Pointe y entrega "Worth Its Weight in Gold" 46.48.
03) Next to you by the Forge, acepta "Wand over Fist" 47.47.
04) You can get repaired/resupplied de Jannos Ironwill 46.48 junto a Bonfire.
05) Ve sur to Boulderfist Hall y entra en the southern most cueva entrance 54.78 y haz "Wand over Fist": hug the left side of la cueva until you get to Kor'gresh Coldrage /target 55.82 y mata y lootea a this ogre.
06) Vuelve norte to Refuge Pointe y entrega "Wand over Fist" (47.47, #2 on map).
07) N/A
08) N/A
09) N/A
10) Ve NW y haz the last part of "Stones of Binding": lootea the Stone of Oeste Binding 25.30 para Burning Key.  NOTE:  As you work your way there, follow the main path to see if you can corre into Forsaken Courier /target (lvl 35 with four lvl 35 bodyguards) y mata y lootea a her para misión "Hints of a New Plague?".
11) Ve SE to Circle of Inner Binding y click en Stone of Inner Binding 36.57 to entrega "Stones of Binding", SKIP "Breaking the Keystone".
12) N/A
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[101] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #34]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) N/A
03) If you have not found the Forsaken Courier for "Hints of a New Plague?", luego skip it y abandon the misión y luego ve a the next section below!  If you did do the misión, luego ve SE to Ve'Shek Farm y up en ledge, entrega "Hints of a New Plague?" 60.54, acepta the next part.
04) Next to you, entrega "Hints of a New Plague?" 60.54.  Luego acepta y haz the escolta a "Hints of a New Plague?": escolta a Kinelory through Ve'Shek Farm.
05) Once back on top de ledge, entrega "Hints of a New Plague?" (60.54, #8 on map), acepta the next part.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[102] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Southshore.
02) Justo afuera de the Posada (entrega if you have it) "Hints of a New Plague?" 50.59.  If it's not finished, luego abandon the misión.
03) You should be nivel 38 or very close to it.  If you are close, luego ve farmea until you are on murlocs just SW of Southshore alrededor de 47.65.
04) N/A
05) Ve norte a bit (en oeste side of el camino) hacia el Gryphon Master 49.52 y if you know you can benefit de getting your nivel 38 spells/abilities luego vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh y get them.  Luego or otherwise vuela a Menethil Harbor, Wetlands.
06) At Menethil Harbor, go en docks y acepta "James Hyal" 8.62.
07) Get en boat (sur en docks 5.64) to get to Theramore.
08) At Theramore, ve a the Gryphon Master 67.51, y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
09) Ve a the Bank SE at Gadgetzan (hut at 52.29) y get the following items out:  Kravel's Parts y Fuel Regulator Blueprints.  Put the following items en bank: your stack of Elixir of Water Breathing potions, Nada Speed Potions.
10) Ve norte to Mirage Raceway y en dwarf, entrega "Parts for Kravel" (78.77 in Thousand Needles).  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "Delivery to the Gnomes".
11) Next to you, entrega "Delivery to the Gnomes" 78.77, acepta "Martek the Exiled".
12) Next to you en dwarf, acepta "The Rumormonger" 78.77.
13) Ve este hacia el Goblin's side y entrega "Goblin Sponsorship" 80.76, acepta "The Eighteenth Pilot".
14) Next to you, entrega "The Eighteenth Pilot" 80.76, acepta "Razzeric's Tweaking".
15) Ve sur to Gadgetzan y put the following item en bank (52.29 in Tanaris, #7 on map):  Fizzle Brassbolts' Letter.
16) Ve a the Gryphon Master sur of Gadgetzan 51.29 y vuela a Theramore, Dustwallow Marsh..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[103] = {title = [[39 Dustwallow Marsh]], text = [[
01) Near you when you land acepta "This Old Lighthouse" 68.52.
02) Next to you acepta "Traitors Among Us" 68.51.
03) At Theramore Isle start working on "Traitors Among Us": talk to 5 Deserter Agitators /target.  Keep an eye out for these guys while continuing on:
04) Nada out este hacia el lighthouse y entrega "This Old Lighthouse" 72.47, acepta "Thresher Oil".
05) Under the water alrededor de the docks at Theramore Isle alrededor de 72.51 do "Thresher Oil": mata y lootea a Young Murk Threshers.
06) Back en lighthouse entrega "Thresher Oil" 72.47 (#4 on map), acepta "Dastardly Denizens of the Deep".
07) On the docks entrega "Dastardly Denizens of the Deep" 69.52, acepta "Is it Real?".
08) At Theramore Isle finish "Traitors Among Us": simply talk to 5 Deserter Agitators /target (#3 on map).  They are spread out all alrededor de the town.
09) Back SE in town entrega "Traitors Among Us" 68.51 (#2 on map), acepta "Propaganda War".
10) Ve down en boat SW en docks y haz "Propaganda War": lootea the Deserter Propaganda 68.59 (cajas in captain's room).
11) Back SE in town entrega "Propaganda War" 68.51 (#2 on map).  Wait a moment luego acepta "Discrediting the Deserters".
12) Do "Discrediting the Deserters": talk to 6 Theramore Guards /target alrededor de the town (these are mostly alrededor de #3 on map).  NOTE:  You do not need to wait para dialog to go by, just talk y move on.
13) Back SE in town entrega "Discrediting the Deserters" 68.51 (#2 on map), acepta "The End of the Deserters".
14) Nada SE to get en boat (ramp entrada en 77.55).
15) Ve down en boat hacia el captain's room y haz "The End of the Deserters": attack Gavis Greyshield 76.57 /target until his health is nearly gone luego the misión will completa.
16) Back SE in town entrega "The End of the Deserters" 68.51 (#2 on map).
17) Norte in Theramore Isle 66.46 acepta "They Call Him Smiling Jim" y "Tabetha's Farm".
18) If your First Aid is 225, luego ve in Foothold Citadel (fortress) y en first floor ve a Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen <Trauma Surgeon> 68.49 y acepta y haz "Triage": usa el/la Triage Bandage misión item right there en room en wounded soldiers.  This misión becomes easier with Show Friendly Nameplates on.  Once done, turn it in.  You can luego destroy the Triage Bandage in your inventory as it is no longer needed. NOTE: In WotLK, this doctor no longer advances your First Aid, you now just do that at any First Aid entrenador.
19) Ve upstairs en Keep (Foothold Citadel) y entrega "James Hyal" 68.48.
20) Next to you en room entrega "They Call Him Smiling Jim" 68.49 , acepta "Inspecting the Ruins".
21) Entra en Posada (norte in Theramore) y entrega (if you have it) "Morgan Stern" 66.45.  Acepta "Mudrock Soup and Bugs".
22) At the Innkeeper 67.45 junto a bar, make Theramore your new home.
23) NW in town acepta "A Disturbing Development" 65.47.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[104] = {title = [[Jarl's Cabin]], text = [[
01) Just NW of Theramore Isle, ve a Sentry Point (tower) y entrega "A Disturbing Development" 65.41 , acepta "Defias in Dustwallow?".
02) Ve este hacia el shore (starting at 65.40 y work norte) to start working on "Mudrock Soup and Bugs": mata y lootea a turtles /target para Forked Mudrock Tongues (can drop de any de turtles).  There are more turtles out en water y alrededor de the small islands along the shore.  Low drop rate!  Work your way to do the next pasos:
03) Ve a the island on your right y haz "Defias in Dustwallow?": mata y lootea a Garn Mathers (he patrols alrededor de the island 64.28 /target).
04) Ve NW to Jarl's cabin 55.26 y acepta "Marsh Frog Legs".  Next to you en cabin acepta "What's Haunting Witch Hill?" (this NPC is either en dock or dentro de cabin).
05) Right junto a Jarl's cabin, click en Loose Dirt 55.26 to acepta "The Orc Report".
06) All alrededor de Jarl's Cabin do "Marsh Frog Legs" along with "What's Haunting Witch Hill?": mata y lootea a Giant Marsh Frogs (frog critters /target).  And mata the undead enemigos (Risen Spirits y Risen Husks).
07) Back at Jarl's cabin 55.26 (#4 on map) entrega "Marsh Frog Legs", acepta "Jarl Needs Eyes".  Next to you en cabin entrega "What's Haunting Witch Hill?", acepta "The Witch's Bane".
08) All alrededor de the open marshlands of NE Dustwallow Marsh start working on "The Witch's Bane" by looting witchbane (plants, mostly alrededor de #6 on map), work your way to do the next pasos:
09) Ve oeste to Norte Point Tower y acepta "Raptor Captor" 47.23.
10) Just norte start working on "Raptor Captor": usa el/la Sturdy Rope misión item on a nearly dead Bloodfen raptor (any type).  Continue on con escolta a misión below while doing this:
11) At the raptor area, acepta y haz the escolta a "Stinky's Escape" 47.18: escolta a "Stinky" Ignatz.  NOTE: If he is not there, luego skip this for now.  You will have more opportunities to try this again later.
12) Finish "Raptor Captor": usa el/la Sturdy Rope misión item on nearly dead Bloodfen raptors (any type, #10 on map).
13) Back at Norte Point Tower entrega "Raptor Captor" 47.23 (#9 on map).  Acepta "Prisoners of the Grimtotems" y "Unleash the Raptors".
14) Ve oeste to Darkmist Cavern alrededor de 35.21 y haz "Jarl Needs Eyes": mata y lootea a the Darkmist spiders for 20 eyes.
15) Ve slightly sur of Brackenwall Village (Horde town) y acepta "Hungry!" (de the ogre at 35.38).  NOTE:  Hug the oeste mountains to avoid the Horde ogre guardias.
16) Ve SW to Shady Rest Posada y entrega "Inspecting the Ruins" 30.48.
17) On the ground junto a you acepta "Suspicious Hoofprints" 30.48.
18) In the torn down Posada, on a plank, click en white dot to acepta "Lieutenant Paval Reethe" 30.48.
19) On the fireplace acepta "The Black Shield" 30.49.
20) Usa la piedra de hogar a Theramore.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[105] = {title = [[Theramore]], text = [[
01) In the Posada, entrega (if you did it) "Stinky's Escape" 66.45.  Also entrega (if its done) "Mudrock Soup and Bugs", acepta "... and Bugs".
02) NW in town entrega "The Orc Report" 65.47, acepta "Captain Vimes".
03) Ve up en Keep 68.49 y entrega "Suspicious Hoofprints", "Captain Vimes", "Lieutenant Paval Reethe" (acepta the next part), "The Black Shield" (acepta the next part).
04) Next to you en same room, entrega "Lieutenant Paval Reethe" 68.48, acepta "Daelin's Men".
05) Vuelve junto a you y entrega "Daelin's Men" 68.49, acepta "The Deserters".
06) Exit the Keep, luego ve oeste hacia el Blacksmith y entrega "The Black Shield" 65.50, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  We will turn the next part in later!
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[106] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #40]], text = [[
01) Just NW of Theramore Isle, ve a Sentry Point (tower) y entrega "Defias in Dustwallow?" 65.47 , acepta "Renn McGill".
02) If you still need to, corre up the este coast (starting at 65.40 y work norte) to continue working on "Mudrock Soup and Bugs": mata y lootea a turtles /target para Forked Mudrock Tongues (can drop de any de turtles).  Work your way hacia el next pasos:
03) Ve a the este side de middle island y down en water entrega "Renn McGill" 64.17, acepta "Secondhand Diving Gear".
04) At the island you are at do "Secondhand Diving Gear": lootea the Tool Kit y Damaged Diving Gear (wooden box).  These items have random spawns alrededor de the island alrededor de 63.19 but are usually alrededor de the tents.  You may find the Damaged Diving Gear en small wrecked boat en island shore 62.18.
05) Back en este part de island en water entrega "Secondhand Diving Gear" 64.17 (#3 on map), acepta "Recover the Cargo!".
06) Do "Recover the Cargo!": open Renn's Supplies in your backpack, luego equip the Repaired Diving Gear (its a head armor).  Luego out alrededor de the misión giver down en water en sea floor usa el/la Salvage Kit misión item on 6 Shipwreck Debris.  NOTE:  You can spot these above the water with floating burning embers.
07) Back en este part de island en water entrega "Recover the Cargo!" 64.17 (#3 on map).  Acepta "Jaina Must Know".
08) Norte en shore alrededor de 58.16 do "Hungry!": mata y lootea a the Mirefin enemigos (murlocs).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[107] = {title = [[Jarl's Cabin]], text = [[
01) SW alrededor de Jarl's cabin ramp entrada en 58.19 continue working on "The Witch's Bane": lootea witchbane (plants):
02) At Jarl's cabin entrega "Jarl Needs Eyes" 55.26, acepta "Jarl Needs a Blade".
03) Just NE at Witch Hill do "Jarl Needs a Blade": mata y lootea a Razorspine /target patrols alrededor de 58.19.  Spawns at 58.18.
04) Around Jarl's cabin finish "The Witch's Bane": lootea 9 witchbane (plants, #1 on map).
05) Back at Jarl's cabin entrega "Jarl Needs a Blade" 55.26 (#2 no map).
06) At Jarl's cabin entrega "The Witch's Bane" 56.26, acepta "Cleansing Witch Hill".
07) Do "Cleansing Witch Hill": en end de dock there at Jarl's cabin 55.27 usa el/la Witchbane Torch misión item luego mata Zelfrax (gargoyle) when he spawns.
08) Back at Jarl's cabin entrega "Cleansing Witch Hill" 56.26.
09) Stinky, 8b) If you have not done the escolta a "Stinky's Escape" 47.18: escolta a "Stinky" Ignatz.  NOTE: If he is not there, luego skip this for now.  You will have one more opportunity to try this again later.
10) Ve SW hacia el ogre (sur of Brackenwall Village) y entrega "Hungry!" 35.38.
11) Ve sur to Lost Point (tower) y dentro de of it attack Balos Jacken /target (up en ledge, 36.54) until he is down to 1/4 health, luego entrega "The Deserters", acepta the next part.
12) Usa la piedra de hogar a Theramore.   If Hearthstone is still on a cooldown, luego ve SE hacia el Flight Master 43.72  at Mudsprocket y vuela a Theramore.
13) In the Posada, entrega (if you still need to) "Stinky's Escape" 66.45.  Also entrega (if its done) "Mudrock Soup and Bugs", acepta "... and Bugs".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[108] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #42]], text = [[
01) Ve hasta lo alto de the Keep 68.49 y entrega "The Deserters" y "The Black Shield".  Acepta "A Grim Connection".
02) Ve hasta lo alto de the wizard building y entrega "Jaina Must Know" 66.49, acepta "Survey Alcaz Island".
03) NW in town acepta "Mission to Mudsprocket" 65.47 (this requires lvl 39, which you should be by now).
04) LAST CHANCE FOR:  If you still need to, corre up the este coast (starting at 65.40 y work norte) to finish "Mudrock Soup and Bugs": mata y lootea a turtles /target para Forked Mudrock Tongues (can drop de any de turtles).
05) Head NW to Norte Point Tower y entrega "A Grim Connection" 47.25.  Acepta "Confirming the Suspicion" y "Arms of the Grimtotems".
06) Stinky, 6b) If you have not done the escolta a "Stinky's Escape" 47.18: escolta a "Stinky" Ignatz.  NOTE: If he is not there, luego this will have to be skipped.
07) Ve NW to Blackhoof Village y haz the following 4 misiones together:
08) "Unleash the Raptors": usa el/la Raptor Bait misión item en windmill en middle de village 42.12.
09) "Prisoners of the Grimtotems": mata y lootea a the Grimtotem (taurens) to obtain keys to open 5 cages.
10) "Confirming the Suspicion": mata y lootea a Grimtotem (taurens) to obtain 4 Grimtotem Notes, luego click on them in your backpack.
11) "Arms of the Grimtotems": lootea 7 Blackhoof Armaments (spear racks) alrededor de the village.
12) Back SW at Norte Point Tower 47.23 (#6 on map) entrega "Prisoners of the Grimtotems", "Unleash the Raptors".
13) Inside la torre 47.25 entrega "Confirming the Suspicion" y "Arms of the Grimtotems".  Acepta "Tabetha's Assistance".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[109] = {title = [[Tabetha's Farm]], text = [[
01) Head sur to Tabetha's Farm 46.57 y dentro de cabin entrega "Tabetha's Assistance" (acepta "Raze Direhorn Post!") y "Tabetha's Farm".  And junto a you acepta "The Grimtotem Weapon" y "The Reagent Thief".
02) Just afuera en side de cabin 46.57 acepta "Direhorn Raiders" y "The Zeppelin Crash".
03) Farmea este to Beezil's Wreck 54.57 y entrega "The Zeppelin Crash".  Acepta "Corrosion Prevention" y "Secure the Cargo!".
04) Around the immediate area do "Corrosion Prevention" along with "Secure the Cargo!": stand cerca de a Power Core Fragment to obtain a buff, luego usa el/la Ooze Buster misión item on oozes.  NOTE:  You don't actually need to attack the oozes.  And lootea 8 Zeppelin Cargo (boxes laying alrededor de).  Also do the next paso en same area:
05) Ve SE to Beezil's Wreck y haz "Razzeric's Tweaking": lootea the Gizmorium Shipping Crate (junto a crashed zeppelin, 54.56).
06) Back at Beezil's Wreck 54.57 (#3 on map) entrega "Corrosion Prevention" along with "Secure the Cargo!", acepta "Delivery for Drazzit".
07) Ve a the small island este y en small dock entrega "Is it Real?" 59.60 , acepta "Nat's Bargain".
08) Do "Nat's Bargain": first usa el/la Pagle's Fish Paste, Extra Strength misión item en misión giver luego nada SW en boat under the water alrededor de 56.63  y luego mata the Lurking Shark /target that comes.
09) Back NE en small island en dock entrega "Nat's Bargain" 59.60 (#7 on map), acepta "Oh, It's Real".
10) Ve NW to Direhorn Post y haz "Raze Direhorn Post!": use Tabetha's Torch misión item en following 3 tents:
11) Burn the Este Tent 48.48.
12) Burn the Northeast Tent 47.47.  Also at this tent mata y lootea a Apothecary Cylla , she drops an item which starts "The Apothecary's Letter", acepta it.
13) Burn the Norte Tent 47.46.
14) Around Direhorn Post finish "Direhorn Raiders": mata 12 Grimtotems (taurens of any type).
15) Around The Quagmire alrededor de 45.49 do the next 2 misiones together:
16) "The Reagent Thief": mata y lootea a Noxious Shredders (green serpents) or Darkfang Creepers (orange spiders).
17) "The Grimtotem Weapon": usa el/la Captured Totem misión item en Mottled Drywallow Crocolisk or a Drywallow Daggermaw, luego mata them.  NOTE: The crocs must be pulsed by the totem on death to get credit.
18) Back at Tabetha's Farm en small dock entrega "The Apothecary's Letter" 45.58 (junto a #1 on map).
19) Inside the cabin 46.57 (#1 on map) entrega "Raze Direhorn Post!", acepta "Justice for the Hyals".  And junto a you entrega "The Grimtotem Weapon" y "The Reagent Thief".
20) Just afuera en side de cabin 46.57 entrega "Direhorn Raiders".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[110] = {title = [[Mudsprocket]], text = [[
01) Ve SW to Mudsprocket (neutral goblin town starting at TBC) y en hut 42.73 entrega "Delivery for Drazzit" y "Mission to Mudsprocket".
02) De the Wanted Poster al fondo de the pasos acepta "WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous" 42.73.
03) Next to you by the green containers acepta "Catch a Dragon by the Tail" 42.73.
04) In the Posada acepta "Bloodfen Feathers" 42.74.
05) Ve NW to Bloodfen Burrow alrededor de 34.65 y haz "Bloodfen Feathers" along with "WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous": mata y lootea a the Bloodfen raptors.  And mata Goreclaw the Ravenous (big gray raptor /target).
06) Vuelve SE to Mudsprocket y en small hut entrega "WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous" 42.73 (#1 on map).
07) In the Posada entrega "Bloodfen Feathers" 42.74 (#4 on map).  Acepta "Banner of the Stonemaul" y "The Essence of Enmity".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[111] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #45]], text = [[
01) Ve NW to The Den of Flame entrada en 40.67 y start working on "The Essence of Enmity" usa el/la Brogg's Totem misión item on Fireman dragon corpses.  While doing this continue on:
02) Entra en la cueva at The Den of Flame (entrada en 38.66).
03) Ve a the end of la cueva y haz "Banner of the Stonemaul": lootea the Stonemaul Clan Banner 38.69.
04) Finish "The Essence of Enmity": usa el/la Brogg's Totem misión item on Firemane dragon corpses.  These can also be found alrededor de #6 on map.
05) Back at Mudsprocket en Posada entrega "Banner of the Stonemaul" y "The Essence of Enmity" 42.74 .  Acepta "Spirits of Stonemaul Hold".
06) NE at Stonemaul Ruins alrededor de 45.66 do "Spirits of Stonemaul Hold": click en Ogre Remains (skeletons en ground), luego mata the ogre spirits that spawn.
07) Back en Posada at Mudsprocket entrega "Spirits of Stonemaul Hold" 42.74  (#5 on map), acepta "Challenge to the Black Flight".
08) Start working on "Catch a Dragon by the Tail" by looting any Wyrmtail (plants) you see por el camino:
09) Ve SE to la entrada of Onyxia's Lair y haz "Challenge to the Black Flight": usa el/la Stonemaul Banner misión item at la entrada 52.76.  Luego mata the dragon that spawns.
10) Work your way back NW to Mudsprocket while finishing "Catch a Dragon by the Tail": lootea 8 Wyrmtail (plants).  These are found all alrededor de Wyrmbog (#8 on map).
11) Back at Mudsprocket by the green containers entrega "Catch a Dragon by the Tail" 42.73 .
12) In the Posada entrega "Challenge to the Black Flight" 42.74 (#5 on map).
13) At the NE outskirts of Mudsprocket, ve a the Flight Master 43.72  y vuela a Theramore, Dustwallow Marsh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[112] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) When you land do "Survey Alcaz Island": talk to Cassa Crimsonwing /target 67.51 to send you on a gryphon ride.
02) On the docks at Theramore entrega "Oh, It's Real" 70.52, acepta "Take Down Tethyr!".
03) There en docks do "Take Down Tethyr!": usa el/la 3 Cove Cannons alrededor de the dock to fire y mata Tethry en water.  TIP: Tethry does a splash attack at every 2nd cannon shot you do at him that could knock you back.  For every 2nd shot usa el/la cannon closest hacia el misión giver at 70.52 , so you wont be knocked back into the water, giving you a faster time to recover.
04) On the docks entrega "Take Down Tethyr!" 70.52 (#2 on map).
05) Ve up en Keep y entrega "Justice for the Hyals" 68.49, acepta "Peace at Last".
06) Ve hasta lo alto de the wizard building y entrega "Survey Alcaz Island" 66.49 .
07) If you still need to:  Entra en Posada y entrega "Stinky's Escape" 66.45, y "Mudrock Soup and Bugs" 66.45, acepta "... and Bugs".
08) Ve a the graveyard just NW of Theramore y haz "Peace at Last": usa el/la Wreath misión item en Hyal Family Monument (grave 64.43).
09) Back up en Keep entrega "Peace at Last" 68.49 (#5 on map).  Dustwallow Marsh is finally finished, phew!!!!
10) Sur en town, de the Gryphon Master 67.51, vuela a Ratchet, The Barrens.
11) At the Ratchet Bank 63.37, get out the following item:  Sample Elven Gem.  And put the following items en bank:  Seaforium Booster.
12) Ve en dock to get en boat to ve a Booty Bay 64.39.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[113] = {title = [[40 Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Once at BB, follow the lower docks y luego acepta "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 28.76.
02) Entra en small cabin (junto a hanging shark) y acepta "Scaring Shaky" 28.77.
03) Entra en Posada y make BB your new home 27.77.
04) Ve upstairs en Posada 27.77 y entrega "The Rumormonger", acepta "Dream Dust in the Swamp".
05) Next to you, de Baron Revilgaz 27.77, acepta "Water Elementals".
06) If you have all the pages para "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn" misión luego get them out now in your bank or mailbox 27.76.  This misión requires that you have the following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.  If you have all of them, get them out now.  If not, you will have a few more chances later to completa this optional misión.
07) N/A
08) Ve norte to el río (starting at 38.31) y haz "Some Assembly Required": mata y lootea a Snapjaw Crocolisks along el río (until 40.15).
09) Ve oeste hacia el island alrededor de 22.23 y haz "Water Elementals": mata y lootea a Lesser Water Elementals.
10) N/A
11) Asegúrate de ser nivel 39 right now, if not farmea until you are.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[114] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Booty Bay.
02) Ve hasta lo alto de the Posada y up en boat-deck, de Baron Revilgaz, entrega "Water Elementals" (up at 27.77), SKIP "Magical Analysis" (for now).
03) Stay up en docks y over past the FP to Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks, entrega "Some Assembly Required" 28.78, acepta "Excelsior".
04) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) Ve NE to Mistvale Valley alrededor de 32.67 y haz "Scaring Shaky": mata y lootea a the Elder Mistvale Gorillas.
06) Ve just slightly NW of BB y clear the Bloodsail enemigos de the area, luego click en Bloodsail Correspondence scroll (en barrel 27.70) to entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers", acepta the next part.  (See Video)
07) It's time to do the 39-40 farmea.  Keep grinding on Jungle Stalkers & Cold Eye Basilisks alrededor de 33.41 or the Venture Co. enemigos alrededor de 41.44 until you are 72,600 XP into lvl 39 or 13,100 XP away de 40, luego Usa la piedra de hogar a Booty Bay.  You can also farmea on Venture Co. Geologist alrededor de 44.20, or Murkgill murlocs alrededor de 34.22  NOTE:  Instead de solo grinding, you could get a 5 man group to do the Scarlet Monastery dungeon.  If things get to messy in STV, you can also go farmea Boulderfist ogres in Arathi Highlands at alrededor de 52.76 or alrededor de 32.44. (but do the first four pasos en next section first).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[115] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) At Booty Bay, en lower docks hacia the boat drop off, entrega "Scaring Shaky" 27.74, acepta "Return to MacKinley".
02) Follow the lower docks y entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 28.76, acepta the next part.
03) Entra en cabin (junto a hanging shark) y entrega "Return to MacKinley" 28.77, SKIP "Voodoo Dues" (for now).
04) Ve all the way upstairs en Posada (en boat-deck) y entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77, SKIP the next part (for now).
05) You should be nivel 40 now, if not farmea until you are.
06) Ve up hacia el Gryphon Master 28.78 y vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
07) N/A
08) And get the following items out de bank 35.62:  Fizzle Brassbolts' Letter, (if you can) stack of 9 Blue Pearls.  And if you have a Frost Oil y Gyrochronatom in your bank, mailbox or AH 25.73, get them out now.  NOTE:  You can see if you can compra a Gyrochronatom de the NPC in Ironforge 68.43.  If you were able to get them, you can also benefit de obtaining a Healing Potion, Lesser Invisibility Potion y a Patterned Bronze Bracers.  All these items are used for easy entrega misiones en Badlands.  And remember to not sell these items to a vender.
09) Entrega any cloth donations if you have them at Dwarves 43.32 y at Gnomes 74.48.
10) N/A
11) GET NEW ABILITIES, 10a) Get new spells/abilities in Ironforge.
12) EPIC MOUNT? 10b) EPIC MOUNT:  At nivel 40 epic ground mounts become available, y only cost about 12 gold.  For more info go here.
13) Ve a the middle of Ironforge hacia el Gryphon Master 55.48 y vuela a Thelsamar, Loch Modan.  First ve a the Gryphon Master56.48 y vuela a Thelsamar, Lock Modan.    DRAENEI ONLY:  Draenei who did Bloodmyst Isle will have to manually corre all the way to Thelsamar to get the Flight Path there by first exiting Ironforge (exit at 15.86).  Luego entra en y go through Sur Gate Pass entrance 82.53, luego the other one entrance 17.59.  Luego head norte in Lock Modan to get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master 34.51.
14) 41 Badlands
15) First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!!
16) Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)
17) At Loch Modan, entra en Posada (building with all the big barriles alrededor de it) y de the first NPC you see make Stoutlager Posada (Thelsamar) your new home 36.48.
18) Entra en small house just este de Posada y acepta "Badlands Reagent Run" 37.49.
19) Ve este in Loch Modan to Ironband's Excavation Site y entrega "Ironband Wants You!" 66.66, acepta "Find Agmond".
20) Head sur into Badlands (47.82 in Loch Modan)..
21) Ve sur hacia el small dwarf camp 54.43 y acepta "Fiery Blaze Enchantment", "Mirages" y (junto a you) "A Dwarf and His Tools".
22) Farmea your way SW to Valley of Fangs 42.53 y entrega "Martek the Exiled", acepta "Indurium".  Next to you, acepta "Barbecued Buzzard Wings".  And if you have 9 Blue Pearls with you, acepta y entrega "Pearl Diving".
23) Ve SE a bit to Agmond's End y de the Battered Dwarven Skeleton 51.62, entrega "Find Agmond", acepta "Murdaloc".
24) Ve sur a bit alrededor de 52.67 y haz "Indurium" along with "Murdaloc": mata y lootea a the Stonevault enemigos para Indurium Flakes, mata 12 Stonevault Bonesnappers y Murdaloc /target (at 50.66 back in el campamento junto a an outhouse).
25) Vuelve norte to Valley of Fangs y entrega "Indurium" (42.53, #6 on map), wait a few seconds luego acepta "News for Fizzle".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[116] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #01]], text = [[
01) Ve NW to The Dustbowl, y en gnome 26.45, acepta "Study of the Elements: Rock".  If you have a Frost Oil item, acepta y completa the misión "Coolant Heads Prevail".  Luego if you have a Gyrochronatom item, acepta y completa the misión "Gyro... What?".
02) WOLK, 1b) Also, if you completed "Gyro... What?" y you have a Healing Potion y a Lesser Invisibility Potion with you, acepta y completa "Liquid Stone" 26.44.
03) Do "Study of the Elements: Rock" mata y lootea a Lesser Rock Elementals al norte en cliffs alrededor de 20.44.
04) Ve a The Dustbowl en gnome (26.45, #1 on map) y entrega "Study of the Elements: Rock", acepta the next part.
05) Farmea your way al sur y haz "Study of the Elements: Rock": mata y lootea a Rock Elementals alrededor de 37.75.
06) Farmea your way norte to The Dustbowl en gnome (26.45, #1 on map) y entrega "Study of the Elements: Rock", acepta the next part.
07) Do "Barbecued Buzzard Wings": mata y lootea a Buzzards.  There is a large amount of Giant Buzzards at 17.60.  And remember to not sell the Buzzard Wings to a vendedor.
08) Ve sur y haz "Study of the Elements: Rock": mata y lootea a Greater Rock Elementals alrededor de 14.86, y more alrededor de 4.79.
09) Ve norte to The Dustbowl en gnome (26.45, #1 on map) y entrega "Study of the Elements: Rock".  If it's available, acepta "This Is Going To Be Hard", y turn it in right junto a you y acepta the next part.  Turn that in right junto a you y acepta the next part.  Mata y lootea a the Fam'retor Guardian that spawns in.  Luego turn it in.
10) And also if you have a Patterned Bronze Bracers with you, acepta (if it is available) "Stone Is Better than Cloth", luego turn it in.
11) Ve este (en middle of Badlands) y entrega "Barbecued Buzzard Wings" 42.53.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
12) Ve NE to Hammertoe's Digsite y under a canopy, junto a a table, de a Crumpled Map en ground 53.34, acepta "A Sign of Hope".
13) In the immediate area alrededor de the Digsite do "A Dwarf and His Tools": mata y lootea a Shadowforge enemigos (dwarves) until the Ryedol's Lucky Pick drops.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[117] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #02]], text = [[
01) Ve NE to Camp Kosh y haz "Mirages": lootea the Excavation Supply Crate 67.23.  This could be at random spots alrededor de el campamento.
02) Ve SE to Lethlor Ravine (path entrada en 67.30) y haz "Fiery Blaze Enchantment" (Elite): mata y lootea a the dragon whelps until the Black Drake's Heart drops (very low drop rate).  NOTES:  Watch out as you get deeper into the ravine there are high nivel elite dragons, but the whelps are easy to take down.  There are more whelps al sur en ravine alrededor de 75.67.  The elite dragons have a higher % droprate para item though (I was able to solo the 43 elites as a lvl 40 hunter).  The droprate is so bad (for at least the whelps) that if after you have grinded to lvl 41 you can skip the misión if you have not found the item by luego.
03) Ve oeste hacia el small dwarf camp 54.43 y entrega all misiones: (if its done) "Fiery Blaze Enchantment", "Mirages" (acepta "Scrounging"), "A Dwarf and His Tools" y "A Sign of Hope", SKIP the next part, (Dungeon).
04) Ve sur a bit to Garek (blood elf, male) y acepta "Tremors of the Earth" 62.54.
05) As you do the following misiones, keep an eye out for Boss Tho'grun /target (para misión "Tremors of the Earth").  This ogre patrols in a large circle counter-clockwise alrededor de the SW part of Badlands.  He has 5 bodyguards. (See Video).  NOTE:  You can focus en next pasos until he shows up...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[118] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) Ve sur a bit more to Camp Boff alrededor de 62.69 y start working on "Scrounging": mata y lootea a the ogres para Scrap Metal.  The scrap can drop de any ogre in Badlands.  When you corre out of ogres to mata, work oeste hacia el next paso:
02) As you work oeste to Camp Cagg alrededor de 10.78 watch out for Boss Tho'grun (#3 on map) por el camino, luego finish "Scrounging": mata y lootea a ogres para Scrap Metal.
03) Ve este along Boss Tho'grun /target patrol path y haz "Tremors of the Earth": mata y lootea a Boss Tho'grun.  This ogre patrols in a large circle counter-clockwise alrededor de the SW part of Badlands.  He has 5 bodyguards. (See Video).
04) Ve este to Garek (night elf) y entrega "Tremors of the Earth" 62.54, SKIP the next part (high lvl Elite).
05) Ve NW hacia el small dwarf camp y entrega "Scrounging" 54.43.
06) Make sure "Badlands Reagent Run" is finished.  It should have gotten completed by doing all the other misiones in Badlands.
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Stoutlager Posada (Thelsamar).  Make sure you are resupplied.
08) Entra en small house just este de Posada y entrega "Badlands Reagent Run" 37.49.
09) Ve este in Loch Modan to Ironband's Excavation Site y entrega "Murdaloc" 66.66, SKIP "Agmond's Fate" (Dungeon).
10) Ve a the Gryphon Master (SW in Thelsamar 34.51) y vuela a Stormwind, Elwynn.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[119] = {title = [[Alliance - Duskwood]], text = [[
01) At Stormwind, ve a the bank 63.78 y get out the following items:  any extra cloth for cloth donations.
02) Ve NE to The Dwarven District y en tavern acepta "In Search of The Temple" 69.40.
03) N/A
04) N/A
05) Just off The Canals, entra en small library y acepta "Mazen's Behest" 52.74.
06) Just upstairs, entrega "Mazen's Behest" 51.74, acepta the next part.
07) If you have cloth donations to entrega, you can do so in Duncan's Textiles upstairs 54.82.
08) At The Mage Quarter, sube por spiral ramp entrance 49.88 to Wizard's Sanctum y acepta "Vital Supplies".
09) Ve este hacia el Gryphon Master 71.73 y vuela a Darkshire, Duskwood.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[120] = {title = [[Alliance - Duskwood]], text = [[
01) 42 Swamp of Sorrows
02) At Darkshire, entra en Posada y de the Innkeeper 74.44 make Darkshire your new home.
03) Frente a big house (norte of el camino), entrega "Vital Supplies" 76.46, SKIP "Supplies for Nethergarde" (for now).
04) Corre este through Deadwind Pass, follow the main path y luego make a left into Ariden's Camp (52.38 in Deadwind Pass) just to discover it for XP.
05) Continue este into Swamp of Sorrows (SoS)... 14.60
06) While questing through out SoS keep an eye out for swamp elementals y mata y lootea a them for "Mazen's Behest".  You only need one item, but it is a very low drop rate:
07) As you entra en SoS start working on "Dream Dust in the Swamp": mata y lootea a the dragon whelps alrededor de el lago (alrededor de 14.60 in SoS) para dream dust.  Just clear the whelps in this area once.  When you corre out of whelps to mata, move on hacia el next pasos (You can revisit this area later):
08) Ve este a bit to Watcher Biggs 27.60 y acepta "Encroaching Wildlife".
09) Right alrededor de the immediate start working on "Encroaching Wildlife": mata Young Sawtooth Crocolisks, Sorrow Spinners (spiders) y Swamp Jaguars (cats).  While doing this, work your way hacia el next 2 pasos:
10) Ve norte y luego find y mata y lootea a Noboru the Cudgel /target.  See patrol path on map (spawns at 47.39).  He drops an item which starts "Noboru the Cudgel", acepta it.
11) Ve a 46.36 y see if there is a Scattered Crate there (its junto a river) y lootea the item dentro de to acepta "The Lost Supplies".  If its not there, you will have another opportunity later, also keep an eye out for it as you continue on if you have not got it yet.
12) Ve NW to The Harborage y entrega "Noboru the Cudgel" 26.31.  Acepta "Draenethyst Crystals" (no exclamation mark).  NOTE:  You can get resupplied here de Masat T'andr /target.
13) TBC, 11a) Next to you acepta "Mercy for the Cursed" 26.32.
14) Ve NW to Misty Valley alrededor de 15.39 y clear the swamp elementals there to see if you can get the item for "Mazen's Behest".  If you can't find it, just move on:
15) Finish "Encroaching Wildlife" (#8 on map), luego turn it in back at Watcher Biggs (27.60, #7 on map) y acepta "The Lost Caravan".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[121] = {title = [[Alliance - Duskwood]], text = [[
01) Ve NE to Fallow Sanctuary y start working on "Draenethyst Crystals": lootea the Draenethyst Crystals alrededor de the village while working your way hacia el broken down caravan NE en sanctuary y lootea the Caravan Chest 64.18 for "The Lost Caravan".  Also if you haven't yet, keep an eye out for a Scattered Crate y acepta "The Lost Supplies" de the item dentro de.
02) Next to you en human /target en cage 65.18, acepta y haz the escolta a "Galen's Escape".  Also finish "Draenethyst Crystals" along with "Mercy for the Cursed": lootea the Draenethyst Crystals alrededor de the village y also mata 3 Cursed Lost Ones.
03) Above Stonard (horde town), at Galen's Strongbox (junto a a tent 48.40), entrega (if you were able to do it) "Galen's Escape".
04) Ve oeste to The Harborage y entrega "Draenethyst Crystals" 26.31.  Next to you entrega "Mercy for the Cursed".  NOTE:  You can get resupplied here de Masat T'andr /target.
05) If you still need to, go NW to Misty Valley alrededor de 15.39 y clear the swamp elementals there to see if you can get the item for "Mazen's Behest".  If you can't find it, just move on:
06) Ve sur to Watcher Biggs 27.60 y entrega "The Lost Caravan", acepta "Driftwood".
07) Ve sur en main path to go into Blasted Lands (entrada en 33.68 in SoS)..
08) As soon as you entra en Blasted Lands, immediately go SE (off el camino) to get to Nethergarde Keep.  At the blacksmith 66.17, asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en.
09) If its finished, entrega "Mazen's Behest" up in la torre 68.19.
10) At los establos, entrega "The Lost Supplies" 67.21.
11) At the sur end of town, sube por spiral wood tower y de the Gryphon Master 66.24, vuela a Darkshire, Duskwood.
12) At Darkshire, frente a big house, acepta "Supplies for Nethergarde" 76.46.
13) Ve este a bit hacia el Gryphon Master (up at 77.44) y vuela a Nethergarde Keep, Blasted Lands.
14) At Nethergarde Keep, at los establos, entrega "Supplies for Nethergarde" (67.21, #10 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[122] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) Corre back norte into SoS (52.5 in Blasted Lands) luego start yendo hacia este, you can go sur de Horde town Stonard, you will have to corre past a few high nivel guardias...
02) Ve just norte y jump en water hacia Temple of Atal Hakkar 65.56 to get it discovered for "In Search of The Temple".  And if you need to, finish "Dream Dust in the Swamp" by mata/looting the dragons alrededor de the Temple of Atal'Hakkar lake (Pool of Tears).
03) Continue este hacia el shore alrededor de 84.85 y haz "Driftwood" along with "... and Bugs": work your way norte along the shore y mata y lootea a crabs para 12 Pristine Crawler Legs y lootea the Sundried Driftwood.
04) Usa la piedra de hogar a Darkshire.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) If you have a mount, luego Mount este through Deadwind Pass luego into SoS y at Watcher Biggs (27.60 in SoS) entrega "Driftwood", acepta "Deliver the Shipment".   OR:  If you do not have a mount, luego ve este a bit hacia el Gryphon Master (up at 77.44) y vuela a Nethergarde Keep, Blasted Lands, luego head norte to SoS y at Watcher Biggs (27.60 in SoS) entrega "Driftwood", acepta "Deliver the Shipment".
06) If you still need the item for "Mazen's Behest", luego ve NW to Misty Valley alrededor de 15.39 y clear the swamp elementals there to see if you can get it.  If you found the item y still need to entrega "Mazen's Behest", luego keep grinding on any enemigos until you are 1.5 bars away de lvl 42.  Or if you have already turned in "Mazen's Behest" or have not found the item for it, luego keep grinding until you are 1 bar away de lvl 42 before continuing..
07) Vuelve sur into Blasted Lands, luego ve a Nethergarde Keep y (if you need to), go up in la torre y entrega "Mazen's Behest" 68.19.
08) At los establos, entrega "Deliver the Shipment" 67.21.
09) At the sur end of town, sube por spiral wood tower y de the Gryphon Master 66.24, vuela a Stormwind, Elwynn.
10) At Stormwind, ve a the Bank 63.78 y put the following items en bank:  12 Pristine Crawler Legs.  And get out de bank:  (if you still need to y have it) 4 Lesser Bloodstone Ore (used for a misión in STV).
11) Ve norte hacia el Dwarven District y entrega "In Search of The Temple" 69.40, acepta "To The Hinterlands".
12) GET NEW SPELLS/ABILITIES, 11b) You should be nivel 42 now.  Get new spells/abilities.
13) Hearth (if you can), luego en Gryphon Master 77.44 vuela a Booty Bay, STV.  If you cannot hearth, luego ve a the Gryphon Master 71.73 in Stormwind y vuela a Booty Bay, Stranglethorn.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[123] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) 43 Stranglethorn Vale
02) At Booty Bay, upstairs en Posada, entrega "Dream Dust in the Swamp" 27.77, wait a few seconds luego acepta "Rumors for Kravel":
03) Next to you de the dwarf, acepta "Up to Snuff".
04) NOTE:  If you still need to, y if you have 4 Lesser Bloodstone Ore with you, acepta y entrega "Favor For Krazek", luego acepta "Return to Corporal Kaleb".
05) Junto a pasos, acepta "Skullsplitter Tusks".
06) Up en boat-deck, de Fleet Master Seahorn 27.77, acepta "The Bloodsail Buccaneers".
07) Drop down en Posada y make BB your new home 27.77.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
08) Next to you 27.77, acepta "Venture Company Mining" y "Zanzil's Secret".
09) Ve junto a bank/mailbox y acepta "Akiris by the Bundle" 27.76.
10) Green Hills, 8a) If you have all the pages for "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn", luego get them out now.  This misión requires that you have the following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.
11) In the cabin (junto a hanging shark), acepta "Voodoo Dues" 28.77.
12) Sube por docks y de Dizzy One-Eye, acepta "Keep An Eye Out" 29.76.
13) Justo al este de BB along the shore, do "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" along with "Up to Snuff" y "Keep An Eye Out": mata y lootea a the Bloodsail enemigos para Snuff along with Dizzy's Eye.  They can drop de any Bloodsail mob (low drop rates).  Also, mata 10 Bloodsail Swashbucklers.  And lootea the Bloodsail Orders en small boat 28.83 or it could be en table 27.83 at el campamento en end of la playa (or at other spots en camps).  And junto a you, lootea the Bloodsail Charts 27.83 on top de box junto a eastern most tent (See Image for Possible Locations).  It could also be at other spots en various camps along la playa.
14) Ve oeste (follow path on map) y haz "Akiris by the Bundle": mata y lootea a the Naga Explorers (starting at 25.64).  Medium drop rate.
15) N/A
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[124] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Ve este cruzando path hacia el Ruins of Jubuwal y haz "Zanzil's Secret" along with "Voodoo Dues": mata y lootea a the Zanzil enemigos for Zanzil's Mixture y mata y lootea a the 3 named enemigos.  Maury "Club Foot" Wilkins /target 35.51.  See next pasos para other 2 enemigos to mata y lootea a...
02) Mata y lootea a Jon-Jon the Crow /target 35.52 by the Bonfire.
03) Mata y lootea a Chucky "Ten Thumbs" /target en other Ruins path entrance 34.54 mob is at 40.58, see map on how to get there.
04) Ve norte a bit hacia el ledges alrededor de 41.44 y haz "Venture Company Mining": mata y lootea a the Venture Co. (goblins).
05) Green Hills, 4b) If you have all the pages for "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn", luego ve a Nesingwary's Expedition, y acepta y turn this in 36.11.  NOTE:  You will have another chance later to turn this in if you do not have all the pages now.  Luego you can get repaired/resupplied at el campamento.
06) Ve NE to Rebel Camp y entrega (if you have it) "Return to Corporal Kaleb" 38.3.
07) Next to you, acepta "Colonel Kurzen" 38.3.  NOTE:  You can get resupplied junto a you.
08) Ve este y entra en The Stockpile (cueva entrada en 46.8)..
09) In la cueva, try to do "Colonel Kurzen": hug the right of la cueva until you get hacia el end of la cueva, luego mata y lootea a Colonel Kurzen /target ( at 50.4).  Also, por el camino, make sure you mata 6 Kurzen Elite y 4 Kurzen Subchief.
10) Exit la cueva 46.8.
11) Ve norte to Rebel Camp y entrega (if you did it) "Colonel Kurzen" (38.3, #5 on map).  NOTE:  You can get resupplied junto a you.
12) Next to you at el campamento, acepta "Kurzen's Mystery" 38.4.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[125] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) Ve SW to Bal'lal Ruins y haz part of "Kurzen's Mystery": lootea the Moon Over the Vale tablet 29.19.
03) Oeste en shore do "Excelsior": mata y lootea a an Elder Saltwater Crocolisk /target.  There are 4 possible spawn locations, see map (one spawns at 29.22).  You should only need to mata y lootea a one of them.  Also these share spawns con Saltwater Crocolisks, so you may need to mata some of them first.
04) Ve oeste under the sea at The Vile Reef y haz part of "Kurzen's Mystery": lootea the Gri'lek the Wanderer tablet 25.23.
05) Ve norte hacia el Ruins of Zul'Kunda y sube por mountain cliff (shortcut at 23.14)..
06) Sube por dirt slope y haz part of "Kurzen's Mystery": lootea the Fall of Gurubashi tablet 23.12.  Watch out there are about 5-6 lvl 34-35s!
07) Work your way up en Ruins of Zul'Kunda y haz the last part of "Kurzen's Mystery": lootea the The Emperor's Tomb tablet 25.9.
08) Ve este to Rebel Camp y entrega "Kurzen's Mystery" 38.4, acepta "Troll Witchery".  Make sure you are resupplied.
09) Ve sur hacia el troll Ruins alrededor de 46.32 y haz "Skullsplitter Tusks" along with "Troll Witchery": mata y lootea a Skullsplitter Mystics or Skullsplitter Witch Doctors para 4 Skullsplitter Fetishes y mata y lootea a any Skullsplitter trolls para tusks.  There is more enemigos just SW en other Ruins alrededor de 42.36 y more sur at 47.41.
10) Ve norte to Rebel Camp y entrega "Troll Witchery" (38.4, #8 on map).
11) Usa la piedra de hogar a Booty Bay.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[126] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Next to you en Posada, entrega "Venture Company Mining" y "Zanzil's Secret" 27.77.
02) Ve up en Posada y entrega "Skullsplitter Tusks" y "Up to Snuff".  Also acepta (if available) "Tran'rek".
03) Up en boat-deck, entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77, SKIP the next part (for now).
04) Next to you de Baron Revilgaz 27.77, acepta "Magical Analysis" (no exclamation mark).
05) Stay up en docks y over past the FP to Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks, entrega "Excelsior" 28.78.
06) Drop down by the bank/mailbox y entrega "Akiris by the Bundle" 27.76.  Acepta the next part.
07) Entra en cabin (junto a hanging shark) y entrega "Voodoo Dues" 28.77.  Acepta "Stoley's Debt".
08) Ve norte up the docks y de Dizzy One-Eye, entrega "Keep An Eye Out" 29.76.
09) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied (just norte a bit en huts 29.75).
10) Get en boat en end of docks 26.73 to ve a Ratchet.
11) Ve a Ratchet's Bank 63.37 y get the following items out:  12 Pristine Crawler Legs.  Put en bank:  Bag of Water Elemental Bracers.
12) Ve a the Flight Master (63.37 in The Barrens) y vuela a Theramore, Dustwallow Marsh.
13) At Theramore, entrega "Akiris by the Bundle", this NPC is either junto a you where you land 68.52 or en docks 69.53.
14) Entra en Posada y entrega "... and Bugs" 66.45.
15) N/A
16) De the Gryphon Master 67.51, vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[127] = {title = [[PLEASE READ With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you will most likely be well into nivel 43. Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into 43-44 Tanaris section below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  However if for some reason you are nivel 43 you can consider doing this section.]], text = [[
01) 43 Desolace
02) At Nijel's Point, sube por ramp en Posada y entrega "Brother Anton" 67.8, acepta "Down the Scarlet Path".
03) Drop down y acepta "Reagents For Reclaimers Inc" 66.10.
04) Ve sur hacia el Kodo Graveyard y acepta "Ghost-o-Plasm Round Up" 48.62.
05) Ve SW to Uthek the Wise (under the tent 36.79) y entrega "Ongeku", acepta "Khan Jehn".
06) As you do the following misiones you can start working on "Reagents For Reclaimers Inc" by mata/looting demons (fel hunters, succubuses y Doomwarder Captains) alrededor de Mannoroc Coven alrededor de 50.77.  Also if you corre into a patrolling group of 2 kodos y 2 goblins, de them you can acepta y haz an easy escolta a "Gizelton Caravan" (no exclamation mark), which leads you through Mannoroc Coven:
07) Ve este hacia el Magram Village y haz "Khan Jehn": mata y lootea a Khan Jehn (en tent 66.80).
08) Ve SW hacia el Valley of Bones 64.91 y haz "Ghost-o-Plasm Round Up": en big skeleton bones sticking out de ground, first clear out the skeletons, luego usa el/la Crate of Ghost Magnets misión item there, luego mata y lootea a the Magrami Spectre that spawn in para plasms.
09) In the immediate area alrededor de the Valley of Bones, finish "Down the Scarlet Path": mata 30 Undead Ravagers.
10) Ve a the Kodo Graveyard y entrega "Ghost-o-Plasm Round Up" (48.62, #3 on map).
11) Ve SW to Uthek the Wise (under the tent 36.79, #4 on map) y entrega "Khan Jehn", SKIP "Khan Hratha".
12) Justo al este def the main path check to see if Super-Seller 680 /target 40.79 is there so you can get resupplied de it.  Most de time he is not there.
13) Ve este to Mannoroc Coven alrededor de 50.77 y finish "Reagents For Reclaimers Inc": mata y lootea a demons (fel hunters, succubuses y Doomwarder Captains).  These are found alrededor de #5 on map.  And again, if you corre into a patrolling group of 2 kodos y 2 goblins, de them you can acepta y haz an easy escolta a "Gizelton Caravan" (no exclamation mark), which leads you through Mannoroc Coven.  If you cannot find them in time it can be skipped.  Also the Doomwarder Captains /target are only found alrededor de (52.84, #5 on map), I recommend going there first.
14) If you did it, entrega "Gizelton Caravan" NE at Scrabblescrew's Camp 61.62.
15) Vuelve norte to Nijel's Point y entrega "Reagents For Reclaimers Inc" (66.10, #1 on map), acepta the next part.
16) Sube por ramp en Posada y entrega "Down the Scarlet Path" 67.8, acepta the next part.
17) Usa la piedra de hogar a Theramore Isle.
18) Ve a the Gryphon Master 67.51 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[128] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) 44 Tanaris
02) Entra en Gadgetzan y en western side on top de hill, acepta "Gadgetzan Water Survey" 50.27.
03) Junto a crane, entrega (if you have it) "Tran'Rek" 52.27, SKIP "Scarab Shells" (Dungeon).
04) De the Wanted Poster junto a cage entrance 52.27, acepta "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting" y "WANTED: Andre Firebeard".
05) Just hacia el este of you, junto a teleporter device, acepta "Handle With Care" 52.27.
06) Entra en Posada y make Gadgetzan your new home 53.28.  Get resupplied.
07) Junto a Posada en windmill 52.28, acepta "Water Pouch Bounty" y "Wastewander Justice".
08) Ve a the Bank SE at Gadgetzan (hut at 52.29) y get the following items out:  Seaforium Booster.  Put the following items en bank:  A Carefully-packed Crate.
09) Ve norte hacia el Shimmering Flats en Mirage Raceway y de the dwarf entrega "Rumors for Kravel" (78.77 in Thousand Needles).  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "Back to Booty Bay".
10) Next to you de the gnome, entrega "News for Fizzle" 78.77.
11) Ve este hacia el goblin's side de Mirage Raceway y entrega "Razzeric's Tweaking" 80.76, acepta "Safety First".  Next to you, acepta "Keeping Pace".
12) At the goblin Zamek 80.77 /target junto a Goblin Racer, click on Completa Quest to setup a distraction, luego ve en gnome's hut y click on Rizzle's Unguarded Plans 77.77 to entrega "Keeping Pace", acepta "Rizzle's Schematics".
13) Ve a the goblin Pozzik y entrega "Rizzle's Schematics" 80.76.  NOTE:  If the Sample of Indurium Ore misión item still remains in your inventory after turning this in, luego you can destroy the item (it's no longer needed).
14) Usa la piedra de hogar a Gadgetzan (if you can), if not just corre back sur to get there, luego de Shreev en western side of Gadgetzan, entrega "Safety First" (51.27 in Tanaris), SKIP the next part (for now).
15) Ve a the Bank SE at Gadgetzan (hut at 52.29, #7 on map) y put the following item en bank:  Kravel's Scheme.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[129] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #14]], text = [[
01) Farmea your way este hacia el Noonshade Ruins alrededor de 60.24 y start working on "Wastewander Justice" along with "Water Pouch Bounty": mata y lootea a the Wastewander enemigos.  NOTES:  Do not sell the Wastewander Water Pouches to a vendedor!  Just clear the area once y continue on...
02) Ve este to Steamwheedle Port y de the female goblin under the red tent, acepta "Pirate Hats Ahoy!" 67.22.
03) De the male troll under the green tent, acepta "Screecher Spirits" 67.22.
04) At the other side de Port, en hut 67.24, entrega "Stoley's Debt", acepta "Stoley's Shipment".  And junto a you, acepta "Southsea Shakedown".
05) Ve SW hacia el Waterspring Field alrededor de 64.30 y finish "Wastewander Justice" along with "Water Pouch Bounty": mata y lootea a the needed Wastewander enemigos.  Also, keep an eye out for Caliph Scorpidsting /target , he patrols alrededor de the area y has 2 rouges following him.  This is for "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting", y you will have another opportunity later to do this if you cannot find him now.
06) Ve a Lost Rigger Cove (entrada en 69.42)...
07) Start working on "Southsea Shakedown" along with "Pirate Hats Ahoy!": mata y lootea a the Southsea enemigos (the Southsea Dock Workers are up at 75.47).  Any of these enemigos has a chance to drop a Pirate's footlocker, which could contain an item which starts "Ship Schedules", acepta it if you are able to find it, if not at least farmea for awhile as it might show up (at least until 6 blocks into lvl 44), otherwise it can be skipped.  While doing this, also go do the following 2 pasos below in this same area:
08) "Stoley's Shipment": lootea the Stolen Cargo up en building 72.47.
09) "WANTED: Andre Firebeard": mata y lootea a Andre Firebeard /target en middle de cove 73.47.  Watch out this fight usually involves 3 adds.  (See Video)
10) Once all these are done (including "Southsea Shakedown" along with "Pirate Hats Ahoy!"), usa la piedra de hogar a Gadgetzan.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[130] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #15]], text = [[
01) Junto a Posada en windmill 52.28, entrega "Water Pouch Bounty" y "Wastewander Justice", acepta "More Wastewander Justice".  Also entrega (if you happen to have done it already) "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting".
02) At the Forge, get repaired/resupplied 51.29.
03) Ve oeste to Sandsorrow Watch y haz "Gadgetzan Water Survey": usa el/la Untapped Dowsing Widget misión item en pool 39.29.  Watch out, as soon as you fill the widget, a few high nivel bugs will spawn.  Either corre away or try to mata them.
04) Vuelve a the western side of Gadgetzan y on top de hill, entrega "Gadgetzan Water Survey" 50.27, SKIP the next part (for now).
05) Ve este to Steamwheedle Port y de the female goblin under the red tent, entrega "Pirate Hats Ahoy!" 67.22.
06) At the other side de Port, en hut 67.24, entrega "Stoley's Shipment", acepta "Deliver to MacKinley".  Next to you, entrega "WANTED: Andre Firebeard", "Southsea Shakedown" y (if you have it) "Ship Schedules".
07) Ve SW hacia el Waterspring Field alrededor de 60.38 y haz "More Wastewander Justice" along with (if you still need to) "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting": mata the needed Wastewander enemigos y mata y lootea a Caliph Scorpidsting /target, he patrols alrededor de the area y has 2 rouges following him.  He usually spawns at 59.40.
08) Hearth (or corre back) to Gadgetzan y en windmill junto a Posada (52.29, #1 on map), entrega "More Wastewander Justice" y "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting".  NOTE:  You can use up any remaining Wastewander Water Pouches para repeatable misión here.
09) Entra en bank junto a you 52.29 y put the following item en bank:  Stoley's Bottle.  Also, if you have found the item called OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, put that in your bank también (y don't acepta the misión de it yet).
10) Ve a the Gryphon Master (sur of Gadgetzan 51.29) y vuela a Thalanaar, Feralas.
11) Travel all the way oeste through Feralas, go norte above the Horde town Camp Mojache to avoid it.  Work your way all the way to Feathermoon y get the Flight Path there de the Hippogryph Master 30.43.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[131] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #16]], text = [[
01) 46 Feralas
02) At Feathermoon, junto a you en gazebo between the sea y the Posada, acepta "The Mark of Quality" 31.43.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Entra en Posada y de the Innkeeper 31.43, make Feathermoon your new home.
04) Entra en big building sur de Posada y acepta "The Missing Courier" y "The Ruins of Solarsal" 30.46.
05) Entra en small building just este of you y acepta "In Search of Knowledge" y "The High Wilderness" 32.46.
06) Ve upstairs y entrega "The Missing Courier" 32.45, acepta the next part.
07) Ve SW to Ruins of Solarsal y click en Solarsal Gazebo 26.52 to entrega "The Ruins of Solarsal", acepta "Return to Feathermoon Stronghold".
08) Vuelve NE to Feathermoon y en big building, entrega "Return to Feathermoon Stronghold" (30.46, #3 on map).  Acepta "Against the Hatecrest".
09) Next to you, entrega "Against the Hatecrest" 30.46, acepta the next part.
10) Ve SW to Ruins of Solarsal alrededor de 29.52 y haz "Against the Hatecrest": mata y lootea a the nagas (any of them can drop the item you need).
11) Vuelve NE hacia el big building at Feathermoon y entrega "Against the Hatecrest" (30.46, #3 on map), acepta "Against Lord Shalzaru".
12) Ve straight down hacia el other big island y entra en Shalzaru's Lair (cueva entrada en 26.67).
13) In Shalzaru's Lair, do "Against Lord Shalzaru": mata y lootea a Lord Shalzaru /target en middle of la cueva (lvl 47 blue naga 29.70).  Also keep grinding here until you are at least 2,900 XP de lvl 45.  These naga yield good XP.
14) Die on purpose, luego res at spirit.
15) Ve norte a bit to Feathermoon y en big building frente a the Posada entrega "Against Lord Shalzaru" (30.46, #3 on map), acepta "Delivering the Relic".
16) Inside the same building, entrega "Delivering the Relic" 30.45.
17) Entra en Posada y de the Cloth y Armor Merchant /target, make sure you get repaired/resupplied (31.43, #2 on map).  Also make sure you upgrade hacia el lvl 45 tier food/drink.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[132] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #17]], text = [[
01) Sube por ramp en Posada y onto the dock to get en boat to take you este 31.40.  If the boat is not there or within view that it is almost there, luego just nada este hacia el shore en next paso:
02) Along The Forgotten Coast do "Screecher Spirits": mata the Screecher enemigos alrededor de 46.38, luego usa el/la Yeh'kinya's Bramble misión item en corpse, luego talk hacia el Screecher Spirit that spawns.
03) Ve sur along the shore (watch out for high lvl enemies) y under the water click en small Wrecked Row Boat 45.65 to entrega "The Missing Courier", acepta "Boat Wreckage".
04) Usa la piedra de hogar a Feathermoon.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) Ve up hacia el 2nd floor en small building at Feathermoon y entrega "Boat Wreckage" 32.45, acepta "The Knife Revealed".
06) Ve hasta lo alto de the tree tower y entrega "The Knife Revealed" 32.44.  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "Psychometric Reading".
07) Ve up hacia el 2nd floor en small building y entrega "Psychometric Reading" (32.45, #5 on map), acepta "The Woodpaw Gnolls".
08) Ve a través de Posada y onto the dock to get en boat to take you este (31.40, # 1 on map):
09) If the boat is not there or within view that it is almost there, luego just nada este hacia el shore at 47.44, luego ve up el camino.
10) Ve SE hacia el Feral Scar Vale alrededor de 56.56 y haz "The Mark of Quality": mata y lootea a the Feral Scar enemigos (Yetis).  NOTE:  While questing in Feralas, you may come across an item called OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-22/FE!" y turn this in a través de small cueva at Feral Scar 53.56, but do NOT do the follow-up escolta a misión.
11) Ve norte to la entrada of Dire Maul at 43.70 only to get it Discovered.  Simply discovering Dire Maul in this area will allow you to acepta a future misión.  You need to actually discover the zone, you will know when you achieved that when your general chat switches over to Dire Maul.
12) Ve este hacia el Ruins of Isildien (starting at 61.56 y work your way sur) y haz "The High Wilderness": mata the needed Gordunni ogres.  The Brutes are norte, Shamans are sur, y the Warlocks are everywhere.
13) Ve al sur along the cliffs alrededor de 57.77 y lootea a Hippogryph Egg in one de nests.  This will be turned in at Tanaris for a later misión.  And remember to not sell this!
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[133] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #18]], text = [[
01) Ve NE hacia el Grimtotem camp y clear the enemies alrededor de the Captured Sprite Darter cage alrededor de 67.47 before doing the next paso's escolta a misión:
02) At the Grimtotem camp is a hidden path junto a a tree (starting at 66.47).  Sube por path y en end de ledge, acepta y haz the escolta a "Freedom for All Creatures": escolta a Kindal Moonweaver /target (you need to lead her) hacia el Captured Sprite Darter cage y click en Cage Door (67.47, #1 on map) to open it.  Luego follow the Sprite Darters y make sure that 6 survive.
03) Vuelve up the hidden path junto a a tree (starting at 66.47, #2 on map).  Sube por path y en end de ledge, entrega "Freedom for All Creatures".  Luego junto a you, acepta "Doling Justice".
04) In the immediate area en Grimtotem camp, do "Doling Justice": mata the required amount of Grimtotem taurens alrededor de el campamento.  There is another camp al norte alrededor de 69.40 for more enemigos, especially the Naturalists /target.
05) Vuelve up the hidden path junto a a tree (starting at 66.47, #2 on map).  Sube por path y en end de ledge, entrega "Doling Justice".  Acepta the next part.
06) Ve sur hacia el gnoll camps y click en Large Leather Backpacks hanging on a big tree 73.56 to entrega "The Woodpaw Gnolls", acepta "The Writhing Deep".
07) In your inventory is an Undelivered Parcel (backpack), de it acepta "Thalanaar Delivery".
08) Ve sur to The Writhing Deep y go down into the last tunnel (entrada en 73.64), luego keep right in la cueva y luego click en Zukk'ash Pod to entrega "The Writhing Deep", acepta y haz "Freed from the Hive": simply wait until Raschal the Courier appears luego wait right there until the misión completes itself.
09) Usa la piedra de hogar a Feathermoon.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
10) Justo afuera de the Posada en Gazebo by the sea, entrega "The Mark of Quality" 31.43.
11) Across the Posada, dentro de small house, entrega "The High Wilderness" 32.46.
12) Ve upstairs y entrega "Freed from the Hive" 32.45, acepta "A Hero's Welcome".
13) Entra en big building y entrega "A Hero's Welcome" 30.46, acepta "Rise of the Silithid".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[134] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) GRIND TIME:  At this point, farmea all the way to nivel 46 !  I recommend grinding en Hatecrest nagas straight down hacia el other big island, in y afuera of la cueva alrededor de 26.67.  These nagas are considered one de best grinding spots en game, especially for Alliance.  Another alternative is to do the Dungeon Uldaman (found en Badlands).  There are a lot of misiones that were opened for Uldaman de the previous questing you have done through out the guide y the Dungeon can get you to nivel 46 most likely.  Once you are nivel 46, luego continue on..
02) Usa la piedra de hogar a Feathermoon y get repaired/resupplied 31.43.
03) 2a) In the small building, acepta "The Sunken Temple" 32.46 (requires lvl 46).
04) Ve a the Hippogryph Master 30.43 y vuela a Thalanaar, Feralas.
05) At Thalanaar, entrega "Thalanaar Delivery" 90.47.
06) Next to you, en Hippogryph Master 89.46 vuela a Rut'theran Village, Teldrassil.
07) At Rut'theran Village, sube por path a través de red portal to get to Darnassus 56.89.
08) Ve a the bank in Darnassus 40.42 y get the following item out:  A Carefully-packed Crate.  Put the following item(s) en bank:  Yeh'kinya's Bramble, Hippogryph Egg y (if you found it) OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon (y don't acepta the misión de it yet)..
09) At Darnassus, go sur in Temple de Moon, go up y entrega "Rise of the Silithid" 42.86.
10) Also up en temple, entrega "Doling Justice" 39.82.
11) Get New Abilities, 10)   NOTE:  You can learn new weapon possibilities de the Weapon Master 58.47.
12) If you have cloth donations to entrega for XP, you can do so de the Alliance Cloth Quartermaster 64.23.  Requires:  60 Wool Cloth --> 60 Silk Cloth --> 60 Mageweave Cloth.
13) Ve a través de red portal 29.41..
14) At Rut'theran Village, go down en house y entrega "Handle With Care" 55.92.  Acepta "Favored of Elune?".
15) Ve upstairs y entrega "In Search of Knowledge" 55.92.
16) Next to you upstairs by the bookshelves is a green book en ground called Feralas: A History 55.91, click on it to acepta "Feralas: A History".
17) Next to you upstairs, entrega "Feralas: A History" 55.92, acepta "The Borrower".
18) Ve a the Hippogryph Master 58.94 on el puente y vuela a Forest Song, Ashenvale.
19) At Ashenvale, head este en main path to entra en Azshara (95.48 in Ashenvale)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[135] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) 46 Azshara
02) As soon as you entra en Azshara, go sur to Talrendis Point y get the Flight Path there de the Hippogryph Master 12.78.
03) At el campamento, acepta "Spiritual Unrest" y "A Land Filled with Hatred" 11.78.
04) Ve just norte above the main path to Shadowsong Shrine alrededor de 14.72 y haz "Spiritual Unrest": mata the required amount of Highborne enemigos (undead apparitions).
05) Ve este to Haldarr Encampment alrededor de 19.62 y haz "A Land Filled with Hatred": mata the needed Haldarr enemigos (satyr demons).
06) Vuelve SW to Talrendis Point y entrega "Spiritual Unrest" y "A Land Filled with Hatred" (11.78, #1 on map).
07) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied de the Bowyer 12.78.
08) Hearth (if you can) to Feathermoon Stronghold.  Luego vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris de the Hippogryph Master 30.43 at Feathermoon.  If piedra de hogar is still on a cooldown, luego ve a the Hippogryph Master at Talrendis Point 12.78 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
09) Ve a the Bank SE at Gadgetzan (hut at 52.29) y get the following items out: Bag of Water Elemental Bracers.
10) At Gadgetzan, junto a teleporter, entrega "The Borrower" 52.27, acepta "The Super Snapper FX".
11) Ve a the Gryphon Master (sur of Gadgetzan 51.29) y vuela a Theramore, Dustwallow Marsh.
12) Get en boat (72.56 en docks) to take you to Menethil Harbor.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[136] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #21]], text = [[
01) vuela a Southshore, Hillsbrad (Gryphon Master, 9.60) luego skip to paso #8 below.
02) N/A
03) N/A
04) N/A
05) N/A
06) Ve NW to Dalaran (big purple globe) y entrega "Magical Analysis" (19.78 in Alterac Mountains).  Acepta "Ansirem's Key" (no exclamation mark).
07) Vuelve SE to Southshore.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[137] = {title = [[PLEASE READ With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you will most likely be well into nivel 46. Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into 46 ST section below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  However if for some reason you are early into nivel 46 you can consider doing this section.  If you are not doing this section luego abandon "Favored of Elune?"]], text = [[
01) 46 The Hinterlands
02) Sigue el camino into The Hinterlands, luego make a sharp left at Aerie Peak, sube por path y entrega "To The Hinterlands" 12.47, acepta "Gryphon Master Talonaxe".
03) Sube por ramps y get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master 11.46.
04) Entra en building junto a you y entrega "Gryphon Master Talonaxe" 10.44, acepta "Rhapsody Shindigger".  Also acepta "Witherbark Cages".
05) Drop down, make a right en Posada y acepta "Skulk Rock Clean-up" y "Troll Necklace Bounty" 15.45.
06) Ve up y NE en Posada hacia el Innkeeper 14.42 patrols a bit y make Wildhammer Keep (Aerie Peak) your new home.
07) On the same nivel de Innkeeper, en SW side de Posada, get repaired/resupplied de Harggan 13.44.
08) As you go out questing in The Hinterlands also start working on "Favored of Elune?": lootea the Wildkin Feathers en ground scattered all alrededor de The Hinterlands:
09) Ve a el camino (starting at 21.48).
10) Ve up to Shindigger's Camp y entrega "Rhapsody Shindigger" 27.49, acepta "Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[138] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Ve SW hacia el troll camp of Zun'watha y haz part of "Witherbark Cages": open the First y Second Witherbark Cages at el campamento 23.59.  Also start working on "Troll Necklace Bounty" by mata/looting the trolls.
02) Ve NE hacia el other troll camp of Hiri'watha y finish "Witherbark Cages": open the Third Witherbark Cage 32.57.  Also finish "Troll Necklace Bounty" by mata/looting the trolls para necklaces (y remember not to sell these to a vendedor)!
03) Ve NE to Agol'watha alrededor de 47.42 y haz "Skulk Rock Clean-up": mata 10 Green Sludge y 10 Jade Ooze.  There is more of these enemigos este at Skulk Rock alrededor de 58.43.
04) While questing, you may have found an item called OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-09/HL!".  If so, go turn this in en middle of el lago on top de hill 49.38, but do NOT do the escolta a yet!
05) Make sure "Favored of Elune?" is finished: lootea the Wildkin Feathers en ground scattered all alrededor de The Hinterlands.
06) Ve este hacia el shore (path entrance downward starting at 72.66).  Once down hacia el shoreline, do "The Super Snapper FX": usa el/la Super Snapper FX misión item on Gammerita /target.  This lvl 48 turtle patrols up y down the shore line (see map).  You don't actually need to mata it.
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Wildhammer Keep (Aerie Peak).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  Remember to not sell your necklaces!
08) Down cerca de SE front de Posada, entrega "Skulk Rock Clean-up" y "Troll Necklace Bounty" 15.45.
09) Ve all the way up at Aerie Peak y entrega "Witherbark Cages" 10.44, acepta "The Altar of Zul".
10) Up at Aerie Peak ve a the Gryphon Master 11.46 y vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[139] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) 47 Stranglethorn Vale
02) At Southshore ve a the Gryphon Master 49.52 y vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
03) Ve a the Bank 35.61 y get the following items out:  Kravel's Scheme y Stoley's Bottle.  Put the following items en bank:  Super Snapper FX.
04) NOTE:  If you need to, cloth donations can be turned in at Tinker Town 74.48 para Gnome faction y at The Great Forge 43.32 para Dwarf faction.
05) N/A
06) N/A
07) N/A
08) N/A
09) Ve a the Gryphon Master 56.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Booty Bay, Stranglethorn.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[140] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) When you land stay up y go over hacia el boat-deck y de Fleet Master Seahorn acepta "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77.
02) Ve a the middle nivel de Posada y entrega "Ansirem's Key" 27.78, acepta ""Pretty Boy" Duncan".
03) Drop down en Posada y make BB your new home 27.77.
04) Next to you en Posada, entrega "Back to Booty Bay" 27.77.
05) Entra en cabin (junto a hanging shark) y entrega "Deliver to MacKinley" 28.77.
06) Ve cerca de end de docks y acepta "The Captain's Chest" 27.74.
07) Exit BB norte y luego ve oeste hacia la costa y haz ""Pretty Boy" Duncan": mata y lootea a "Pretty Boy" Duncan 27.69.
08) Ve este hacia el shore y attempt to do "The Captain's Chest" (Elite): mata y lootea a Gorlash /target.  This lvl 42 elite giant patrols up y down the shore alrededor de 37.70.   You may need to group up with someone, if you cannot do it, it can be skipped.
09) Search the shore este of BB for Half-Buried Bottles until a Carefully Folded Note shows up, de it acepta "Message in a Bottle".
10) Ve a the island este of BB (use Nada Speed if you can), plus watch out para lvl 41 stealthed panthers there, luego entrega "Message in a Bottle" 39.81, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  If the Carefully Folded Note item remains in your inventory, you can destroy it.
11) Este en island do "Message in a Bottle": mata y lootea a King Mukla /target (lvl 42 big gorilla, at 41.84).
12) Back NW en island entrega "Message in a Bottle" (#11 on map, 39.81).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[141] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Do "The Bloodsail Buccaneers": mata the 3 pirates in each de 3 ships.  Also find a scroll laying en ground (can be in any de 3 ships) called Cortello's Riddle, y de it acepta "Cortello's Riddle".  Sometimes this scroll can be en basement de ships, so search there too.  The first pirate to mata is Captain Stillwater down the first flight of stairs en ship 33.88.  See next pasos para other two:
02) Mata Fleet Master Firallon down the first flight of stairs en middle ship 31.91.  Watch out for Ironpatch en room before Firallon, take him on alone first.
03) Mata Captain Keelhaul down the first flight of stairs en last ship 29.88.  Make sure you find the scroll that starts "Cortello's Riddle" before leaving this area.
04) Die on purpose y res at spirit to get to Booty Bay.
05) At the end de docks, entrega (if you did it) "The Captain's Chest" 27.74.
06) Ve hacia the Posada y junto a teleporter en Blade Trader /target 27.78, get repaired/resupplied.
07) Ve up en middle nivel de Posada y entrega ""Pretty Boy" Duncan" 27.78
08) Up en Posada en boat-deck, de Fleet Master Seahorn entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77.
09) This is the last time my guide will tell you to entrega "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn" if it is completa.  This misión requires that you have the following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.
10) N/A
11) If you have all the Green Hills pages, first vuela a Rebel Camp, luego ve a Nesingwary's Expedition, acepta y entrega "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn" 36.11.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
12) N/A
13) N/A
14) N/A
15) N/A
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[142] = {title = [[Alliance - Redridge Mountains]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) N/A
03) If you went to Nesingwary's Expedition: Hearth to Booty Bay.
04) Next to you en Posada, acepta "Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog" 27.77.
05) N/A
06) Make sure you get 15 Silk Cloth out of your bank, mailbox or AH 27.77, for a later misión.
07) Ve up hacia el Gryphon Master 28.78 y vuela a Lakeshire, Redridge.
08) At Redridge, follow the main path norte to get into Burning Steppes (entrada en 47.7 in Redridge Mountains).
09) When you entra en Burning Steppes, keep hugging the right side de mountains to get to Morgan's Vigil, y get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master (84.68 in Burning Steppes).
10) Head oeste en main path through Burning Steppes y first head to 23.52 just to discover Draco'dar for XP.
11) Ve norte to entra en Blackrock Mountain 29.38.  Luego ve norte to get to Searing Gorge.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[143] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) 48 Searing Gorge
02) Ve este in Searing Gorge y de the Wooden Outhouse 66.62, acepta "Caught!".
03) At the Grimesilt Dig Site junto a you, start working on "Caught!": mata the Dark Iron Geologists /target.  Also make sure you have 15 Silk Cloth (it can drop de the dwarves en Dig Site).  Also en Dig Site, is a dwarf /target 64.61 y de him acepta y haz the escolta a "Suntara Stones": simply escolta a him al norte along el camino, once he falls down, luego junto a him turn this misión in de the Singed Letter 74.19 en ground, acepta the next part.
04) Vuelve sur to Grimesilt Dig Site alrededor de 62.61 y finish "Caught!": mata the Dark Iron Geologists y obtain 15 Silk Cloth (#2 on map).
05) Vuelve a the Wooden Outhouse (66.62, #1 on map), y entrega "Caught!", acepta "Ledger from Tanaris".  Luego pick up the Goodsteel Ledger (it drops en ground junto a outhouse).
06) Ve SE up alrededor de the mountains y mata y lootea a Margol the Rager /target (a lvl 48 grey dinosaur, patrols alrededor de 73.76), he drops an item, which starts "The Horn of the Beast", acepta it.
07) Do part of "Ledger from Tanaris": mata y lootea a Glassweb Spiders /target para Leg Shafts.  These are scattered en eastern side of Searing Gorge alrededor de 62.70.
08) Ve up NW y de Kalaran Windblade 39.39 acepta "Divine Retribution", luego do it by simply talking to him.  Luego turn it in.  De him, acepta "The Flawless Flame".
09) Make sure your Hearthstone is less than 6 minutes until the cooldown resets (farmea on any enemigos en immediate area until it is), luego continue on..
10) Ve up to Thorium Point entrance 32.33...
11) Acepta ALL misiones at Thorium Point:  De the WANTED/Missing/Lost & Found sign 38.26 acepta "WANTED: Overseer Maltorius", "STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass" y "JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition".  .
12) WOTLK, 10b) Next to you acepta "Kill 'Em With Sleep Deprivation" 38.28.
13) Next to you 39.28 acepta "Curse These Fat Fingers", "Fiery Menace!" y "Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It"
14) Next to you by the Forge acepta "What the Flux?" 39.29.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied by this NPC también.
15) Ve a the Gryphon Master 38.31 at Thorium Point y vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[144] = {title = [[Alliance - Loch Modan]], text = [[
01) Ve a the Ironforge Bank 35.62 y put the following items into it:  Goodsteel Ledger y 20 Solid Crystal Leg Shafts.
02) Entra en Posada y make Ironforge your new home de the Innkeeper 18.51.
03) Ve NE to Hall of Explorers y de Curator Thorius (he patrols alrededor de 70.18), entrega "Suntara Stones", acepta "Dwarven Justice".
04) Ve a the Gryphon Master 56.48 en middle of Ironforge y if you have "The Horn of the Beast" previously de killing Margol the Rager at Searing Gorge, luego vuela a Thelsamar, Loch Modan, otherwise just fly back to Thorium Point, Searing Gorge y skip hacia el Searing Gorge Farmea section below.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[145] = {title = [[Loch Modan Door to Searing Gorge]], text = [[
01) If you haven't yet, ve a the Gryphon Master 56.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Thelsamar, Loch Modan.
02) At Loch Modan, sigue el camino SW hacia el locked door y entrega "The Horn of the Beast" 18.84, acepta "Proof of Deed".
03) Hearth to Ironforge.
04) At Ironforge, go NE to Hall of Explorers y de Curator Thorius patrols alrededor de 70.18, entrega "Proof of Deed".  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "At Last!".
05) GET NEW ABILITIES, 4b) If you need to, get new spells/abilities in Ironforge.
06) Ve a the Gryphon Master (56.48, #1 on map) en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Thelsamar, Loch Modan.
07) At Loch Modan, sigue el camino SW hacia el locked door y entrega "At Last!" (18.84, #2 on map).
08) With the Key you have now, open the gated Door frente a you, luego ve straight a través de tunnel to get back to Searing Gorge.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[146] = {title = [[Searing Gorge Farmea - NOTE  Do this section all at once (in any order)]], text = [[
01) "The Flawless Flame": mata y lootea a Magma Elementals, Tempered War Golems, y Heavy War Golems para Golem Oil.  See next paso para Heart of Flame:
02) Mata y lootea a the fire elementals para Heart of Flame, these include:  Inferno Elementals, Blazing Elementals y Magma Elementals.
03) "Fiery Menace!": mata Greater Lava Spiders alrededor de the western side of Searing Gorge.
04) "Curse These Fat Fingers": mata Heavy War Golems alrededor de the middle of Searing Gorge.
05) "STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass": mata y lootea a Dark Iron Steamsmith para Smithing Tuyere alrededor de 40.50.  See next paso for where to find the Lookout's Spyglass:
06) Mata y lootea a Dark Iron Lookouts para Lookout's Spyglass, these enemigos are scattered alrededor de the watchtowers at Searing Gorge, there is a large amount alrededor de 53.59, see map for other locations.
07) Once "The Flawless Flame" is done, turn it in at Kalaran Windblade 39.39 y acepta "Forging the Shaft".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[147] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #32]], text = [[
01) "JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition": entra en one de caves down in The Cauldron (middle of Searing Gorge), I recommend going into the eastern most cueva entrance 49.45 y luego mata the needed Dark Iron dwarves in la cueva.
02) "What the Flux?" y "WANTED: Overseer Maltorius": lootea the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux 40.36 detrás de Overseer Maltorius (41.36 in la cueva). And mata y lootea a Overseer Maltorius (lvl 50).
03) WOTLK, 2b) In the hallways cruzando room alrededor de 45.31 do "Kill 'Em With Sleep Deprivation": lootea the pillows along side the walls where the beds are at.  Watch out groups of sleepy dwarves patrol this hall y an elite mob can spawn en middle of that hall, so be careful!  You can skip this if you don't want to wait para pillows to respawn or deal con enemigos that are en way.
04) Work your way in la mina y entrega "Dwarven Justice" 41.26, acepta "Release Them".
05) "Forging the Shaft": mata y lootea a Dark Iron dwarves para Thorium Plated Daggers.  NOTES:  This misión requires "The Flawless Flame" to be finished y turned in first.  Save any Dark Iron Scraps you find, you will need 30 of them for a later misión, but you will also have another good chance to find a lot more later on en lvl 53-54 Burning Steppes section también.
06) "Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It": entra en la cueva 47.46 y mata Incendosaurs.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[148] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #33]], text = [[
01) Ve a Kalaran Windblade 39.39 y entrega "Forging the Shaft", acepta "The Flame's Casing".
02) Ve up to Thorium Point (entrada en 33.33)...
03) Entrega "WANTED: Overseer Maltorius" 38.27.
04) WOTLK, 3b) Next to you, entrega (if you did it) "Kill 'Em With Sleep Deprivation" 38.28.
05) Next to you, entrega "Curse These Fat Fingers", "Fiery Menace!" y "Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It" 39.28.
06) Next to you, entrega "STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass" y "JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition" 39.28.
07) At the Forge junto a you entrega "What the Flux?" 39.29.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied de this NPC.
08) Ve oeste alrededor de 25.35 y haz "The Flame's Casing": mata y lootea a the Twilight enemigos until the Symbol of Ragnaros drops (low drop rate).  While doing this do the next pasos también:
09) Sube por path at Firewatch Ridge (starting at 24.33)..
10) Sube por path (en dead fat tree, make a left) y haz "Release Them": en middle de lava pit, lootea the Twilight Artifact 29.26.
11) Next to you by the lava pit, de the caged NPC, acepta "Prayer to Elune" 30.26, luego simply talk hacia el NPC to completa it, turn it in y acepta the next part.
12) Do "Prayer to Elune": mata y lootea a the Twilight enemigos to obtain the Prayer to Elune.  There is more enemigos to mata down below alrededor de la cueva entrance (alrededor de 24.36, #4 on map).
13) Ve este to Kalaran Windblade (39.39, #1 on map) y entrega "The Flame's Casing", acepta "The Torch of Retribution".
14) Wait a minute, luego entrega "The Torch of Retribution", acepta the next part.  Luego click en Torch of Retribution en air junto a you to entrega the next part of "The Torch of Retribution".  Acepta "Squire Maltrake".  Next to you, entrega "Squire Maltrake", acepta "Set Them Ablaze!".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[149] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #34]], text = [[
01) Do "Set Them Ablaze!": equip the Torch of Retribution misión item y en lo alto de the 4 watchtowers, click en Sentry Braziers.  The Northern Tower is at 33.54.  See next pasos para others:
02) The Western Tower is at 36.61.
03) You can stop en small camp 42.75 to get repaired/resupplied de Graw Cornerstone.
04) The Southern Tower is at 44.61.
05) The Eastern Tower is at 50.55.  NOTE:  You must cross a bridge to get to it.
06) While doing these misiones (specifically de killing the Dark Iron dwarves), you should have obtained an item called Grimsite Outhouse Key, de it acepta "The Key to Freedom".  Luego ve SE y turn this in en Wooden Outhouse 66.62.
07) Vuelve norte to Kalaran Windblade (39.39, #1 on map) y entrega "Set Them Ablaze!".
08) Wait a minute (farmea while waiting), luego click en Hoard de Black Dragonflight 39.39 cofre en ground junto a Kalaran Windblade y acepta "Trinkets...".  Luego click en cofre again to turn this in.  Lootea the cofre received.  NOTE:  The Black Dragonflight Molt will be used for a later misión.
09) Drop down (en eastern big crane) to entra en the eastern most cueva at The Cauldron 49.45.
10) Entra en cueva y click en Altar of Suntara (en middle de big room 41.25) to entrega "Release Them".
11) Next to you acepta y haz "Rise, Obsidion!": junto a you en room, mata y lootea a Obsidion (lvl 52 golem) y mata y lootea a Lathoric the Black (lvl 52 dwarf).
12) Die on purpose, luego res at spirit.
13) At Thorium Point, asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en de Master Smith Burninate 39.28 junto a Forge.
14) N/A
15) Ve a the Gryphon Master 38.31 at Thorium Point y vuela a Nethergarde Keep, Blasted Lands.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[150] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) Ve norte to entra en Swamp of Sorrows, luego sigue el camino NW y click on A Soggy Scrolll under el puente (23.48 in SoS) to entrega "Cortello's Riddle", acepta the next part.
02) Ve all the way este hacia el middle de shore at SoS y haz part of "Ledger from Tanaris": mata y lootea a Jarquia /target 95.52, he drops the Goodsteel's Balanced Flameberge.
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ironforge.
04) At Ironforge's Posada, de the Innkeeper 18.51, acepta "Assisting Arch Druid Staghelm".
05) Ve NE to Hall of Explorers y de Curator Thorius (he patrols alrededor de 74.20), entrega (if you did it) "Rise, Obsidion!".
06) Also en Hall of Explorers, acepta "A Little Slime Goes a Long Way" 76.23.  NOTE:  Do not lootea the item received (yet).
07) GET NEW ABILITIES, 07) Get your nivel 48 spells/abilities.
08) Ve a the bank 35.62 y  put the following items en bank: Package of Empty Ooze Containers, stack of Dark Iron Scraps, Black Dragonflight Molt, Torch of Retribution (can be used as a future light source) y (if you have it) Prayer to Elune.
09) Ve a the Gryphon Master 56.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Menethil Harbor, Wetlands.
10) At Menethil Harbor, go en docks y get en southern boat to take you to Theramore Isle 5.64..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[151] = {title = [[PLEASE READ With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you will most likely be well into nivel 48. Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into 49 Dustwallow Marsh section below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  However if for some reason you are early into nivel 48 you can consider doing this section.]], text = [[
01) 49 Feralas
02) At the gazebo between the Posada y the Sea, acepta "Improved Quality" 31.43.
03) Ve cruzando Posada hacia el small building y entrega "Return to Troyas" 32.45, wait a few seconds luego acepta "The Stave of Equinex".
04) Next to you, acepta "The Sunken Temple".
05) Ve a través de Posada y onto the dock to get en boat to take you este 31.40.  If the boat is not there or within view that it is almost there, luego just nada este at 45.43 y acepta "Zapped Giants" y "Fuel for the Zapping".  NOTE:  "Zapped Giants" y its misión item Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker is on a 2 hour timer, so work somewhat quickly, but you should have plenty of time.
06) Do "Fuel for the Zapping" (starting at 44.39): mata y lootea a water elementals, which include Sea Elementals y Sea Sprays (low drop rate).  Watch out para elite giants (you can usa el/la Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker misión item on them to make them non-elite).
07) Vuelve a the goblin junto a dock y entrega "Fuel for the Zapping" (45.43, #4 on map).  NOTE:  The repeatable misión "Refuel for the Zapping" does not yield much XP.
08) Sigue el camino up the hill 46.38..
09) Ve este to Rage Scar Hold entrance 52.32 y haz "Improved Quality": mata y lootea a the yeti para hides.  Also keep grinding en yetis until you get the Pristine Yeti Hide, de it acepta "Pristine Yeti Hide".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[152] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #37]], text = [[
01) As you work your way norte (starting alrededor de 50.33), do part of "Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail": mata y lootea a the Ironfur Patriarchs (bears) y the Groddoc Thunderers (gorillas) for their livers.  NOTE:  The Roc Gizzards will be done later in Tanaris.  You can work your way hacia el next paso while working on this:
02) Ve NW y de Rockbiter (big giant 42.22), acepta "The Giant Guardian".
03) Just hacia el oeste of you (alrededor de 40.24 y work norte) do "Zapped Giants": use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker misión item en giants (this removes the elite status) luego mata y lootea a them.
04) Ve norte to Ruins of Ravenwind y haz "The Stave of Equinex": lootea the following Flames:  First one is the Flame of Byltan under the gazebo 39.16.  See next paso para others:
05) Ve norte y up en gazebo, lootea the Flame of Lahassa 38.12.
06) Ve este y lootea the Flame of Imbel 40.9.
07) The last flame is a bit hidden.  Ve a the stone ruins y hop en stone bridge at 40.11, go up it luego you will have to do a few more jumps to get up there.  Once up there, lootea the Flame of Samha 41.13.
08) Ve oeste hacia el Equinex Monolith 39.13 y use your Troyas' Stave misión item at it.  Luego click en Equinex Monolith to entrega "The Stave of Equinex", acepta "The Morrow Stone".
09) Ve al norte y entrega "The Giant Guardian" 38.10, luego acepta y haz the escolta a "Wandering Shay":  The first thing to do is lootea Shay's Chest junto a you, luego simply escolta a her /target (you lead her) hacia el next paso:
10) Lead her to Rockbiter (big giant 42.22, #2 on map).  If she starts roaming aimlessly, use Shay's Bell misión item to call her back to you.  At Rockbiter, entrega "Wandering Shay".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[153] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #38]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal sur luego NE to la entrada of Dire Maul at 43.70 only to get it Discovered.  Simply discovering Dire Maul in this area will allow you to acepta a future misión.  You need to actually discover the zone, you will know when you achieved that when your general chat switches over to Dire Maul.
02) Este en Grimtotem camp is a hidden path junto a a tree (starting at 66.47).  Sube por path y en end de ledge, acepta "An Orphan Looking For a Home" 66.46.
03) While questing in Feralas, you may come across an item called OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-22/FE!".  Luego turn this in a través de small cueva 53.56 y haz the escolta a "Rescue OOX-22/FE!".  TIP:  Before doing the escolta a, clear el camino of yetis hacia el main path, otherwise this escolta a can be really tough.  Try to keep aggro off de Robot Chicken /target, as it can die easily.  This is also a fairly long escolta a (12.5 minute).
04) Ve oeste a bit hacia el goblin junto a dock y entrega "Zapped Giants" 45.43.  You can get resupplied de him now.
05) Ve just NW along the shore (hacia el specific spot of 41.38), luego die on purpose y res at spirit to get back to Feathermoon.  NOTE:  Otherwise you will end up en Dire Maul graveyard.
06) Ve cruzando Posada hacia el small building y entrega "The Morrow Stone" 32.46.
07) At the gazebo junto a Posada/Sea 31.43, entrega "Improved Quality" y "Pristine Yeti Hide".
08) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied de the Cloth Armor Merchant 31.43 en Posada.
09) Near you en Hippogryph Master 30.43 vuela a Theramore, Dustwallow Marsh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[154] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #39]], text = [[
01) 49 Dustwallow Marsh
02) At Theramore, go oeste along the afuera walls de town to 64.52, luego make a nada oeste hacia el next paso:
03) At the other side of el río at 55.50, sube por hill to get into Beezil's Wreck..
04) Ve sur a bit y haz the last part of "Ledger from Tanaris": lootea the Damaged Crate para Overdue Package 54.56.
05) Ve oeste to Bloodfen Burrow (small cueva 31.66) y click en Musty Scroll to entrega "Cortello's Riddle", acepta the next part.
06) Ve a the NE outskirts of Mudsprocket, hacia el Flight Master 43.72 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
07) N/A
08) N/A
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[155] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #40]], text = [[
01) 50 Tanaris
02) As you entra en Gadgetzan, make a right en Bank (hut at 52.29) y get the following items out:  Hippogryph Egg, Yeh'kinya's Bramble, Goodsteel Ledger, 20 Solid Crystal Leg Shafts.
03) Junto a Forge, entrega "Ledger from Tanaris" 51.29.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) On the western side of Gadgetzan, up en hill, acepta "Noxious Lair Investigation" 50.27.
05) Junto a crane 52.27 acepta "Thistleshrub Valley" y "Super Sticky".
06) Ve a the Egg-O-Matic machine in Gadgetzan (junto a teleporter 52.27), y entrega your Hippogryph Egg for "The Super Egg-O-Matic" misión (additional eggs do not yield XP).  NOTE:  You can entrega different types of eggs en NPC junto a machine for a non-XP reward.
07) Behind the Posada, junto a Bonfire, acepta "The Dunemaul Compound" 53.27.
08) On the sur end of Gadgetzan, junto a AH, acepta "The Thirsty Goblin" 52.29.
09) Ve sur hacia el Broken Pillar y entrega "The Sunken Temple" 53.46, acepta "The Stone Circle".  Also acepta "Gahz'ridian".
10) Ve SW y haz part of "The Dunemaul Compound": mata Gor'marok the Ravager (en small cueva 42.58).
11) N/A
12) Ve sur to Southmoon Ruins alrededor de 41.72 y finish "The Dunemaul Compound" along with "Gahz'ridian": mata Dunemaul Brutes y Dunemaul Enforcers.  Also lootea the Gahz'ridian de the ground.  TIP:  You can equip the Gahz'ridian Detector helm to help you see the Gahz'ridian en minimap.  Also, there is another area of enemigos, but with less Gahz'ridian, alrededor de 46.66.
13) Ve oeste to The Noxious Lair alrededor de 34.46 y haz "Noxious Lair Investigation": mata y lootea a the Centipaar enemigos (bugs), y any of them can drop the insect parts.
14) Ve sur to Thistleshrub Valley alrededor de 30.65 y haz "Thistleshrub Valley" along with "The Thirsty Goblin": mata 8 Gnarled Thistleshrubs y 8 Thistleshrub Rootshapers.  Also mata y lootea a the Thistleshrub Dew Collectors /target para Laden Dew Gland (low drop rate).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[156] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #41]], text = [[
01) At the Thistleshrub Valley 32.74 or 29.63 acepta y haz the escolta a misión "Tooga's Quest": escolta a Tooga /target (turtle) NE to Torta (At next paso).  NOTE: If you cannot find this turtle, luego someone else is probably doing the escolta a, if so, luego just skip this.
02) Once at Torta 67.26, entrega "Tooga's Quest".
03) Just norte a bit at Steamwheedle Port, en hut, acepta "Yuka Screwspigot" 67.24.
04) Norte at Steamwheedle Port, entrega "Screecher Spirits" 67.22, SKIP "The Prophecy of Mosh'aru" (Zul'Farrak Dungeon).
05) You can get resupplied de Jabbey 67.22 en hut.
06) Farmea back to Gadgetzan y junto a AH entrega "The Thirsty Goblin" 52.29, acepta "In Good Taste".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) At Sprinkle (junto a hut), entrega "In Good Taste" 51.27, acepta "Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient".
08) In the hut junto a you, entrega "Noxious Lair Investigation" 51.27.
09) Junto a crane cerca de norte Gadgetzan entrance, entrega "Thistleshrub Valley" 52.27.
10) Behind the Posada, junto a Bonfire, entrega "The Dunemaul Compound" 53.27.
11) If you have the OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon item in your bank 52.29, get that out now.
12) On the western side of Gadgetzan, up en hill, acepta "The Scrimshank Redemption" 50.27.
13) Ve sur hacia el Broken Pillar y entrega "Gahz'ridian" 53.46.
14) N/A
15) If you have the item OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-17/TN!".  Luego turn this in at 60.65 NOTE: The chicken escorts are skipped due to faster leveling rates.
16) Ve SE to The Gaping Chasm y haz "The Scrimshank Redemption": entra en specific cueva entrance 56.69 y keep making right turns in la cueva, which will lead you hacia el item you need to lootea.
17) Die on purpose y res at spirit exit 56.69, luego head norte to get back to Gadgetzan.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[157] = {title = [[50 The Hinterlands]], text = [[
01) On the western side of Gadgetzan, up en hill, entrega "The Scrimshank Redemption" 50.27, acepta "Insect Part Analysis".
02) In the hut NW in Gadgetzan, entrega "Insect Part Analysis" 51.27, acepta the next part.
03) Vuelve a the western side of Gadgetzan, up en hill (50.27, #1 on map) y entrega "Insect Part Analysis".  Acepta "Rise of the Silithid".
04) Baja por hill y between the two huts, de Shreev /target, acepta (no exclamation mark) "Safety First" 51.27.
05) At this point, asegúrate de ser nivel 50 before continuing (farmea on any enemigos in Tanaris until you are).  If you are still a few bars away I recommend grinding en ogres en Dunemaul Compound alrededor de 41.53.
06) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied de Krinkle 51.29 by the Forge..
07) Ve a the Bank SE at Gadgetzan (hut at 52.29) y get the following items out:  Super Snapper FX.  Put the following item en bank:  Insect Analysis Report.
08) Ve norte into The Shimmering Flats y en Night Elf standing by the bleachers (78.75 in Thousand Needles), entrega (you probably wont have this for TBC/SOM, if so ignore this) "An Orphan Looking For a Home", y if you have 2 Elixir of Fortitude with you, acepta y entrega "A Short Incubation", luego acepta "The Newest Member of the Family".  NOTE:  This misión has a 1 hour countdown limit, so you must work somewhat quickly con following pasos to get this completed successfully...
09) Ve a the goblin side de Mirage Raceway y entrega "Safety First" 80.76.
10) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ironforge.
11) 10b) Check the AH 26.72 for a Mithril Casing y if you are able to get it, store it in your bank for now for a later misión at Un'goro Crater.
12) GET NEW ABILITIES, 10b) At Ironforge, get your nivel 50 spells/abilities.
13) Ve a the Gryphon Master 56.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Southshore, Hillsbrad.
14) First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!!
15) Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)
16) Ve NE to el camino that goes into The Hinterlands (starting at 89.27 in Hillsbrad).
17) Sigue el camino into The Hinterlands, luego make a sharp left at Aerie Peak, luego a right into the Posada y acepta "Troll Necklace Bounty" y "Skulk Rock Clean-up" 15.45.
18) Ve up en Posada hacia el Innkeeper 14.42 patrols a bit y make Wildhammer Keep (Aerie Peak) your new home.
19) TBC, 3b) Just afuera 15.47, acepta "Featherbeard's Endorsement" y "A Gesture of Goodwill".
20) As you go out questing in The Hinterlands also start working on "Favored of Elune?": lootea the Wildkin Feathers en ground scattered all alrededor de The Hinterlands you see por el camino:
21) TBC, 4a) Just sur, entra en Featherbeard's Hovel y de the book by the fireplace, entrega "Featherbeard's Endorsement" 13.55, acepta "In Pursuit of Featherbeard".
22) TBC, 4b) SE, dentro de of a small cueva 25.66 do "A Gesture of Goodwill": mata the two named enemigos (troll y his spider).
23) TBC, 4c) Entra en Shadra'Aldor entrance 36.65.
24) TBC, 4d) Sube por temple y entrega "In Pursuit of Featherbeard" 37.72, acepta "Reclaiming the Eggs".
25) TBC, 4e) In the immediate area alrededor de the SE side of Shadra'Aldor do "Reclaiming the Eggs": lootea Gryphon Eggs.  There is a lot up en wooden crate 34.75.  Also do "Troll Necklace Bounty": mata y lootea a trolls alrededor de the temples.
26) Ve este to Valorwind Lake 41.60 y haz "Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient": under the water lootea a Violet Tragan (mushroom).
27) Ve NE to Agol'watha alrededor de 47.42 y haz "Skulk Rock Clean-up": mata 10 Green Sludge /target y 10 Jade Ooze /target.  There is more of these enemigos este at Skulk Rock alrededor de 58.43.
28) NOTE: While questing, you may find an item called OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-09/HL!".  If so, go turn this in en middle of el lago on top de hill 49.38, but do NOT do the escolta a!
29) Make sure "Favored of Elune?" is finished: lootea the Wildkin Feathers en ground scattered all alrededor de The Hinterlands (#4 on map).
30) Along the este shore ramp down entrance 73.66 do "Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog": lootea the Pupellyverbos Port (blue bottles en ground).  Also do "The Super Snapper FX" by using the Super Snapper FX misión item on Gammerita /target.  This lvl 48 turtle patrols up y down the shore line.  You don't actually need to mata it.   While doing this, work your way to do the next paso también:
31) Ve norte en shore y underneath the waterfall, lootea Cortello's Treasure cofre 81.47 to entrega "Cortello's Riddle" (14 slot bag reward)!
32) Usa la piedra de hogar a Wildhammer Keep (Aerie Peak).   If Hearthstone is still on a cooldown, keep grinding (or take a break) until you are able to hearth.  Make sure you are resupplied.  Do not sell your Troll Tribal Necklaces to a vendedor!
33) Down en Posada entrega "Troll Necklace Bounty" y "Skulk Rock Clean-up" 15.45 (#2 on map).
34) TBC, 12b) Just afuera 15.47, entrega "A Gesture of Goodwill" y "Reclaiming the Eggs".  NOTE: Featherbeard's Map can be destroyed as its not used for anything.
35) Ve up y entrega "To The Hinterlands" 12.47, acepta "Gryphon Master Talonaxe".
36) Ve up en building y entrega "Gryphon Master Talonaxe" 10.44, SKIP "Rhapsody Shindigger".
37) Justo afuera de the building, en Gryphon Master 11.46, vuela a Menethil Harbor, Wetlands.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[158] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) At Menethil Harbor, take the southern boat (5.64 en docks) to ve a Theramore.
02) At Theramore, entra en Posada y de the Innkeeper 67.45 make it your new home.
03) Ve sur hacia el Gryphon Master 67.51, vuela a Ratchet, The Barrens.
04) At Ratchet do "The Stone Circle": just right afuera of Liv Rizzlefix's hut (at la entrada), lootea Marvon's Chest 62.39.  Also, go in Liv Rizzlefix's hut y acepta "Volcanic Activity".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[159] = {title = [[PLEASE READ With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you will most likely be well into nivel 50. Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into the section 51 Ungoro Crator below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  However if for some reason you are early into nivel 48 you can consider doing this section.]], text = [[
01) 51 Blasted Lands
02) Ve up hacia el Gryphon Master 28.78 y vuela a Nethergarde Keep, Blasted Lands.
03) At Nethergarde Keep, go up hasta lo alto de la torre y acepta "Petty Squabbles" 68.19.
04) Next to you up in la torre, entrega (if you have it) "Thadius Grimshade" 67.19, SKIP "Nekrum's Medallion" (Dungeon).
05) Ve norte hacia el border of Blasted Lands y SoS, hacia el Fallen Hero de Horde (34.66 in SoS) y entrega "Petty Squabbles", acepta y haz "A Tale of Sorrow" by simply talking hacia el NPC.  Luego turn it in y acepta "The Stones That Bind Us".
06) Vuelve sur to entra en the Blasted Lands y there is a small misión hub at 51.14 that gives 5 misiones.  These 5 misiones requires the following total number of items to completa them, y they can drop without needing to acepta the misiones.  The color codes below show where the enemigos are at en images y stars represent rare enemigos that may not be there.  Work en rest of this section all at once):
07) Mob - Total Items Needed - After "The Decisive Striker" - And luego "Vulture's Vigor"
08) Vulture Gizzards     =14 - 12 - 2
09) Basilisk Brain         =11 - 11 - 11
10) Blasted Boar Lungs =6 - 5 - 5
11) Scorpok Pincers      =6 - 3 - 3
12) Snickerfang Jowls   =5 - 5 - 3
13) 2+ PLAYERS (or could be soloable):  While grinding for these items, try to do "The Stones That Bind Us": drag the different servants close to their Stone of Binding crystal junto a each of them, luego mata them along with attacking the crystal también.  This allows you to actually mata the mob y get misión credit.  Each of these different servants are located at different parts de Blasted Lands.  See map for locations.  If for some reason you cannot solo this misión (or find help), it can be skipped.
14) While grinding make sure you get everything discovered for XP (including The Tainted Scar at 44.57).
15) As you get these items, you can turn the misiones in for a 60 min stat reward that will help you farmea faster in Blasted Lands or even para next section Un'Goro Crater (although they don't stack).  Ve a the misión hub at 51.14 y entrega all 5 of these misiones:  "Snickerfang Jowls" (+25 Strength), "A Boar's Vitality" (+25 Stamina), "The Decisive Striker" (+25 Agility), "The Basilisk's Bite" (+25 Intellect) y "Vulture's Vigor" (+25 Spirit).  NOTE:  The follow up misiones do NOT yield XP: "Rage of Ages", "Spirit of the Boar", "Salt of the Scorpok", "Infallible Mind", y "Spiritual Domination".
16) While questing in Blasted Lands, you may have came across an item called Imperfect Draenethyst Fragment, turn these in at 52.36 para misión "Everything Counts In Large Amounts".  NOTE:  I have NEVER found a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere para misión "To Serve Kum'isha" ..good luck on that.  Also, the follow up misión "One Draenei's Junk" is repeatable but yields no XP.
17) Ve a the border of Blasted Lands y SoS, hacia el Fallen Hero de Horde (34.66 in SoS) y entrega (if you did it) "The Stones That Bind Us", SKIP "Kirith".  Acepta "Heroes of Old".
18) Next to you en other side of el camino, entrega (if you have it) "Heroes of Old" (33.66 in SoS), acepta the next part.  Luego click en Spectral Lockbox en ground junto a you to turn it in.
19) Usa la piedra de hogar a Theramore.  NOTE:  If you did not do "The Stones That Bind Us", luego abandon the misión.
20) De the Gryphon Master 67.51, vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[160] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #05]], text = [[
01) 52 Un'Goro Crater
02) TBC/SoM, 00b) If you skipped Blasted lands section:  Ve a the Flight Master 63.37 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris..
03) Ve a the bank SE in Gadgetzan (hut at 52.29) y put the following items into it:  Snapshot of Gammerita y Super Snapper FX. Get the following item out:  Mithril Casing (it could be in your mailbox 52.28).  This is used for a misión in Un'Goro Crater, y remember to not sell this to a vendedor.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) At Gadgetzan, ve a Sprinkle (by the NW hut 51.27) y entrega "Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient".  Acepta "Delivery for Marin".
05) Junto a AH, de Marin Noggenfogger 52.29, entrega "Delivery for Marin"  NOTE:  "Noggenfogger Elixir" can take up to a minute para NPC to make the item for you, it does not yeild any XP, so you can do this when you are not in a hurry (such as after nivel 60).  The Noggenfogger Elixir item is used for fun y can be stored en bank when you want to use it.
06) NOTE:  The Noggenfogger Elixir item is used for fun y can be stored en bank 52.29when you want to use it.
07) Head sur hacia el Broken Pillar y entrega "The Stone Circle" 53.46.
08) Ve SW into Un'Goro Crater (entrada en 27.54 in Tanaris)...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[161] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #06]], text = [[
01) At the bottom of el camino into Un'Goro Crater, sube por hill junto a waterfall y acepta "The Apes of Un'Goro" y "The Fare of Lar'korwi" 72.76.
02) Ve norte a bit y haz "The Fare of Lar'korwi": lootea the big Fresh Threshadon Carcass lying en ground 69.57.
03) Farmea norte to la entrada of Marshal's Refuge y acepta "Chasing A-Me 01" 46.13.  NOTE:  On the way to Marshal's Refuge, farmea on Bloodpetal enemigos (plants) to start collecting Savage Fronds for a later misión.  Also start collecting crystals (the red, blue, green y yellow) scattered everywhere.
04) Ve up into Marshal's Refuge y acepta ALL misiones there:  De the goblin on top de hill, acepta "Shizzle's Flyer" 44.12.
05) Sube por hill a bit to Muigin y acepta "Muigin and Larion" 43.10.
06) Move into Marshal's Refuge 44.8 y acepta "Lost!", (de the Wanted Sign Beware of Pterrordax) "Beware of Pterrordax".
07) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 43.8.
08) Next to you acepta "Roll the Bones" 43.7.
09) Next to you 44.7 acepta "Alien Ecology" y "Expedition Salvation".  NOTE:  If you have already found A Mangled Journal, acepta y entrega "Williden's Journal".
10) Time to do the Un'Goro Farmea!  NOTES For the Farmea:
11) - Don't worry about looting the Un'Goro Dirt Piles, you will find enough Un'Goro Soil de mob drops.  Also do not sell the Un'Goro Soil to vendors, you will need these for misión turn-ins!
12) - Don't worry about looting the Bloodpetal Sprouts, as they are not turned in for any XP.
13) - The Dinosaur Bones you need para misión "Roll the Bones" will drop de many different enemigos as you do the other misiones.
14) - Also while questing, lootea 7 crystals of each color (red, blue, green, y yellow) for a later misión.  These crystals are scattered all alrededor de Un'Goro Crater.
15) - As you see the Bloodpetel enemigos (plants spread all alrededor de Un'Goro) por el camino mata y lootea a them para misión "Muigin and Larion".  These plants also drop Savage Fronds, you could recoge 30 of these for a later misión at lvl 59.  As you are doing the Un'Goro misiones associated with these enemigos you should get about half, so farmea on these that you see por el camino y see what you can get before leaving Un'Goro Crater, y you could always check the AH for more of these, or just skip this entirely.
16) - Watch out para Elite Devilsaurs patrolling alrededor de this zone.  I highlighted them through out the images so you can be alerted if you are in a danger zone for them.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[162] = {title = [[LET THE GRIND BEGIN]], text = [[
01) Justo al sur de Marshal's Refuge alrededor de 46.16 do "Super Sticky": mata y lootea a the Tar enemigos alrededor de the tar pits.
02) Ve NE to Fungal Rock y start working on "The Apes of Un'Goro": mata y lootea a the apes (in y afuera of la cueva).  Also entra en cueva entrance 64.16 y luego make a right y entrega "Chasing A-Me 01", luego if you have a Mithril Casing with you, acepta y entrega "Chasing A-Me 01".  Luego acepta y haz the escolta a "Chasing A-Me 01": escolta a A-Me 01 to Marshal's Refuge, y luego turn it in once you get there.
03) Ve up en mountain ledge (ramp entrada en 55.12) y start working on "Shizzle's Flyer": mata y lootea a the Pterrordax /target.  There are only 6 mob spawns here, so clear the area once y move on hacia el next paso..
04) Make sure "The Apes of Un'Goro" is finished: mata y lootea a the apes (in y afuera of la cueva alrededor de 64.16, #2 on map).
05) Ve SE y haz part of "Expedition Salvation": under the tent, lootea the Crate of Foodstuffs 69.37.
06) Mata y lootea a Bloodpetal enemigos (plants) starting below el río alrededor de 61.48 y work you way sur.  Mata y lootea a any Diemetradon you see también for "Shizzle's Flyer".
07) Farmea your way SE to Torwa Pathfinder on top de hill by the waterfall y entrega "The Apes of Un'Goro" 72.76.  Acepta "The Mighty U'cha".  And entrega "The Fare of Lar'korwi", acepta "The Scent of Lar'korwi".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[163] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #08]], text = [[
01) Just hacia el oeste of you at The Marshlands alrededor de 67.73 do "The Scent of Lar'korwi": corre cruzando raptor egg nests (there is 5 total: 67.73 63.77 67.67 61.72 62.66) y luego mata y lootea a the Lar'korwi Mates that spawn in.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
02) At The Marshlands, en western most pond, norte on it's shore, click on A Wrecked Raft 63.69 to acepta "It's a Secret to Everybody".  Luego right junto a wrecked raft, under the water, click on A Small Pack 63.69 to entrega "It's a Secret to Everybody", acepta the next part.  NOTE:  To free up bag space, do NOT lootea A Small Pack yet!
03) Ve este to Torwa Pathfinder on top de hill by the waterfall y entrega "The Scent of Lar'korwi" 72.76, acepta "The Bait for Lar'korwi".  NOTE:  Do NOT lootea Torwa's Pouch yet!
04) Ve oeste to The Slithering Scar y haz "Alien Ecology": entra en la cueva entrance 50.81.  Gira a la izquierda in la cueva y luego use your Unused Scraping Vial misión item en mound en center de room 49.85.
05) Ve sur up en ledges alrededor de 56.90 to continue obtaining the Webbed Pterrordax Scales (you will be able to get more of these later) for "Shizzle's Flyer".  There is another spot of these enemigos alrededor de 45.90.
06) Farmea NW a bit hacia el old camp site 38.66 y haz the last part of "Expedition Salvation": lootea the Research Equipment (looks like a stack of brown boxes junto a a tent).
07) All alrededor de the western side of Un'Goro Crater, finish up "Muigin and Larion" (mata Bloodpetal Trappers) along with finishing up "Beware of Pterrordax", "Shizzle's Flyer" y "Roll the Bones" (mata y lootea a Frenzied Pterrordax).  The Dinosaur Bones can also drop de Elder Diemetradon y regular Diemetradon enemigos (found sur-middle).  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
08) At the Golakka Hot Springs (below the hotspring mountain), acepta "Finding the Source" 31.50.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[164] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #09]], text = [[
01) Do "Volcanic Activity" along with "Finding the Source".  First ve a the norte entrada en Fire Plume Ridge (spiky bridge entrada en 53.43).  Sigue el camino upwards hacia el top y use Krakle's Thermometer misión item en Fire Plume Ridge Hot Spot (the one at 50.46).  Watch out para lvl 56 Elite mob in la cueva en lo alto de the Ridge.  Also mata y lootea a the fire elementals alrededor de Fire Plume Ridge para 9 Un'Goro Ash y to start collecting Core of Elements for a future misión (I recommend at least getting about 10 for now).
02) Make sure all the misiones above are done, including obtaining 7 crystals of each color (red, blue, green, y yellow), luego ve a the small cueva en eastern side of Fire Plume Ridge y entrega "Lost!" 52.50.
03) Acepta y haz the escolta a "A Little Help From My Friends": escolta a Ringo /target back to Marshal's Refuge 44.9.  You will need to usa el/la misión item Spraggle's Canteen on Ringo to wake him up if he faints.
04) entrega "A Little Help From My Friends" y "Beware of Pterrordax" 44.9.
05) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 43.8.
06) Next to you entrega "Roll the Bones"43.7.
07) Next to you 44.7 entrega "Alien Ecology", "Expedition Salvation" y (if you haven't yet) acepta y entrega "Williden's Journal" de the item A Mangled Journal (this item/misión is obtained while killing any mob in Un'Goro Crater that should be in your inventory by now).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
08) Open y lootea A Small Pack in your inventory y luego ve a Linken (en middle of Marshal's Refuge detrás de some trees 45.8) y entrega "It's a Secret to Everybody", acepta the next part.  NOTE:  The Faded Photograph is not needed y will remain in your inventory forever unless you destroy or bank it.
09) At the western side of Marshal's Refuge up en hill, entrega "Muigin and Larion" 43.10, SKIP "A Visit to Gregan".
10) Entra en la cueva at Marshal's Refuge entrance 43.6 y en very end of la cueva acepta y entrega "Crystals of Power" 42.3.  Luego acepta the 3 Pylon misiones:  "The Northern Pylon", "The Eastern Pylon" y "The Western Pylon".  You can destroy any remaining crystals in your inventory (to free bag space).
11) Sal de la cueva, y luego sur in Marshal's Refuge on top de hill, entrega "Shizzle's Flyer" 44.12.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[165] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #10]], text = [[
01) Ve este up en ledges y haz "The Northern Pylon": click en Northern Crystal Pylon 57.13.
02) Ve este to Fungal Rock y haz "The Mighty U'cha": entra en la cueva entrance 65.16, luego keep left in la cueva until you get to U'cha (lvl 55 red colored ape) y mata y lootea a him.
03) On the eastern side of Un'Goro Crater, go up en ledges y haz "The Eastern Pylon": click en Eastern Crystal Pylon 77.50.
04) Just hacia el este of you en mountain ledges there, do "The Bait for Lar'korwi": en old dinosaur bones, there is a gray flat rock en ground at 80.50.  At this spot open your Torwa's Pouch misión item y first usa el/la Preserved Threshadon Meat misión item, luego usa el/la Preserved Pheromone Mixture at this spot, luego mata y lootea a Lar'korwi that spawns in (See Video).
05) Ve sur to Torwa Pathfinder 72.76 on top de hill by the waterfall y entrega "The Bait for Lar'korwi" y "The Mighty U'cha".
06) Ve oeste up en mountain ledges y haz "The Western Pylon": click en Western Crystal Pylon 24.59.
07) Ve NE to Golakka Hot Springs (below the hotspring mountain) y entrega "Finding the Source" 31.50, acepta "The New Springs".
08) Farmea your way back norte to Marshal's Refuge entrance 46.13.  Also at this time see if you can obtain 30 Savage Fronds de the Bloodpetel enemigos (plants all alrededor de Un'Goro), 30 of these can be used for a later misión at lvl 59.  If you are still far detrás de on that luego don't worry about it, you may find more en AH (or just skip it).  Also remember to not sell your Un'Goro Soil!
09) Entra en la cueva at Marshal's Refuge entrance 43.6 y work your way hacia el end of la cueva y entrega at 42.3 "The Northern Pylon", "The Eastern Pylon" y "The Western Pylon".  Luego acepta y entrega "Making Sense of It".  NOTE:  The Crystal Pylon User's Manual can be destroyed or saved in your bank for later reference y you can always get a new one de this NPC in la cueva.
10) Sal de la cueva, asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en 44.7.
11) Ve up en eastern side of Marshal's Refuge, hacia el Flight Master 45.6 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[166] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Ve a the Bank SE at Gadgetzan (hut at 52.29) y put the following items en bank:  9 Un'Goro Ash, Savage Fronds, Core of Elements.  Get the following items out de bank:  Snapshot of Gammerita y Super Snapper FX.
02) Norte in Gadgetzan (junto a crane) entrega "Super Sticky" 52.27.
03) If you are not nivel 52 luego farmea on any mob in Tanaris until you are.
04) Usa la piedra de hogar a Theramore.
05) N/A
06) At Theramore ve a the Gryphon Master 67.51 y vuela a Rut'theran Village, Teldrassil.
07) At Rut'theran Village, entra en house 55.92 y entrega "Favored of Elune?", acepta "Moontouched Wildkin".
08) 09b) Ve upstairs en house y entrega "The Super Snapper FX" 55.92, SKIP "Return to Troyas".
09) Sube por path a través de red portal 56.89 to get to Darnassus.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[167] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #12]], text = [[
01) While in Darnassus, if you corre across Herald Moonstalker /target (she patrols all alrededor de the city), de her, acepta "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!".  If you cannot find her, luego don't worry you will have another chance later:
02) Norte en Cenarion Enclave, go hasta lo alto de the tree tower y entrega "Assisting Arch Druid Staghelm" 35.9, acepta "Un'Goro Soil".
03) Drop down detrás de tree tower y entrega "Un'Goro Soil" 31.8.
04) Vuelve up hasta lo alto de the tree tower y acepta "Morrowgrain Research" (35.9, #2 on map).  NOTE:  It's a long walk alrededor de unless you go a través de shortcut right detrás de you.
05) Ve down hacia el middle nivel en tree tower y entrega "Morrowgrain Research", SKIP the next part.
06) You can sell any remaining Packet of Tharlendris Seeds y Un'Goro Soil to this vendedor.
07) N/A
08) Ve a the Bank 40.42 y get the following items out:  Package of Empty Ooze Containers, Insect Analysis Report y (if you have it) Prayer to Elune.
09) Ve sur to Temple de Moon y entrega "Rise of the Silithid" up at 42.86 , SKIP "March of the Silithid" (for now).
10) If you have "Prayer to Elune", luego turn this in también (up en Temple de Moon 38.81).
11) Exit Darnassus by going a través de red portal 29.40.
12) On the docks, ve a the Hippogryph Master 58.94 y vuela a Astranaar, Ashenvale.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[168] = {title = [[PLEASE READ With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you will most likely be well into nivel 52. Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into the section 53-54 Felwood below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  Also its not wise to even do this zone if you wanted to since we skipped getting the misiones for this zone earlier.]], text = [[
01) 53 Azshara
02) At Azshara, go este to Ruins of Eldarath y start working on "Arcane Runes": lootea 3 of 4 Runes en ruins.  First one is Rune of Beth'Amara 37.53.  See next pasos for 2 more (for now):
03) Ve SE a bit y lootea Rune of Markri 39.55.
04) Ve norte a bit y lootea Rune of Jin'yael 40.50.
05) Exit Ruins of Eldarath yendo hacia este through The Shattered Strand, y luego exit norte 46.38..
06) Ve NE hacia el hill entrance 53.20...
07) Ve up hasta lo alto de the hill y acepta "Kim'jael Indeed!" 53.22.
08) Ve sur to Thalassian Base Camp alrededor de 58.28 y haz "Kim'jael Indeed!": lootea Kim'jael's Equipment boxes del suelo alrededor de el campamento.
09) Ve NE hacia el hill entrance (53.20, #5 on map)...
10) Ve up hasta lo alto de the hill y entrega "Kim'jael Indeed!" 53.22.  Acepta "Kim'jael's "Missing" Equipment".
11) Drop down to The Shattered Strand 51.36 (be careful, its a long drop), luego do "Kim'jael's "Missing" Equipment": mata y lootea a Spitelash enemigos (naga) until Some Rune drops (low drop rate).
12) Exit The Shattered Strand yendo hacia norte (at 46.38, #4 on map)..
13) Head este hacia el hill entrance (53.20, #5 on map)...
14) Ve up hasta lo alto de the hill y entrega "Kim'jael's "Missing" Equipment" 53.22.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[169] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #14]], text = [[
01) GRIND TIME:  At this point you should be about nivel 53.  Farmea all the way to nivel 53 y a half (53.5) on Blood Elves alrededor de Thalassian Base Camp alrededor de 58.28.  NOTE:  Blood Elves are squishy enemigos (enemigos that have 30% fewer health/armor, than the average mob that nivel), so they die relatively fast y yield good XP/hour. Another decent grinding spot is the Satyrs en Legash Encampment alrededor de 61.25.  Also make sure "Morrowgrain Research" is finished too.  OPTIONAL:  Instead de grinding, you could go do BRD Dungeon instead.
02) Ve SW to Ruins of Eldarath y haz the last part of "Arcane Runes": lootea Rune of Sael'hai 42.64.
03) Ve all the way SE in Azshara en little island 78.91 y use your Standard Issue Flare Gun misión item en helicopter pad, luego de the NPC that spawns, entrega "Arcane Runes", acepta "Return to Tymor".
04) Usa la piedra de hogar a Craftsmen's Terrace (Darnassus).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  NOTE:  If the Standard Issue Flare Gun is still in your inventory you can destroy it.
05) Ve oeste hacia el middle nivel de tree tower 35.8 y entrega "Morrowgrain Research".  NOTES:  The misión is repeatable but you only get 550 XP en next entrega, luego no more afterwards.  After turning this in, you can sell any remaining Packet of Tharlendris Seeds, Morrowgrains y Un'Goro Soil to a vendedor.  And you can destroy the Evergreen Pouch también.
06) Ve a the bank at Darnassus 40.42 y
07) Exit Darnassus by going a través de red portal 29.41.
08) On the docks, ve a the Hippogryph Master 58.94 y vuela a Astranaar, Ashenvale.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[170] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #15]], text = [[
01) 54 Felwood
02) Head este en main path, luego norte to Felwood (entrada en 56.29 in Ashenvale)..
03) As you entra en Felwood, y off to your right de main path, acepta "Cleansing Felwood" (54.87 in Felwood).
04) Ve norte a bit to Emerald Sanctuary y acepta "Forces of Jaedenar" 51.82.  And junto a you en tent 51.82, acepta "Verifying the Corruption" y (if you are lvl 53) "To Winterspring!".  And en house, acepta "The Corruption of the Jadefire" 51.82. Also, get the FP de the Flight Master 52.82.
05) Just sur a bit junto a main path, de Grazle /target (furblog 51.85), acepta "Timbermaw Ally".
06) Ve sur to Deadwood Village alrededor de 49.91 y haz "Timbermaw Ally": mata the required amount of Deadwood enemigos.
07) Ve norte a bit along the main path to Grazle (51.85, #5 on map) y entrega "Timbermaw Ally".  Acepta "Speak to Nafien".
08) Ve al norte hacia el two small ponds on your left alrededor de 41.71 y haz part of "A Little Slime Goes a Long Way": first lootea your Package of Empty Ooze Containers misión item, luego usa el/la Empty Cursed Ooze Jar misión item on Cursed Ooze corpses.
09) Justo al oeste de you do "The Corruption of the Jadefire": mata the required amount of Jadefire Satyrs y Xavathras /target 32.67 is en oeste end of el campamento by the green well.
10) Ve al norte y start working en last part of "A Little Slime Goes a Long Way" alrededor de 41.59: usa el/la Empty Tainted Ooze Jar misión item on Tainted Ooze corpses.  When you corre out of enemigos, just continue on:
11) Ve oeste into Jaedenar alrededor de 39.59 y haz "Forces of Jaedenar": mata the required amount of enemigos en area.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[171] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #16]], text = [[
01) Back sur a bit off the main path alrededor de 41.59 finish "A Little Slime Goes a Long Way": usa el/la Empty Tainted Ooze Jar misión item on Tainted Ooze corpses.  NOTE:  There is even more of these slimes al norte a bit alrededor de alrededor de 40.56.
02) Ve sur to Emerald Sanctuary y entrega "Forces of Jaedenar" 51.82, acepta "Collection of the Corrupt Water".
03) Entra en house y entrega "The Corruption of the Jadefire" 51.82.  Acepta "Further Corruption".
04) Ve norte in Jaedenar y haz "Collection of the Corrupt Water": use your Empty Canteen misión item en green moonwell 35.60.
05) Vuelve sur to Emerald Sanctuary y entrega "Collection of the Corrupt Water" (51.82, #2 on map), acepta "Seeking Spiritual Aid".  If you are nivel 53, acepta (if you haven't yet) "To Winterspring!" 51.82.  If not don't worry (it's not needed).
06) Ve al norte y en este side of el camino to Shatter Scar Vale alrededor de 42.43 do "Verifying the Corruption": walk across one de craters en Vale to get it explored, y mata the required amount of fire elementals.
07) Ve norte to entra en Jadefire Corre 42.20..
08) Farmea sur in Jadefire Corre y mata y lootea a Xavaric 39.22 /target, he drops an item, which starts "Flute of Xavaric", acepta it.
09) In the immediate area alrededor de Jadefire Corre, do "Further Corruption" along with "Flute of Xavaric": mata the required amount of Jadefire Satyrs (demons) y lootea them para 5 Jadefire Felbinds.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[172] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #17]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal up NE to Irontree Woods y haz "Cleansing Felwood": mata y lootea a the Warpwood elementals.  There is more enemigos en Irontree Cavern entrance 56.17.
02) Ve este to Talonbranch Glade y get the Flight Path de the Hippogryph Master 62.24.  NOTE:  You can get repaired/resupplied en NPCs by the gazebo 62.26 .
03) Sigue el camino principal norte (right before the Timbermaw Hold entrance) y de Nafien 65.8, entrega "Speak to Nafien".  And acepta "Deadwood of the North".
04) Drop down oeste to Felpaw Village alrededor de 63.9 y haz "Deadwood of the North": mata the required amount of Deadwood furbolgs.
05) Vuelve up to Nafien by the Timbermaw Hold entrance (65.8 #3 on map) y entrega "Deadwood of the North".  Acepta "Speak to Salfa".  Also entrega any feathers you may have (repeatable misión to increase rep).  NOTE:  Becoming friendlier with Timbermaw Hold will allow you to entra en their cueva without them attacking you y allowing you to get additional misiones y items de them.
06) Entra en Timbermaw Hold junto a you entrance 65.7 y go a través de cueva , make a right en middle after el puente to entra en Moonglade al norte.
07) Once in Moonglade, go este y just right after the first lake you see, get the Flight Path de the Hippogryph Master 48.67.
08) Exit Moonglade back to Timbermaw Hold (36.73 in Moonglade).
09) In Timbermaw Hold, make a right after the stairs to go into Winterspring..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[173] = {title = [[54 Winterspring]], text = [[
01) Right afuera of la cueva, entrega "Speak to Salfa" (28.34 in Winterspring).  And acepta "Winterfall Activity".
02) Sigue el camino principal sur to Donova Snowden 31.45 y acepta "Threat of the Winterfall".  Entrega "The New Springs", acepta "Strange Sources".  Also entrega "It's a Secret to Everybody", SKIP "The Videre Elixir".  NOTE:  You do not have to wait para NPC, just sal de..
03) As you go este a través de open fields of Winterspring start working on "Moontouched Wildkin": lootea the Moontouched Feathers en ground (sur de main path).  While doing this, head este hacia el next paso:
04) Head NE to Starfall Village y entrega (if you have it) "To Winterspring!" 52.30, acepta "The Ruins of Kel'Theril".
05) Next to you, entrega "The Ruins of Kel'Theril" 52.30, acepta "Troubled Spirits of Kel'Theril".  Also acepta "Enraged Wildkin".
06) Make sure you are resupplied at Food & Drink 52.29 or General Goods 51.31.
07) Ve SE y just above Everlook ve a the Hippogryph Master 62.37 to get the Flight Path.
08) Ve alrededor de the oeste side of Everlook to entra en it en sur side.  As you entra en Everlook, on your left, acepta "Are We There, Yeti?" 61.38.
09) Entra en Posada y de the Innkeeper, make Everlook your new home 61.39.
10) TBC, 9b) Back in Everlook by the cage 62.38, acepta "Ursius of the Shardtooth".
11) Ve a Everlook's Bank 61.37 y put the following items into it:  Flute of Xavaric, 5 Jadefire Felbind, Corrupt Moonwell Water, 15 Blood Amber, 6 Filled Cursed Ooze Jar, 6 Filled Tainted Ooze Jar, any Core of Elements you may have, any Deadwood Headdress Feathers you may have, y (if you have it) Deadwood Ritual Totem.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[174] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #19]], text = [[
01) As you work en following misiones also start working on "Are We There, Yeti?" by mata/looting yeti (any will do), but don't make it your main priority:
02) Ve SW to The Ruins of Kel'Theril y haz "Troubled Spirits of Kel'Theril": lootea the 4 Relic Fragments en ground.  Watch out para high nivel water elementals. Just corre in, lootea them y corre out. First one to lootea is First Relic Fragment 55.43.  See next pasos para other 3:
03) Ve oeste a bit y lootea the Third Relic Fragment 53.43.
04) Ve este a bit y lootea the Fourth Relic Fragment 52.41.
05) Ve NW a bit y lootea the Second Relic Fragment 51.42.
06) Ve sur hacia el small wrecked camp y click en Damaged Crate 59.60 to entrega "Enraged Wildkin", acepta the next part.
07) Ve SE a bit y click on Jaron's Wagon 61.61 to entrega "Enraged Wildkin", acepta the next part.
08) Do part of "Enraged Wildkin": right junto a carreta, lootea Jaron's Supplies (small crate 61.61).
09) Ve este to Owl Wing Thicket entrance 64.59 y finish "Enraged Wildkin": mata y lootea a the owls until you get the Blue-feathered Amulet (high drop rate).  Try to avoid the higher nivel owls, you can find more owls up alrededor de the hills en Owl Wing Thicket y more owls alrededor de 59.60.
10) Sigue el camino principal sur to discover Darkwhisper Gorge at 60.74 for "Strange Sources".  You actually need to go further sur past el puente to get this discovered.
11) Usa la piedra de hogar a Everlook.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 62.38.
12) Ve a Everlook's Bank 61.37 y put the following items into it:  Jaron's Pick, First Relic Fragment, Second Relic Fragment, Third Relic Fragment, y Fourth Relic Fragment.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[175] = {title = [[TBC, 00) As you go questing, keep an eye out for a bear named Ursius /target (he looks just like all other other ones), if so, mata him for \"Ursius of the Shardtooth\", but don't intentionally try to find him now]], text = [[
01) Exit Everlook hacia el right, luego ve este to Winterfall Village alrededor de 67.35 y haz "Winterfall Activity": mata the required amount of Winterfall furbolgs.  NOTE:  This place is usually busy with lvl 60+ players farming Winterfall Firewater here.  If that's the case luego this misión can be skipped (there is no follow up).  You can also skip this if you are only nivel 53 right now as it is kind of a higher nivel misión.
02) Ve oeste to Starfall Village y entrega "Enraged Wildkin" 52.30.  Make sure you are resupplied.
03) Ve oeste y haz "Threat of the Winterfall": mata the required amount of Winterfall furbolgs.  There are two camps of these enemigos (one at 42.43 y one at 31.36).  While doing this misión you should find an item, which starts "Winterfall Firewater" (acepta it).
04) Ve SW to Donova Snowden 31.45 y entrega "Strange Sources", "Threat of the Winterfall" y "Winterfall Firewater", acepta "Falling to Corruption".
05) Make sure "Moontouched Wildkin" is finished now: lootea the Moontouched Feathers en ground (sur de main path).
06) Hearth (or corre back if its still on a cooldown) to Everlook.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 62.38.
07) TBC, 6b) IF YOU DID IT:  Back in Everlook by the cage 62.38, entrega "Ursius of the Shardtooth".
08) Ve SE to Ice Thistle Hills alrededor de 66.41 y finish "Are We There, Yeti?": mata y lootea a yeti (any will do).
09) Hearth (or vuelve) to Everlook y entrega "Are We There, Yeti?" 61.38, acepta the next part.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[176] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Ve SE back to Ice Thistle Hills alrededor de 66.41 y haz "Are We There, Yeti?": mata y lootea a Ice Thistle Matriarchs y Ice Thistle Patriarchs para 2 horns (low drop rate).  There is a higher concentration of these enemigos in la cueva entrance up at 68.42.
02) Hearth if you can .  If you can't hearth, luego ve back to Everlook if you are close, or die on purpose y res at spirit if you are deep in la cueva.  Once at Everlook entrega "Are We There, Yeti?" 61.38, acepta the next part.
03) Do part of "Are We There, Yeti?": at Legacki 62.39 /target (junto a Posada), use Umi's Mechanical Yeti misión item to scare her.
04) In the Posada 61.39 acepta "The Everlook Report", "Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff" y (junto a you) "Sister Pamela".
05) Ve a Everlook's Bank 61.37 y put the following items into it:  10 Moontouched Feathers, Umi's Mechanical Yeti, Everlook Report, Studies in Spirit Speaking y (if you have it) Winterfall Ritual Totem.  The totem could have dropped by one de Winterfall furbolgs.  And get the following items out:  15 Blood Amber, 9 Un'Goro Ash, Flute of Xavaric, 5 Jadefire Felbind y Corrupt Moonwell Water.
06) Exit Everlook to your right y ve a the Hippogryph Master (norte of Everlook 62.37) to vuela a Talonbranch Glade, Felwood.
07) Ve norte to Felpaw Village y clear the enemigos alrededor de the Deadwood Cauldron at 60.6, or distract the enemigos some how (See Video), luego click en Cauldron to entrega "Falling to Corruption", acepta "Mystery Goo".
08) Ve a través de cueva NE entrance 65.7 to get to Winterspring y right afuera of la cueva, entrega "Winterfall Activity" (28.34 in Winterspring).
09) Sigue el camino principal sur to Donova Snowden 31.45 y entrega "Mystery Goo", acepta "Toxic Horrors".
10) Hearth (or go este) to get to Everlook.
11) Ve a the Hippogryph Master (62.37, #6 on map) to vuela a Ratchet, The Barrens.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[177] = {title = [[55 Felwood]], text = [[
01) At Ratchet, In Liv Rizzlefix's hut (62.39 in The Barrens), entrega "Volcanic Activity".
02) Ve up hacia el Posada y make Ratchet your new home 62.39.
03) Ve sur of Ratchet to The Tidus Stair (small Tauren camp 66.44) y entrega "Seeking Spiritual Aid".  Wait a minute, luego acepta "Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood".
04) Ve norte hacia el Flight Master 63.37 at Ratchet y vuela a Emerald Sanctuary, Felwood.
05) At Emerald Sanctuary entrega "Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood" 51.82, acepta "Dousing the Flames of Protection".
06) In the house 51.82, entrega "Flute of Xavaric", acepta "Felbound Ancients".  Also entrega "Further Corruption"
07) In the tent, entrega "Verifying the Corruption" 51.82.
08) Ve SE, y just off the main path, entrega "Cleansing Felwood" (54.87 in Felwood).  Luego click the NPC again y talk to her to get a Cenarion Beacon.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[178] = {title = [[Gnome/Dwarf - Dun Morogh]], text = [[
01) Ve norte to Jaedenar, y entra en Shadow Hold entrance 35.58, luego do "Dousing the Flames of Protection": click en 4 Braziers.  The cueva is relatively linear y if you keep following it you will see the 4 Braziers to click on.  The first one is al fondo de the ramp that enters la cueva 36.56.  Ve up a bit y you will see the 2nd one 36.55.  Keep moving in y you will corre into a big room that has the last two (37.53, 38.53).  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
02) 01b) Exit la cueva grinding backwards out of it.  Also if you found a Blood Red Key (in keyring), luego turn it in cerca de entrance of la cueva de the caged night elf 36.56.  Luego ve ahead y haz the escolta a "Rescue From Jaedenar" which leads back into la cueva y luego back out of it.
03) Vuelve sur to Emerald Sanctuary y entrega "Dousing the Flames of Protection" 51.82.  Acepta "A Final Blow" (this will be done later at nivel 58).  Also, junto a you, entrega (if you did it) "Rescue From Jaedenar", acepta "Retribution of the Light" (this would also be done later at nivel 58).
04) Ve sur y just hacia el este de main path, entrega "Salve via Hunting" 54.87.  NOTES:  If for some reason you do not have the 6 Corrupted Soul Shards, farmea on any mob in Felwood until you get them.  The misión is repeatable, but doesn't yield additional XP.  The reward item Cenarion Plant Salve is used to cleanse the various corrupted plants alrededor de Felwood y the reward you get de them is decent (but no XP).
05) Ve sur y farmea on Deadwood furblogs alrededor de 49.89 until you are able to hearth.
06) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ratchet .  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) Ve norte hacia el Flight Master 63.37 at Ratchet y vuela a Theramore, Dustwallow Marsh.
08) N/A
09) At Theramore, go SE en end de docks to get en boat to take you to Menethil Harbor 72.56.
10) At Menethil, ve a the Gryphon Master 9.60 y vuela a Ironforge, Dun Morogh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[179] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #24]], text = [[
01) At Ironforge, go oeste to The High Seat y acepta "The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan" 38.55.  Luego do it by talking hacia el NPC.  Turn it in y acepta the next part.
02) Ve oeste hacia el Posada y make Ironforge your new home de the Innkeeper 18.51.
03) Ve a the bank 35.62 y get the following items out:  current stack of Dark Iron Scraps, Black Dragonflight Molt, 6 Filled Cursed Ooze Jar, 6 Filled Tainted Ooze Jar y any cloth for cloth donations.  Put en bank:  Eridan's Vial, your Cenarion Beacon, any Cenarion Plant Salves y any Corrupted Soul Shards you may have.
04) You can entrega any cloth donation para Dwarf Faction norte de Mistina Steelshield 43.32.
05) N/A
06) GET NEW ABILITIES, 5b) Get your nivel 54 spells/abilities (if you haven't yet).
07) Ve este to Hall of Explorers (at The Library) y entrega "A Little Slime Goes a Long Way" 76.23.  Acepta the next part.
08) You can go sur to Tinker Town y entrega any cloth donations para Gnome faction de Bubulo Acerbus 74.48.
09) GET NEW ABILITIES, 7b) Get your nivel 54 spells/abilities (if you haven't yet).
10) Ve a the Bank (35.62, #3 on map) y put the following item into it:  Bag of Empty Ooze Containers.
11) Ve a the Gryphon Master 56.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Morgan's Vigil, Burning Steppes.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[180] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #25]], text = [[
01) 56 Burning Steppes
02) Next to you when you land at Morgan's Vigil 85.69, acepta "Extinguish the Firegut" y "FIFTY! YEP!".
03) Farmea your way norte to Flame Crest ramp entrance 64.28..
04) Ve up to Flame Crest y acepta "Broodling Essence" y "Tablet of the Seven" 65.24.
05) Entra en small cueva there y entrega "Yuka Screwspigot" 66.22, SKIP the next part (Dungeon).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
06) Ve a the este side of Burning Steppes (starting alrededor de 73.28, #8 on map) y work en following 4 pasos together:
07) Start working on "FIFTY! YEP!" by mata/looting any Worgs you see.  Don't make this a main priority now!
08) Start working on "Broodling Essence": usa el/la Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 misión item on Broodlings (dragon whelps), luego mata them y lootea the Broodling Essence crystal that drops.  Also throughout questing in Burning Steppes, mata any dragon whelps you see, they are squishy enemigos that die real fast.
09) N/A
10) If you have the Black Dragonflight Molt with you, work your way este hacia el small cueva 95.32 luego acepta y entrega "A Taste of Flame" (you will need to talk to him first after getting the misión), SKIP the next part (Dungeon misión).
11) At Dreadmaul Rock (en middle de este side of Burning Steppes) do "Extinguish the Firegut": mata the required amount of Firegut ogres.  Also finish "Broodling Essence": usa el/la Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 misión item on Broodlings (dragon whelps), luego mata them y lootea the Broodling Essence crystal that drops.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[181] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #26]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste to Ruins of Thaurissan (starting at 69.38) y haz "The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan": lootea the Thaurissan Relics (small stones).  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
02) Work oeste in Ruins of Thaurissan y haz "Tablet of the Seven": lootea the Tablet de Seven junto a dwarf statue 54.41.
03) Farmea your way norte to Flame Crest ramp entrance 64.29..
04) Ve up to Flame Crest y entrega "Broodling Essence" 65.24, acepta "Felnok Steelspring". And entrega "Tablet of the Seven".
05) At Flame Crest asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en de Yuka Screwspigot 66.22 en small cueva.
06) Farmea sur to Morgan's Vigil y entrega "Extinguish the Firegut" 85.69, acepta "Gor'tesh the Brute Lord".
07) Ve oeste to The Pillar of Ash (starting at 53.53) y finish "FIFTY! YEP!": mata y lootea a the Blackrock orcs.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
08) Work your way oeste in The Pillar of Ash y haz "Gor'tesh the Brute Lord": mata y lootea a Gor'tesh /target (ogre that patrols alrededor de the bunker entrance 39.55).
09) Farmea back este to Morgan's Vigil y entrega "Gor'tesh the Brute Lord" (85.69, #6 on map), acepta "Ogre Head On A Stick = Party".  Also entrega "FIFTY! YEP!".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  If you have any Blackrock Medallions left over after turning in "FIFTY! YEP!", they can be destroyed.
10) Ve up hasta lo alto de Dreadmaul Rock (bridge entrada en 76.38)..
11) Once en top do "Ogre Head On A Stick = Party": junto a bonfire, click en Soft Dirt Mound 81.47.
12) While at Dreadmaul Rock, make sure you recoge a total of 30 Dark Iron Scraps, this will be used for a later misión.  All the Ogres in Burning Steppes can drop them.
13) N/A
14) Vuelve sur to Morgan's Vigil y entrega "Ogre Head On A Stick = Party" (85.69, #6 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[182] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 85.68.  NOTE: Steps 1 - 16 are taken out for WoTLK due hacia el Onyxia key misión chain was taken out for it!
02) [TBC/SOM] 16a) Ve a the Gryphon Master 84.68 at Morgan's Vigil y vuela a Booty Bay, STV.
03) [TBC/SOM] 16b) At Booty Bay, STV entra en Posada y entrega "Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog".
04) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ironforge.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[183] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #28]], text = [[
01) At Ironforge, ve a the bank 35.61 y get the following item out:  Everlook Report..  Put the following items en bank:  stack of 30+ Dark Iron Scraps y Tinkee's Letter.
02) If you have not accepted "The New Frontier" y "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!" de Stormwind previously, luego find Courier Hammerfall /target (he patrols alrededor de Ironforge, See Map) y acepta these misiones de him.  As you work en following pasos you might corre into him, but make sure these are accepted before flying out of Ironforge:
03) You can entrega any cloth donation para Dwarf faction de Mistina Steelshield 43.32 y cloth donations para Gnome faction de Bubulo Acerbus 74.48.
04) Ve a The High Seat y entrega "The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan" 38.55.
05) If you turned nivel 56 luego get new spells/abilities for your class.
06) Make sure "The New Frontier" y "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!" are accepted de Courier Hammerfall /target (he patrols alrededor de Ironforge, (#2 on map), luego ve a the Gryphon Master 56.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Southshore, Hillsbrad.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[184] = {title = [[56 Western Plaguelands]], text = [[
01) At Southshore, go NE (follow path to take on map) to get to Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands...
02) At Chillwind Camp, right as you get there y junto a shack/torn down house, acepta "A Plague Upon Thee" (43.85 in Western Plaguelands).
03) Behind the shack, get the Flight Path de the Gryphon Master she patrols a bit alrededor de 43.85.
04) TBC, 3a) De the male Draenei 43.84 acepta "The Mark of the Lightbringer".
05) De the bald human male by the tent, entrega "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!" 43.84, acepta "Clear the Way".
06) Frente a other tent, de The Argent Dawn female human 43.84, entrega "The Everlook Report".  Also completa "Argent Dawn Commission".  NOTE:  The trinket received called Argent Dawn Commission will allow you to recoge Scourgestones de undead enemigos en Plaguelands (both eastern y western).  Right-click it in your inventory to wear it.  As long as you have it on, this will allow you to increase your rep with The Argent Dawn, which will allow you to compra items such as Enriched Manna Biscuits later.
07) Ve este to Sorrow Hill alrededor de 48.81 y haz "Clear the Way": mata 10 Skeletal Flayers y 10 Slavering Ghouls.
08) Vuelve oeste to Chillwind Camp y de the bald human male by the tent (43.84, #2 on map), entrega "Clear the Way".  Acepta "All Along the Watchtowers" y "The Scourge Cauldrons".
09) Next to you by the carreta 43.85, entrega "The Scourge Cauldrons", acepta "Target: Felstone Field".
10) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied /target 43.84.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[185] = {title = [[GROUP IF YOU CAN The rest de entire 56-56 WPL section is soloable but is probably the hardest section to do en entire guide y I recommend seeing if you can group with someone to do the rest of this section, if not you should be able to solo it, some sections will be a bit rough.  Proceed with caution]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal NW to get into Ruins of Andorhal y haz part of "All Along the Watchtowers": usa el/la Beacon Torch misión item at Tower One 40.72.  NOTE: You must usa el/la torch item right en doorway of these towers in order for it to work, don't waste your charges!
02) Ve norte y entra en the Andorhal Posada entrance 40.68, go upstairs y acepta "A Matter of Time" 39.67.
03) Ve NE y haz part of "All Along the Watchtowers": usa el/la Beacon Torch misión item at Tower Two 42.66.
04) Ve NE y haz the last part of "All Along the Watchtowers": usa el/la Beacon Torch misión item at Tower Three 44.63.
05) Ve este a bit y haz "A Matter of Time": usa el/la Temporal Displacer misión item cerca de silos alrededor de 47.63 luego mata the Temporal Parasites that spawn.  NOTE:  The misión item only works en silos emitting blue beams of light.
06) Ve sur y haz part of "All Along the Watchtowers": usa el/la Beacon Torch misión item at Tower Four 47.71.
07) Ve NW y entra en the Andorhal Posada (entrance 40.68, #2 on map), go upstairs y entrega "A Matter of Time".  Acepta "Counting Out Time".
08) All alrededor de Ruins of Andorhal do "Counting Out Time": lootea the Small Lockboxes all alrededor de the broken down houses.  There is usually one at each broken down house.
09) Entra en the Andorhal Posada (entrance 40.68, #2 on map), go upstairs y entrega "Counting Out Time".  NOTES:  This misión is repeatable, but you will not get additional XP de it.  The misión reward Attuned Dampener can only be used on Araj the Summoner en middle of Andorhal, y there will be misiones later associated with killing him.
10) Cauldron Quest Chain Info:  You need to mata the Cauldron Lord at each targeted granja field (listed below), grab their key y use it en big cauldron en middle of la granja fields.  You will be going back y forth de Chillwind Camp hacia el next field.  As you entra en each field, the Cauldron Lords spawns cerca de Scourge Cauldron en middle of each field, if the Cauldron Lord is not there, sal de the field y come back.
11) At Felstone Field, do "Target: Felstone Field": mata y lootea a Cauldron Lord Bilemaw /target 37.57.  Luego click en Scourge Cauldron 37.57 to entrega "Target: Felstone Field", acepta "Return to Chillwind Camp".
12) Norte in Felstone Field, go up en house y acepta "Better Late Than Never" 38.54.
13) Entra en barn junto a house y click on Janice's Parcel 39.55 to entrega "Better Late Than Never".  Luego click Janice's Parcel again to acepta the next part of "Better Late Than Never".
14) Make sure you are at least 10,000 XP away de 56 (if you aren't yet).  Keep grinding on any undead enemigos to increase rep with The Argent Dawn until you are.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[186] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ironforge.
02) At Ironforge, ve a the Bank 35.61 y get the following items out:  First Relic Fragment, Second Relic Fragment, Third Relic Fragment, Fourth Relic Fragment, Studies in Spirit Speaking, (if you can) Nada Speed Potion, (if you have them) 30+ Dark Iron Scraps y 30+ Savage Fronds.  There is a misión in Eastern Plaguelands that wants these items:  2 Thorium Bar, Golden Rod, 8 Hi-Explosive Bomb, 8 Unstable Trigger (get these out, either de the AH or bank if you can get all of them).  You can luego mail these items (including the 30+ Dark Iron Scraps y 30+ Savage Fronds) to yourself y retrieve them de the mailbox at Light's Hope in EPL):
03) Also, put en bank:  Attuned Dampener.
04) Ve a the Gryphon Master 55.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Stormwind, Elwynn.
05) At the side entrance de Cathedral Square, go up en City Hall building y entrega "Better Late Than Never" 57.48, acepta "Good Natured Emma".
06) Find Ol' Emma /target, she patrols alrededor de the northern part of The Trade District.  She patrols de up en house at 60.57 to 67.72.  De her, entrega "Good Natured Emma", acepta "Good Luck Charm".
07) Ve NE to Stormwind Keep y acepta "The First and the Last" 80.38.
08) GET NEW ABILITIES, 7b) You should be nivel 56 now.  Get new lvl 56 spells/abilities if you haven't yet.
09) Ve sur to Old Town y up in SI:7, entrega "The First and the Last" 78.71, acepta y entrega "Honor the Dead", luego acepta "Flint Shadowmore".
10) Hearth if you can, luego vuela a Chillwind Camp, WPL. If you can't hearth luego just ve a the Gryphon Master 71.73 y vuela a Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands.
11) When you land at Chillwind Camp, junto a you by the carreta, entrega "Return to Chillwind Camp" 43.85, acepta "Target: Dalson's Tears".
12) De the bald human male by the tent 43.84, entrega "All Along the Watchtowers".  Acepta "Scholomance".  You can luego destroy the Beacon Torch item.
13) Next to you, entrega "Scholomance" 43.84, acepta "Skeletal Fragments".  NOTE:  "Skeletal Fragments" misión involves mata/looting skeleton type enemigos alrededor de Ruins of Andorhal, Felstone Field y Dalson's Tears.  Start working on this misión as you continue working on other WPL misiones:
14) Frente a torn down house, entrega "Flint Shadowmore" 44.85, acepta "The Eastern Plagues".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[187] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #32]], text = [[
01) Ve norte to Felstone Field y up en house, entrega "Good Luck Charm" 38.54, acepta "Two Halves Become One".
02) Ve sur in Felstone Field y haz "Two Halves Become One": mata y lootea a the Jabbering Ghoul /target (only one mob spawn that patrols alrededor de la granja).  This mob drops Good Luck Other-Half-Charm.  Right-click this item in your inventory.
03) Vuelve up en house at Felstone Field y entrega "Two Halves Become One" (38.54, #1 on map).
04) Ve este to Dalson's Tears granja y haz "Target: Dalson's Tears": mata y lootea a Cauldron Lord Malvinious /target 46.52.  Luego click en Scourge Cauldron to entrega "Target: Dalson's Tears", acepta "Return to Chillwind Camp".
05) There is a small misión chain here at this granja that yields good XP:  Entra en Barn at Dalson's Tears y click on Mrs. Dalson's Diary laying en ground 48.51 to completa "Mrs. Dalson's Diary".
06) Next, find y mata y lootea a the Wandering Skeleton /target.  This one skeleton wanders alrededor de the NE side of Dalson's Tears.  He circles alrededor de the barn también.
07) Click en Outhouse 48.50 detrás de barn to completa "Locked Away".  Luego Farmer Dalson will spawn junto a Outhouse, mata y lootea a this zombie.
08) Ve up en house (junto a barn) y click en Locked Cabinet 47.50 to entrega "Locked Away".
09) Vuelve sur to Chillwind Camp y entrega "Return to Chillwind Camp" 43.85, acepta "Target: Writhing Haunt".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
10) Ve NE to The Writhing Haunt y haz "Target: Writhing Haunt": mata y lootea a Cauldron Lord Razarch /target 53.66.  Luego click en Scourge Cauldron to entrega "Target: Writhing Haunt", acepta "Return to Chillwind Camp".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[188] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #33]], text = [[
01) Vuelve a Chillwind Camp y entrega "Return to Chillwind Camp" 43.84, acepta "Target: Gahrron's Withering".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) De the The Argent Dawn female human 43.84 by the tent, entrega any Scourgestones you may have to increase your rep with The Argent Dawn.   Also, it's important to make sure you save at least one Argent Dawn Valor Token for a later misión.
03) Ve NE to Gahrron's Withering y haz "Target: Gahrron's Withering": mata y lootea a Cauldron Lord Soulwrath /target 63.59.  Luego click en Scourge Cauldron to entrega "Target: Gahrron's Withering", acepta "Return to Chillwind Camp".
04) Make sure "Skeletal Fragments" is finished:  mata y lootea a skeleton type enemigos.  You can find a large amount at Ruins of Andorhal (starting at 49.67).
05) Vuelve a Chillwind Camp (#1 on map) y entrega "Skeletal Fragments" 43.84, SKIP "Mold Rhymes With...".
06) At the carreta, entrega "Return to Chillwind Camp" 43.85.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  You can also entrega Scourgestones to increase rep with The Argent Dawn, but it's important to make sure you save at least one Argent Dawn Valor Token for a later misión.
07) De the bald human male by the tent 43.84, completa "Mission Accomplished!".
08) If for some reason you are already friendly with The Argent Dawn, luego stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits junto a you de Argent Quartermaster Lightspark (gnome 43.84).  These biscuits will help you nivel faster by receiving mana faster de consuming these biscuits.
09) Ve este into Eastern Plaguelands (follow path on map)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[189] = {title = [[57 Eastern Plaguelands]], text = [[
01) Ve norte along Thondoril River to Tiron Fordring 5.38 y acepta "Demon Dogs", "Blood Tinged Skies" y "Carrion Grubbage".
02) Farmea SE to The Marris Stead y haz "The Eastern Plagues": lootea the 3 skeleton remains.  First one to lootea is Mangled Human Remains [Turyen] (up on a hill 25.68).  See next pasos para other two:
03) Ve oeste a bit (watch out para elites) y lootea the Mangled Human Remains [Fredo] (up on a hill 24.68).  Getting this also gets The Blightcaller Uncovered también.
04) Sur a bit click on Mangled Human Remains [Rutger] (just norte of la carretera 25.73).
05) Ve sur to The Undercroft y down en crypt, de the Torn Scroll laying en ground, acepta "Hameya's Plea" 24.78.
06) Farmea este to Darrowshire (mata y lootea a every mob you see por el camino) to Pamela Redpath y entrega "Sister Pamela" 32.84, acepta "Pamela's Doll".
07) At Darrowshire do "Pamela's Doll": find the 3 parts to Pamela's Doll:  the head, the left side y right side.  These parts have multiple spawn locations alrededor de Darrowshire in each de 3 buildings en area (excluding the building where Pamela is at).  They look like little yellow things.  Search the buildings para 3 parts: big house 34.85, torn down house 35.85, small house 35.83, luego click one of them to combine them to make Pamela's Doll.  (See Video)
08) Vuelve a Pamela Redpath at Darrowshire y entrega "Pamela's Doll" ( 32.84, #6 on map).  Acepta "Auntie Marlene" y "Uncle Carlin".
09) Around southern EPL alrededor de 36.76, finish "Blood Tinged Skies": mata 30 Plaguebats.  Also do part of "Demon Dogs": mata 20 Plaguehound Runts.  And start working on "Carrion Grubbage": mata y lootea a Carrion enemigos para worm meat.  All of these enemigos are found in southern Eastern Plaguelands y the Carrion worm enemigos are all over Eastern Plaguelands.  Once you are nearing completion, work your way este hacia el next paso:
10) Farmea to Light's Hope Chapel 74.58 y acepta "The Restless Souls" y "Zaeldarr the Outcast".  Get resupplied here.
11) Ve norte a bit y entrega "Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff" 76.54.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[190] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #35]], text = [[
01) Next to you, entrega "Uncle Carlin" 76.54, acepta "Defenders of Darrowshire".
02) Next to you de the Gryphon Master 76.53 get the Flight Path.
03) Get repaired de Craftsman Wilhelm 75.54 junto a Forge.
04) Right frente a Posada's Entrance, ve a Rayne y if you have 30 Savage Fronds acepta y entrega "Savage Fronds" 75.53.  NOTE:  This y all 30 item entrega misiones here at Light's Hope requires you to be friendly with The Argent Dawn.  If you are not friendly yet, ignore these for now y you will be able to turn these in a bit later once you are.
05) Entra en Posada y en back de the human with black hair 76.52, acepta y entrega "Binding the Dreadnaught" (requires the 30 Dark Iron Scraps).
06) If you have all 30 Bone Fragments, luego you can acepta y entrega "Bonescythe Digs" 76.53 (if not you can have more opportunities later).
07) If you were able to obtain the items needed for "That's Asking A Lot", luego turn it in (en dwarf by the Campfire, 75.52 ), acepta "When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent".
08) Next to you en human en horse y with your one Argent Dawn Valor Token you saved earlier, acepta y entrega "They Call Me "The Rooster" 75.52.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[191] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #36]], text = [[
01) Do part of "Demon Dogs": mata 5 Plaguehounds /target.  These evil dogs are found en middle-eastern side of Eastern Plaguelands alrededor de 66.50.
02) Ve NE a bit alrededor de 61.35 y start working on "Defenders of Darrowshire": mata any Gibbering Ghouls or Diseased Flayers y luego talk hacia el spirit that spawns.  If the area is cleared, you can continue on y revisit this place later:
03) Farmea norte to Zul'Mashar (ramp entrada en 59.19)..
04) Ve up into Zul'Mashar y haz "Hameya's Plea": mata y lootea a Infiltrator Hameya /target.  This lvl 60 troll patrols alrededor de frente a temple alrededor de 64.13.
05) Finish up "Carrion Grubbage" y "Demon Dogs": mata y lootea a Carrion enemigos para worm meat y mata 5 Frenzied Plaguehounds.  These enemigos are found NE alrededor de the open fields of Eastern Plaguelands alrededor de 52.26.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
06) Ve norte (just below Quel'Lithien Lodge) y entrega "Troubled Spirits of Kel'Theril" 49.18 , acepta "Fragments of the Past".
07) Ve oeste to Plaguewood (starting at 41.29 ) y haz the following 3 misiones together:
08) "A Plague Upon Thee": lootea the Large Termite Mounds, these are spaced all alrededor de Plaguewood (see map).
09) "Defenders of Darrowshire": continue working on this by killing Cannibal Ghouls y talk hacia el spirits that spawn.  You will have more opportunities later to finish this.
10) If you have it do "When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent": entra en various ziggurat buildings alrededor de Plaguewood y use Smokey's Special Compound misión item dentro de buildings.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[192] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #37]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste to Terrordale y en hut entrega "The Restless Souls" 11.29 , SKIP the next part (dungeon).  And junto a you, acepta "Augustus' Receipt Book".
02) Do "Augustus' Receipt Book": go NE a bit hacia el Terrordale Posada (the largest building en area entrance 14.28 ) y go up en Posada, make a right y between two split open barriles lootea Augustus' Receipt Book 14.26 en ground.  NOTE:  Mata y lootea a all Crypt Fiends you see to start obtaining Crypt Fiend Parts (used for a later misión).
03) Vuelve a the hut in Terrordale y entrega "Augustus' Receipt Book" ( 11.29 , #1 on map).  NOTE:  You can now get resupplied de this NPC.
04) Farmea on Crypt Fiend enemigos all alrededor de Terrordale to potentially recoge 30 Crypt Fiend Parts.  This can be used for a later misión.  There is more en next paso también (but watch out para Elite):
05) Ve a través de long cueva entrance 12.25.  NOTES:  This cueva journey is not easy.  There is a lvl 60 elite spider /target (with a 1 hour respawn) that patrols back y forth hacia el 2 entrances of this cueva.  Try to sneak past it if you can.  If this cueva is too hard for you, luego another possible quick alternative is to take the Tower Gryphon ride de the Plaguewood Tower 19.27 hacia el Crown Guard Tower, as long as the Alliance has control over the towers that is.  Try to get all 30 Crypt Fiend Parts before leaving this area.  If you are still far off de that, luego you can skip getting the remaining ones.
06) Once you get out hacia el other side of la cueva (or take la torre ride), norte along Thondoril River at Tiron Fordring 5.38 , entrega "Demon Dogs" "Blood Tinged Skies" y "Carrion Grubbage".  Acepta "Redemption".  Simply talk to Tiron Fordring to completa "Redemption", acepta "Of Forgotten Memories".
07) Ve sur to The Undercroft, go down en crypt y luego do "Zaeldarr the Outcast": mata y lootea a Zaeldarr the Outcast 24.78.  (See Video)
08) Behind the crypt, junto a wooden carreta, click en Mound of Dirt to entrega "Hameya's Plea" 24.79.
09) Next to you, do "Of Forgotten Memories": click en Loose Dirt Mound 25.80 that is junto a Tirion Fordring's Grave, luego mata y lootea a Mercutio Filthgorger (he has 3 bodyguards).  IMPORTANT TIP:  These enemigos spawn between the two dirt mounds (de the previous paso).  Mercutio Filthgorger spawns in first, luego his bodyguards soon after.  So act fast y immediately pull Mercutio Filthgorger away de his spawn point to avoid fighting his guardias too, as this fight can be really tough to do solo without this tactic.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[193] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #38]], text = [[
01) Ve NW to Tiron Fordring, 5.38 y entrega "Of Forgotten Memories", acepta "Of Lost Honor".
02) Ve a the sur side of Light's Hope Chapel (farmea on all enemigos por el camino), luego entrega "Zaeldarr the Outcast" 74.58.
03) Ve norte in Light's Hope Chapel y entrega (if it's finished) "Defenders of Darrowshire" 76.54.
04) Next to you at Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff 76.54, entrega any Scourgestones you have.
05) Get resupplied/repaired de Craftsman Wilhelm 75.54 junto a Forge.  NOTE:  If for some reason you are already Friendly with The Argent Dawn, luego stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits de the female dwarf Miranda Breechlock 76.54 by the tent.
06) Entra en Posada y with your 30 Crypt Fiend Parts, acepta y entrega "Cryptstalker Armor Doesn't Make Itself..." 76.53.
07) If you have all 30 Bone Fragments, luego you can acepta y entrega (if you haven't yet) "Bonescythe Digs" 76.53 (if not you can have another opportunity later).
08) Ve norte a bit more in Light's Hope Chapel y entrega (if you did it) "When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent" 75.52.  If you turned this in, you can luego destroy Smokey's Special Compound.
09) Phase6, 8b) If you still need to:  Next to you en human en horse y with your Argent Dawn Valor Token, acepta y entrega "They Call Me "The Rooster" 75.52.
10) Go NE a bit around 61.35 and finish (if you still need to) "Defenders of Darrowshire": kill any Gibbering Ghouls or Diseased Flayers and then talk to the spirit that spawns.
11) Go north to Northdale and do "Of Lost Honor": loot the Symbol of Lost Honor (under the lake 66.29).
12) IF YOU STILL NEED TO: Go SE to Light's Hope Chapel and turn in "Defenders of Darrowshire" (#3 on map) 76.54.
13) Grind all the way back west to Tiron Fordring, ( 5.38, #1 on map) and turn in "Of Lost Honor", accept "Of Love y Family".
14) Go down south at the island of Caer Darrow 66.75 in WPL (use a Swim Speed Potion if you have one) and turn in "Of Love y Family".  SKIP the next part (Dungeon).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[194] = {title = [[58 Western Plaguelands]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste to Sorrow Hill y en house entrega "Auntie Marlene" 49.79, acepta "A Strange Historian".  NOTE: She could be upstairs también.
02) Do "A Strange Historian": junto a house your at, lootea Joseph Redpath's Monument en graveyard 50.77.  (See Video)
03) Ve oeste to Chillwind Camp y frente a torn down house, entrega "The Eastern Plagues" 44.85, acepta "The Blightcaller Cometh".
04) Next to you en shack, entrega "A Plague Upon Thee" 43.85, acepta the next part.
05) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 43.84.  NOTE:  If you have any remaining Plagueland Termites in your inventory, you can destroy them.
06) Entra en Ruins of Andorhal en oeste side y go upstairs en Andorhal Posada entrance 40.68 y entrega "A Strange Historian", acepta "The Annals of Darrowshire".
07) Entra en the City Hall building en middle of Andorhal entrance 44.69 y haz "The Annals of Darrowshire": lootea the Annals of Darrowshire (blue book).  The actual Annals of Darrowshire book looks different de the others, it has a lighter tint en top portion de pages en book, unlike the rest which has a darker tint en top portion de pages. (See Video)
08) Vuelve oeste hacia el Andorhal Posada entrance 40.68 y entrega "The Annals of Darrowshire" (#6 on map).  Acepta "Brother Carlin".
09) Ve este to The Writhing Haunt y en small house acepta "The Wildlife Suffers Too" 54.65.
10) Work your way norte (hacia el next paso) while starting on "The Wildlife Suffers Too": mata Diseased Wolves /target:
11) Ve norte to Northridge Lumber Camp y haz "A Plague Upon Thee": clear the enemigos en lumber camp, click en Northridge Lumber Mill Crate 48.32 to place the termite barrel.  Luego click en spawned Termite Barrel on top de crate to entrega "A Plague Upon Thee", acepta the next part.  (See Video)
12) Baja por long slope in Northridge Lumber Camp y acepta "Unfinished Business" 52.28.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[195] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #40]], text = [[
01) Ve sur a bit y haz "Unfinished Business": mata the needed Scarlet human enemigos en area.  The mages y knights (are alrededor de 50.41).  NOTE: They share spawns with each other.  See next paso para medics y hunters:
02) Ve sur a bit hacia el small Scarlet camp y mata the needed medics y hunters alrededor de 52.44.
03) Vuelve up NE in Northridge Lumber Camp, down the long slope y entrega "Unfinished Business" 52.28, acepta the next part.
04) Ve este a bit y haz "Unfinished Business": mata Huntsman Radley /target 58.36.  See next paso para other named mob to mata:
05) Mata Cavalier Durgen /target.  He patrols alrededor de in la torre 55.24.   Also go up this tower y haz "The Mark of the Lightbringer" by looting the Holy Coffer.
06) Vuelve down in Northridge Lumber Camp y entrega "Unfinished Business" (52.28, #3 on map), acepta the next part.
07) Ve norte to Hearthglen y haz the last part of "Unfinished Business": go hasta lo alto de the watchtower 46.18 to completa the misión.  Just mount up y avoid the enemigos.  Having a healing potion on hand helps.  (Watch This Video to see a shortcut y how to do this misión).
08) Vuelve down in Northridge Lumber Camp y entrega "Unfinished Business" (52.28, #3 on map).
09) Make sure "The Wildlife Suffers Too" is finished: mata 8 Diseased Wolves /target.  These wolves are found mostly above Dalson's Tears granja alrededor de 47.45.  They share spawns con spiders en area, so mata them if not enough wolves.  Work your way hacia el next paso:
10) Ve sur hacia el small house at The Writhing Haunt y entrega "The Wildlife Suffers Too" 54.65, acepta the next part.
11) Do "The Wildlife Suffers Too" (part 2): mata 8 Diseased Grizzly /target.  These bears are found norte y este of The Writhing Haunt.  They share spawns con spiders, so mata spiders if not enough bears.
12) Vuelve a the small house at The Writhing Haunt y entrega "The Wildlife Suffers Too" (54.65, #10 on map).  Acepta "Glyphed Oaken Branch".
13) At this point make sure you have at least 30 Bone Fragments (if you still need to entrega The Argent Dawn EPL misión).  You can granja this item at Ruins of Andorhal (starting at 49.67 ).
14) Ve a Chillwind Camp y frente a shack, entrega "A Plague Upon Thee" 43.85.
15) Also entrega "The Mark of the Lightbringer" 43.84, acepta "Tomb of the Lightbringer". NOTES:  Accepting this starts an escolta a, which we will do on next paso:  Also if this male Draenei is not there, it means someone else is currently doing the escolta a, if so just skip it luego, or consider doing it later.
16) Do "Tomb of the Lightbringer": escolta a the misión giver to Uther's Tomb 52.83 to completa it.
17) Ve a Chillwind Camp y entrega "Tomb of the Lightbringer" 43.84.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[196] = {title = [[Human - Elwynn Forest]], text = [[
01) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  You can stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits de the gnome 43.84 (I get about 300 biscuits).
02) You should be nivel 58 by now, if not, farmea on any enemigos until you are.
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ironforge.
04) At Ironforge, ve a the Bank 35.61 y put the following items en bank:  Extended Annals of Darrowshire, any remaining Crypt Fiend Parts, Bone Fragments, Savage Fronds, Dark Iron Scraps, any Insignias y any Scourgestones you may have.  Get the following items out:  Eridan's Vial y 10 Moontouched Feathers.
05) Get your nivel 58 spells/abilities for your class.
06) Near the Gryphon Master acepta "Taking Back Silithus" 59.47.
07) Ve a the Gryphon Master 55.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Stormwind, Elwynn.
08) At Stormwind, go NE to Stormwind Keep y entrega "The Blightcaller Cometh" 80.38, acepta "Order Must Be Restored".  NOTE:  "Order Must Be Restored" can be kept in your misión book until you want to do this in EPL with a raid, but my guide will not cover it.
09) Ve a the docks y take the southern boat 22.56to take you to Auberdine.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[197] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) At Auberdine, en small dock junto a Posada, ve a the Hippogryph Master 36.46and vuela a Rut'theran Village, Teldrassil.
02) At Rut'theran Village, entra en house y entrega "Moontouched Wildkin" 55.92, acepta "Find Ranshalla".
03) Sube por path a través de red portal 56.89 to get to Darnassus.
04) At Darnassus, go norte to Cenarion Enclave y en middle nivel de tree tower 35.8, entrega "Glyphed Oaken Branch".
05) Ve hasta lo alto de the tree tower y entrega "The New Frontier", acepta the next part.
06) Ve down hacia el middle nivel de tree tower y entrega "The New Frontier" 35.8, acepta "Rabine Saturna".
07) Ve sur to Temple de Moon y en water fuente en middle 39.85 do "Felbound Ancients": usa el/la Eridan's Vial misión item en waterfall.
08) Ve up in Temple de Moon (en este side) y de Gracina Spiritmight /target acepta (no exclamation mark) "March of the Silithid" 42.86.
09) Any cloth donations are turned in at 64.23 para Night Elf faction.
10) Exit Darnassus by going a través de red portal 29.41.
11) On the docks, ve a the Hippogryph Master 58.94 y vuela a Moonglade.
12) Once in Moonglade, ve a Nighthaven y entrega "Rabine Saturna" 52.45, acepta "Wasteland".  Also acepta "A Reliquary of Purity". NOTE:  In order to acepta the purity misión, you need to have been en Dire Maul zone in Feralas before talking to Rabine Saturna in order to unlock the dialog option (which you also need to read) in order to get this misión.  If you can't get it, you can just skip it y ignore any future notations of it.
13) Ve sur (just este de small lake) hacia el Hippogryph Master 48.67 y vuela a Talonbranch Glade, Felwood.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[198] = {title = [[58 Felwood / Azshara]], text = [[
01) Ve SW to Irontree Woods (alrededor de 50.23 in Felwood) y haz "Toxic Horrors": mata y lootea a Toxic Horrors (green water elementals).
02) Ve sur to Jaedenar y entra en Shadow Hold, entrance 35.58 .  Keep going a través de cueva luego do (if you have it) "Retribution of the Light" by killing Rakaiah 38.51, luego turn it in en slab next you in that room, acepta the next part.  Luego do "A Final Blow": keep going a través de cueva (it is relatively linear), luego mata y lootea a Shadow Lord Fel'dan /target y his two succubus minions (in la cueva at 39.47).  Luego exit la cueva going backwards.
03) Ve sur to Emerald Sanctuary y entrega "A Final Blow" 51.82.  And entrega (if you have it) The Remains of Trey Lightforge.
04) In the small house, entrega "Felbound Ancients" 51.82.  Acepta "Purified!".  Wait a few seconds, luego entrega "Purified!".  NOTE:  Hold onto the item received Flute de Ancients.  It involves an escolta a misión that can be done later (but my guide wont cover it).  You can do that escolta a if you corre out of misiones to do en very end de guide.  There is also a trick you can do con flute, as it spawns in extra Toxic Horrors during the escolta a which can be used to help you granja a valuable item.
05) Ve sur into Ashenvale, make a right off the main path y die on purpose (alrededor de 55.34 in Ashenvale).  Res at spirit.
06) NW in Astranaar, ve a the Hippogryph Master 34.48 y vuela a Talrendis Point, Azshara.
07) Ve este dentro de Temple of Zin-Malor y down below lootea the Sacred Highborne Writings (light green book en ground 42.53).
08) Ve oeste to Talrendis Point y you can get repaired/resupplied de the Bowyer 12.78.
09) Ve a the Hippogryph Master 12.78 at Talrendis Point y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[199] = {title = [[58 Tanaris / Un'Goro]], text = [[
01) SE in Gadgetzan, ve a the Bank 52.29 y get the following items out:  Bag of Empty Ooze Containers, Umi's Mechanical Yeti y your stack of Core of Elements.  Put the following items en bank:  3 Toxic Horror Droplet y Sacred Highborne Writings.
02) NW in Gadgetzan, do part of "Are We There, Yeti?": use Umi's Mechanical Yeti misión item to scare Sprinkle /target 51.27.
03) In the hut junto a you, entrega "March of the Silithid" 51.27, acepta "Bungle in the Jungle".
04) Ve SW into Un'Goro Crater (entrance 27.54 in Tanaris).
05) At Un'Goro Crater, go oeste to The Slithering Scar alrededor de 50.81 y haz "Bungle in the Jungle": keep mata/looting the Gorishi enemigos (bugs) until you get the Gorishi Scent Gland (can drop de any of them, but has a low drop rate) y also 5 Un'Goro Soil.  These bugs can be found in y afuera of la cueva.  You can find more soil de the slimes en next paso.
06) Do "A Little Slime Goes a Long Way".  First lootea your Bag of Empty Ooze Containers, luego usa el/la Empty Pure Sample Jar misión item en corpses of slimes through out Un'Goro Crater (any slimes will do).  Work your way hacia el next paso:
07) Ve norte to Marshal's Refuge y haz the last part of "Are We There, Yeti?": usa el/la Umi's Mechanical Yeti misión item to scare Quixxil /target 44.9.
08) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 43.8.  Remember to not sell your Un'Goro Soils!
09) Ve oeste to entra en Silithus (entrance 29.22 in Un'Goro Crater)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[200] = {title = [[59 Silithus]], text = [[
01) As you entra en Silithus ve a the small camp on your left (Valor's Rest) y entrega "Wasteland" 82.19, acepta "The Spirits of Southwind".
02) Sigue el camino principal oeste to Cenarion Hold y entrega "Taking Back Silithus" 51.38, acepta "Securing the Supply Lines".
03) Next to you en Wanted Poster: Deathclasp 51.38, acepta "Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands" (Elite).
04) Ve up en Posada junto a you y acepta "Deadly Desert Venom" 52.39.
05) Ve up in Cenarion Hold y acepta "The Twilight Mystery" 50.37.
06) Behind the moonwell, acepta "Secret Communication" 49.38.  And IF YOU ARE LVL 60 acepta: "Abyssal Contacts", y (junto a you) "Twilight Geolords".
07) Entra en building junto a you y acepta "Dearest Natalia" 49.34.
08) Exit the building y make a left to sube por dirt ramp y acepta "Report to Marshal Bluewall" 51.35.
09) At the Hippogryph Master 51.34 in Cenarion Hold get the FP.
10) Ve sur to Southwind Village alrededor de 62.52 y haz "The Spirits of Southwind" along with "A Reliquary of Purity": mata 8 Tortured Druids y 8 Tortured Sentinels alrededor de the village y work your way up en village into the building y lootea the Dusty Reliquary 63.55.
11) Farmea/lootea all enemigos as you go NE to Valor's Rest y entrega "The Spirits of Southwind" (82.19, #1 on map), acepta "Hive in the Tower".
12) Farmea back down SW to Southwind Village y haz "Hive in the Tower": go hasta lo alto de the swarming bug tower 60.53 y click en Hive'Ashi Pod, luego mata y lootea a the Hive'Ashi Ambushers until you get the Encrusted Silithid Object.  Also while doing Southwind Village misiones you should find an item (which drops de the bugs), which starts "Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter", acepta it.  And keep grinding until you get it.
13) Ve NE to Valor's Rest y entrega "Hive in the Tower" (82.19, #1 on map), acepta "Umber, Archivist".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[201] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #46]], text = [[
01) Ve a the small camp above Staghelm Point alrededor de 66.21 y haz "Secret Communication": mata y lootea a the Twilight enemigos.  NOTE:  IF YOU ARE LVL 60 the misión "Abyssal Contacts" can be done here y multiple times later in this zone but my guide will not cover it or the follow ups, but its worth doing.  And keep the next paso in mind:
02) All alrededor de NE Silithus do "Deadly Desert Venom" along with "Securing the Supply Lines": mata y lootea a Stonelash Scorpids (scorpids), mata y lootea a Sand Skitterers (spiders), y mata Dredge Strikers (snakes).
03) Ve a Cenarion Hold y entrega "Securing the Supply Lines" 51.38, acepta "Stepping Up Security".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) Ve up en Posada junto a you y entrega "Deadly Desert Venom" 52.39.  Acepta "Noggle's Last Hope".
05) Ve up in Cenarion Hold y detrás de moonwell, entrega "Secret Communication" 49.38.  NOTE:  The repeatable misión "Encrypted Twilight Texts" does not yield XP, only rep con Cenarion Circle.  But save your additional Encryped Twilight Texts for a future misión.
06) Ve a the NW end of Silithus alrededor de 27.15 y haz "The Twilight Mystery": lootea the tablets en ground.  And farmea on Dust Stormers & Whirling Invaders (wind elementals) until you get a total of 30 Core of Elements (used for a later misión), however if you are far off de the 30, you can optionally skip this.
07) All alrededor de the middle of Silithus do "Stepping Up Security": mata 20 Dredge Crushers.  Also do part of "Noggle's Last Hope": mata y lootea a Stonelash Pincers.  Work your way hacia el next paso:
08) Sur en small Alliance camp, entrega "Report to Marshal Bluewall" 33.51, acepta "Scouring the Desert".  NOTE:  For "Scouring the Desert", keep an eye out for a Silithyst Geyser which looks like a glowing red thing all alrededor de Silithuis, click on it y you will get a buff, maintain the buff while bringing it back hacia el PVP Alliance base y stand en teleporter looking thing 33.51, luego turn the misión in junto a you at Marshal Bluewall 33.51.
09) Farmea sur to Bronzebeard Encampment y entrega "Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter" 41.88.  Also at this same NPC, talk to him to do part of "Dearest Natalia".
10) Next to you at Frankal Stonebridge 41.89 (sitting down at a tent), finish "Dearest Natalia" by talking to this NPC.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[202] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #47]], text = [[
01) All alrededor de southern Silithus finish "Noggle's Last Hope": mata y lootea a Stonelash Flayers (scorpids) y Rock Stalker (spiders).
02) Farmea norte to Cenarion Hold y justo afuera de the Posada, entrega "Stepping Up Security" 51.38.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Next to you, go up en Posada y entrega "Noggle's Last Hope" 52.39.  Luego junto a you, acepta "Noggle's Lost Satchel".
04) Ve up in Cenarion Hold y entrega "The Twilight Mystery" 50.37, acepta "The Deserter".
05) Entra en building junto a you y entrega "Dearest Natalia" 49.34, SKIP "Into The Maw of Madness" (group misión).
06) Ve SE to Ortell's Hideout (small cueva) y entrega "The Deserter" 67.70, acepta "The Twilight Lexicon".
07) Farmea NW to Twilight Base Camp y haz "The Twilight Lexicon": mata y lootea a the 3 named enemigos.  First one is Twilight Keeper Havunth /target.  This orc patrols alrededor de the Twilight Base Camp 42.44.  Also IF YOU ARE LVL 60 start working on "Twilight Geolords" by killing the Twilight Geolords (y you will see more of these enemigos en next 2 camps coming up).  See next pasos para other two:
08) Farmea oeste to Twilight Post y mata y lootea a Twilight Keeper Mayna /target (female human 26.37).  NOTE:  Feel free to farmea en Twilight enemigos here to obtain Encryped Twilight Texts.  You will need 10 for a future misión y you will have one more opportunity en next paso to get some more:
09) Ve sur to Twilight Outpost y mata y lootea a Twilight Keeper Exeter /target (red armored human with fiery sword 16.86).  NOTES:  You can avoid Hive'Zora & get there quicker by hugging the oeste side of Silithus mountains.  Also keep grinding en Twilight enemigos until you get 10 Encryped Twilight Texts, this will be used for an easy entrega misión later.  And IF YOU ARE LVL 60 make sure "Twilight Geolords" is finished now.
10) Ve right detrás de Bronzebeard Encampment hacia el mountain entrance 43.90 y try to do "Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands" (Elite): mata y lootea a Deathclasp /target.  This nivel 59 Elite scorpid is soloable but could give you some troubles.  If you cannot solo it, or find a group to help you, luego it can be skipped.  (See Video)
11) Also en same area of Deathclasp, do "Noggle's Lost Satchel": lootea Noggle's Satchel (yellow sack on ground 45.91).  (See Video)
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[203] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #48]], text = [[
01) Farmea este to Ortell's Hideout (small cueva) y entrega "The Twilight Lexicon" 67.70, acepta "A Terrible Purpose".  Also acepta, y luego entrega "True Believers".  Also this misión is repeatable, but no additional XP.
02) Farmea back to Cenarion Hold y up en Posada entrega "Noggle's Lost Satchel" 52.39.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Ve up in Cenarion Hold y en building, entrega "A Terrible Purpose" 49.34, SKIP "Into The Maw of Madness" (requires group).  Also, IF YOU ARE LVL 60 entrega "Twilight Geolords" 49.38 (by the moonwell), NOTE: "Vyral the Vile" is a solable misión that can be done, but wont be covered here.
04) As you exit the building, make a left y go all the way hasta lo alto de la torre y entrega (if you did it) "Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands" 51.34.
05) Drop down y en Hippogryph Master 51.34 vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
06) NW in Gadgetzan, en hut, entrega "Bungle in the Jungle" 51.27.
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ironforge.
08) At Ironforge, ve a the bank 35.61 y get the following items out: Sacred Highborne Writings, 3 Toxic Horror Droplet, Tinkee's Letter, Extended Annals of Darrowshire y (if you still need to) 30+ Bone Fragments.  NOTE:  30 Core of Elements could already be in your inventory, if not get them out too (if you have them).  You can put into the bank any remaining Encrypted Twilight Text you may have.
09) This is the last time I will remind you to entrega any cloth donations for Ironforge that you may have.  These are found de the Dwarf faction de Mistina Steelshield 43.32 y cloth donations para Gnome faction de Bubulo Acerbus 74.48.
10) Ve norte to Hall of Explorers (at The Library) y entrega "A Little Slime Goes a Long Way" 76.23.
11) Ve a the Gryphon Master 55.48 en middle of Ironforge y vuela a Light's Hope Chapel, Eastern Plaguelands.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[204] = {title = [[59 Eastern Plaguelands]], text = [[
01) At Light's Hope Chapel, junto a you when you land, by the tent, entrega "Brother Carlin" 76.54 , acepta "Villains of Darrowshire".  NOTE:  "Heroes of Darrowshire" (y all follow up misiones) is a misión chain you could do if you have a group, y it's worth doing, especially later when you get the chance.
02) Next to you de Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock <The Argent Dawn> 76.54, you can re-stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits if you need to.
03) Entra en Posada y de the female human 76.52 sitting en table, (if you have the 30 Core of Elements) completa The Elemental Equation.
04) (If you still need to)  Next to you by la entrada, (with 30 Bone Fragments), acepta y entrega "Bonescythe Digs" 76.53.
05) Ve NW (just below Quel'Lithien Lodge 49.18) y entrega "Fragments of the Past", SKIP the next part.
06) Ve sur to Blackwood Lake y haz part of "Villains of Darrowshire": lootea Horgus' Skull under the water (look para purple glow 47.44).
07) Ve sur to The Infectis Scar y haz the last part of "Villains of Darrowshire": lootea Shattered Sword of Marduk 49.60.  Look para pink glow.
08) Vuelve a Light's Hope Chapel at Carlin Redpath y entrega "Villains of Darrowshire" ( 76.54, #1 on map).
09) Ve a the Gryphon Master 76.53 y vuela a Menethil Harbor, Wetlands.  NOTE:  If your Hearthstone cooldown is almost up (less than 15 minutes), luego ve farmea on any enemigos in EPL (or take a break) until you are able to usa la piedra de hogar a Ironforge, luego vuela a Menethil Harbor.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[205] = {title = [[Alliance - Wetlands]], text = [[
01) At Menethil Harbor, go en docks y get en southern boat 5.64 to take you to Theramore.
02) At Theramore ve a the Gryphon Master 67.51 y vuela a Moonglade.
03) Once in Moonglade, ve a Nighthaven y at Umber, entrega "Umber, Archivist" 45.36 or could be at 48.40, acepta "Uncovering Past Secrets".
04) Ve into Nighthaven y entrega (if you have it) "A Reliquary of Purity" 52.45, SKIP "Shards of the Felvine" (Dungeon).  Also entrega "Uncovering Past Secrets".
05) Vuelve a Umber at Nighthaven y completa "Under the Chitin Was..." (48.40 or could be at 45.36, #3 on map).
06) Exit Moonglade en SW path to ve a Timbermaw Hold (36.72 in Moonglade).
07) In Timbermaw Hold, make a right after the stairs (NOT el puente) to go into Winterspring..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[206] = {title = [[60 Winterspring]], text = [[
01) Ve sur to Donova Snowden (31.45 in Winterspring) y entrega "Toxic Horrors", acepta "Winterfall Runners".
02) Try to do "Winterfall Runners": try to find the pack of Winterfall Runners /target (three lvl 57s) that patrols the main path de the Timbermaw Hold cueva 28.34 to Winterfall Village 68.38 y mata y lootea a them para Winterfall Crate.  See map for exact patrol path.  If after making one pass y you cannot find these enemigos, luego this can be skipped for now.
03) If (or when ever) you have completed "Winterfall Runners", vuelve a Donova Snowden (31.45, #1 on map) y turn it in.  Acepta "High Chief Winterfall" .  NOTE:  My guide will not cover "High Chief Winterfall".
04) Frostsaber Mounts Only (NO XP):  Sigue el camino principal este, luego norte to Frostsaber Rock y up en ice ledge, acepta "Frostsaber Provisions" 50.10.  NOTE:  This is a repeatable misión that only yields rep points that can eventually allow you to purchase unique Frostsaber mounts de him.
05) Ve a Everlook while starting on (if you have it) "Frostsaber Provisions": mata y lootea a bears y chimera.
06) Just to your left as you entra en Everlook (junto a hut) entrega "Are We There, Yeti?" 61.38.  Luego completa (if you have the engineering profession) "A Yeti of Your Own".
07) De Felnok Steelspring under the blue tent 62.39, entrega "Felnok Steelspring", acepta "Chillwind Horns".
08) Back in Everlook by the cage 62.38, acepta "Luck Be With You" (Elite).  And acepta (if you don't have it) "Ursius of the Shardtooth" OR (if available) "Brumeran of the Chillwind".
09) Entra en Posada y make Everlook your new home 61.39.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
10) You can Bank 61.37 any remaining Core of Elements, Bone Fragments y Insignias you may have.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[207] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #52]], text = [[
01) As you do the rest of this section, start working on "Chillwind Horns" (mata y lootea a chimera) y continue working on (if you have it) "Frostsaber Provisions" (mata y lootea a bears & chimera) por el camino, also (if you still need to) keep an eye out for a bear named Ursius /target (he looks just like all other other ones), if so, mata y lootea a him for "Ursius of the Shardtooth" OR if you have (instead) "Brumeran of the Chillwind" luego keep an eye out for Brumeran /target (lvl 58 Chimera) y mata it.:
02) Ve a la entrada de Owl Wing Thicket y de Ranshalla 63.59, entrega "Find Ranshalla".  Luego acepta y haz the escolta a "Guardians of the Altar": follow Ranshalla a través de Owl Wing Thicket y click en 5 Fire of Elune torches (one in each cueva).  Luego click en Altar of Elune en end de escolta a.
03) Ve sur to Frostwhisper Gorge (entrance 59.66, you can even just go directly sur de the escolta a) y start working on "Luck Be With You" (Elite): lootea Frostmaul Shards.  Just try to distract the giants to lootea the shards.  Try to sneak in a take as much as you can, you can return here later to get more.
04) Farmea norte to Everlook.
05) In Everlook, by the cage 62.38, y entrega (if its done) "Luck Be With You", luego acepta y entrega "Cache of Mau'ari".  NOTE:  The Cache of Mau'ari allows you to entrega E'kos for a temporary stat boost as long as the item remains in your bags.  Also entrega (if you did any of them) "Ursius of the Shardtooth" OR "Brumeran of the Chillwind".
06) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 62.38.
07) Norte of Everlook alrededor de 56.21 finish "Chillwind Horns" (mata y lootea a chimera) y (if you have it) "Frostsaber Provisions" (mata y lootea a bears y chimera).
08) Frostsaber Mounts Only (NO XP):  Ve norte to Frostsaber Rock y up en ice ledge, entrega "Frostsaber Provisions" 50.10.  NOTE:  This is a repeatable misión that only yields rep points that can eventually allow you to purchase unique Frostsaber mounts de him.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Alliance[208] = {title = [[Night Elf - Teldrassil]], text = [[
01) Die on purpose to get back to Everlook.
02) In Everlook, de Felnok Steelspring under the blue tent 62.39, entrega "Chillwind Horns", acepta "Return to Tinkee".  NOTE:  My guide will not cover "Return to Tinkee", but you can turn this in next time you head to Burning Steppes.
03) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 62.38.
04) Exit Everlook to your right y ve a the Hippogryph Master 62.37 to vuela a Rut'theran Village, Teldrassil.
05) At Rut'theran Village, entra en house y entrega "Guardians of the Altar" 55.92, acepta "Wildkin of Elune".
06) Sube por path a través de red portal 56.89 to get to Darnassus.
07) Ve norte to Cenarion Enclave hasta lo alto de the tree tower y entrega "Wildkin of Elune" 35.9.
08) While in Darnassus, any cloth donations are turned in at 64.23 para Night Elf faction.
09) Usa la piedra de hogar a Everlook.
10) If you still need to, finish "Luck Be With You": go sur to Frostwhisper Gorge entrance 59.66 y lootea Frostmaul Shards.  Distract the elite giants y sneak in to lootea the shards.  Luego turn this in at Everlook once finished.
11) At this point you should be very close to nivel 60.  I usually farmea the rest de way to nivel 60 en Owl Wing Thicket entrance 64.59.  But here is a list of other things you could do instead de owl grinding:
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[1] = {title = [[8 Durotar]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino principal just este y acepta "A Peon's Burden" 52.68.
02) Ve SE hacia Sen'jin Village y luego acepta "Thwarting Kolkar Aggression" (NPC /target patrols alrededor de 54.74 y hides detrás de rocks y trees).
03) At Sen'jen Village 56.75, entrega "Report to Sen'jin Village", acepta all misiones there: "Minshina's Skull", "Report to Orgnil" y "Zalazane".  Next to you, acepta "A solvent Spirit" 56.74.  Luego junto a you up en little hut, acepta "Practical Prey" 56.74.  You can get resupplied by the dancing male troll 56.74 by the Raging Bonfire.
04) Corre al norte to Razor Hill.  Once there, on your left, entrega "Report to Orgnil" 52.43, acepta "Dark Storms".  In the burrow junto a you 52.43, acepta "Vanquish the Betrayers" y "Encroachment".
05) Ve up hasta lo alto de the watchtower NW of Razor Hill, (up at 50.40) y acepta "Carry Your Weight".
06) Drop down SE y acepta "Break a Few Eggs" (en cooking area, 51.43).
07) Entra en Posada junto a you y entrega "A Peon's Burden" 52.42.  And also make Razor Hill your new home for your Hearthstone.  Make sure you are resupplied.
08) If you have an extra silver to spare:  en Barracks, get Apprentice First Aid de Rawrk 54.42.
09) Ve SE to Tiragarde Keep y haz "Vanquish the Betrayers" along with "Carry Your Weight": mata y lootea a the humans alrededor de y en fortress, also work your way hasta lo alto de the fortress y mata y lootea a Lieutenant Benedict 60.58.  Once you lootea the key de his corpse, luego ve up the other pasos to open Benedict's Chest up at 59.58, to acepta "The Admiral's Orders" de the Aged Envelope dentro de.
10) Once done, die on purpose en NW side de fortress y res at spirit to get back to Razor Hill y up en burrow, entrega "Vanquish the Betrayers" (52.44, #4 on map), acepta "From The Wreckage....".  Also entrega "The Admiral's Orders", acepta the next part.
11) Ve up hasta lo alto de the watchtower NW of Razor Hill, (up at 50.40, #5 on map) y entrega "Carry Your Weight".
12) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 52.41.
13) Ve este to la playa y under the water alrededor de 60.44 do "A solvent Spirit" along with "From The Wreckage....": mata y lootea a the crabs y makrura enemigos y lootea the Gnomish Toolboxes.
14) Ve just SW of Razor Hill alrededor de 49.49 y haz the first half of "Encroachment": mata the Razormane Quilboars y Razormane Scouts.
15) Luego ve a Razor Hill y en lo alto de the burrow entrega "From The Wreckage...." (52.44, #4 on map).   Also asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en.
16) If you have not learned Apprentice First Aid, luego get that now en Barracks de Rawrk 54.42.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[2] = {title = [[10 Durotar]], text = [[
01) Corre way al sur to Kolkar Crag (entrada en 51.79) y haz "Thwarting Kolkar Aggression": click en attack plans (scrolls) en ground.  Follow the pasos below to find all the scrolls...
02) Click on Attack Plan: Valley of Trials 50.81.
03) Click on Attack Plan: Sen'jin Village 48.77.
04) Click on Attack Plan: Orgrimmar 46.79.
05) Ve este hacia Sen'jin Village hacia el NPC /target that patrols y hides alrededor de tress/rocks alrededor de 54.76 y entrega "Thwarting Kolkar Aggression".
06) Ve a Sen'jin Village y entrega "A solvent Spirit" 56.74.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) Ve a Echo Isles (the islands SE of Durotar) y haz the following 4 misiones together "Break a Few Eggs", "Practical Prey", "Minshina's Skull" y "Zalazane": mata y lootea a Durotar Tigers, pickup Taillasher Eggs, y (at 67.88) pickup Minshina's Skull (en little hill with candles alrededor de it) y in that same area mata the needed trolls y mata y lootea a Zalazane /target (See Video).
08) After completing all these misiones, die on purpose (luego res) to get to Sen'jin Village quickly, y entrega "Minshina's Skull" y "Zalazane" 56.75.  NOTE:  Save the misión reward item Faintly Glowing Skull for a later misión.
09) In the little hut junto a you, entrega "Practical Prey" 56.74.
10) Usa la piedra de hogar a Razor Hill y entrega "Break a Few Eggs" (by the cooking area junto a Posada, 51.43).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
11) Ve oeste of Razor Hill alrededor de 44.40 y haz the second half of "Encroachment": mata the Razormane Dustrunners y Razormane Battleguards.
12) Farmea norte hacia el little house 43.30 y acepta "Lost But Not Forgotten".
13) Ve NE hacia el goblin y acepta "Winds in the Desert" 46.23.
14) Ve este a bit 49.22 y haz "Winds in the Desert": lootea Stolen Supply Sacks alrededor de the harpies.
15) Vuelve a the goblin y entrega "Winds in the Desert" (46.23, #13 on map), acepta "Securing the Lines".
16) Keep grinding on any mob en area until you are at least 1.5 bars away de nivel 10, luego corre back to Razor Hill [Don't Hearth] (or you can die on purpose sur en Razorwind Canyon harpy camp at about 48.34).
17) At the top de burrow entrega "Encroachment" 52.43.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
18) On the oeste side in Razor Hill, acepta "Conscript of the Horde" 51.44.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[3] = {title = [[Crossroads (The Barrens)]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste cruzando river y junto a path, entrega "Conscript of the Horde" (62.19 in The Barrens), acepta "Crossroads Conscription".
02) Head safely to XRs y acepta "Meats to Orgrimmar" 53.30.
03) At Sergra Darkthorn, entrega "Crossroads Conscription" 52.31.  Acepta "Plainstrider Menace".
04) Sur in XRs acepta "The Forgotten Pools" 52.32.  Luego junto a you, get repaired/resupplied de the Clothier.
05) Right afuera the Posada y junto a mailbox, acepta "Raptor Thieves" 52.30.
06) At the orc standing al fondo de the watchtower acepta "Disrupt the Attacks" 52.31, y "Supplies for the Crossroads".
07) Ve norte a bit hacia el undead under the red canopy y acepta "Fungal Spores" y "Wharfmaster Dizzywig" 51.30.
08) Next to you en Wind Rider Master 52.30 entrega "Meats to Orgrimmar", acepta "Ride to Orgrimmar".  Luego take a flight to Orgrimmar, Durotar.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[4] = {title = [[Orgrimmar]], text = [[
01) Stay up (cross el puente), luego Ve norte to Thrall y acepta "Hidden Enemies" 32.38.  In that room entrega "The Admiral's Orders".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[5] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) 12 Durotar
02) y haz "Securing the Lines": mata the harpies (a través de other side de small cueva 52.28 in Durotar).
03) At the goblin, entrega "Securing the Lines" 46.23.
04) Along el río oeste of Durotar 37.21 do "Lost But Not Forgotten": mata y lootea a the Dreadmaw Crocolisk until Kron's Amulet drops.
05) Entra en Thunder Ridge (at 39.31)...
06) In Thunder Ridge, do "Dark Storms": work your way to Fizzle Darkstorm (a goblin at 42.27, /target) y mata y lootea a him.  Be careful he is heavily guarded..
07) Exit Thunder Ridge, luego ve este hacia el little house y entrega "Lost But Not Forgotten" 43.30.
08) Ve SE to Razor Hill y entrega "Dark Storms" (52.43).  Acepta "Margoz".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  ALSO:  If you destroyed your Hearthstone earlier, luego get a new one in Razor Hill's Posada 52.42 by making it your new home.  If for some reason you are already nivel 12, get new spells/abilities while in town.
09) Ve NE y entrega "Margoz" 56.20, acepta "Skull Rock".
10) Ve norte to entra en Skull Rock (cueva entrada en 55.10) y haz "Skull Rock" along with "Hidden Enemies": mata y lootea a the enemigos in la cueva.  If you can, try to mata Gazz'uz /target (has multiple spawn locations in cueva), he drops Eye of Burning Shadow item which starts "Burning Shadows". TIPS: usa el/la misión reward item Faintly Glowing Skull to help you mata him, he's tough without it.  Also use a Sticky Glue on his voidwalker, or pull Gazz in a water pool since his voidwalker cant nada.  If you are an Orc, don't use Blood Fury before you have used your healing items.  Try to party up with somebody if you can. (See Video on how I killed Gazz'uz).  Also don't sal de this cueva until you have grinded out First Aid (50) to learn Journeyman First Aid soon.
11) Exit la cueva y go directly sur to entrega "Skull Rock" (56.20, #8 on map).  Acepta "Neeru Fireblade".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[6] = {title = [[Orgrimmar]], text = [[
01) Ve into Orgrimmar y ve a the Posada y entrega "Ride to Orgrimmar" 54.68, acepta "Doras the Wind Rider Master".
02) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y entrega "Doras the Wind Rider Master", acepta "Return to the Crossroads.".
03) Ve norte to Thrall y entrega "Hidden Enemies" 32.38.  Acepta the next part.
04) Ve a Cleft of Shadows (entrada en 42.57 in Orgrimmar).
05) In Cleft of Shadows 50.51, entrega "Neeru Fireblade" (acepta "Ak'Zeloth") y (if you have it) "Burning Shadows".  Also keep talking to this NPC to completa "Hidden Enemies".
06) Vuelve a Thrall (32.38, #3 on map) y entrega "Hidden Enemies", SKIP the next part (Dungeon).  NOTE: You can destroy the Lieutenant's Insignia, as its not used for anything else.
07) Hearth (or corre) to Razor Hill. Asegúrate de ser nivel 12 (farmea on any enemigos until you are).  Make sure you get repaired/resupplied.  Upgrade First Aid en Barracks de Rawrk 54.42 to learn Journeyman First Aid.
08) Corre oeste into the Barrens...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[7] = {title = [[Levels 12-15 Barrens]], text = [[
01) Over el puente, junto a watchtower, entrega (if you have it de the Durotar section) "Ak'Zeloth" 62.20, acepta "The Demon Seed".  Luego lootea a Flawed Power Stone de the table junto a you.  NOTE: The Flawed Power Stone item received only lasts 30 minutes, so you need to do the next few pasos somewhat quickly (but you should have plenty of time).
02) While working en following pasos, also start working on "Plainstrider Menace" y "Raptor Thieves" by killing plainstriders y raptors all alrededor de the fields de Barrens, but don't make it your main priority:
03) Ve oeste cruzando main path, luego sube por big mountain ramp (begins at 51.22).
04) Once you get en top do "The Demon Seed": entra en small cueva y use your Flawed Power Stone misión item on The Altar of Fire 48.19.  NOTES:  Watch out for a rare elite named Rathorian, he is very dangerous.  If he is en way, luego either try to team up with someone to help you mata him, or this misión can be skipped.  His respawn is every 5.5 hours.
05) Ve este y haz "Disrupt the Attacks": mata the required amount of Razormane quilboars alrededor de 54.27.  ALSO: Back en Razormane camp is a barrel called Chen's Empty Keg keg 56.27, lootea it y acepta the misión de the item received.
06) Ve a the NE side of XRs y entrega "Return to the Crossroads." 53.30.
07) Entrega (if it's completa) "Plainstrider Menace" (de Sergra Darkthorn 52.31), acepta "The Zhevra".
08) Entra en Posada y make XRs your new home 52.30.
09) At the orc standing al fondo de the watchtower, entrega "Disrupt the Attacks" (52.31, #7 on map).  Acepta "The Disruption Ends".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
10) Sube por watchtower junto a you y acepta "Harpy Raiders".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[8] = {title = [[Tauren]], text = [[
01) 6 Mulgore
02) First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!!
03) Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, WotLK, or SoM)
04) Right frente a you, acepta "The Hunt Begins" 45.77.
05) In the big hut, acepta "A Humble Task" 44.76.
06) Start working on "The Hunt Begins" by mata/looting Plainstriders as you go SE to entrega "A Humble Task" 50.81, acepta the next part.
07) Do "A Humble Task": junto a you pick up a Water Pitcher 50.81 en well (junto a misión giver).
08) Finish "The Hunt Begins" by mata/looting Plainstriders (#3 on map) as you head back to Camp Narache 45.77.
09) Stop en General Goods 45.77 vendedor (in small hut) to vende la basura to gain money.
10) In the big hut, entrega "A Humble Task" 44.76, acepta "Rites of the Earthmother".
11) Ve sur y entrega "Rites of the Earthmother" 43.92, acepta "Rite of Strength".  Also start working on "The Hunt Continues" by mata/looting any Mountain Cougars (cats) you see por el camino.
12) Do "The Hunt Continues": mata y lootea a Mountain Cougars alrededor de the mountain slopes alrededor de 45.91.
13) Farmea your way back to Camp Narache (asegúrate de estar al menos a 3 bars away de nivel 4) y luego entrega "The Hunt Continues" 45.77, acepta "The Battleboars".  Also acepta (de the NPC patrolling alrededor de) "Break Sharptusk!".
14) Stop en General Goods 45.77 vendedor (in small hut) to vende la basura to gain money.
15) Get new spells/abilities.
16) Ve a the area alrededor de 57.86 y haz most of "The Battleboars" by mata/looting Battleboars.  Get about half (4/8 of each item needed), luego continue on..
17) Ve a la cueva at entrance 58.85 while continue killing Battleboars por el camino for "The Battleboars".  Once you get to la cueva, luego ve a the next paso..
18) Farmea your way hacia el big tent while mata/looting Bristlebacks for "Rite of Strength".  Once you get hacia el tent, mata y lootea a Chief Sharptusk Thornmantle /target 65.78 for "Break Sharptusk!".
19) Luego farmea hacia el small cueva y en dentro de is a Dirt-stained Map 63.83.  Lootea it, luego usa el/la item to start "Attack on Camp Narache".
20) Make sure all other misiones are completa luego Usa la piedra de hogar a Camp Narache y entrega all misiones: (frente a you) "The Battleboars" 45.77, (de patrolling NPC) "Break Sharptusk!", (in hut 44.76) "Attack on Camp Narache" y "Rite of Strength" luego acepta "Rites of the Earthmother" (part 2).
21) In the tent, get repaired/resupplied 44.77.
22) Ve oeste on el camino y acepta "A Task Unfinished" 39.82.
23) The starting noob zone is completa, continue following la carretera to Bloodhoof Village 47.62 while grinding enemigos por el camino y asegúrate de ser nivel 6 before getting there para nuevas habilidades/hechizos.  Once you hit nivel 6, you can luego die on purpose y res at spirit healer to get you to Bloodhoof Village faster (or just corre there if you are close).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[9] = {title = [[8 Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Once at Bloodhoof Village acepta "Dangers of the Windfury" 47.62.
02) Entra en Posada (entrance is at 47.61) y de the First Aid Trainer entrena Apprentice First Aid.  And talk hacia el Innkeeper 47.61 to entrega "A Task Unfinished" y to make Bloodhoof Village your new home for your piedra de hogar.
03) Justo afuera de la posada 48.60, entrega "Rites of the Earthmother" y acepta "Sharing the Land", "Dwarven Digging" y "Rite of Vision".
04) Este a bit acepta "Poison Water" 49.60.
05) Entra en hut (junto a you) y acepta "Swoop Hunting" 49.59.
06) Norte a bit by the fire entrega "Rite of Vision" 48.58, acepta the next part.
07) Oeste a bit acepta "Mazzranache" 47.57.
08) Ve este de main path y haz "Rite of Vision": lootea Ambercorns alrededor de the trees y lootea Well Stones (alrededor de the well at 54.66).  Farmea any enemigos you see por el camino.
09) All alrededor de the area, start doing "Poison Water", "Swoop Hunting" y "Mazzranache": mata & lootea Swoops, Wolves, Plainstriders y Cougars.  Work your way sur to do the next pasos también:
10) Ve sur a bit y haz "Sharing the Land" alrededor de 52.70.  NOTE: There are several camps of these enemigos y the Poachers are only in certain camps.
11) Ve este a bit y haz "Dangers of the Windfury" 62.71: mata y lootea the harpies.
12) Find Morin Cloudstalker /target along el camino (patrols alrededor de 54.60) y acepta "The Ravaged Caravan".
13) Ve norte hacia el ravaged caravan 54.48 y haz "The Ravaged Caravan": open the Sealed Supply Crate to turn the misión in, acepta the next part.
14) Make sure all misiones are completa (besides "Dwarven Digging" y "Swoop Hunting"), luego Hearth (or die on purpose) to vuelve a Bloodhoof Village y entrega "Sharing the Land" 48.60.
15) Sur a bit entrega "Dangers of the Windfury" 47.62.
16) NE a bit entrega "Poison Water" 49.60, acepta "Winterhoof Cleansing".
17) If you completed "Swoop Hunting" turn it in junto a you en hut 49.59.
18) Norte a bit by the fire y entrega "Rite of Vision" 48.58, acepta the next "Rite of Wisdom".  NOTE:  Don't bother using  Water de Seers misión item.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[10] = {title = [[10 Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Ve a Morin Cloudstalker /target along the main path going este alrededor de 54.60 y entrega "The Ravaged Caravan", acepta "The Venture Co." y "Supervisor Fizsprocket".
02) Ve sur a bit y haz "Winterhoof Cleansing": usa el/la Winterhoof Cleansing Totem misión item en well 54.66.
03) Ve NW to Bloodhoof Village y entrega "Winterhoof Cleansing" 49.60, acepta "Thunderhorn Totem".
04) While focusing en next pasos, also start working on "Thunderhorn Totem" by mata/looting Prairie Stalkers (wolves) y Flatland Cougars (cats)...
05) Ve NW y start working on "Dwarven Digging" alrededor de 33.49: find Prospector's Picks y use them at a Forge.  NOTE:  Without grouping, it's hard to get hacia el Forge there 31.50.  Instead, there will be other easier Forges later on en guide you can use.  For now, just get 5 Prospector's Picks.  The diggers are easier to mata solo, y taurens can use their War Stomp ability to prevent the Appraiser's de healing themselves.
06) Ve al norte (past the harpy camp) to la cueva 33.36 y entrega "Rite of Vision", acepta "Rite of Wisdom".
07) Work your way este y acepta "A Sacred Burial" 60.26.
08) Work your way hacia el Ancestral Spirit 61.21 y entrega "Rite of Wisdom" acepta "Journey into Thunder Bluff".  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
09) In the Immediate area alrededor de Red Rocks do "A Sacred Burial": mata 8 Bristleback Interlopers (#8 on map).
10) Ve SW a bit y entrega "A Sacred Burial" (60.26, #7 on map)
11) Finish up "Thunderhorn Totem": mata y lootea a Prairie Stalkers y Flatland Cougars (alrededor de the middle of Mulgore alrededor de 52.35).
12) If you are not nivel 10 (or at least 1 bar away de it), farmea until you are,
13) Right afuera de Posada, acepta (if you are lvl 10) "The Hunter's Way" 47.60.  If you're not lvl 10 do the next paso before this one:
14) Este entrega "Thunderhorn Totem" 49.60, acepta "Thunderhorn Cleansing".  Also entrega (if you need to) "Swoop Hunting" (en tent junto a you 49.59).
15) Get new spells/abilities y acepta your class's nivel 10 misiones.  NOTE:  You can destroy the  Water de Seers item to free bag space.
16) Ve norte y haz "Thunderhorn Cleansing": usa el/la Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem en well 45.45.
17) Ve norte to Thunder Bluff (a Lift is at 36.30 in Mulgore), y build up First Aid while waiting para Lift.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[11] = {title = [[Thunder Bluff (TB)]], text = [[
01) In TB, acepta "Preparation for Ceremony" 38.60.
02) Finish up "Dwarven Digging" by using your 5 Prospector's Picks en Thunder Bluff Forge 40.56.
03) Ve up este y entrega "Journey into Thunder Bluff" 60.52, acepta "Rites of the Earthmother".
04) Ve norte y sal de TB by taking the Lift down 54.28.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[12] = {title = [[12 Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Ve SE y haz "Supervisor Fizsprocket" along with "The Venture Co.": mata y lootea a Supervisor Fizsprocket in la cueva (entrance 62.47, /target).  Keep hugging the right side of la cueva straight through to get to him.
02) Make sure "The Venture Co." is finished before continuing, luego die on purpose to get to Bloodhoof Village y entrega "Dwarven Digging" (by the big totem, 48.60).
03) Ve este a bit y entrega "Thunderhorn Cleansing" 49.60, acepta "Wildmane Totem".
04) Ve este y find Morin Cloudstalker /target along el camino alrededor de 54.60 y entrega "The Venture Co." y "Supervisor Fizsprocket".
05) While doing the following pasos al norte also focus on doing "The Hunter's Way" along with "Wildmane Totem" by mata/looting the Flatland Prowler & Prairie Wolf Alphas (mostly norte of TB):
06) Do "Rites of the Earthmother": mata Arra'chea y lootea his horn.  Arra'chea /target is a kodo that patrols clockwise just hacia el right of TB.  His original spawn point is at 49.19.  If you can't find him in time, luego it can be skipped.
07) Work your way hacia el very norte of Mulgore alrededor de 55.17 y haz "Preparation for Ceremony": mata y lootea a the harpies (These harpies are in many camps norte y NW of Mulgore).
08) Make sure "The Hunter's Way" along with "Wildmane Totem" are finished: mata y lootea a Flatland Prowlers & Prairie Wolf Alphas (mostly norte of TB).
09) Ve a the Lift 41.22 to go into TB.  NOTE:  If you are real far away de that, you can die on purpose to get right hacia el Lift.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[13] = {title = [[Thunder Bluff]], text = [[
01) Ve a the Elder Rise y acepta "The Barrens Oases" 70.29.
02) Entrega (if you did it) "Rites of the Earthmother" 60.52.
03) Ve a the Hunter Rise y entrega "The Hunter's Way" 62.81, acepta "Sergra Darkthorn".
04) Entrega "Preparation for Ceremony" 38.60.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[14] = {title = [[12 Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Bloodhoof Village.
02) Este a bit y entrega "Wildmane Totem" 49.60, acepta "Wildmane Cleansing".
03) Farmea your way norte to 47.33 luego die on purpose y res at spirit.
04) Ve norte a bit y haz "Wildmane Cleansing": usa el/la Wildmane Cleansing Totem misión item en well 43.14.
05) Hearth or farmea sur to 47.38 y die on purpose to get back to Bloodhoof Village.
06) Entrega "Wildmane Cleansing" (49.60, #2 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[15] = {title = [[12 The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Corre este into the Barrens y get the Flight Path in Camp Taurajo de the Wind Rider Master (44.59 en Barrens).
02) In the middle of CT acepta "Journey to the Crossroads" 45.59.
03) Sigue el camino norte hacia el Crossroads (XRs) y entrega "The Barrens Oases" (sur in XRs, 52.32), acepta "The Forgotten Pools".
04) At Sergra Darkthorn, entrega "Sergra Darkthorn" 52.31, acepta "Plainstrider Menace".
05) Entra en Posada y make XRs your new home 52.30.
06) Right afuera the Posada on your right acepta "Raptor Thieves" 52.30.
07) At the orc standing al fondo de the watchtower, entrega "Journey to the Crossroads" 52.31, acepta "Disrupt the Attacks" y "Supplies for the Crossroads".
08) Sube por watchtower junto a you y acepta "Harpy Raiders" 52.31.
09) Drop down, y right junto a Wind Rider Master 51.30 acepta "Fungal Spores" y "Wharfmaster Dizzywig".
10) NW in XRs, acepta "A Bundle of Hides" 51.29.
11) At the Wind Rider Master 51.30, entrega "A Bundle of Hides", SKIP "Ride to Thunder Bluff" (for now).
12) While working en following pasos, also start working on "Plainstrider Menace" y "Raptor Thieves" by killing plainstriders y raptors all alrededor de the fields de Barrens, but don't make it your main priority:
13) Ve NE y haz "Disrupt the Attacks": mata the needed Razormane enemigos alrededor de 54.27.  ALSO: Back en Razormane camp is a barrel called Chen's Empty Keg 56.27, lootea it y acepta the misión de the item received.
14) Vuelve SW to XRs y en orc standing al fondo de the watchtower entrega "Disrupt the Attacks" (52.31, #7 on map).  Acepta "The Disruption Ends".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[16] = {title = [[Undead – Blood Elf]], text = [[
01) 6 DeathKnell (Tirisfal Glades)
02) First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!!
03) Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, WotLK, or SoM)
04) First thing to do is to destroy your Hearthstone in your Backpack.  NOTE: The Hearthstone is not needed right now y you will get a new one later.  This will give you an extra bag space.
05) Right frente a you acepta "Rude Awakening" 30.72.
06) Entra en church building y entrega "Rude Awakening" 31.66, acepta "The Mindless Ones".
07) Baja por hill a bit alrededor de 32.63 y haz "The Mindless Ones": mata the needed zombies.
08) Vuelve a the church (31.66, #2 on map) y entrega "The Mindless Ones".  Acepta y "Rattling the Rattlecages".  Next to you acepta "The Damned" 31.66.
09) Do "The Damned" along with "Rattling the Rattlecages": mata Rattlecage Skeletons /target (en village area) y mata y lootea a wolves y bats all alrededor de the afuera de village area.  Both are alrededor de 32.60.
10) Vuelve a the church y entrega "The Damned". (31.66, #2 on map).  Acepta "Marla's Last Wish".  Next to you, entrega "Rattling the Rattlecages".
11) Right afuera the church (de the patrolling NPC) acepta "Scavenging Deathknell" patrols a bit 32.66, y "Night Web's Hollow" 32.66.
12) Do "Scavenging Deathknell": pick up the Equipment Boxes in y alrededor de the village buildings alrededor de 32.64.
13) Ve NW y haz "Night Web's Hollow": mata the Young Night Web Spiders afuera of la mina y the Night Web Spiders dentro de mine (mine entrada en 27.59).
14) Die on purpose y res at spirit.
15) Entrega "Scavenging Deathknell" 32.66.
16) Make sure you are resupplied 32.65.
17) Entrega "Night Web's Hollow" 32.66, acepta "The Scarlet Crusade".
18) Ve este de village alrededor de 37.67 y haz "The Scarlet Crusade": mata y lootea a the Scarlet humans.
19) Ve norte a bit y haz part of "Marla's Last Wish": mata y lootea a the zombie Samuel Flipps 37.62 /target.
20) Die on purpose (res at spirit), luego junto a you in the graveyard do the last part of "Marla's Last Wish": click on Marla's Grave 31.65 (dirt mound).
21) In the church, entrega "Marla's Last Wish" (31.66, #2 on map).
22) Just afuera, entrega "The Scarlet Crusade" 32.66, acepta "The Red Messenger".
23) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 32.65.
24) Ve este y haz "The Red Messenger": mata y lootea a Meven Korgal 37.69 /target.  He is guarded by a few other enemigos, but it can be soloed.
25) Back oeste, entrega "The Red Messenger" 32.66, acepta "Vital Intelligence".
26) Sigue el camino NE out of Deathknell y acepta "A Rogue's Deal" 38.57.  The starting noob zone is completa.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[17] = {title = [[10 Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) Down el camino en intersection, acepta "Fields of Grief" 41.54.
02) Corre este to Brill 58.51 along the main path, grinding enemigos por el camino, y make sure you get to nivel 6 before you get there (para nuevas habilidades/hechizos).  Por el camino on el camino acepta "Gordo's Task" (de the abomination Gordo /target).
03) Once at Brill, frente a graveyard entrance, acepta "A Putrid Task" 58.51.
04) Entra en first house on your right y acepta "A New Plague" 59.52.
05) Justo afuera de the house pick up Apprentice Herbalist de the Herbalism Trainer /target 60.52.  NOTE: I recommend getting this at least temporarily for helping you find the Gloom Weed y Doom Weeds later in this zone.
06) Frente a Town Hall building, entrega "Vital Intelligence" 61.52.  Acepta "At War with the Scarlet Crusade".
07) Right detrás de this NPC, acepta "Wanted: Maggot Eye" 61.51 (de the Wanted! sign).
08) Entra en Town Hall building right junto a you y acepta "Graverobbers" 61.51.
09) Entra en the Posada entrance 62.53 y en Innkeeper 62.52 entrega "A Rogue's Deal".  Make this Posada your new home for your Hearthstone (by talking hacia el Innkeeper).  Make sure you are resupplied.
10) In Brill's Posada, get your nivel 6 spells/abilities.
11) Ve just oeste of Brill y haz "Gordo's Task" along with "A Putrid Task": pick up Gloom Weed y mata y lootea a zombies.  Also, start working on "A New Plague" (mata y lootea a darkhounds).  TIPS:  There is a merchant en small house 53.56 that you can sell items to.  Don't forget to turn Find Herbs on to spot the Gloom Weed on mini map.
12) Finish "A New Plague": mata y lootea a darkhounds (blue dots on map).  Focus on finishing this oeste alrededor de 42.45.
13) Ve oeste y haz "At War with the Scarlet Crusade": mata y lootea a the Scarlet Warriors.  Also start working on "Fields of Grief" by looting Tirisfal Pumpkins you see por el camino.  TIP: Work your way along the main path, looting pumpkins you see along the norte side of la granja, you will find a few more alrededor de la torre alrededor de 32.47.  The Scarlet Warriors are norte y oeste of la granja.
14) Finish "Fields of Grief": pickup Tirisfal Pumpkins alrededor de la granja 36.51.
15) Die on purpose y res at spirit.
16) In the graveyard junto a you alrededor de 58.49 entrega "Gordo's Task" (the NPC /target patrols alrededor de the grave), acepta "Doom Weed".
17) Frente a graveyard entrance entrega "A Putrid Task" (58.51, #3 on map).  Acepta "The Mills Overrun".
18) In the small house 59.52 (#4 on map), entrega "Fields of Grief" y "A New Plague", acepta the next part to both of these misiones.
19) Frente a Town Hall, entrega "At War with the Scarlet Crusade" 61.52 (#6 on map), acepta the next part.
20) Next to you acepta "Proof of Demise" 61.52.
21) Get resupplied 61.53.
22) Justo dentro de the Posada entrance 62.53, stop en First Aid Trainer /target 62.53 y get Apprentice First Aid.  NOTE: If you could not afford this, luego get this when you can.
23) Inside the Posada, acepta "Deaths in the Family" y "The Haunted Mills" 62.52.
24) Ve downstairs en Posada y entrega "Fields of Grief" 62.51.
25) Ve upstairs en Posada y acepta "The Chill of Death" 62.53.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[18] = {title = [[Undead - Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) If you have an extra silver to spare, it's wise to check to see if you can compra any health potions de Selina Weston /target 62.50 detrás de Brill.  It will come in handy for tough solo misiones soon.
02) Ve just norte above Brill y haz "Graverobbers" along with "Doom Weed": mata y lootea a the Rot Hide Graverobbers, y pickup Doom Weeds all alrededor de the area alrededor de 55.42.  You will find the Rot Hide Mongrels /target norte alrededor de la granja 59.36.  Don't forget to turn Find Herbs on to spot the Doom Weeds on mini map.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
03) First asegúrate de ser nivel 8, luego do "Wanted: Maggot Eye": mata y lootea a Maggot Eye en hut 59.31.  TIPS:  This can be hard to solo, make sure you are prepared y use a potion if you have one.  If you cant do it luego skip it or try later.
04) Ve norte to la playa alrededor de 60.28 y haz "A New Plague": mata y lootea a the murlocs.  NOTE:  Be careful, these murlocs are not easy.
05) Frente a Town Hall, entrega (if you did it) "Wanted: Maggot Eye" 61.52.
06) Entra en Town Hall y entrega "Graverobbers".  Acepta "Forsaken Duties" 61.51.
07) Make sure you are all repaired/resupplied 60.53.
08) In the small house 59.52, entrega "A New Plague", acepta the next part.
09) Ve a the grave y entrega "Doom Weed" (NPC /target patrols alrededor de 58.49).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[19] = {title = [[NOTE  While doing this section start working on "The Chill of Death" by mata/looting Duskbats you see por el camino]], text = [[
01) Ve NW to Agamand Mills y haz "The Mills Overrun" (mata y lootea a the skeletons alrededor de the mill) while also killing the named enemigos for "Deaths in the Family" y "The Haunted Mills". Follow the pasos below to mata the named enemigos for these misiones:
02) Mata y lootea a Devlin Agamand /target, a skeleton warrior patroling alrededor de the grassy area alrededor de 47.41.
03) Mata y lootea a Nissa Agamand /target, she is a ghost that patrols alrededor de en house entrada en 50.36.
04) Mata y lootea a Gregor Agamand /target , a ghoul that patrols alrededor de the windmill alrededor de 46.29.
05) Mata y lootea a Thurman Agamand /target, a zombie that patrols between the two windmills junto a cliff alrededor de 44.34.
06) Make sure "The Mills Overrun" is finished, luego hearth to Gallows' End Taven (Brill).  If you cannot hearth, luego die on purpose y res at spirit.  If you died on purpose luego do paso #10 next before continuing on.
07) In the Posada 62.52 entrega "Deaths in the Family" y "The Haunted Mills", acepta "Speak with Sevren".
08) NOTE: While doing the Agamand misiones, you may have received an item called A Letter to Yvette, acepta "A Letter Undelivered" de it, luego turn it dentro de Posada, cerca de entrance 62.53.
09) In the Town Hall entrega "Speak with Sevren" 61.51, acepta "The Family Crypt".
10) At the graveyard entrance, entrega "The Mills Overrun" 58.52.
11) Make sure you are now nivel 10, if not farmea until you are.  You can continue to work on "The Chill of Death" by mata/looting bats alrededor de Brill until you are.  If you happen to get all 5 Pelts before hitting nivel 10, luego ve a the Trade Supplies /target vendedor (under the red tent 61.52) y purchase a Coarse Thread, luego ve upstairs en Posada y entrega "The Chill of Death" (but it doesn't need to be completed now).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[20] = {title = [[12 Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) Frente a Town Hall, entrega "At War with the Scarlet Crusade" 61.52, acepta the next part.  Also entrega junto a you (if it is done) "Proof of Demise".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) If you are still working on "The Chill of Death", luego ve a the Trade Supplies /target vendedor (under the red tent 61.52) y purchase a Coarse Thread (remember not to sell this!)
03) Ve SE hacia el small camp along the main path y entrega "Forsaken Duties" 66.60, acepta "Return to the Magistrate" y "Rear Guard Patrol".
04) Ve este to Balnir Farmstead alrededor de 76.61 y haz "Rear Guard Patrol": mata the zombies y spirits alrededor de la granja.
05) Ve NE a bit y haz "At War with the Scarlet Crusade": mata 5 Scarlet Friars, y mata Captain Vachon (en watchtower 79.56).  NOTE:  "Proof of Demise" does not need to be completed now.
06) Ve este y haz "A New Plague": mata y lootea a the spiders alrededor de 84.54.  Also, make sure you have all 5 de Duskbat Pelts for "The Chill of Death".
07) Frente a Town Hall, entrega "Proof of Demise" (if it is done) 61.52, y junto a you "At War with the Scarlet Crusade", acepta the next part.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[21] = {title = [[Undead - Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) In the small house 59.52, entrega "A New Plague", acepta the next part.  Also acepta "Delivery to Silverpine Forest".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) Above Agamand Mills, go down en crypt (entrada en 52.27) y haz "The Family Crypt": mata the zombies y ghosts, y mata y lootea a Captain Dargol, he is en very bottom de crypt.  NOTE:  This misión is not easy, but every class should be able to solo it at nivel 11 with good skill.
03) Die on purpose y res en spirit, luego entra en Town Hall 61.51 y entrega "The Family Crypt" y "Return to the Magistrate".
04) Entra en basement de Posada y entrega "A New Plague".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) Do "At War with the Scarlet Crusade": mata Captain Melrache y his two bodyguards en watchtower 79.25.  Also make sure "Proof of Demise" is now finished.
06) Hearth, or corre back to Brill y frente a Town Hall, entrega "At War with the Scarlet Crusade" 61.52 y (if you still need to) "Proof of Demise".
07) At the First Aid Trainer 62.53 just in la entrada de Posada, learn Heavy Linen Bandage (skill 40), y if possible Journeyman First Aid (skill 50).
08) Asegúrate de ser nivel 12, farmea on any enemigos alrededor de Brill until you are.  Luego ve in Brill's Posada y get your nivel 12 spells/abilities.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[22] = {title = [[Levels 12+ Options - Now you have two options on where to go.  You can ve a The Barrens, or you can ve a Silverpine Forest (next section below).  Overall with WotLK 50% faster misión XP rate, I recommend skipping Silverpine Forest y just jump right into The Barrens guide, otherwise you will be too far ahead after doing Silverpine.  So for WotLK 50% XP rate, I would highly recommend skipping Silverpine y going to The Barrens. - If you decide to ve a The Barrens right away, luego abandon "Delivery to Silverpine Forest" y follow the pasos in this section to get to The Barrens.  Otherwise, skip hacia el Silverpine Forest 12-15 section below. - To The Barrens Only]], text = [[
01) Get en Zeppelin to ve a Orgrimmar (61.59 in Tirisfal Glades).   NOTE:  There are two Zeppelins, the eastern one takes you to Stranglethorn Vale y the western one to Orgrimmar.
02) Once in Orgrimmar, get the Flight Path de the Wind Rider Master (up at 45.64).
03) Sal de Orgrimmar (sur) y corre to Razor Hill y en oeste side de town, acepta "Conscript of the Horde" (51.44 in Durotar).
04) Luego ve a the Levels 15 Barrens (Undead) section down below in this guide.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[23] = {title = [[Silverpine Forest 12-15]], text = [[
01) Head sur en main path to entra en Silverpine Forest (54.76 in Tirisfal Glades).
02) Just to your right off the main path at Malden's Orchard, en small house house 56.9, acepta y haz the escolta a "Escorting Erland" by escorting Deathstalker Erland SW a bit to The Ivar Patch.  Luego turn it in de the NPC 53.13 frente a big house y acepta "The Deathstalkers' Report".  Do NOT acepta "Wild Hearts" yet.
03) Die on purpose y res at spirit to get to The Sepulcher.  NOTE:  Save any Discolored Worg Hearts you may have.
04) At the Innkeeper justo afuera de the crypt/Posada 43.41, make The Sepulcher your new home.
05) Ve down en Posada/crypt y entrega "The Deathstalkers' Report" (down at 43.41), acepta "Speak with Renferrel".  Also acepta "Lost Deathstalkers" y "The Dead Fields".
06) Exit the crypt y make a sharp left hacia el NPC 43.41 under the canopy y entrega "Delivery to Silverpine Forest" y "Speak with Renferrel", SKIP "Zinge's Delivery" (for now).  Also acepta "A Recipe For Death".
07) At the largest tombstone en graveyard, acepta "Border Crossings" 44.41.
08) Just norte de the NPC in purple, acepta "Prove Your Worth" 44.40.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[24] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #12]], text = [[
01) As you do the following pasos also start working on part of "A Recipe For Death" by mata/looting any bears you see por el camino:
02) Work your way norte y este de main path alrededor de Valgan's Field alrededor de 52.25 do "Prove Your Worth": mata 5 Moonrage Whitescalps (worgen).
03) Work your way norte to The Ivar Patch y de the NPC 53.13 frente a big house, entrega "Lost Deathstalkers".  Also acepta "Wild Hearts".
04) Around the immediate area do "Wild Hearts": mata y lootea a worgs.
05) Farmea sur to The Dead Fields y haz "The Dead Fields": keep killing the gnolls until Nightlash /target spawns en middle de field 45.21, luego mata y lootea a her.
06) Farmea oeste to The Skittering Dark (watch out para lvl 24 elite) y haz part of "A Recipe For Death": mata y lootea a the spiders (in y afuera of la cueva, 36.14, #1 on map).  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
07) You can get resupplied de the Fisherman 33.18 by the shore.  Be careful not to sell your Discolored Worg Hearts!
08) Finish "A Recipe For Death" by mata/looting the rest of bears you need.  You can find a lot of Giant Grizzled Bears alrededor de where you are at y Ferocious Grizzled Bears a bit more este.  #1 on map.
09) Die on purpose to get to The Sepulcher.
10) Down en crypt/inn entrega "The Dead Fields" 43.41, acepta "The Decrepit Ferry".
11) Exit the crypt y make a sharp left hacia el NPC 43.41 under the canopy y entrega "Wild Hearts", acepta "Return to Quinn".
12) Just norte de the NPC in purple, entrega "Prove Your Worth" 44.40, acepta "Arugal's Folly".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[25] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #13]], text = [[
01) Ve este hacia el shore y click en Corpse Laden Boat 58.35 to entrega "The Decrepit Ferry", acepta "Rot Hide Clues".
02) Ve norte to Valgan's Field y haz "Arugal's Folly": upstairs en big house, lootea the Dusty Spellbooks 53.29 en ground.
03) Ve norte to The Ivar Patch y upstairs en big house, entrega "Return to Quinn" 53.13.
04) Just afuera the house, acepta "Ivar the Foul" 53.13.
05) Entra en barn junto a you y haz "Ivar the Foul": mata y lootea a Ivar the Foul 51.14.  Be careful there is a few other enemigos alrededor de this ghoul.
06) Vuelve a Rane frente a big house y entrega "Ivar the Foul" (53.13, #3 on map).
07) Die on purpose to get to The Sepulcher.
08) Down en crypt/inn, entrega "Rot Hide Clues" 43.41, SKIP "Rot Hide Ichor".
09) Exit the crypt, y just norte de the NPC in purple, entrega "Arugal's Folly" 44.40, acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
10) Ve este to Deep Elem Mine alrededor de 56.46 y haz "Arugal's Folly": mata y lootea a Moonrage Glutton y Darksoul (worgen).  You will find more Darksouls in la mina.
11) Ve SW hacia el small Dalaran camp y click en Dalaran Crate (junto a a canopy, 50.60) to entrega "Border Crossings", acepta "Maps and Runes".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[26] = {title = [[Undead - Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) At The Sepulcher, afuera en largest tombstone en graveyard, entrega "Maps and Runes" 44.41, acepta "Dalar's Analysis".
02) Just norte de the NPC in purple, entrega "Arugal's Folly" 44.40, acepta the next part.  And entrega "Dalar's Analysis", acepta "Dalaran's Intentions".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Back en largest tombstone en graveyard, entrega "Dalaran's Intentions" 44.41, acepta "Ambermill Investigations".
04) Ve SE back to Deep Elem Mine y haz "Arugal's Folly": entra en la mina (entrada en 57.46) y en end of la mina mata y lootea a Grimson the Pale.
05) Ve sur to Ambermill alrededor de 56.63 y haz "Ambermill Investigations": mata y lootea a the Dalaran Protectors, Mages y Conjurors para 8 pendants.
06) At The Sepulcher, junto a Posada/crypt/mailbox, acepta "Supplying the Sepulcher" 43.42.
07) Junto a crypt/inn, de the NPC 43.41 under the canopy, acepta "Zinge's Delivery".
08) At the largest tombstone en graveyard, entrega "Ambermill Investigations" 44.41, SKIP "The Weaver".
09) Just norte de the NPC in purple, entrega "Arugal's Folly" (44.40, #2 on map), SKIP the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
10) SE in town de the Bat Handler 46.43, entrega "Supplying the Sepulcher", acepta "Ride to the Undercity".  Luego take a bat ride to Undercity, Tirisfal.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[27] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) When you land en UC, go cruzando room en Trade Quarter y entrega "Ride to the Undercity" 61.42, acepta "Michael Garrett".
02) Ve a the Bat Handler 63.49 y entrega "Michael Garrett", acepta "Return to Podrig".  Skip the ride for now.
03) Ve SW down in The Apothecarium y entrega "A Recipe For Death" 49.69, SKIP the next part.
04) Next to you en room, entrega "Zinge's Delivery" 50.68, acepta "Sample for Helbrim".
05) Usa la piedra de hogar a The Sepulcher.
06) Junto a crypt/Posada/mailbox, entrega "Return to Podrig" (43.42 in Silverpine Forest).
07) SE en Bat Handler 46.43, take a bat ride to Undercity, Tirisfal.
08) Once en UC, exit it y head norte hacia el Zeppelin to ve a Orgrimmar (61.59 in Tirisfal Glades).  NOTE:  There are two Zeppelins, the eastern one takes you to Stranglethorn Vale y the western one to Orgrimmar.
09) Once in Orgrimmar, get the Flight Path de the Wind Rider Master (up at 45.64).
10) Sal de Orgrimmar (sur) y corre to Razor Hill (in Durotar) to get new spells/abilities.  You can also upgrade First Aid if you need to en Barracks de the First Aid Trainer 54.42.
11) At the oeste entrance of Razor Hill acepta "Conscript of the Horde" 51.44.
12) Head oeste en main path to entra en The Barrens..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[28] = {title = [[Levels 15 Barrens (Undead)]], text = [[
01) Just over el puente, junto a path, entrega "Conscript of the Horde" (62.19 en Barrens), acepta "Crossroads Conscription".
02) Ve SW to XRs y en Posada, make XRs your new home de the Innkeeper 52.30.
03) Right afuera the Posada on your right acepta "Raptor Thieves" 52.30.
04) At the orc standing al fondo de the watchtower acepta "Disrupt the Attacks" 52.31, y "Supplies for the Crossroads".
05) Sube por watchtower junto a you y acepta "Harpy Raiders" 52.31.
06) Drop down y get the FP de the Wind Rider Master 52.30.
07) Right junto a you under the red canopy, entrega (if you have it) "Sample for Helbrim" 51.30.  Also acepta "Fungal Spores" y "Wharfmaster Dizzywig".
08) At Sergra Darkthorn, entrega "Crossroads Conscription" 52.31.  Acepta "Plainstrider Menace".
09) Ve sur in XRs y acepta "The Forgotten Pools" 52.32.  Luego junto a you, get repaired/resupplied de the Clothier.
10) While working en following pasos, also start working on "Plainstrider Menace" y "Raptor Thieves" by killing plainstriders y raptors all alrededor de the fields de Barrens, but don't make it your main priority:
11) Ve NE y haz "Disrupt the Attacks": mata the needed Razormane enemigos alrededor de 54.27.  ALSO: Back en Razormane camp there is a barrel called Chen's Empty Keg 56.27, lootea it y acepta the misión de the item received.
12) Vuelve SW hacia el XRs y en orc standing al fondo de the watchtower, entrega "Disrupt the Attacks" (52.31, #4 on map).  Acepta "The Disruption Ends".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
13) NOTE:  As you continue on in The Barrens, you might be a few levels above what the guide indicates, but that is ok, simply follow The Barrens guide entirely (whether you did the Silverpine section or not).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[29] = {title = [[First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!! - Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)]], text = [[
01) Vuelve a the other Razormane camps up NE alrededor de 57.25 y haz "The Disruption Ends" y "Supplies for the Crossroads": mata the required amount of Razormane quilboars y lootea a Crossroads' Supply Crates (there are multiple locations of these cajas).  Kreenig Snarlsnout is at 59.27 /target.
02) Asegúrate de ser nivel 13 as you work your way SE to Ratchet (stay junto a river for enemigos more your nivel) y luego ve up en engineering building y acepta "Southsea Freebooters" 63.36.
03) Ve a the Flight Master 63.37 to get the FP, luego junto a you acepta "Samophlange".  NOTE:  To free up bag space you can destroy the Control Console Operating Manual as it is not needed.
04) Ve a the goblin en docks y entrega "Wharfmaster Dizzywig" 63.38.  Acepta "Miner's Fortune".
05) At the WANTED sign junto a bank, acepta "WANTED: Baron Longshore" 63.38.
06) Acepta "Raptor Horns" (junto a Ratchet's bank, 62.38).
07) Entrega "Chen's Empty Keg" (male orc junto a Plate-n-Chain hut, 62.38), acepta the next part.  Also focus on doing this misión while throughout The Barrens by mata/looting cats, plainstriders y Thunderlizards...
08) NOTE:  At the Ratchet's Posada 62.39 you can compra Longjaw Mud Snapper food for really cheap.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
09) Sigue el camino sur of Ratchet to The Merchant Coast y haz "Southsea Freebooters" along with "WANTED: Baron Longshore": mata the needed Southsea pirates y mata y lootea a Baron Longshore /target, he has 3 possible spawns en southern most tents (starting at 64.47).
10) Vuelve a Ratchet, y en engineering building entrega "Southsea Freebooters" (acepta "The Missing Shipment") y "WANTED: Baron Longshore" 63.36.
11) Ve a the goblin en docks y entrega "The Missing Shipment" (63.38, #6 on map), acepta the next part.
12) Vuelve en engineering building y entrega "The Missing Shipment" 63.36, acepta "Stolen Booty".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[30] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Sur of Ratchet again at The Merchant Coast, do "Stolen Booty": lootea the Fragile - Do Not Drop box para Lens 64.49.  For the boots, see next paso:
02) Ve SW a bit hacia el other small pirate camp y lootea Drizzlik's Emporium box para boots 63.50.
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a XRs.
04) Ve a the orc al fondo de the watchtower y entrega "The Disruption Ends" y "Supplies for the Crossroads" 52.31.
05) Entrega (if you haven't yet) "Plainstrider Menace" (it should be done by now) 52.31, acepta "The Zhevra".  NOTES:  If "Plainstrider Menace" is not done yet, you can find a lot of Plainstriders just alrededor de the outskirts de XRs.  Also asegúrate de ser nivel 14 before continuing.
06) Sur in XRs, acepta "Consumed by Hatred" y "Lost in Battle" 52.32.
07) At this point, I make sure I have 3/4 six slot bags, if I don't, I compra them en bag vendedor /target (the southern most vendedor in XRs, 52.32).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
08) NW in Crossroads 51.29, you can possibly upgrade your weapons de the Weaponsmith.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[31] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste of XRs (grinding on zhevra, plainstriders y raptors por el camino), hacia el orc 45.28 en burrow y acepta " Kolkar Leaders" y "Centaur Bracers".
02) While focusing en following misiones, also mata any Plainstriders, Centaur, Raptors y Zhevra por el camino, but don't make them your main focus...
03) Farmea your way to The Forgotten Pools y haz "The Forgotten Pools": discover the fissure under the water 45.23.  Also start working on (or finish?) "Fungal Spores": lootea the Laden Mushrooms alrededor de The Forgotten Pools.    ALTERNATE ROUTE CHOICE:  Some classes can get away without needing to get all the shrooms for "Fungal Spores" right now, or for other classes that can get away without needing to ve a TB at lvl 16 para nuevas habilidades/hechizos y wait to lvl 20 to get them instead.  This choice dramatically changes the route below para 16-20 sections.  Speedlevelers may want to skip going to TB at 16 y get their spells/abilities instead at lvl 20 to save travel time.  With all that being said, choose your route:
04) Choose Your Route: Fungal Spores Incomplete / TB at 20
05) Do "Kolkar Leaders": farmea your way to Barak Kodobane 43.23 /target, y mata y lootea a him.  NOTE:  "Centaur Bracers" does not need to be completed now.
06) Ve NW to The Dry Hills y haz "Harpy Raiders": mata y lootea a the harpies alrededor de 41.19.  Watch out there is an Rare Elite /target that wanders alrededor de en area.
07) Farmea your way oeste (at 35.28 in The Barrens) y acepta "Goblin Invaders" y "Avenge My Village".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[32] = {title = [[16 Stonetalon Mountains]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste into Stonetalon Mountains y haz "Avenge My Village": mata the required amount of Grimtotem taurens alrededor de 81.90.  TIP:  Mata the Grimtotem Sorcerers first as they do a lot of damage.
02) Vuelve y entrega "Avenge My Village" 35.28, acepta "Kill Grundig Darkcloud".
03) Vuelve into Stonetalon, to el camino that goes up into Grimtotem post hill entrance 76.89.   NOTE:  If this entrance is to tough for you luego a safer entrance is at 72.87 (which will also clear el camino para future escolta a coming up).
04) Do "Kill Grundig Darkcloud": mata 6 Grimtotem Brutes y also mata Grundig Darkcloud /target, he is standing en pasos afuera the hut 74.86.
05) Acepta y haz the escolta a misión there ("Protect Kaya" 73.86 en hut). TIPS:  Make bandages during the escolta a.  When reaching down to Camp Aparaje, mata the Ruffian detrás de big totem before the final fight starts.  Try to keep aggro off of Kaya Flathoof, as she has low HP.   Mata the Sorcerer first that pops out during the one battle you have to fight.  If it's too hard for you, skip it.
06) Once done, vuelve y entrega (if you did it) "Protect Kaya" (at 35.28 in The Barrens, #2 on map), acepta "Kaya's Alive".  Also entrega "Kill Grundig Darkcloud".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[33] = {title = [[20 Barrens]], text = [[
01) Farmea your way hacia el orc en burrow y entrega "Kolkar Leaders" 45.28.  Acepta "Verog the Dervish".  Also entrega (if it's done) "Centaur Bracers" if not don't worry.
02) At this point, make sure "The Zhevra" is finished, mata y lootea a Zhevra while you work your way hacia el XRs...
03) Ve a XRs y entrega all misiones y acepta new ones:  Entrega (If it's completa) "Fungal Spores" 51.30 (junto a Wind Rider Master).  SKIP (if it's available) "Apothecary Zamah" (for now).
04) Ve up en watchtower y entrega "Harpy Raiders" 52.31, acepta "Harpy Lieutenants".
05) If you finished "Raptor Thieves", turn it in junto a Posada 52.30, acepta "Stolen Silver".  If not, don't worry, I will mention when it needs to be finished.
06) At Sergra Darkthorn entrega "The Zhevra" 52.31, acepta "Prowlers of the Barrens".
07) Sur in XRs, entrega "The Forgotten Pools" 52.32, acepta "The Stagnant Oasis".  Luego junto a you, get repaired/resupplied de the Clothier.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[34] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Make sure you are upgraded to lvl 15 food/water!
02) Ve NW of XRs y haz "Prowlers of the Barrens" along with "Raptor Thieves" (if you still need to): mata y lootea a raptors y Savannah Prowlers starting at 42.29, luego work your way al norte.  Look para green grassy areas para Prowlers.  Work your way hacia el next paso:
03) Ve al norte to The Dry Hills (harpy camp) y haz "Harpy Lieutenants" alrededor de 40.17: mata y lootea a the Witchwing Slayers (they are the only ones that drop the rings).  Watch out there is an Rare Elite /target that wanders alrededor de en area.
04) Farmea este y you can get repaired/resupplied de Vrang Wildgore junto a hut 44.12.
05) Farmea your way este y haz "Samophlange": clear the Venture Co. enemigos out de area, luego click en Control Console 52.12 to entrega the misión y acepta the next part.  Do the next part by clicking en 3 Valves alrededor de the research facility.  Luego click en Control Console again to turn it in y acepta the next part. (See Video of whole misión chain) See next paso:
06) Ve NE a bit y haz the next part of "Samophlange": mata y lootea a Tinkerer Sniggles /target (en hut, 53.10).
07) Vuelve a the research facility's Control Console 52.12 to entrega "Samophlange" (#5 on map), acepta the next part.
08) Ve NE to The Sludge Fen at Wizzlecrank's Shredder 56.7 y acepta "Ignition".  NOTE:  This shredder may currently be in an escolta a, if this is the case keep grinding on enemigos until the escolta a completes luego acepta this.
09) Ve up hasta lo alto de the building en middle de pond y haz "Ignition": mata y lootea a Supervisor Lugwizzle /target (he patrols alrededor de en top alrededor de 56.9).
10) Vuelve down to Wizzlecrank's Shredder (56.7, #8 on map) y entrega (as long as he is currently not in an escolta a) "Ignition".  Luego acepta y haz the escolta a "The Escape" by escorting the shredder out of The Sludge Fen.  (See video on how I do Ignition y Escape)
11) Ve NE to Boulder Lode Mine y haz "Miner's Fortune" 62.6: mata y lootea a the enemigos there until the Cats Eye Emerald drops.  NOTE:  The enemigos afuera of la mina can drop the emerald también (it's a low drop rate).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[35] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) ORC & TROLL ONLY:  Farmea your way sur hacia el watchtower y entrega (if you have it) "The Demon Seed" 62.20.
02) Continue sur to Ratchet y en engineering building entrega "Stolen Booty" 63.36.
03) Near the Flight Master 63.37, entrega "The Escape" y "Samophlange".  Acepta "Ziz Fizziks" , SKIP "Wenikee Boltbucket".
04) At the goblin en docks, entrega "Miner's Fortune" 63.38.
05) By the Bank 62.38 acepta "Deepmoss Spider Eggs".  And entrega (if it is completa) "Raptor Horns".  Luego en hut junto a you, asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en.
06) Entrega (if it's done) "Chen's Empty Keg" (male orc junto a Plate-n-Chain hut, 62.38), acepta the next part.  If it's not done yet, don't worry.
07) Ve oeste of Ratchet, y haz "The Stagnant Oasis": click en Bubbling Fissure down in el lago 56.43.  Also continue working on "Fungal Spores" (if you still need to): lootea Laden Mushrooms alrededor de el lago (y it doesn't need to be completed now).
08) Ve oeste a bit y haz "Verog the Dervish": by mata/looting Verog the Dervish (spawns at 53.42 /target).  NOTE:  Verog spawns in randomly when a centaur has been killed alrededor de the area, y there will be a yell notice to let you know he spawns in.  Also, make sure "Centaur Bracers" is finished.
09) Ve a XRs y entrega "The Stagnant Oasis" (sur in XRs, 52.32), acepta "Altered Beings".  NOTE:  If the Dried Seeds is still in your bags, you can destroy it, as it now has no use.
10) At Sergra Darkthorn entrega "Prowlers of the Barrens" 52.31, acepta "Echeyakee".
11) Junto a Posada, entrega (if it's completa) "Raptor Thieves" 52.30, acepta "Stolen Silver".
12) At the bottom de watchtower, acepta "Report to Kadrak" 52.31.
13) Sube por watchtower y entrega "Harpy Lieutenants" 52.31, acepta "Serena Bloodfeather".
14) 13b) Drop down y entrega (If it's completa) "Fungal Spores" (junto a Wind Rider Master, 51.30).  SKIP (if it's available) "Apothecary Zamah" (for now).
15) Get repaired/resupplied NW in XRs en Forge/blacksmith area 51.29.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[36] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #12]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste de XRs hacia el orc 45.28 en burrow y entrega "Verog the Dervish" y (if you still need to) "Centaur Bracers", acepta "Hezrul Bloodmark".
02) Farmea your way norte to The Dry Hills (harpy camp) y haz "Serena Bloodfeather": far back in el campamento, mata y lootea a Serena Bloodfeather 39.12 /target.
03) Ve este (farmea enemigos por el camino) y haz "Echeyakee": use your Horn of Echeyakee misión item en kodo bones 56.17, luego mata y lootea a Echeyakee /target (See Video).  Also make sure "Raptor Thieves" is finished now (mata y lootea a raptors if you still need to).
04) Usa la piedra de hogar a XRs.  Get resupplied en Posada.
05) At Sergra Darkthorn, entrega "Echeyakee" 52.31, acepta "The Angry Scytheclaws".
06) Junto a Posada, entrega (if you still need to) "Raptor Thieves" 52.30, acepta "Stolen Silver".
07) Ve hasta lo alto de the watchtower y entrega "Serena Bloodfeather" 52.31.  Acepta "Letter to Jin'Zil".
08) Ve SW to The Lushwater Oasis y haz "Altered Beings" along with "Hezrul Bloodmark": mata y lootea a the Oasis Snapjaw (turtles) in y alrededor de el lago alrededor de 46.38.  Also mata y lootea a Hezrul Bloodmark /target, he patrols clockwise alrededor de el lago.  TIPS:  Try to avoid the gray lvl enemigos.  If you can't find Hezrul in time, the misión can be skipped.  Also finish "Fungal Spores" (if you still need to): lootea Laden Mushrooms alrededor de el lago.
09) Ve SE hacia el Raptor Grounds y haz "Stolen Silver" along with continuing (if you still need to) "Raptor Horns": mata y lootea a raptors y lootea the Stolen Silver cofre 58.54. (See Video)
10) Ve NW y haz "The Angry Scytheclaws" alrededor de 52.46: mata y lootea a raptors for Sunscale Feathers, luego use them en 3 Raptor nests.  Make sure "Raptor Horns" is completa now también.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[37] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #13]], text = [[
01) Ve SW cruzando main path/bridge (to 49.50) y haz "Lost in Battle" (Manrik's Wife): She's laying dead by the hut. Simply examine the Beaten Corpse.
02) Ve oeste alrededor de 50.53 y see if a lvl 22 gray kodo named Lakota'mani /target is there y mata y lootea a him.  He might also be en right side de main path alrededor de 47.51.  He drops Hoof of Lakota'mani which starts "Lakota'mani", acepta it if you can spot him soon (if not you can try again later)..
03) Farmea sur to Camp Taurajo (CT) y acepta "Weapons of Choice" (by the Forge, 45.58).
04) Entrega (if you have it) "Lakota'mani" 45.59.
05) At the quilboar en cage acepta "Tribes at War" 45.59. And get the FP there junto a you de the Wind Rider Master.  Get resupplied while in town.  NOTE:  Don't sell Blood Shards to a vendedor.
06) Ve norte to Agama'gor y haz "Tribes at War" along with "Consumed by Hatred" alrededor de 43.46: mata y lootea a the Bristlebacks (Quilboar).  The Geomancers are norte en area alrededor de 43.47, Thornweavers are en middle alrededor de 44.52 y Water Seekers are sur alrededor de 45.54.  If you ve a the area este de main path alrededor de 53.54 they are evenly spaced out there.
07) Ve sur to CT y entrega (if you have it) "Lakota'mani" (45.59, #4 on map).
08) Ve a the quilboar en cage y entrega "Tribes at War" (45.59, #5 on map).  Acepta "Blood Shards of Agamaggan" y luego talk hacia el NPC to turn it in. Luego acepta "Betrayal from Within"  NOTE:  You can entrega Blood Shards for ability boosts here.  You can entrega multiple y they will stack.  Save Blood Shards for later (I recommend storing them en mailbox y use some para next paso).
09) At this point, asegúrate de estar al menos a 5 bars away de nivel 20.  If you aren't luego I recommend grinding on Bristlebacks (Quilboar, #6 on map) to obtain Wool Cloth so you can get skill 115 for Heavy Wool Bandage sooner.  You can also farmea on beasts alrededor de where Lakota'mani is at (alrededor de 47.51, #2 on map).  You can use some Blood Shards to help the farmea.  NOTES:  Instead de grinding, you could get a 5 man group y haz the Wailing Caverns dungeon 46.36.  Also make sure "Chen's Empty Keg" (part 2 is finished by now if you still need to).
10) De CT, vuela a XRs (or corre there if you are close by).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[38] = {title = [[Tauren - Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Next to XR's Posada, entrega "Stolen Silver" 52.30.
02) At Sergra Darkthorn entrega "The Angry Scytheclaws" 52.31, acepta "Jorn Skyseer".
03) 03b) Sur in XR's, entrega "Consumed by Hatred" y "Lost in Battle" 52.32.
04) Across el camino, entrega "Altered Beings" 52.32.  Asegúrate de ser nivel 20 now y repaired/resupplied junto a you en Clothier.
05) By the Wind Rider Master 52.30 acepta "Apothecary Zamah".  NOTE: Work somewhat quickly con next number of pasos as this misión is on a timer!
06) At the Wind Rider Master junto a you, vuela a Camp Taurajo, The Barrens.
07) At CT, entrega "Jorn Skyseer" 45.59, acepta "Ishamuhale".  Also acepta "Melor Sends Word".
08) Sigue el camino oeste into Mulgore y as you entra en on your right alrededor de 67.59, die on purpose, luego res at spirit.  If you are a Tauren, just vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore y skip hacia el TB section below.
09) At Mulgore, sigue el camino norte y luego get on a Lift (at 32.66 in Mulgore) to go into Thunder Bluff.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[39] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #17]], text = [[
01) As you do the following pasos in TB keep an eye out for Bluff Runner Windstrider /target y acepta "The Ashenvale Hunt" if you see him (optional, not required misión).  He patrols alrededor de TB, see patrol path on map:
02) Ve a the weapon master 41.63 y get new weapon possibilities.
03) Entrega (if you have it) "Melor Sends Word" (on The Hunter's Rise, 62.81), luego acepta "Steelsnap".
04) Get New Abilities, 3b) Get new spells/abilities.
05) NON TAURENS:  Ve hasta lo alto de la torre en middle of TB y get the FP de the Wind Rider Master 47.50.
06) Ve a the Pools of Vision cueva underneath The Spirit Rise (entrance is 30.30) y entrega "Apothecary Zamah" 23.21.
07) Above The Spirit Rise, upgrade First Aid de the First Aid Trainer 30.21.  NOTE:  You need skill 80 for Wool Bandage y skill 115 for Heavy Wool Bandage.
08) Nivel 20 Mounts, 7b)  At nivel 20 mounts become available.  If you happen to be nivel 20 y if you have the gold luego get your mount ASAP.  It differs depending on your class & race y it costs roughly 5 gold.  Check out my Mount Guide on where to find your mount entrenador & vendedor.
09) Hearth back to XRs.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[40] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #20]], text = [[
01) Ve a XR's Wind Rider Master 52.30 y vuela a Ratchet (este of XRs).
02) By Ratchet's Bank, entrega (if you still need to) "Raptor Horns" 62.38.  Acepta (if you haven't yet) "Deepmoss Spider Eggs".
03) Entrega (if you still need to) "Chen's Empty Keg" (male orc junto a Plate-n-Chain hut, 62.38), acepta the next part.
04) N/A
05) N/A
06) N/A
07) N/A
08) Usa la piedra de hogar a XRs.   Or if Hearthstone is still on a cooldown, vuela a XRs (Flight Master is at 63.37 in Ratchet).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
09) Ve oeste de the XR's hacia el orc en burrow y entrega (if you did it) "Hezrul Bloodmark" 45.28. NOTE:  SKIP "Counterattack!" (requires group y can fail or take to long for xp/time).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[41] = {title = [[21 Stonetalon Mountains - First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!! - Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)]], text = [[
01) Corre oeste into Stonetalon Mountains.  When you get there take el camino (starting at 82.98 in Stonetalon)..
02) Ve a the witch doctor en small cueva y entrega (if you have it) "Letter to Jin'Zil" 75.98.  Acepta "Jin'Zil's Forest Magic".
03) At the other side de village, acepta "Blood Feeders" 71.95.
04) Ve NW hacia el Wanted Poster: Besseleth y acepta "Arachnophobia" 59.76.
05) Sigue el camino oeste to Sishir Canyon alrededor de 54.76 y start working on "Deepmoss Spider Eggs" (lootea Deepmoss Eggs) y haz part of "Blood Feeders": mata 10 Deepmoss Creepers (the Deepmoss Venomspitters does not need to be completed now).  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
06) Oeste in Sishir Canyon do "Arachnophobia": mata y lootea a Besseleth (lvl 21 orange spider, with several possible spawn locations: 55.72 53.72 52.74, /target ).
07) Ve norte to Windshear Crag y entrega "Ziz Fizziks" en goblin en hut 59.63, acepta "Super Reaper 6000".
08) Do "Goblin Invaders", "Super Reaper 6000" y finish up "Deepmoss Spider Eggs" y "Blood Feeders" alrededor de Windshear Crag: mata the Venture Co. Loggers, mata y lootea a the Venture Co. Operators until the Blueprints drop (its a low drop rate).  Also lootea the Deepmoss Eggs y mata Deepmoss Venomspitters.  NOTES:  There are a lot of operators en big tank shredder, 63.54 y more alrededor de other structures en area.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
09) There is a goblin merchant hacia el oeste in Windshear Crag 58.52 that you can get repaired/resupplied at.
10) Vuelve a the goblin en hut y entrega "Super Reaper 6000" (59.63, #7 on map), acepta "Further Instructions".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[42] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Head to Sun Rock Retreat y en tauren junto a Posada entrega "Arachnophobia" 47.61.
02) Justo al norte de you en female tauren, entrega (if you have it) "Kaya's Alive" 47.58.  Also acepta "Cycle of Rebirth".
03) Oeste en village, get the FP de the Wind Rider Master 45.60.  Luego junto a you de the Bowyer 45.59 under the red tent, asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en.
04) Corre up the little pathway SW in Sun Rock Retreat, make a left at 45.63 y luego acepta "Trouble in the Deeps" 47.64.
05) N/A
06) Ve este hacia el small village of Malaka'Jin y entrega "Blood Feeders" 71.95.  You can get resupplied en village 74.95.
07) Corre este y entrega "Goblin Invaders" (at 35.28 in The Barrens).  Acepta "Shredding Machines".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[43] = {title = [[23 Southern Barrens]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a XRs.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) Oeste in XRs, acepta "Egg Hunt" 51.30.
03) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 52.30 y vuela a Camp Taurajo, The Barrens.
04) Entrega (if you haven't yet ) "Jorn Skyseer" 45.59, acepta (if you haven't yet) "Ishamuhale".  And (if you haven't yet) acepta "Melor Sends Word".
05) Entra en Posada y make CT your new home de the Innkeeper 46.59.
06) If you have Blood Shards, give them hacia el quilboar en cage 45.59.
07) First go sur of CT alrededor de 46.62 to see if a blue thunderlizard named Owatanka /target is roaming alrededor de the area y mata y lootea a him.  If he is not there luego ve check este cruzando main path (he could patrol randomly alrededor de the este area alrededor de 49.60).  He drops Owatanka's Tailspike which starts "Owatanka", acepta it.  NOTE:  If you've been grinding for awhile looking for Owatanka, luego regresa a CT to entrega the misión, get resupplied y refresh your Blood Shard buffs.
08) Ve sur y haz "Egg Hunt": lootea the Silithid Mounds.   NOTE:  There is a rare mob called Silithid Harvester (at alrededor de 43.70 or alrededor de 48.70, /target) that drops an item which starts "The Harvester", acepta it if you are able to mata this mob.  This rare has a 2 hour 45 min respawn, so he may not be there.  You can try again later en nivel 25 Southern Barrens section below.
09) As you focus en follow misiones below, also start working on "Chen's Empty Keg" by mata/looting the Stormhides, Greater Thunderhawks y kodos por el camino.  Also if you corre across a reddish thunderhawk named Washte Pawne /target, mata y lootea a him, he drops Washte Pawne's Feather, which starts "Washte Pawne", acepta it.  Washte Pawne randomly wonders alrededor de Blackthorn Ridge (or hacia el este de main path).
10) Ve sur to Blackthorn Ridge y haz "Betrayal from Within" along with "Weapons of Choice": mata the Razormane Seers para Wand, Razormane Warfrenzy para Shield, y the Razormane Pathfinder para Backstabber.  Also, mata y lootea a the 3 named enemigos, Kuz wonders alrededor de (alrededor de 45.80 /target), see below para other named enemigos to mata...
11) Mata y lootea a Lok Orcbane up en tent (40.81 /target).
12) Mata y lootea a Nak en middle de field (alrededor de 44.83 /target).  Watch out para stealthed enemigos en area!
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[44] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #05]], text = [[
01) Once done, go find the tauren Gann Stonespire /target, he patrols up y down the main path hacia el right of Blackthorn Ridge alrededor de 46.81.  De him, acepta "Gann's Reclamation".
02) Ve al sur to Bael Modan (entrance is 47.85)...
03) Do "Gann's Reclamation": mata the Bael'dun dwarves y mata y lootea a Prospector Khazgorm down in Bael Modan 48.86.
04) Find the tauren Gann Stonespire /target along the main path (alrededor de 46.81, #1 on map) y entrega "Gann's Reclamation", acepta "Revenge of Gann".
05) Make sure "Chen's Empty Keg" is finished by mata/looting the Stormhides, Greater Thunderhawks y kodos.
06) Usa la piedra de hogar a Camp Taurajo.  NOTE:  DONT vendedor items yet!
07) Norte at CT by the Forge, entrega "Weapons of Choice" 45.58.
08) Entrega (if you haven't yet) "Owatanka", "Washte Pawne" y (if you did it) "The Harvester" 45.59.
09) Ve a the quilboar en cage y entrega "Betrayal from Within" 45.59, acepta the next part.
10) At the Wind Rider Master 44.59 junto a you, vuela a XRs.
11) Oeste in XRs, entrega "Egg Hunt" 51.30.  After turning this in you can destroy any remaining Silithid Eggs left.
12) Ve a the orc al fondo de the watchtower y entrega "Betrayal from Within" 52.31.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied now.
13) Ve este (above Ratchet) y haz "Ishamuhale".  First find y mata y lootea a a Zhevra por el camino there.  Luego usa el/la Fresh Zhevra Carcass misión item en dead tree 60.30, luego mata y lootea a Ishamuhale /target when he appears.
14) Ve SE to Ratchet y junto a bank entrega "Deepmoss Spider Eggs" 62.38.  NOTE:  If you have any leftover Deepmoss Eggs, you can destroy them.
15) Entrega "Chen's Empty Keg" (male orc junto a Plate-n-Chain hut, 62.38).  NOTE:  This misión is now repeatable, but you do not get additional XP de it.
16) Junto a Flight Master entrega "Further Instructions" 63.37, acepta the next part.
17) At the Flight Master 63.37 junto a you vuela a Sun Rock Retreat, Stonetalon Mountains.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[45] = {title = [[25 Stonetalon Mountains]], text = [[
01) At Sun Rock Retreat, acepta Cenarius' Legacy" at the blood elf 46.60.
02) At the tauren by the Inn, accept "Harpies Threaten" 47.61.
03) Go in the Inn next to you and make Sun Rock Retreat your new home from the Innkeeper 47.62.  NOTE: Upstairs in the Inn is a vendor 48.62 that can sell healing/mana potions (on a timer).
04) Follow the path SW of Sun Rock Retreat entrance 45.62 and from the water elemental, accept "Elemental War" 47.64.
05) Go north to Mirkfallon Lake around 50.43 and do "Cycle of Rebirth": loot Gaea Seeds from the ground around the lake.  Also start working on "Jin'Zil's Forest Magic" by kill/looting the deer around the lake.
06) Work your way north while kill/looting deer & saps for "Jin'Zil's Forest Magic".  Once you get to Stonetalon Peak around 36.13 do "Cenarius' Legacy": kill the Cenarion night elf mobs around the middle of Stonetalon Peak.  Keep the next step in mind:
07) Go to the south and west side of Stonetalon Peak and finish up "Jin'Zil's Forest Magic": kill the deer, cats (west), saps (south), and fey dragons.  There are 3 spawn locations for the fey dragons, (see map for locations).
08) Once done, Hearth to Sun Rock Retreat, get resupplied at Innkeeper, then go to the goblin in the hut and turn in "Further Instructions" 59.63, accept "Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[46] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Ve norte into Windshear Crag y haz "Shredding Machines": mata the two shredder machines.  XT:9 patrols alrededor de the sur side of el río in Windshear Crag y XT:4 patrols alrededor de the norte side of el río alrededor de 65.46.  TIP:  Usa /target xt to find either of them.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
02) N/A
03) Ve NE to el camino at 70.41...
04) Do "Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle": sigue el camino up hacia el construction site y go down to mata y lootea a Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle (has several spawn locations en platforms alrededor de 64.40 /target). (See Video)
05) Vuelve a the goblin en hut y entrega "Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle" 59.63.
06) N/A
07) N/A
08) Ve SE hacia el witch doctor in la cueva y entrega "Jin'Zil's Forest Magic" 75.98.
09) Ve este hacia el border of Stonetalon & Barrens y entrega "Shredding Machines" (35.28 in The Barrens).
10) Hearth if you can, if not consider waiting until you can hearth or just corre back to Sun Rock Retreat.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[47] = {title = [[Tauren - Mulgore]], text = [[
01) At the female tauren, entrega "Cycle of Rebirth" 47.58.  Acepta "New Life".
02) At the blood elf, entrega "Cenarius' Legacy" 46.60, SKIP "Ordanus".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Ve a el camino SW in Sun Rock Retreat entrance 45.62 y continue following it SW into The Charred Vale alrededor de 37.67 y haz "Harpies Threaten" along with "Elemental War" y "New Life": mata y lootea a the fire elementals, click en Gaea Dirt Mounds en ground y mata the harpies.  NOTE: All these are evenly done throughout The Charred Vale, but the Bloodfury Harpy & Bloodfury Ambushers are norte, while the Bloodfury Slayers & Bloodfury Roguefeathers are sur.
04) Once they are all done, asegúrate de estar al menos a 4 bars away de nivel 25, so you may have to farmea a little, luego ve a el camino that leads back to Sun Rock Retreat 38.68...
05) Ve a the water elemental y entrega "Elemental War" 47.64.
06) Drop down y de the tauren by the Posada, entrega "Harpies Threaten" 47.61, SKIP "Bloodfury Bloodline" (for now).  Acepta "Calling in the Reserves".
07) Just norte a bit en female tauren, entrega "New Life" (47.58, #2 on map).
08) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
09) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 45.60 y vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore. BLOOD ELVES:  Blood elves who did Ghostlands will need to vuela a Camp Taurajo, luego head oeste into Mulgore, luego ve NW to get to Thunder Bluff 36.30.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[48] = {title = [[Thunder Bluff]], text = [[
01) Ve este a bit hacia el Cooking Trainer (51.53 in TB) y get Apprentice Cook.  NOTE:  Make sure you get this side profession so you can do an easy entrega XP misión at nivel 30 Hillsbrad.
02) Just este a bit by the Bonfire, acepta "The sacred Flame" 55.51.
03) Entrega (if you haven't yet) "Melor Sends Word" (on The Hunter Rise, 62.81), acepta "Steelsnap".
04) GET NEW ABILITIES, 3b) Get new spells/abilities for your class.
05) If you still need to upgrade to Heavy Wool Bandage (requires First Aid skill 115), luego ve a the top of The Spirit Rise hacia el First Aid Trainer 30.21 to get that.
06) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master en middle of TB 47.50 y vuela a Camp Taurajo, The Barrens.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[49] = {title = [[25 Southern Barrens]], text = [[
01) Entrega "Ishamuhale" 45.59, acepta "Enraged Thunder Lizards".
02) Entra en Posada y Make CT your home de the Innkeeper 46.59.  Don't forget to upgrade to lvl 25 food/water!
03) Norte in CT by the Forge, acepta "A New Ore Sample" 45.58.  NOTE: you need to be lvl 25 to get this.
04) As you do the following pasos start working on "Enraged Thunder Lizards" by mata/looting thunderlizards (stegosaurus dinos) por el camino.  They are scattered everywhere en open fields of southern Barrens:
05) If you haven't killed/looted the mob called Silithid Harvester (alrededor de 43.70 or alrededor de 48.70 /target), luego ve give it a try right now.  This drops an item which starts "The Harvester", acepta it if you are able to mata this mob.  This has a 2 hour 45 min respawn.  If not there, it can be skipped.
06) At Bael'dun Keep (up at 49.84) do "Revenge of Gann": mata y lootea a the Bael'dun dwarves there para items you need.  OPTIONAL GROUP QUEST HERE:  If you can find the help of one other player, luego down y SE de Bael'dun Keep entrance is a misión giver junto a a tent 49.86 that gives "The Tear of the Moons".  This is done down en keep by looting General Twinbraid's Strongbox down 49.84 frente a fireplace.  There is a lvl 30 mob y numerous other dwarf enemigos en area.  If done, turn it in.
07) Find the tauren Gann Stonespire patrolling along the main path (alrededor de 46.81 /target) y entrega "Revenge of Gann", acepta the next part.
08) Do "Revenge of Gann": go sur to Bael Modan y click en Bael Modan Flying Machine on top de small tower 47.86.  NOTE:  You can be about 30 yards away to activate it.
09) Vuelve a the tauren Gann Stonespire along the main path (alrededor de 46.81, #7 on map, /target) y entrega "Revenge of Gann".
10) Make sure "Enraged Thunder Lizards" is finished: mata y lootea a thunderlizards (stegosaurus dinos) scattered everywhere en open fields of southern Barrens.
11) Head sur de main path to The Great Lift (at 44.92 in The Barrens) y entrega "Calling in the Reserves".  Next to you there, acepta (if it's available) "Message to Freewind Post" 32.22.
12) Baja por Lift to entra en Thousand Needles...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[50] = {title = [[26 Thousand Needles]], text = [[
01) First off, keep an eye out para Galak Messenger /target y mata y lootea a this centaur when you see him in 1k Needles.  He has a very large patrol path.  He drops an item which starts "Assassination Plot", acepta it (if you can).  But, don't intentionally do this yet, continue on con next paso:
02) Ve a the Lift, to go up to Freewind Post (47.48 in Thousand Needles).
03) Once up at Freewind Post, by the Bonfire entrega (f you have it) "Message to Freewind Post" 46.51, acepta "Pacify the Centaur".
04) De the Wanted Poster - Arnak Grimtotem junto a Posada, acepta "Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem" 46.51.
05) TBC, 4a) Next to you de the female blood elf acepta "A Different Approach" 46.50.
06) On the oeste side of Freewind Post, acepta "Alien Egg" 45.50.
07) NW at Freewind Post, acepta "Wind Rider" 45.49.  Next to you there, get the FP de the Wind Rider Master.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
08) Vuelve down the Lift (47.48, #2 on map).
09) Ve just norte to Splithoof Crag y haz "Pacify the Centaur": mata the required amount of Galak Centaur alrededor de 46.43.
10) As you work este start working on "A New Ore Sample": mata y lootea a the Gravelsnout Surveyors or Gravelsnout Diggers /target until an Unrefined Ore Sample drops.  NOTES:  The drop rate is about 20%, but there are only a few of these mob spawns all alrededor de 1k Needles al fondo de the pinnacles.  Don't intentionally try to find this right now, but keep this in mind while in 1k needles (y future trips back to 1k needles). If you can't find the ore sample luego this can be skipped for now.  You'll have easier opportunities to try again later:
11) Sube por mountain ramp (entrance is este at 55.44)...
12) Once you get hacia el top in la cueva, acepta y haz "Test of Faith" 54.41.  Once teleported, simply jump (or walk) off the wooden plank to completa the misión, luego turn it in, SKIP "Test of Endurance" (Elite).
13) TBC, 11a) Ve este starting alrededor de 64.48 y haz "A Different Approach": mata y lootea a Thundering Boulderkin para 2 Purifying Earths.  There are only 6-8 spawns (see map).  100% drop rate.
14) Do "Alien Egg": lootea an Alien Egg.  This egg has several possible spawn points (either: 56.50 52.55 38.56).
15) Make sure you are at least 2 bars away de nivel 26, luego ve get en Lift to vuelve a Freewind Post ( 47.49, #2 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[51] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) At Freewind Post, junto a Bonfire entrega "Pacify the Centaur" (46.51, #3 on map), acepta "Grimtotem Spying".
02) Oeste in Freewind Post entrega "Alien Egg" 45.50.  Acepta "Serpent Wild".
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a Camp Taurajo.
04) Entrega (if you did it) "A New Ore Sample" (norte in CT en Forge, 45.58 in The Barrens).
05) Entrega "Enraged Thunder Lizards" (acepta "Cry of the Thunderhawk"), (if you have it) "Washte Pawne" y (if you did it) "The Harvester" 45.59.
06) Ve just sur of CT alrededor de 45.64 y haz "Cry of the Thunderhawk": mata y lootea a a Thunderhawk /target.  6 spawns alrededor de CT (see map).  Drop rate is 100%.
07) Vuelve a CT y entrega "Cry of the Thunderhawk" (45.59, #5 on map), SKIP "Mahren Skyseer".
08) Ve a the Wind Rider Master at CT 44.59 y vuela a   Crossroads, The Barrens.
09) Ve norte y entrega "Report to Kadrak" (up en watchtower 48.5), SKIP "The Warsong Reports".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[52] = {title = [[27 Ashenvale]], text = [[
01) Ve a Splintertree Post y entrega (if you have the initial misión) "The Ashenvale Hunt" 74.61.  Luego acepta y turn it in again.
02) Get the Flight Path there de the Wind Rider Master 73.62.
03) You can get repaired/resupplied de Burkrum 74.60 junto a Posada.
04) Junto a Posada, acepta "Stonetalon Standstill" 74.60.
05) Entra en Posada y make Splintertree Post your new home de the Innkeeper 74.61.
06) TBC, 6b) At the outskirts of Splintertree Post, entrega (if you have it) "Report to Splintertree Post" 71.68.
07) Acepta "Ashenvale Outrunners" 71.68.
08) Justo al sur de Splintertree Post, mata the first de three enemigos related hacia el Ashenvale hunt: Sharptalon /target.  This lvl 31 blue hippogryph (patrols alrededor de y spawns at alrededor de 75.70).  This mob drops an item, which starts "Sharptalon's Claw", acepta it.  TIP:  An easy way to mata this mob is to bring his health to a 3rd left, luego drag him into the guardias at Splintertree Post, they will finish em.
09) Justo al sur de Splintertree Post, do "Ashenvale Outrunners": mata 9 Ashenvale Outrunners /target.
10) Ve slightly oeste y haz the escolta a misión "Torek's Assault" (starts at 68.75): escolta a Torek /target & his raiders oeste into the Silverwing Outpost.
11) Ve oeste to Mystral Lake y haz "Stonetalon Standstill": mata 12 Befouled Water Elementals alrededor de el lago y discover the gazebo en small island en middle of el lago 49.70.  Also, make sure you find y mata y lootea a Tideress /target, this water elemental patrols alrededor de under el lago, he drops an item which starts "The Befouled Element", acepta it.
12) Mata the next mob related hacia el Ashenvale Hunt: Ursangous /target, this bear patrols clockwise alrededor de the mountain y trees alrededor de 42.68.  He drops an item, which starts "Ursangous's Paw", acepta it.
13) Mata the last mob related hacia el Ashenvale Hunt: Shadumbra /target, this black panther patrols alrededor de alrededor de 57.56.  This cat drops an item, which starts "Shadumbra's Head", acepta it.
14) Do "The Sacred Flame".  First mata y lootea a the Laughing Sisters alrededor de Raynewood Retreat alrededor de 59.55 until you get an Etched Phial (low drop rate), luego see next paso...
15) Usa el/la misión item Etched Phial en Moonwell al sur 60.73.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[53] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #15]], text = [[
01) Hearth (or corre back) to Splintertree Post.
02) Right afuera the Posada on your left entrega the 3 Ashenvale Hunt misiones: "Sharptalon's Claw", "Ursangous's Paw" y "Shadumbra's Head" 74.61.  Luego acepta y completa "The Hunt Completed".
03) Junto a Posada, entrega "Stonetalon Standstill" y "The Befouled Element" 74.60, acepta "Je'neu of the Earthen Ring".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) At the orc junto a western watchtower, entrega "Torek's Assault" 73.62.
05) At the outskirts of Splintertree Post, entrega "Ashenvale Outrunners" 71.68.
06) The goal now is to go all the way hacia el other side of Ashenvale, to Zoram Strand (follow path on map) y luego get the Flight Path there de the Wind Rider Master 12.34.  NOTE: Once you get to Astranaar 37.55(alliance town), go sur of it to get alrededor de it.
07) At Zoram 'gar Outpost, first acepta "Vorsha the Lasher" (starts frente a bigger tent 12.35) (IMPORTANT:  This starts an escolta a.  If he is not there you can try later en guide.  Do the next few pasos quickly en village before following Muglash para escolta a:
08) entrega "Je'neu of the Earthen Ring" 12.34 (up in hut).   Also entrega "Trouble in the Deeps" 12.34, SKIP "The Essence of Aku'Mai" (Blackfathom Deeps dungeon).
09) De the troll up en other tent, acepta "Troll Charm" 12.35.   De the female troll junto a you, acepta "Naga at the Zoram Strand" 12.35 (no exclamation mark).
10) De the orc junto a Cauldron acepta "Between a Rock and a Thistlefur" 12.35.
11) Do the escolta a you previously accepted (if you were able to) "Vorsha the Lasher": follow y protect Muglash /target until you can click en Naga Brazier, luego after a few waves of Naga enemigos, mata Vorsha the Lasher. (See Video).   Do this along with "Naga at the Zoram Strand" by mata/looting Naga along la costa.
12) Farmea your way hacia el Thistlefur Hold cueva (entrance is 39.31) killing enemigos for "Between a Rock and a Thistlefur".  Also, before getting to la cueva, make sure Rorgish Jowl /target is dead.  He is a rare mob that patrols alrededor de (before la cueva entrance) making your future escolta a misión difficult.  He has a 5.5 hour respawn.
13) In la cueva do "Troll Charm": lootea the Troll Chests en ground.  Luego, en back of la cueva, de the white bear en cage 42.35, acepta y try to do the escolta a misión "Freedom to Ruul".  You may have to fight 3-5 enemigos at once several times, if you fail luego it can be skipped.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[54] = {title = [[Tauren - Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Make sure "Between a Rock and a Thistlefur" is finished, luego ve back to Zoram Strand y luego make sure "Naga at the Zoram Strand" is finished by mata/looting naga along la costa, luego entrega "Vorsha the Lasher" 12.34.  NOTE:  If you didn't do "Vorsha the Lasher" previously you can try now.
02) (click to show instructions):
03) At the orc junto a Cauldron, entrega "Between a Rock and a Thistlefur" 12.35.
04) Up en tent, entrega "Troll Charm" 12.35.   De the female troll junto a you, entrega "Naga at the Zoram Strand" 12.35.
05) Usa la piedra de hogar a Splintertree Post.
06) In the Posada, entrega (if you did it) "Freedom to Ruul" 74.61.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) TBC, 5a) If you are nivel 27 go norte in Splintertree Post y acepta "Destroy the Legion" 73.60 (if not we will get this in a bit).
08) N/A
09) TBC, 7a) If you have not accepted "Destroy the Legion" 73.60 at Splintertree Post, luego ve there to acepta it (requires nivel 27).
10) TBC, 7b) Ve SE to Felfire Hill alrededor de 80.68 y haz "Destroy the Legion": mata the required amount of demons.  While doing this misión you may find an item (low drop rate) which starts "Diabolical Plans", acepta it (if you can).  If you can't find it luego skip it.
11) N/A
12) TBC, 8a) Corre back to Splintertree Post (don't hearth) y entrega "Destroy the Legion" (73.60, #5 on map).  If you found an item that started "Diabolical Plans", luego turn that in también.
13) TBC, 8b) OPTIONAL: If you were able to entrega "Diabolical Plans" luego you could acepta y haz "Never Again!" (especially if you want one de misión rewards) by going SE to Demon Fall Canyon (entrance 84.73) y killing the two named enemigos.  Gorgannon patrols alrededor de 89.77, y Diathorus the Seeker is in la cueva (entrada en 78.82), y he's far back in it at 79.85.  Cave exit is at 77.83.  Luego turn the misión in at 73.61.
14) en Wind Rider Master 73.62, vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[55] = {title = [[28 Stonetalon Mountains]], text = [[
01) NOTE: SoM (100% misión rate) will NOT do pasos 1-7 in Stonetalon!
02) Este en Bonfire, entrega "The Sacred Flame" (55.51 in TB), acepta the next part.
03) GET NEW ABILITIES, 8b) Get your nivel 28 spells/abilities.
04) Ve a TB's Posada y make Thunder Bluff your new home de the Innkeeper 46.65.
05) OPTIONAL, 9b) If you have an open 2nd profession y have not got Herbalism yet luego I recommend getting it (its only 10 copper) at 50.40.  This can help you track an item pickup for a later misión.
06) If you still need to upgrade to Heavy Wool Bandage (requires First Aid skill 115), luego ve a the top of The Spirit Rise hacia el First Aid Trainer 30.21 to get that.
07) Ve a the Wind Rider Master en lo alto de la torre en middle of TB 47.50 y vuela a Freewind Post, Thousand Needles.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[56] = {title = [[29 Thousand Needles]], text = [[
01) In the Posada, entrega "The Sacred Flame" (46.52 in Thousand Needles), acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) Take the Lift down de Freewind Post y luego ve a la cueva norte (entrance is at 44.38) y haz "The Sacred Flame": keep hugging the left side of la cueva until you get hacia el Ancient Brazier 42.31, luego lootea it (See Video).
03) REMINDER:  Keep an eye out para Galak Messenger /target y mata y lootea a this centaur when you see him in 1k Needles.  He has a very large patrol path.  He drops an item which starts "Assassination Plot", acepta it (if you can).  But, don't intentionally do this yet, continue on con next paso...
04) Farmea oeste to Whitereach Post 21.32 y entrega "Serpent Wild", acepta "Sacred Fire".  And junto a you, acepta "Hypercapacitor Gizmo".  Also entrega "A Different Approach", acepta "A Dip in the Moonwell".  NOTES:  If you have already killed Galak Messenger /target y accepted the misión de the item he dropped, luego entrega "Assassination Plot", luego acepta, do & entrega the follow up escolta a misión.  You can also get resupplied here de Laer Stepperunner /target.
05) Ve este hacia el Boiling Pool alrededor de 35.35 y haz "Sacred Fire": lootea 10 Incendia Agave de the ground y under the water. TIP: Usa Find Herbs in Spellbook (if you have it) to help you locate these easier.
06) Ve oeste y haz "Steelsnap": mata y lootea a Steelsnap /target.  This hyena patrols counter-clockwise alrededor de a somewhat large circle (starting at 18.27) y has two bodyguards.  Original spawn is in Camp E-thok 17.19. (See Video)
07) If you are still working on "A New Ore Sample", luego see if you can find the Ore Sample: mata y lootea a the Gravelsnout Surveyors /target (there are two spawns nearby to check) para Unrefined Ore Sample (see map for locations).
08) TBC, 7a) Ve oeste y entra en the bottom mountain ramp entrance 12.19, luego do "A Dip in the Moonwell": use your misión item Robotron Control Unit en Concealed Control Panel 9.19 al fondo de the mesa.  Luego control your robot hacia el Alliance moonwell 90.46 close by y use its recoge water ability in it.  NOTE:  Classes that use pets must dismiss them first in order for this to work right.
09) Ve a the Highperch (ramp entrance 14.33) y haz "Wind Rider": lootea 10 Highperch Wyvern Eggs de the ground.
10) In Highperch, sube por mountain ramp 13.40.  Once up there watch out for Heartrazor /target (a patrolling rare elite with a 12 hour respawn) y luego acepta y haz the escolta a misión there "Homeward Bound" 18.41.  You can have the escolta a try to help you mata the rare elite.  It's also possible to time it so you can start y completa the escolta a so the rare is out de way (just as he passes de the escortee).  If you fail, luego this escolta a can be skipped.
11) Once again, if you are still working on "A New Ore Sample": mata y lootea a the Gravelsnout Surveyors /target (there are two spawns nearby to check) para Unrefined Ore Sample (see map for locations, #7 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[57] = {title = [[Thunder Bluff]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Thunder Bluff.
02) Ve a The Hunter Rise y entrega "Steelsnap" 62.81.  Acepta "Frostmaw".
03) Ve a The Elder Rise y entrega "Sacred Fire" 70.31.  Acepta "Arikara".
04) Ve a the Wind Rider Master en lo alto de la torre en middle of TB 47.50 y vuela a Freewind Post, Thousand Needles.
05) Right when you land back at Freewind Post, entrega "Wind Rider" (45.49 in Thousand Needles).
06) Entra en Posada 46.52 y make Freewind Post your new home.
07) Next to you en Posada, entrega "The Sacred Flame" 46.52.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[58] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #20]], text = [[
01) Sube por mountain ramp (starting at 32.37) that allows you to entra en Darkcloud Pinnacle en top...
02) Once you get hacia el top do "Grimtotem Spying": lootea the three Document Chests para secret notes.  For Secret Note #1, cross the bridges up in Darkcloud Pinnacle until you get hacia el Document Chest 32.33 y lootea it.  For the other two, see next pasos...
03) Secret Note #2 is en hut 34.40.
04) Secret Note #3 is en hut 39.42.
05) Ve over hacia el other pinnacle (up at 38.35) y haz "Arikara": click en Sacred Fire of Life en middle de pinnacle, luego mata y lootea a Arikara (lvl 28).
06) Stay up y go norte (to 38.27) luego do "Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem": mata y lootea a Arnak Grimtotem /target.
07) Do the escolta a "Free at Last" (same area 38.26, #6 on map): escolta a Lakota Windsong /target all the way out of Darkcloud Pinnacle.
08) Ve a Whitereach Post 21.32 y entrega "Homeward Bound" y "Arikara".
09) TBC, 8a) Next to you entrega "A Dip in the Moonwell" 21.33, acepta "Testing the Tonic".  You can also get resupplied here de Laer Stepperunner /target.
10) You should be nivel 29 by now, if not farmea to nivel 29, I farmea away at centaurs alrededor de Camp E'Thok 19.25 or wyverns at Highperch (entrance is 13.34).
11) Do "Hypercapacitor Gizmo" (Elite): clear the enemigos alrededor de the Panther Cage 23.25, open the cage y mata y lootea a the lvl 30 elite panther.
12) This is your last chance to mata y lootea a the centaur Galak Messenger /target.  He has a very large patrol path (see map).  He drops an item which starts "Assassination Plot", acepta it.  If you can't find him in time, luego skip it along con follow up misión.
13) Ve a Whitereach Post (21.33, #8 on map) y entrega "Hypercapacitor Gizmo".  Also entrega (if you did it) "Assassination Plot", luego acepta y haz the short escolta a "Protect Kanati Greycloud", luego turn it in.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[59] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Freewind Post.
02) In the Posada, entrega (if you did it) "Free at Last" 46.52.
03) TBC, 2a) Just afuera the Posada on your right entrega "Testing the Tonic"46.50.
04) By the Bonfire entrega "Grimtotem Spying" y "Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem" 46.51.
05) 03b) At this point asegúrate de ser nivel 30 (or 2000 away de 30 if you can entrega "A New Ore Sample" en next paso).  Just farmea on any enemigos in 1kNeedles until you are there.
06) Ve a the Wind Rider Master (norte in Freewind Post 45.49) y if you have "A New Ore Sample" finished vuela a Camp Taurajo, The Barrens to turn it in 45.58.  Luego, (or otherwise) vuela a Orgrimmar, Durotar.
07) Once at Orgrimmar, go get new spells/abilities.
08) Entra en Posada y make Orgrimmar your new home de the Innkeeper 54.68.
09) Ve a the Bank 50.70 y put the following item into it:  Kodo Skin Scroll.  And get out (if you have it) Nada Speed Potions, you can get these de the AH también.
10) The goal now is to go all the way to Hillsbrad Foothills.  To get there, first sal de Orgrimmar en sur entrance, luego get on The Undercity Zeppelin (51.14 in Durotar).  Make sure you get en Undercity Zeppelin (sur landing) y not the STV zeppelin (norte landing)!  You can save some time by jumping off the zeppelin at a certain timing so you won't die y continue sur onto el camino!
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[60] = {title = [[30 Hillsbrad Foothills]], text = [[
01) Corre all the way to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills y get the FP there de the Bat Handler (60.19 in Hillsbrad).  ALSO:  You can just bypass the UC for now (no need to get UC's FP yet) y just sigue el camino shown en map to get to Hillsbrad.  NOTES:  If you can, use a Nada Speed Potion to cross el lago.  Once you reach Alterac Mountains you can start grinding on some enemigos por el camino to Tarren Mill.  TIP:  Focus on killing some Snapjaw turtles along the shore y save the Turtle Meat for a later misión, I recommend obtaining at least 4 Turtle Meat before moving on (you can get more later on), y remember to not sell them to a vendedor!
02) Remember to get the FP at Tarren Mill de the Bat Handler (60.19 in Hillsbrad)!
03) In the church building, acepta "Regthar Deathgate" 63.21.
04) Ve este into Arathi Highlands... entrance 63.21
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[61] = {title = [[30 Arathi Highlands - First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!! - Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)]], text = [[
01) Sigue el camino all the way to Hammerfall y acepta "Hammerfall" (down by the Forge, 73.34 in Arathi Highlands).  Luego get repaired/resupplied junto a you 73.33.
02) SE at Hammerfall, entrega "Hammerfall" 75.36, acepta "Raising Spirits".
03) Sube por pasos y get the FP de the Wind Rider Master 73.33.
04) Just hacia el oeste of Hammerfall alrededor de 70.35, do "Raising Spirits": mata y lootea a Highland Striders (raptors).  23% drop rate.
05) Vuelve a Hammerfall (at Tor'gan, #2 on map) y entrega "Raising Spirits" 75.36, acepta the next part.
06) Down in Hammerfall, entrega "Raising Spirits" (73.34, #1 on map), acepta the next part.
07) Vuelve a Tor'gan y entrega "Raising Spirits" (75.36, #2 on map), SKIP "Guile of the Raptor" (for now).
08) Usa la piedra de hogar a Orgrimmar.
09) At Orgrimmar, get your nivel 30 spells/abilities if you haven't yet.
10) Sal de Orgrimmar en sur entrance, luego get en Zeppelin (51.13 in Durotar) to ve a Grom'Gol (in STV).
11) Get the FP SE at Grom'Gol de the Wind Rider Master 33.29 .  NOTE:  For SoM/WotLK 100% misión rate, we come here only to get the FP, y we will be skipping all Nesingwary hunting misiones.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[62] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Orgrimmar.  If piedra de hogar is still on a cooldown, luego get back en zeppelin to take you to Orgrimmar.
02) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Crossroads, The Barrens.
03) Ve oeste en XRs y acepta "The Swarm Grows" 51.30.
04) Ve oeste de the XRs hacia el orc up en burrow y entrega "Regthar Deathgate" 45.28, acepta "The Kolkar of Desolace".
05) Corre back hacia el Wind Rider Master at XRs 52.30 y vuela a Freewind Post, Thousand Needles.
06) At Freewind Post, IF you are nivel 32, acepta "Family Tree" by the Bonfire 46.51.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[63] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #03]], text = [[
01) 32 Thousand Needles (Shimmering Flats)
02) Ve SE hacia el Mirage Raceway en middle of The Shimmering Flats y de the dwarf, acepta "Rocket Car Parts" 78.77.  Next to you en two gnomes 78.77, acepta "Salt Flat Venom" y "Hardened Shells".  NOTE:  SKIP "Wharfmaster Dizzywig" y "Hemet Nesingwary Jr." (for now).
03) Este en Goblin's side of Mirage Raceway acepta "Load Lightening" 80.76.
04) SE in Mirage Raceway by the starting line acepta "A Bump in the Road" 82.78.
05) Do The Shimmering Flats farmea.  Do the following 5 pasos below (in any order) all together alrededor de The Shimmering Flats:
06) "Rocket Car Parts": pick up 30 Rocket Car Rubble de the ground.
07) "Hardened Shells": mata y lootea a turtles all over The Shimmering Flats.  ALSO:  If you have not completed the Turtle Meat entrega misión at Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad yet, luego make sure you save 10 Turtle Meat for later (do not sell to vender).  You can get the Turtle Meat de any turtle at The Shimmering Flats y there is a large amount al norte alrededor de 83.55.
08) "Load Lightening": mata y lootea a vultures (Salt Flats Scavengers & Salt Flats Vultures).  Large amount alrededor de 88.66.
09) "Salt Flat Venom": mata y lootea a scorpids (Scorpid Reavers & Scorpid Terrors).  Large amount alrededor de 72.73.
10) "A Bump in the Road": mata basilisks.  Saltstone Basilisks are NW, Saltstone Crystalhides are everywhere but NW, y the Saltstone Gazers are sur at Tahonda Ruins alrededor de 77.86.
11) Once all done, vuelve a Mirage Raceway (en gnomes section) y de the dwarf (78.77, #1 on map) entrega "Rocket Car Parts".  Acepta "Wharfmaster Dizzywig" y "Hemet Nesingwary Jr.".  Luego junto a you 78.77, entrega "Salt Flat Venom" y "Hardened Shells".  Acepta "Encrusted Tail Fins".
12) Este en goblin section de Mirage Raceway entrega "Load Lightening" (80.76, #2 on map), acepta "Goblin Sponsorship".
13) SE in Mirage Raceway by the starting line entrega "A Bump in the Road" (82.78, #3 on map).
14) Asegúrate de ser nivel 32 (farmea on any enemigos until you are).
15) Ve sur to el camino that leads into Tanaris (starting at 74.94)...
16) Sigue el camino sur to Gadgetzan y get the FP there de the Wind Rider Master (52.25 in Tanaris).
17) If you have not accepted "Family Tree" de Freewind Post yet (requires lvl 32), luego vuela a Freewind Post, Thousand Needles y acepta this by the Bonfire.
18) Usa la piedra de hogar a Orgrimmar.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[64] = {title = [[Orgrimmar]], text = [[
01) Ve a the Bank 50.69 y put the following items into it:  Kravel's Parts Order, Kravel's Crate y (if you are still en turtle meat misión) your stack of Turtle Meat.  Also get the following items out: (if you have any) water breathing potions y Nada Speed Potions (para Desolace section), try to get a stack of each if you can (you can try the AH too).  Also, make sure you save all your extra Cloths in either your bank or mailbox 51.70, you will need them later for Cloth Donation turn-ins.  If you happen to have 60 (or 120) Wool Cloth (get that out now).
02) Ve NE to Magar's Cloth Goods y (if you have the 60 Wool Cloth) acepta y entrega the wool cloth donation misión de Rashona Straglash 64.51.  NOTE:  We will save the Silk Cloth to build up First Aid first before the silk donations.
03) Ve a the Valley of Honor y entrega "The Swarm Grows" 75.34, acepta the next part.
04) Get your nivel 32 spells/abilities.
05) Ve down hacia el Cleft of Shadow (entrada en 55.41) y acepta "Alliance Relations".  The NPC patrols alrededor de en Cleft of Shadow.
06) If you have 60 more Wool Cloth you can turn this in for more Wool Cloth Donations de the Troll Faction at 38.88.
07) If you haven't got Silk Bandage for First Aid yet, do that now en First Aid Trainer 34.85 en Valley of Spirits.
08) Oeste in Orgrimmar, entrega "Alliance Relations" (en hut 23.53), acepta the next part.
09) Stay up y go over hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Sun Rock Retreat, Stonetalon Mountains.
10) Ve a el camino SW in Sun Rock Retreat 45.62 to ve a the Charred Vale, luego corre sur into Desolace (entrance 30.78)...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[65] = {title = [[34 Desolace]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) N/A
03) Ve a Ghost Walker Post (entrada en 57.57)...
04) Gira a la izquierda en main entrance, luego entrega "The Kolkar of Desolace" 56.60.  Acepta "Khan Dez'hepah".
05) Just norte a bit en hut get repaired/resupplied y entrega "Family Tree" 55.56.  Luego ve cruzando bridge in Ghost Walker Post y entrega "Alliance Relations" 53.54.  Acepta the next part.  Also acepta (de the same NPC) "Befouled by Satyr".
06) Next to you, entrega "Alliance Relations" 52.53, acepta "The Burning of Spirits".
07) Ve este hacia el Kolkar Village y haz "Khan Dez'hepah": mata y lootea a Khan Dez'hepah /target.  This big bearded centaur is usually en bigger tent 73.42, but can sometimes be found in other areas alrededor de the Kolkar Village también, so you may need to farmea alrededor de the village to find him.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[66] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) N/A
03) Ve a Ghost Walker Post, make a left at la entrada (56.57, #3 on map) y luego entrega "Khan Dez'hepah" 56.60.  SKIP "Centaur Bounty".
04) N/A
05) Continue following the main path oeste to Shadowprey Village y acepta "Hunting in Stranglethorn" 25.72.
06) Ve up en village y acepta "Hand of Iruxos" (on top de mound junto a gong 26.68).
07) Entra en Posada 24.68 y make Shadowprey Village your new home de the Innkeeper.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  If you still have "A New Ore Sample" in your log, abandon it.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[67] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #07]], text = [[
01) Ve down hacia el docks y acepta "Other Fish to Fry" 23.73.
02) Next to you en hut, acepta "Clam Bait" 23.72.
03) N/A
04) Make sure you are resupplied de Lah'Mawhani 23.72 up en hut.  Luego nada norte up the water (use Nada Speed Potions if you have them) y work your way hacia el wrecked boat en shore y de Rackmore's Log 36.30 sitting en barrel, acepta "Claim Rackmore's Treasure!".
05) Ve up to The Argent Dawn dude y acepta "Sceptre of Light" 39.27.
06) Ve este hacia el Thunder Axe Fortress (entrada en 56.29) y haz "The Burning of Spirits": usa el/la Burning Gem misión item en enemigos en fortress right before they die to recoge the Infused Burning Gems.  While working on this, do the following 2 pasos below también:
07) Do "Sceptre of Light": as you entra en Thunder Axe Fortress, make a left, sube por watchtower (ramp entrada en 55.30) y mata y lootea a the Burning Blade Seer.
08) GROUP 2+ Players: Entra en fortress entrance 55.27 y haz "Hand of Iruxos": click en Hand of Iruxos Crystal 55.27 en middle y luego mata y lootea a the Demon Spirit that spawns.  Be prepared to mata the lvl 37 demon! (See Video).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[68] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #08]], text = [[
01) Before leaving the Thunder Axe Fortress, make sure you have found an item called Flayed Demon Skin (2% drop rate), which starts "The Corrupter".
02) Ve a Ghost Walker Post (shortcut at 56.54)...
03) N/A
04) Luego ve cruzando bridge in Ghost Walker Post 52.53 y entrega "The Burning of Spirits" y "The Corrupter", acepta the next part.
05) Ve NE to Sargeron alrededor de 74.22 y haz "Befouled by Satyr" along with "The Corrupter": mata the required amount of Hatefury Satyrs: Rogue Felsworn Betrayer Hellcaller .  And mata y lootea a the Hatefury Shadowstalkers /target until a Shadowstalker Scalp drops.
06) Ve SW to Kormek's Hut y acepta "Bone Collector" 62.39.  Requires lvl 33.  If you are not 33, ignore this paso y you will be able to acepta this later en guide.  NOTE:  You can get resupplied de Vendor-Tron 1000 /target if he is there.
07) Ve a Ghost Walker Post (shortcut at 56.54, #2 on map), luego ve cruzando bridge y entrega "Befouled by Satyr" (53.54, #4 on map), acepta "Alliance Relations".
08) Next to you, entrega "The Corrupter" 52.53, acepta the next part.  Make sure you are resupplied 51.53.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[69] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #09]], text = [[
01) Ve NW up to The Argent Dawn dude y entrega "Sceptre of Light" 39.27, acepta "Book of the Ancients".
02) Ve a where the boat is under the water alrededor de 34.32 y haz the first part of "Claim Rackmore's Treasure!": mata y lootea a the Drysnap enemigos para Silver Key (15% drop rate).  Also start working on "Clam Bait" by mata/looting crabs y looting Giant Softshell Clams.  Usa a water breathing potion if you have one.  As you do the following pasos, you should find the Golden Key de any Slitherblade mob...
03) Do "Book of the Ancients": farmea your way hacia el NW end de bigger island y click en Serpent Statue 28.7, luego mata y lootea a Lord Kragaru when he spawns. (See Video)
04) Do the last part of "Claim Rackmore's Treasure!": Once you find the Golden Key de any Slitherblade mob, click on Rackmore's Chest 30.9 en bigger island to turn this in.
05) Do "The Corrupter": mata y lootea a the Slitherblade Oracles /target en water y en 2 bigger islands until you get the Oracle Crystal (low drop rate).  Usa a water breathing potion if you have one.
06) Finish up "Other Fish to Fry": mata the needed Slitherblade enemigos.  The Myrmidon are scattered between the two biggest islands, the Naga are more hacia the shore alrededor de 36.24 y there are only a few Sorceresses scattered everywhere.
07) Make sure "Clam Bait" is finished: recoge Soft-shelled Clam Meat de Enraged Reef Crawlers (crabs) or de the Giant Softshell Clams under the water (alrededor de #2 on map alrededor de 36.24 y slightly norte of it también).
08) Ve up to The Argent Dawn dude y entrega "Book of the Ancients" (39.27, #1 on map).
09) If you have not accepted "Bone Collector" yet, do so now at Kormek's Hut 62.39.
10) Ve a Ghost Walker Post (shortcut at 56.54)....
11) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 56.56, luego ve cruzando bridge y entrega "The Corrupter" 52.53.  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta the next part.
12) Next to you, entrega "The Corrupter" 53.54, SKIP the next part (for now).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[70] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) At the Kodo Graveyard junto a you alrededor de 53.57, do "Bone Collector": lootea the Kodo Bones en ground.  NOTE:  Looting some of these bones spawns a high lvl Kodo Apparition.
02) N/A
03) Ve a Ghost Walker Post, entrance 57.57...
04) N/A
05) Stop en hut just norte to get repaired/resupplied de Muuran 56.57.
06) Farmea your way NE to Kormek's Hut y entrega "Bone Collector" 62.39.
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Shadowprey Village.
08) Justo afuera de the Posada, y up en mound, entrega (if you have it) "Hand of Iruxos" 26.68, SKIP "Portals of the Legion" (for now).
09) N/A
10) Vuelve oeste to Shadowprey Village y down en docks entrega "Other Fish to Fry" 23.73 y junto a you en hut "Clam Bait" 23.72.
11) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 22.74 en end de docks at Shadowprey Village y vuela a Camp Taurajo, The Barrens.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[71] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Once at CT, corre SE into Dustwallow Marsh ( 51.79 in The Barrens) y recoge the 3 misión-objects en Shady Rest Posada (See Video):  "Suspicious Hoofprints" (en ground frente a old Posada 51.79), "Lieutenant Paval Reethe" (a small white dot on a plank 30.48) y "The Black Shield" (en fireplace 30.49).
02) Ve NE to Brackenwall Village 36.32 y entrega "The Black Shield" (acepta the next part), "Suspicious Hoofprints" y "Lieutenant Paval Reethe".
03) Next to you de Do'gol, entrega "The Black Shield" 37.31, SKIP the next part (for now).
04) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 36.32 y vuela a Ratchet, The Barrens.
05) Ve a Gazlowe en engineering building y entrega "Goblin Sponsorship" (63.36 in The Barrens), acepta the next part.
06) Ve a the Bank 63.37 y get the following items out:  Kravel's Parts Order, Kravel's Crate y Silk Cloth (to build up First Aid).  Put en bank:  Belgrom's Sealed Note.
07) Ve a the goblin en docks y entrega "Wharfmaster Dizzywig" 63.38, acepta "Parts for Kravel".
08) Get en boat to ve a BB (Booty Bay) 64.39.  While waiting para boat, build up First Aid.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[72] = {title = [[36 Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) As soon as you get off the boat, entrega "Goblin Sponsorship" 26.74, acepta the next part.
02) Entra en Posada (The Salty Sailor Tavern) y make BB your home de the Innkeeper 27.77.  Next to you en Posada, acepta "Singing Blue Shards".
03) Ve upstairs en Posada y acepta "Bloodscalp Ears", "Hostile Takeover" y "Investigate the Camp".
04) Stay up en top de docks y go over past the Alliance FP to Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks y acepta "Supply and Demand" 28.78.
05) Vuelve over hasta lo alto de the Posada y luego ve up the pasos to Baron Revilgaz 27.77 en boat-deck y entrega "Goblin Sponsorship", acepta the next part.
06) Next to you en roof, ve a the Wind Rider Master 27.77 y vuela a Grom'gol, Stranglethorn.
07) In Grom'gol acepta the following: "The Defense of Grom'gol" 32.29, "Mok'thardin's Enchantment" 32.29, "Bloodscalp Insight" (junto a Bonfire 32.29), "Hunt for Yenniku" 32.28,"Bloody Bone Necklaces"y "The Vile Reef".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
08) REMINDER:  The "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn" misión requires that you save any Green Hills of Stranglethorn pages you find.  These pages can drop de any humanoid mob in STV.  You will need one of each de following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  I recommend mailing them to your alt for storage.  Once your alt collects all the pages, mail them back to your main.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.  You don't need to acepta the misión to get the page drops, so acepta y turn this in at Nesingwary's Expedition 36.11 if you get all the pages.  You will regresa a STV numerous times en future for more chances to find the pages.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[73] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #13]], text = [[
01) Ve a the ledges along the shore alrededor de 27.19 y start working on "Singing Blue Shards": mata y lootea a Crystal Spine Basilisks.  80% drop rate.  There's only 9 mob spawns en area.  If you corre out of enemigos, you can start working en next paso(s) luego come back to this spot.  You will also have more opportunities later en guide to completa this.
02) Ve sur at Bal'lal Ruins, just off the shore alrededor de 29.20 y haz "Bloodscalp Ears" along with "Hunt for Yenniku", "Bloodscalp Insight" y start working on "Bloody Bone Necklaces": mata y lootea a the trolls en ruins.  Mata y lootea a Bloodscalp Shamans para totem.   There is another Ruins up NE alrededor de 34.16 for more enemigos.  NOTE:  "Bloody Bone Necklaces" does not need to be finished now.
03) N/A
04) Ve sur (just norte of Grom'gol, alrededor de 32.23) y haz "The Defense of Grom'gol": mata Lashtail Raptors.
05) Ve a Grom'gol y entrega "Hunt for Yenniku" 32.28, acepta "Headhunting".
06) TBC, 5a) Junto a Bonfire entrega "Bloodscalp Insight" 32.29, acepta "An Unusual Patron".
07) Entrega "The Defense of Grom'gol" 32.29, acepta the next part.
08) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 32.29.  REMINDER: Once you turn lvl 35, start using the higher tier food/drink.
09) Ve NW under the water at The Vile Reef y haz "The Vile Reef" along with "Encrusted Tail Fins": lootea the Gri'lek the Wanderer tablet 25.23.  Also mata y lootea a the murlocs.  Usa Nada Speed Potions y an Elixer of Water Breathing (unless you are Undead) if you can.
10) Ve oeste hacia el The Savage Coast island y en Altar of Naias 20.23 do "An Unusual Patron": usa el/la misión item Gift of Naias luego mata y lootea a Naias (water elemental) when he spawns.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[74] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Ve al norte hacia el troll Ruins alrededor de 20.14 y haz "Headhunting" along with finishing up "Bloody Bone Necklaces": mata y lootea a the trolls alrededor de the Ruins para necklaces (low drop rate).  And mata y lootea a the Bloodscalp Headhunters para Shrunken Heads.  You can mata lower nivel trolls para necklaces al sur en two ruins (between paso #3 on map).
02) Ve a Nesingwary's Expedition 36.11 y entrega "Hemet Nesingwary Jr.", "Hunting in Stranglethorn"  Get repaired/resupplied de Jaquilina Dramet.
03) N/A
04) At el río este alrededor de 34.9 of you do "Supply and Demand": mata y lootea a River Crocolisk.  And continue working on (if you still need to) "Singing Blue Shards" by mata/looting Stone Maw Basilisk alrededor de the norte end of el río.  Work your way hacia el next paso:
05) Ve SE cruzando river hacia el Venture Co. Operations Center y haz "Hostile Takeover": mata y lootea a the Venture Co. Geologist /target scattered alrededor de the Operations para 8 crystals.  Also do the first part of "Goblin Sponsorship": work your way hasta lo alto de the Operations Center entrance 42.18 y luego mata y lootea a Foreman Cozzle (en control room, 43.18).  See next paso for where to use Cozzle's Key at...
06) Do the last part of "Goblin Sponsorship": lootea Cozzle's Footlocker (en small house 43.20).  NOTE:  Your key will disappear as soon as you click the cofre, so make sure you have room in your bags para Blueprints.
07) Ve este y haz "Mok'thardin's Enchantment": mata y lootea a Shadowmaw Panthers /target alrededor de 49.23.  Also mata y lootea a Stranglethorn Tigress alrededor de the same area para fang.
08) Finish (if you still need to) "Singing Blue Shards": mata y lootea a Crystal Spine Basilisks just NE alrededor de the mountain ledges alrededor de 48.8.
09) Ve oeste cruzando river to Mizjah Ruins alrededor de 37.31 y haz "The Defense of Grom'gol": mata the required amount of Mosh'Ogg ogres.
10) Usa la piedra de hogar a BB.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[75] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) In the Posada, entrega "Singing Blue Shards" 27.77, SKIP "Venture Company Mining" (for now).
02) Ve upstairs en Posada y entrega "Bloodscalp Ears", "Hostile Takeover" y "Investigate the Camp".
03) Stay up en top de docks y go over past the Alliance FP to Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks y entrega "Supply and Demand" 28.78.  Acepta "Some Assembly Required".
04) Vuelve over hasta lo alto de the Posada y luego ve up the pasos to Baron Revilgaz 27.77 en boat-deck y entrega "Goblin Sponsorship", acepta the next part.
05) Next to you en roof, ve a the Wind Rider Master 27.77 y vuela a Grom'gol, Stranglethorn.
06) Entrega ALL misiones in Grom'gol: "The Defense of Grom'gol", "Mok'thardin's Enchantment" (SKIP the next part for now), "An Unusual Patron", "Headhunting", "Bloody Bone Necklaces" y "The Vile Reef".  Acepta "Trollbane".
07) You should be nivel 36 now, if not farmea to it.
08) Get en zeppelin to ve a the The Undercity (up en Posada, 32.29).  Build up First Aid while waiting.
09) Ve a the Bank en middle of UC 66.44 y get out the following items:  (if you have any) Elixir of Water Breathing potions.  If you were able to get an Elixir of Water Breathing, also get out (if you have any) a stack of Nada Speed Potions, y (if you are still en turtle meat misión) your stack of Turtle Meat . Also put en bank:  10 stack of Encrusted Tail Fin, Fuel Regulator Blueprints y Kravel's Parts.
10) Ve up y acepta "To Steal From Thieves" 64.49.
11) Next to you en Bat Handler 63.49, vuela a Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad.
12) Once at Tarren Mill, acepta "The Hammer May Fall" (de Tallow 62.20).
13) If you have not finished the Turtle Meat entrega yet, do so now... Entra en Posada (bigger house 62.19).  De Christoph Jeffcoat, acepta "Soothing Turtle Bisque" (requires the cooking profession to acepta).  De this NPC, compra a Soothing Spices.  Luego wWith your Turtle Meat you farmed earlier, simply entrega the misión right there.
14) Ve a the Bat Handler 60.19 y vuela a Hammerfall, Arathi.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[76] = {title = [[37 Arathi Highlands]], text = [[
01) Entra en Posada y make Hammerfall your new home de the Innkeeper 74.32.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) On the balcony junto a you, entrega "Trollbane" 74.34, acepta "Sigil of Strom".
03) Ve down to Tor'gan 75.36 y acepta "Foul Magics" y "Guile of the Raptor".
04) Ve oeste y click en Shards of Myzrael 62.34 to acepta "The Princess Trapped".
05) Ve este of Hammerfall y haz "The Princess Trapped": mata y lootea a the Drywhisker kobolds, in y afuera of la cueva (entrada en 83.36).  TIPS:  Look para tree y rock 81.40, it shows you where the hidden path is to la cueva.  If you have mining, luego mine as many Lesser Bloodstone Deposits as you can.  These are used for an Alliance misión only at STV y sell good en neutral AH.
06) Once done, ve a the Iridescent Shards (en end of la cueva 84.31) y entrega "The Princess Trapped", acepta "Stones of Binding".
07) If you have 225 First Aid now, luego ve a Hammerfall y en building acepta y haz "Triage" 73.37: usa el/la Triage Bandage misión item right there en room en wounded soldiers (See Video).  Once done, turn it in.  You can also destroy the Triage Bandage in your inventory as it is no longer needed.  If you were not able to do this misión yet, you will be farming more cloth in Arathi to try again later. NOTE: In WotLK, this doctor no longer advances your First Aid, you now just do that at any First Aid entrenador.
08) Sube por pasos in Hammerfall y asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en.  Luego take the norte exit 73.30 y go oeste hacia el Circle of Este Binding y haz part of "Stones of Binding": lootea the Stone of Este Binding 67.30 para Cresting Key.
09) Ve oeste to Dabyrie's Farmstead y haz "To Steal From Thieves": mata y lootea a the 3 named enemigos.  Mata y lootea a Kenata Dabyrie /target (up en small house 56.36).  See next pasos para other 2...
10) Mata y lootea a Fardel Dabyrie /target (standing afuera junto a barn 57.39, or frente a establos 54.38)...
11) Mata y lootea a Marcel Dabyrie /target (in los establos 54.38).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[77] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #17]], text = [[
01) Ve sur a bit y haz part of "Stones of Binding": lootea the Stone of Outer Binding 52.51 para Thundering Key.
02) Ve sur y haz "Guile of the Raptor": mata y lootea a Highland Fleshstalkers alrededor de 50.64.
03) Ve NW to Boulder'gor y haz "The Hammer May Fall": mata the Boulderfist Ogres (afuera of la mina) y the Boulderfist Enforcers (dentro de of la mina 35.44).
04) Ve norte to Northfold Manor alrededor de 32.28 y haz "Foul Magics": mata y lootea a the Syndicate enemigos.  Any of them can drop the amulets.
05) Ve oeste y haz the last part of "Stones of Binding": lootea the Stone of Oeste Binding 25.30 para Burning Key.
06) Do "Sigil of Strom": en este side in Stromgarde Keep alrededor de 28.61 mata y lootea a the Syndicate Prowlers, Conjurors y Magus para Sigil of Strom.
07) Ve slightly este y click en Stone of Inner Binding to entrega "Stones of Binding" 36.57, acepta "Breaking the Keystone".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[78] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #18]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Hammerfall.
02) On the balcony just afuera the Posada, entrega "Sigil of Strom" 74.34, SKIP "The Broken Sigil" (for now).
03) Next to you en balcony entrega "The Hammer May Fall" 74.34, acepta "Call to Arms".
04) Ve SE in Hammerfall at Tor'gan 75.36 y entrega "Foul Magics" y "Guile of the Raptor" (acepta the next part).
05) Ve down in Hammerfall y entrega "Guile of the Raptor" 73.34.  Wait a few seconds luego acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied by the Forge.
06) Vuelve up to Tor'gan (75.36, #4 on map) y entrega "Guile of the Raptor", SKIP "Foul Magics".
07) Farmea sur to Witherbark Village alrededor de 67.63 y haz "Call to Arms": mata the required amount of Witherbark trolls alrededor de the village.
08) Farmea back norte to Hammerfall y up the pasos entrega "Call to Arms" 74.34, acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
09) While doing the rest of Arathi misiones, if you happen to corre cruzando lvl 42 Giant named Fozruk /target, you can mata y lootea a him for "Breaking the Keystone".  This giant has a large patrol path (see map).  Don't intentionally try to find him.  If you did mata y lootea a him, luego turn this in (at 36.58) y acepta the next part.  NOTE:  The follow up misiones are worth doing as they are easy to solo, but are not covered en guide.
10) Farmea SW to Boulderfist Hall alrededor de 54.73 y haz "Call to Arms": mata the required amount of Boulderfist ogres.  If you still need to do "Triage", luego make sure you get your First Aid skill to 225 before proceeding.
11) Hearth (or farmea back 74.34 if its still on a cooldown) to Hammerfall.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
12) On the deck entrega "Call to Arms" 74.34.
13) NOTE: due hacia el faster leveling changes, we will be skipping the Stromguard misiones ("Call to Arms", "The Broken Sigil", "The Real Threat" y "Foul Magics").
14) If you have not done the First Aid misión "Triage" yet, do so now:
15) (click to show instructions):
16) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 73.33 y vuela a Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad.  If "Breaking the Keystone" is still in your misión book, abandon it.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[79] = {title = [[37 Alterac Mountains]], text = [[
01) Once at TM, entra en small house 62.21 y acepta "Prison Break In" & "Stone Tokens".
02) TBC, 1a) At the church entrance acepta "The Crown of Will" 63.21.
03) Ve norte hacia el small cueva (38.66 in Alterac Mountains) y en way mata y lootea a a cat for a Fresh Carcass.
04) At the small cueva do "Frostmaw": usa el/la Fresh Carcass misión item en Flame of Uzel (38.66, #2 on map), luego mata y lootea a Frostmaw /target when he spawns.  This yeti spawns justo afuera de la cueva. (See Video)
05) TBC, 3a) Ve al norte (take hill entrada en 39.62) to Ruins of Alterac y haz "The Crown of Will": mata 10 Crushridge Maulers /target alrededor de 41.49.
06) Ve oeste (take hill exit at 38.61) to Lordamere Internment Camp y haz "Stone Tokens" along with "Prison Break In": mata y lootea a the Dalaran humans para tokens y mata y lootea a the 4 named enemigos.  First one is Ricter 20.84 afuera frente a outhouses.  See next pasos para others...
07) Mata y lootea a Alina y Dermot dentro de building 20.86 junto a outhouses.
08) Mata y lootea a Kegan Darkmar upstairs en other building 18.83.  NOTE:  There are more Dalaran enemigos to mata para tokens at Dalaran (justo afuera de the big purple globe).
09) N/A
10) Corre back to Tarren Mill y en small house 62.21, entrega "Prison Break In" y "Stone Tokens", acepta "Dalaran Patrols" y "Bracers of Binding".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
11) TBC, 8a) At the church entrance entrega "The Crown of Will" 63.21 , SKIP the next part.
12) Ve norte into Alterac Mountains (follow path on map) y haz "Bracers of Binding" along with "Dalaran Patrols": mata 4 Dalaran Summoners y mata y lootea a the Elemental Slaves.  Done alrededor de the purple Dalaran globe (alrededor de 19.76 in Alterac Mountains).
13) Once done, vuelve a Tarren Mill.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
14) In the small house, entrega "Dalaran Patrols" y "Bracers of Binding" (62.21, #8 on map).
15) Ve a the Bat Handler 60.19 y vuela a Undercity, Tirisfal.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[80] = {title = [[Undead - Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) Right where you land en UC, entrega "To Steal From Thieves" 64.49.
02) Ve a the Bank (en middle of UC, 66.44) y get the following items out:  10 stack of Encrusted Tail Fin, Belgrom's Sealed Note, Fuel Regulator Blueprints y Kravel's Parts.  Also get out (if you have it) 60 Wool Cloth y luego 60 Silk Cloth for cloth donations in Orgrimmar.  Put en bank:  any Nada Speed Potions.
03) Sal de the UC y get on a zeppelin to ve a Orgrimmar (61.59 in Tirisfal Glades).
04) Ve oeste in Orgrimmar (take the ramp at 42.62)...
05) Ve SW to Valley of Spirits in Darkbriar Lodge y (if you have them) entrega 60 Wool Cloth y luego 60 Silk Cloth for cloth donations de Vehena 38.88 para Troll faction.
06) WOTLK, 5b) You can stop en First Aid Trainer 34.85 to upgrade First Aid.
07) Continue oeste to Keldran en hut y entrega "Alliance Relations" 23.53.
08) Stay up y go over hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Crossroads, The Barrens.
09) Ve in XR's Posada 52.30 y make it your new home.
10) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 52.30 y vuela a Freewind Post, Thousand Needles.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[81] = {title = [[38 Thousand Needles (Shimmering Flats)]], text = [[
01) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) Corre este hacia Ironstone Camp (right junto a Shimmering Flats) y entrega "The Swarm Grows" 68.64, acepta the next part.
03) Ve a the oeste side of Mirage Raceway y en dwarf 78.77, entrega "Parts for Kravel".  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "Delivery to the Gnomes".
04) Next to you, entrega "Delivery to the Gnomes" 78.77.  Acepta "Martek the Exiled".  Also entrega "Encrusted Tail Fins".
05) Back en dwarf junto a you acepta "The Rumormonger" (78.77, #3 on map).
06) Ve este hacia el Goblin's side y entrega "Goblin Sponsorship" 80.76, acepta "The Eighteenth Pilot".
07) Next to you, entrega "The Eighteenth Pilot" 80.76, acepta "Razzeric's Tweaking".
08) Ve SW to The Rustmaul Dig Site y haz "The Swarm Grows": mata the required amount of Silithid bugs.  There is only a few Invaders in la cueva entrance 66.86 so go for these guys first.  The Searchers are up y alrededor de the Dig Site.  Within the first few enemigos you mata, you should receive an item which starts "Parts of the Swarm", acepta it y start doing it en same area by mata/looting the Silithid enemigos, y the items you need can drop de any of them.
09) Make sure you are at least 2 bars away de nivel 38.  Farmea en bugs until you are.
10) Ve norte to Ironstone Camp y entrega "The Swarm Grows" (68.64, #2 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[82] = {title = [[Tauren - Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a XRs.
02) Ve oeste en XRs y entrega "Parts of the Swarm" 51.30, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  If the Cracked Silithid Carapace remains in your bags, destroy it.
03) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 52.30 y vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.
04) N/A
05) Ve a The Hunter Rise y entrega "Frostmaw" 62.81.  Acepta "Deadmire".
06) GET NEW ABILITIES, 5b) You should be nivel 38 now.  Get new spells/abilities for your class.
07) Ve a the Bank 47.59 y put the following item into it:  Fizzle Brassbolts' Letter.
08) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master en middle of TB 47.50 y vuela a Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[83] = {title = [[38 Dustwallow Marsh]], text = [[
01) Oeste at Brackenwall Village, de Nazeer Bloodpike 35.31, acepta "Theramore Spies" y "Check Up on Tabetha".
02) De the male blood elf acepta "Twilight of the Dawn Runner" 36.32.
03) De Do'gol (ogre), acepta "The Black Shield" 37.31.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) Ve a the Innkeeper (blue ogre at small cueva entrance 37.32) to make Brackenwall Village your new home.
05) In the small cueva acepta "The Hermit of Witch Hill" 37.33.
06) Ve slightly sur of Brackenwall Village y acepta "Hungry!" (de the ogre at 35.38).
07) Start working on "Theramore Spies" along with "The Black Shield": mata Theramore Infiltrators /target y mata y lootea a any type of spiders.  Farmea your way hacia el next paso...
08) Stinky, 7b) See if you can do the escolta a "Stinky's Escape" 47.18 (#16 on map): escolta a "Stinky" Ignatz.  NOTE: If he is not there, luego skip this for now.  You will have more opportunities to try again later.
09) Ve este to Norte Point Tower (entrada en 47.24) y haz "Twilight of the Dawn Runner": al fondo de la torre talk to Ithania /target to free her, luego ve a the top of la torre to lootea the Warped Crates.
10) Ve este to Jarl's cabin 55.26 y entrega "The Hermit of Witch Hill", acepta "Marsh Frog Legs".  Next to you en cabin acepta "What's Haunting Witch Hill?" (this NPC is either en cabin or en dock).
11) Right junto a Jarl's cabin, click en Loose Dirt 55.26 to acepta "The Lost Report".
12) All alrededor de Jarl's Cabin do "Marsh Frog Legs" along with "What's Haunting Witch Hill?": mata y lootea a Giant Marsh Frogs (frog critters /target).  And mata the undead enemigos (Risen Spirits y Risen Husks).
13) Back at Jarl's cabin 55.26 (#9 on map) entrega "Marsh Frog Legs", acepta "Jarl Needs Eyes".  Next to you en cabin entrega "What's Haunting Witch Hill?", acepta "The Witch's Bane".
14) All alrededor de Jarl's cabin start working on "The Witch's Bane" by looting witchbane (plants, mostly alrededor de #11 on map), that you see por el camino:
15) Ve NE hacia el shore alrededor de 57.17 y haz "Hungry!": mata y lootea a the Mirefin (murlocs).
16) Exit at 58.19.
17) If you have not done the escolta a "Stinky's Escape" 47.18: escolta a "Stinky" Ignatz y farmea enemigos during the escolta a.  NOTE: If he is not there, luego skip this for now.  You will have one more opportunity to try this again later.
18) All alrededor de Jarl's cabin finish "The Witch's Bane": lootea 9 witchbane (plants, mostly alrededor de #11 on map).
19) Back at Jarl's cabin entrega "The Witch's Bane" 56.26 (#9 on map), acepta "Cleansing Witch Hill".
20) Do "Cleansing Witch Hill": en end de dock there at Jarl's cabin 55.27 usa el/la Witchbane Torch misión item luego mata Zelfrax (gargoyle) when he spawns.
21) Back at Jarl's cabin entrega "Cleansing Witch Hill" 56.26 (#9 on map).
22) Finish up "Theramore Spies": mata 9 Theramore Infiltrators /target just NE of Brackenwall Villagearound 42.26 (#7 on map).
23) Ve oeste to Darkmist Cavern alrededor de 35.22 y haz "Jarl Needs Eyes": mata y lootea a the Darkmist spiders for 20 eyes.  Also make sure "The Black Shield" is finished by mata/looting any spiders.
24) Ve a the oeste side in Brackenwall Village 35.31 (#1 on map) y entrega "Theramore Spies", acepta "The Theramore Docks".  And entrega "The Lost Report".
25) De the male blood elf entrega "Twilight of the Dawn Runner" 36.32 .
26) Entrega "The Black Shield" 37.31, acepta the next part.
27) At Krog, entrega "The Black Shield" 36.32.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
28) Ve just sur of Brackenwall Village en ogre y entrega "Hungry!" 35.38 (#6 on map).
29) Ve SE hacia el ogre (41.37 /target) on el camino y acepta y haz the escolta a "Questioning Reethe": follow Ogron, luego mata the enemigos that spawn in junto a Paval Reethe.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[84] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #27]], text = [[
01) Head SE to Tabetha's Farm y dentro de cabin entrega "Check Up on Tabetha" 46.57.  Acepta "Help for Mudsprocket".  And junto a you acepta "The Grimtotem Weapon" y "The Reagent Thief".
02) Just afuera en side de cabin 46.57 acepta "Direhorn Raiders" y "The Zeppelin Crash".
03) Ve este to Beezil's Wreck 54.57 y entrega "The Zeppelin Crash".  Acepta "Corrosion Prevention" y "Secure the Cargo!".
04) At Beezil's Wreck do "Razzeric's Tweaking": lootea the Gizmorium Shipping Crate (box at 54.56).
05) Around the immediate area do "Corrosion Prevention" along with "Secure the Cargo!": stand cerca de a Power Core Fragment to obtain a buff, luego usa el/la Ooze Buster misión item on oozes.  NOTE:  You don't actually need to attack the oozes.  And lootea 8 Zeppelin Cargo (boxes laying alrededor de).
06) Back at Beezil's Wreck 54.57 (#4 on map) entrega "Corrosion Prevention" along with "Secure the Cargo!", acepta "Delivery for Drazzit".
07) Ve NW to Direhorn Post y en NE tent mata y lootea a Apothecary Cylla 47.47, she drops an item which starts "Signs of Treachery", acepta it.
08) In the immediate area alrededor de Direhorn Post do "Direhorn Raiders": mata 12 Grimtotems (taurens of any type).
09) Around The Quagmire alrededor de 43.49 do the next 3 misiones together:
10) "The Reagent Thief": mata y lootea a Noxious Shredders (green serpents) or Darkfang Creepers (orange spiders).  These are alrededor de #1 on map.
11) "The Grimtotem Weapon": usa el/la Captured Totem misión item en Mottled Drywallow Crocolisk or a Drywallow Daggermaw, luego mata them.  NOTE: The crocs must be pulsed by the totem on death to get credit.
12) "Deadmire": mata y lootea a Deadmire /target.  This white crocolisk patrols alrededor de, mostly alrededor de the eastern part of #11 on map alrededor de 48.56.
13) Back at Tabetha's Farm y dentro de cabin 46.57 (#2 on map) entrega "The Grimtotem Weapon" y "The Reagent Thief".
14) Just afuera en side de cabin 46.57 entrega "Direhorn Raiders".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[85] = {title = [[Tauren - Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Ve SW to Mudsprocket (neutral goblin town specific to TBC) y en hut 42.73 entrega "Delivery for Drazzit" y "Help for Mudsprocket".
02) At the NE outskirts of town, ve a the Flight Master 43.72 y vuela a Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh.  NOTE: We will do the Mudsprocket misiones when we return back to Dustwallow Marsh at nivel 43.
03) At Krog, entrega "Questioning Reethe" 36.32.  Acepta "The Black Shield".
04) If you have not done the escolta a "Stinky's Escape" 47.18: escolta a "Stinky" Ignatz.  NOTE: If he is not there, luego this will have to be skipped.
05) Ve este to Jarl's cabin 55.26 y entrega "Jarl Needs Eyes", acepta "Jarl Needs a Blade".
06) Right junto a Jarl's cabin, click en Loose Dirt to acepta "The Severed Head" 55.26.
07) Just NE at Witch Hill do "Jarl Needs a Blade": mata y lootea a Razorspine patrols alrededor de 58.19.  Spawns at 58.18.
08) Back at Jarl's cabin entrega "Jarl Needs a Blade" 55.26 (#5 on map).
09) Ve all the way detrás de Alliance town (Theramore Isle) y haz "The Theramore Docks": lootea Captain's Footlocker (under the water 72.51).  NOTE:  Do not go a través de town, just go alrededor de the side de town y into the water.  (See Video)
10) Usa la piedra de hogar a Brackenwall Village.
11) Oeste in Brackenwall Village 35.31, entrega "The Theramore Docks", "The Severed Head" (acepta "The Troll Witchdoctor") y "Signs of Treachery".
12) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 36.32 /target y vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[86] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) CLOTH DONATIONS?  If you happen to have 60 Wool Cloth, luego 60 Silk Cloth y luego 60 Mageweave Cloth, get those out (for cloth donations in a bit).  Bank 47.59.
02) Ve a the NW hut on The Hunter Rise y entrega "The Black Shield" 54.81, acepta "Return to Krog".
03) Also en Hunter Rise, entrega "Deadmire" 62.81.
04) If you have either 60 Wool Cloth, 60 Silk Cloth or 60 Mageweave Cloth go turn them in up en hut de Rumstag Proudstrider 43.43 (Tauren faction cloth donations).
05) Ve hasta lo alto de la torre hacia el Wind Rider Master 47.50 y vuela a Ratchet, The Barrens.
06) At Ratchet junto a bank, entrega "Stinky's Escape" 62.38.
07) At the Bank 63.37, get the following items out:  (if you have any) Nada Speed Potions y any Elixer of Water Breathing potions.  Put into the Bank: Seaforium Booster.
08) Get en boat 64.39 to ve a BB...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[87] = {title = [[40 Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Once at BB, follow the lower docks y luego acepta "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 28.76.
02) Entra en small cabin (junto a hanging shark) y acepta "Scaring Shaky" 28.77.
03) Entra en Posada y make BB your new home 27.77.
04) Sube por stairs en Posada y entrega "The Rumormonger", acepta "Dream Dust in the Swamp".
05) Next to you en roof, ve a the Wind Rider Master 27.77 y vuela a Grom'gol, Stranglethorn.
06) At Grom'gol, acepta "Mok'thardin's Enchantment" 32.29.
07) By the Cauldron, entrega "The Troll Witchdoctor" 32.28.
08) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
09) Ve sur alrededor de 31.42 y haz "Mok'thardin's Enchantment": mata y lootea a Jungle Stalkers.
10) Make sure you are at least a half a bar away de nivel 39 (keep grinding on Jungle Stalkers & Cold Eye Basilisks until you are).
11) Luego ve back to Grom'gol y entrega "Mok'thardin's Enchantment" (32.29, #7 on map), acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
12) N/A
13) Ve este to el río alrededor de 39.29 y haz "Some Assembly Required": mata y lootea a Snapjaw Crocolisks /target along el río.
14) N/A
15) N/A
16) Usa la piedra de hogar a BB.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[88] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Ve just slightly NW of BB y clear the Bloodsail (humans) de the area, luego click en Bloodsail Correspondence scroll (en barrel 27.70) to entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers", acepta the next part.  (See Video)
02) Ve NE to Mistvale Valley alrededor de 32.67 y haz "Scaring Shaky" along with "Mok'thardin's Enchantment": mata y lootea a the Elder Mistvale Gorillas.  Very low drop rate para Aged Gorilla Sinew (but keep grinding until you get it).
03) Corre back SW to BB y cerca de boat pickup entrega "Scaring Shaky" 27.74, acepta "Return to MacKinley".
04) On the lower docks, entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 28.76, acepta the next part.
05) Entra en cabin (junto a hanging shark) y entrega "Return to MacKinley" 28.77, SKIP "Voodoo Dues" (for now).
06) Ve all the way upstairs en Posada luego ve over past the Alliance FP to Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks y entrega "Some Assembly Required" 28.78, acepta "Excelsior".
07) Vuelve hasta lo alto de the Posada (en boat-deck) y entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77, SKIP the next part (for now).
08) Next to you en roof, ve a the Wind Rider Master 27.77 y vuela a Grom'gol, Stranglethorn.
09) At Grom'gol, entrega "Mok'thardin's Enchantment" 32.29, acepta the next part.
10) By the Bubbling Cauldron, acepta "Split Bone Necklace" 32.28.
11) Entra en Posada y make Grom'gol your new home 31.30.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
12) You should be a little over half way to nivel 40.  Now I farmea the rest de way to 40 on Jungle Thunderers alrededor de 42.27 or the Venture Co. Geologists alrededor de 45.21.  These enemigos have less armor y die faster.  Instead de grinding, you could get a 5 man group to do the Scarlet Monastery dungeon.
13) Once you are nivel 40, usa la piedra de hogar a Grom'gol.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[89] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #32]], text = [[
01) At the top of Grom'gol's Posada, get en zeppelin to ve a the UC 32.29.
02) At UC's Bank 66.44, Mailbox 68.38 or AH get the following items out:  Fizzle Brassbolts' Letter, (if you can) stack of 9 Blue Pearls, (if you have them) Frost Oil, Gyrochronatom, stack of Elixir of Water Breathing + Nada Speed Potions.  And if you have Healing Potion, Lesser Invisibility Potion y a Patterned Bronze Bracers get those out también.  These items are used for easy entrega misiones en Badlands.  And remember to not sell these items to a vendedor.  Put en bank:  any Split Bone Necklaces you may have.
03) EPIC MOUNT:  At nivel 40 epic ground mounts become available, y only cost about 12 gold.  For more info go here.
04) Ve a the Bat Handler (63.49 en UC) y vuela a Hammerfall, Arathi.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[90] = {title = [[Badlands Corre Map]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) Corre all the way hacia el Badlands entrance 49.8.  See map for directions depending on where you are coming de.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[91] = {title = [[How to corre hacia el Badlands de Arathi Highlands - 41 Badlands - First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!! - Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)]], text = [[
01) As you entra en Badlands, farmea your way SW to Valley of Fangs y entrega "Martek the Exiled" 42.53, acepta "Indurium".  Next to you, acepta "Barbecued Buzzard Wings".  And if you have 9 Blue Pearls with you, acepta y entrega "Pearl Diving".
02) Ve sur a bit alrededor de 52.66 y haz "Indurium": mata y lootea a the Stonevault troggs.
03) Vuelve norte to Valley of Fangs y entrega "Indurium" (42.53, #1 on map).  Wait a few seconds luego acepta "News for Fizzle".
04) Ve NW to The Dustbowl, y en gnome 26.45, acepta "Study of the Elements: Rock".  If you have a Frost Oil item, acepta y completa the misión "Coolant Heads Prevail".  Luego if you have a Gyrochronatom item, acepta y completa the misión "Gyro... What?".
05) Farmea oeste to Kargath y get the FP there de the Wind Rider Master 4.45.  NOTE:  Keep your Hearthstone set to Grom'gol!
06) TBC, 5a) At the watchtower entrance acepta "Unclaimed Baggage" 6.48.
07) Sube por watchtower y acepta "Coyote Thieves" y "Report to Helgrum" 6.47.
08) Entra en Posada 3.46 y acepta "Broken Alliances" y (upstairs) "Badlands Reagent Run".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
09) Do "Study of the Elements: Rock" mata y lootea a Lesser Rock Elementals al norte en cliffs alrededor de 17.43.
10) Ve a The Dustbowl en gnome (26.45, #4 on map) y entrega "Study of the Elements: Rock", acepta the next part.
11) Farmea your way sur y haz "Study of the Elements: Rock": mata y lootea a Rock Elementals alrededor de 38.74.
12) Farmea your way norte to The Dustbowl en gnome (26.45, #4 on map) y entrega "Study of the Elements: Rock", acepta the next part.
13) TBC, 11a) Ve NE to Angor Fortress entrance 43.30, y haz "Unclaimed Baggage": make a left at la entrada luego en room before going down the pasos lootea the orange Empty Barrel 41.29.  Luego ve back hacia el main entrance y make a right at it, luego en room before going down the pasos lootea the Weapon Rack 42.27.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[92] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #01]], text = [[
01) Do the following 4 pasos below (in any order) alrededor de the western part of Badlands:
02) "Broken Alliances": mata y lootea a Boss Tho'grun /target.  This ogre patrols in a large circle counter-clockwise alrededor de the SW part of Badlands.  He has 5 bodyguards.  Pull/kite him away de his guardias to take him on 1v1. (See Video).  NOTE:  You can focus en next pasos until he shows up...
03) "Barbecued Buzzard Wings": mata y lootea a Buzzards.  There is a large amount of Giant Buzzards at 16.61.  And remember to not sell the Buzzard Wings to a vendedor.
04) "Coyote Thieves": mata y lootea a Coyotes.  Focus more en Elder Crag Coyotes alrededor de the western side of Badlands.
05) "Badlands Reagent Run": mata y lootea a Buzzards, Coyotes y Rock Elementals.  This misión will naturally get done by doing the others.
06) Ve sur y haz "Study of the Elements: Rock": mata y lootea a Greater Rock Elementals alrededor de 14.86, y more alrededor de 4.79.
07) Once all that is done, vuelve a Kargath, y al fondo de the watchtower entrega "Unclaimed Baggage" 6.48, luego go up en watchtower y entrega "Coyote Thieves".
08) Entra en Posada 50.66 y entrega "Broken Alliances", SKIP the next part (high nivel group misión).
09) Ve upstairs y entrega "Badlands Reagent Run" 50.66, SKIP the next part (dungeon).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
10) Ve este to The Dustbowl en gnome 51.66 y entrega "Study of the Elements: Rock".  If it is available, acepta "This Is Going To Be Hard", y turn it in right junto a you y acepta the next part.  Turn that in right junto a you y acepta the next part.  Mata y lootea a the Fam'retor Guardian that spawns in.  Luego turn it in.
11) Also, if you have a Healing Potion y a Lesser Invisibility Potion with you, acepta (if it is available) "Liquid Stone", luego turn it in.
12) And also if you have a Patterned Bronze Bracers with you, acepta (if it is available) "Stone Is Better than Cloth", luego turn it in.
13) Ve este (en middle of Badlands) y entrega "Barbecued Buzzard Wings" 42.53.
14) N/A
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[93] = {title = [[Alliance - Duskwood]], text = [[
01) Usa la piedra de hogar a Grom'gol.
02) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Now could be a good time to see if you have all the pages for "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn".  This misión requires that you have the following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.  If you have all of them, get them out now y ve a Nesingwary's Expedition 36.11 y turn this misión in.  If not, you will regresa a STV numerous times en future for more chances to find the pages.
04) Corre all the way to Swamp of Sorrows, stopping por el camino at Beggar's Haunt to acepta "Nothing But the Truth" (in Duskwood at 88.36).
05) Next to you, entrega "Nothing But the Truth" 87.35, skip the next part.
06) Corre este through Deadwind Pass, follow the main path y luego make a left into Ariden's Camp (52.38 in Deadwind Pass) just to discover it for XP.
07) Continue este into Swamp of Sorrows 61.41...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[94] = {title = [[42 Swamp of Sorrows]], text = [[
01) As you entra en Swamp of Sorrows (SoS) start working on "Dream Dust in the Swamp": mata y lootea a the dragon whelps alrededor de el lago (SW alrededor de 13.60 in SoS) para dream dust.  Just clear the whelps in this area once.  When you corre out of whelps to mata, move on hacia el next pasos:
02) N/A
03) Ve este y luego find y mata y lootea a Noboru the Cudgel /target.  See patrol path on map (spawns at 47.39).  He drops an item which starts "Noboru the Cudgel", acepta it.
04) Ve NW to The Harborage y entrega "Noboru the Cudgel" 26.31.  Acepta "Draenethyst Crystals" (no exclamation mark).
05) Ve SE to Stonard y en Posada make it your new home de the Innkeeper 45.57.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  NOTE: You can purchase potions de the vendedor upstairs en Posada.
06) Next to you en Posada, acepta "Lack of Surplus" 45.57.
07) Entra en building y acepta "Little Morsels" 48.55.  Ve upstairs y entrega "Report to Helgrum".  Next to you, acepta "Pool of Tears".
08) Potions, 8a) NOTE:  There is another potion vendedor 46.53 here you can check for Healing/Mana potions.
09) Do "Pool of Tears": lootea the Atal'ai Artifacts under el lago alrededor de the Temple of Atal Hakkar alrededor de 65.54.  Usa water breathing potions (if you're not undead) y any Nada Speed Potions if you have any.  ALSO:  Continue working on (if you still need to) "Dream Dust in the Swamp" by mata/looting any dragons you see alrededor de el lago.
10) Do "Lack of Surplus": mata y lootea a crocolisks.  There are Sawtooth Crocolisks (alrededor de the middle of SoS alrededor de 57.53) y Sawtooth Snappers (alrededor de the NE of SoS alrededor de 80.28).
11) Ve SE to Misty Reed Post y entrega "Lack of Surplus" 81.81, SKIP the next part.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[95] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Ve norte hacia el Fallow Sanctuary y de the human /target en cage 65.18, acepta y try to do the escolta a "Galen's Escape" (it's wise to clear the enemigos alrededor de the cage first).  While doing the escolta a also do "Draenethyst Crystals": lootea the Draenethyst Crystals alrededor de the village.  And do "Little Morsels": usa el/la Fel-Tainted Morsels misión item en 3 captured animals to feed them, listed below:
02) Feed Captured Jaguar 65.23.
03) Feed Captured Tarantula 63.24.
04) Feed Captured crocolisk 60.22.
05) Make sure "Dream Dust in the Swamp" is finished now by mata/looting the dragons alrededor de the Pools of Tears lake alrededor de 63.39.
06) Above Stonard, at Galen's Strongbox (junto a a tent 48.40), entrega (if you were able to do it) "Galen's Escape".
07) Ve oeste to The Harborage y entrega "Draenethyst Crystals" 26.31.
08) Hearth (or go SE) to Stonard y en building entrega "Little Morsels" 48.55.  Luego ve up en building y entrega "Pool of Tears", acepta "The Atal'ai Exile".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
09) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 46.55 y vuela a Booty Bay, Stranglethorn...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[96] = {title = [[43 Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Once you land, junto a you de Fleet Master Seahorn, acepta "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77.
02) Next to you en lo alto de the Posada, acepta "Skullsplitter Tusks" 27.77.
03) Next to you, entrega "Dream Dust in the Swamp" 27.77, SKIP "Rumors for Kravel" (for now).
04) Next to you de the dwarf 27.77, acepta "Up to Snuff".
05) Drop down en Posada y make BB your new home 27.77.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  You will not come back to town for awhile, so make sure you are well stocked.
06) Next to you 27.77, acepta "Venture Company Mining" y "Zanzil's Secret".
07) Ve junto a bank y acepta "Akiris by the Bundle" 27.76.
08) At the Bank 27.77 junto a you put the following item into it:  Bundle of Atal'ai Artifacts.  Get out de bank:  any Split Bone Necklaces you may have.
09) In the cabin (junto a hanging shark), acepta "Voodoo Dues" 28.77.
10) Ve norte up the docks y de Dizzy One-Eye, acepta "Keep An Eye Out" 29.76.
11) Justo al este de BB along the shore, do "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" along with "Up to Snuff" y "Keep An Eye Out": mata y lootea a the Bloodsail enemigos para Snuff along with Dizzy's Eye.  They can drop de any Bloodsail mob (low drop rates).  Also, mata 10 Bloodsail Swashbucklers.  And lootea the Bloodsail Orders en small boat 28.83 or it could be en table 27.83 at el campamento en end of la playa (or other spots alrededor de the camps).  And junto a you, lootea the Bloodsail Charts 27.83 on top de box junto a eastern most tent (See Image for Possible Locations).  It could also be at other spots en various camps along la playa.
12) Ve oeste (follow path on map) y haz "Mok'thardin's Enchantment" along with "Akiris by the Bundle": mata y lootea a the Naga Explorers y luego work your way up hacia el top y lootea The Holy Spring water fuente over el puente 29.62.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[97] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) Ve este cruzando path hacia el Ruins of Jubuwal y haz "Zanzil's Secret" along with "Voodoo Dues": mata y lootea a the Zanzil enemigos for Zanzil's Mixture y mata y lootea a the 3 named enemigos.  Mata y lootea a  Maury "Club Foot" Wilkins /target 35.51.  Mobs are tightly packed so be careful.  See next paso para other 2 enemigos to mata y lootea a...
03) Mata y lootea a Jon-Jon the Crow /target 35.52 by the Bonfire.
04) Mata y lootea a Chucky "Ten Thumbs" /target en Ruins of Aboraz este path entrance 34.54 (mob is at 40.58, see map on how to get there).  Watch out there is numerous stealthed panthers en pathway there.
05) Vuelve oeste hacia el main path, luego norte a bit hacia el ledges alrededor de 41.44 y haz "Venture Company Mining": mata y lootea a the Venture Co. goblins.
06) Ve norte hacia el troll Ruins alrededor de 42.36 y haz "Skullsplitter Tusks" along with "Split Bone Necklace": mata y lootea a the Skullsplitter trolls.  There is more enemigos just SE en other Ruins alrededor de 47.40 y NE alrededor de 46.33.
07) N/A
08) N/A
09) Ve a Grom'gol (by the Cauldron) y entrega "Split Bone Necklace" 32.28.  And click the Bubbling Cauldron to acepta "Marg Speaks".
10) Entrega "Mok'thardin's Enchantment" 32.29.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
11) Now could be a good time to see if you have all the pages for "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn".  This misión requires that you have the following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.  If you have all of them, get them out now (we will turn it in a few pasos later).  If not, you will regresa a STV one more time en future for one last chance to find the pages.
12) Oeste en shore do "Excelsior": mata y lootea a an Elder Saltwater Crocolisks /target (lvl 38).  There are 4 possible spawn locations try this one first 33.33, see map.  You should only need to mata y lootea a one of them.  Also these spawn by killing the regular Saltwater Crocolisks, so you may need to mata some of them first to get these to spawn in.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[98] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) At Nesingwary's Expedition, entrega (if you have all the Green Hills pages) "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn" 36.11.
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a BB.
04) Next to you en Posada 27.77, entrega "Venture Company Mining" y "Zanzil's Secret".
05) Ve up en Posada y entrega "Skullsplitter Tusks" y "Up to Snuff".  Also acepta "Rumors for Kravel" y "Tran'rek".
06) Next to you up the pasos en boat-deck, entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77, SKIP the next part (for now).
07) Stay up en top de docks y go over past the Alliance FP to Tan-Your-Hide Leatherworks y entrega "Excelsior" 28.78.
08) Drop down by the bank y entrega "Akiris by the Bundle" 27.76.  Luego en Bank junto a you, put into it:  Goblin Rumors.
09) Entra en cabin (junto a hanging shark) y entrega "Voodoo Dues" 28.77.  Acepta "Stoley's Debt".
10) Ve norte up the docks y de Dizzy One-Eye 29.76, entrega "Keep An Eye Out".
11) Get en boat en end of docks 26.73 to ve a Ratchet.
12) Once at Ratchet, ve a the Flight Master (63.37 in The Barrens) y vuela a Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[99] = {title = [[44 Dustwallow Marsh]], text = [[
01) You can get repaired/resupplied de Zulrg (ogre) 36.32.
02) By the Bonfire acepta "Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern" 36.31.
03) At Krog, entrega "Return to Krog" 36.32, acepta "More than Coincidence" y "The Grimtotem Plot".
04) At the Innkeeper, make Brackenwall Village your new home.
05) In the small cueva at Brackenwall Village, acepta "Identifying the Brood" 37.33.
06) At the este entrance of Brackenwall Village acepta "Army of the Black Dragon" 37.31.
07) Ve norte to Blackhoof Village alrededor de 42.13 y haz "The Grimtotem Plot" along with "More than Coincidence": mata y lootea a Grimtotem (taurens) to obtain 4 Grimtotem Notes, luego click on them in your backpack.  Also lootea 7 Blackhoof Armaments (spear racks) alrededor de the village.
08) Hearth (or vuelve), y at Krog 36.32, entrega "More than Coincidence" y "The Grimtotem Plot".  Acepta "Seek Out Tabetha".
09) At the Wind Rider Master /target 36.32 vuela a Mudsprocket, Dustwallow Marsh.
10) At Mudsprocket, by the green containers acepta "Catch a Dragon by the Tail" 42.73.
11) Next to you de the Wanted Poster acepta "WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous" 42.73.
12) In the Posada acepta "Bloodfen Feathers" 42.74.
13) In the Posada, talk hacia el Innkeeper (goblin) to make Mudsprocket your new home.  He is most likely up the pasos 42.74.
14) Ve NW to Bloodfen Burrow alrededor de 34.65 y haz "Bloodfen Feathers" along with "WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous": mata y lootea a the Bloodfen raptors.  And mata Goreclaw the Ravenous (bigger raptor /target).
15) Hearth (or vuelve) to Mudsprocket y en small hut entrega "WANTED: Goreclaw the Ravenous" 42.73.
16) In the Posada entrega "Bloodfen Feathers" 42.74.  Acepta "Banner of the Stonemaul" y "The Essence of Enmity".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[100] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #11]], text = [[
01) As you do this section start working en following:  "Army of the Black Dragon" (mata required amount of Firemane dragons), "The Essence of Enmity" (usa el/la Brogg's Totem misión item on Firemane dragon corpses), "Catch a Dragon by the Tail" (lootea Wyrmtail plants) y "Identifying the Brood" (mata y lootea a any dragon whelps):
02) Work your way NE to Tabetha's Farm y en hut entrega "Seek Out Tabetha" 46.57, acepta "Raze Direhorn Post!".
03) Ve NW to Direhorn Post y haz "Raze Direhorn Post!": use Tabetha's Torch misión item en following 3 tents:
04) Burn the Este Tent 48.48.
05) Burn the Northeast Tent 47.47.  Also at this tent mata y lootea a Apothecary Cylla , she drops an item which starts "The Apothecary's Letter", acepta it.
06) Burn the Norte Tent 47.46.
07) Back dentro de cabin 46.57 (#2 on map) entrega "Raze Direhorn Post!", acepta "Justice Dispensed".
08) Ve este hacia el shore/water alrededor de 56.61 y haz "Marg Speaks": mata y lootea a the Muckshell enemigos until the Jeweled Pendant drops (very low drop rate).
09) Exit the shore (at 53.64).
10) Ve oeste to Stonemaul Ruins y haz "Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern": pick up the 3 misión objects.  First one is Mok'Morokk's Snuff (middle de fenced area 45.66).  See next pasos for other two:
11) Ve oeste y lootea Mok'Morokk's Grog (before la cueva entrance 39.66).  Luego mata the dragon that spawns.
12) Entra en cueva junto a you y en end of it lootea Mok'Morokk's Strongbox 37.70.
13) Also en same cueva do "Banner of the Stonemaul": lootea the Stonemaul Clan Banner 38.69.
14) Before leaving la cueva (exit at 39.66) make sure you finish killing the 5 Firemane Scalebanes /target needed for "Army of the Black Dragon" (as they are generally only found here).
15) Finish "The Essence of Enmity": usa el/la Brogg's Totem misión item on Firemane dragon corpses.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[101] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #12]], text = [[
01) Vuelve SE to Mudsprocket y en Posada 42.74 entrega "Banner of the Stonemaul" y "The Essence of Enmity".  Acepta "Spirits of Stonemaul Hold".
02) NE at Stonemaul Ruins alrededor de 45.66 do "Spirits of Stonemaul Hold": click en Ogre Remains (skeletons en ground), luego mata the ogre spirits that spawn.
03) Around Stonemaul Ruins finish "Army of the Black Dragon": mata required amount of Firemane dragons.
04) Back en Posada at Mudsprocket entrega "Spirits of Stonemaul Hold" 42.74  (#1 on map), acepta "Challenge to the Black Flight".
05) Continue working on "Catch a Dragon by the Tail" by looting any Wyrmtail (plants) you see por el camino:
06) Ve SE to la entrada of Onyxia's Lair 53.77 y haz "Challenge to the Black Flight": usa el/la Stonemaul Banner misión item at la entrada.
07) Work your way back NW to Mudsprocket while finishing "Catch a Dragon by the Tail" y "Identifying the Brood": lootea 8 Wyrmtail (plants).  And mata y lootea a any dragon whelps.  These are found all alrededor de Wyrmbog (#5 on map).
08) Back at Mudsprocket by the green containers entrega "Catch a Dragon by the Tail" 42.73 (#1 on map).
09) In the Posada entrega "Challenge to the Black Flight" 42.74.
10) At the NE outskirts of town, ve a the Flight Master 43.72 y vuela a Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh.
11) At the oeste side of Brackenwall Village, entrega "Marg Speaks" 35.31, acepta "Report to Zor".
12) By the Bonfire, entrega "Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern" 36.31.
13) At the este entrance of Brackenwall Village entrega "Army of the Black Dragon" 37.31.
14) In the small cueva, entrega "Identifying the Brood" 37.33.  Wait a few seconds luego acepta "The Brood of Onyxia".
15) At Krog, entrega "Justice Dispensed" 36.32.
16) Junto a Bonfire, entrega "The Brood of Onyxia" 36.31, acepta the next part.
17) Back en small cueva entrega "The Brood of Onyxia" 37.33, SKIP the next part (for now).
18) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  If for some reason you turned nivel 45, remember to get the lvl 45 food/drink 37.32.
19) Ve a the Wind Rider Master /target 36.32 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[102] = {title = [[PLEASE READ With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you will most likely be well into nivel 44. Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into 44-45 Tanaris section below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  However if for some reason you are in nivel 43 you can consider doing this section.]], text = [[
01) 44 Desolace
02) At Shadowprey Village, on top de mound junto a gong 26.68, acepta (if it's available) "Portals of the Legion" (no exclamation mark).  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) N/A
04) N/A
05) Ve NE hacia el Kodo Graveyard y acepta "Ghost-o-Plasm Round Up" (48.62).
06) Ve este to Ghost Walker Post (entrance is 56.57)...
07) Gira a la izquierda at la entrada, luego ve cruzando bridge y acepta "The Corrupter" 53.54.
08) N/A
09) Ve SW hacia el Valley of Bones alrededor de 64.91 y haz "Ghost-o-Plasm Round Up": en big skeleton bones sticking out de ground, first clear out the skeletons, luego usa el/la Crate of Ghost Magnets misión item there, luego mata y lootea a the Magrami Spectre that spawn in para plasms.
10) Ve NW hacia el Mannoroc Coven y haz "The Corrupter" (Elite): mata Lord Azrethoc /target (lvl 40 elite doomguard that patrols alrededor de) y also mata Jugkar Grim'rod /target (lvl 40 orc warlock, at 56.78).
11) At the Mannoroc Coven do (if you have it) "Portals of the Legion": click en Demon Portals, luego mata the Demon Portal Guardians that spawn to banish the portals.  Portal locations are:  55.79 54.79 53.80 53.82 53.84 51.81 50.77 50.74 51.71 55.72
12) Ve a Ghost Walker Post (entrance is 56.58, #5 on map)...
13) Gira a la izquierda at la entrada, luego ve cruzando bridge y entrega "The Corrupter" (53.54, #6 on map).
14) Ve a the Kodo Graveyard y entrega "Ghost-o-Plasm Round Up" (48.62, #4 on map).
15) Vuelve a Shadowprey Village y on top de mound junto a gong (26.68, #1 on map), entrega (if you have it) "Portals of the Legion". Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
16) Usa la piedra de hogar a Thunder Bluff.
17) Ve a the Wind Rider Master en lo alto de la torre en middle of TB 47.50 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[103] = {title = [[45 Tanaris]], text = [[
01) As you entra en Gadgetzan (junto a crane 52.27) entrega "Tran'Rek", SKIP "Scarab Shells" (Dungeon).
02) De the Wanted Poster junto a cage entrance 52.27, acepta "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting" y "WANTED: Andre Firebeard".
03) Entra en Posada en este side y make Gadgetzan your new home de the Innkeeper 53.28.
04) Junto a Posada en windmill (just sur 52.28), acepta "Water Pouch Bounty" y "Wastewander Justice".
05) At the Bank junto a you 52.29, get the following items out:  Goblin Rumors y Seaforium Booster.  Put en bank:  Jeweled Pendant.
06) At the western side of Gadgetzan on top de hill, acepta "Gadgetzan Water Survey" 50.27.
07) Ve norte hacia el Shimmering Flats en Mirage Raceway y de the dwarf entrega "Rumors for Kravel" (78.77 in Thousand Needles).  Wait a few seconds, luego acepta "Back to Booty Bay".
08) Next to you de the gnome, entrega "News for Fizzle" 78.77.
09) Ve over hacia el goblin's side de Mirage Raceway y entrega "Razzeric's Tweaking" 80.76, acepta "Safety First".  Next to you, acepta "Keeping Pace".
10) At the goblin Zamek 80.77 /target junto a Goblin Racer, click on Completa Quest to setup a distraction, luego ve en gnome's hut y click on Rizzle's Unguarded Plans 77.77 to entrega "Keeping Pace", acepta "Rizzle's Schematics".
11) Ve a the goblin Pozzik y entrega "Rizzle's Schematics" 80.76.
12) Hearth (or vuelve) to Gadgetzan.  NOTE:  You can now destroy the Sample of Indurium Ore as it is no longer used for anything.
13) De Shreev en western side of Gadgetzan, entrega "Safety First" 51.27, SKIP the next part.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[104] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #16]], text = [[
01) Farmea your way este hacia el Noonshade Ruins alrededor de 60.24 y start working on "Wastewander Justice" along with "Water Pouch Bounty": mata y lootea a the Wastewander humans.  NOTES:  Do not sell the Wastewander Water Pouches to a vendedor!  Just clear the area once y continue on...
02) Ve este to Steamwheedle Port y de the female goblin under the red tent, acepta "Pirate Hats Ahoy!" 67.22.
03) De the male troll under the green tent, acepta "Screecher Spirits" 67.22.
04) At the other side de Port, en hut 67.24, entrega "Stoley's Debt", acepta "Stoley's Shipment".  And junto a you, acepta "Southsea Shakedown".
05) Ve SW hacia el Waterspring Field alrededor de 64.30 y finish "Wastewander Justice" along with "Water Pouch Bounty": mata y lootea a the needed Wastewander enemigos.  Also, keep an eye out for Caliph Scorpidsting /target, he patrols alrededor de the area y has 2 rogues following him.  This is for "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting", y you will have another opportunity later to do this if you cannot find him now.
06) Ve a Lost Rigger Cove (entrada en 69.42)...
07) Start working on "Southsea Shakedown" along with "Pirate Hats Ahoy!": mata y lootea a the Southsea pirates (the Southsea Dock Workers are up at wood platforms 75.47).  Any of these enemigos has a chance to drop a Pirate's footlocker, which could contain an item which starts "Ship Schedules", acepta it if you are able to find it, otherwise it can be skipped.  While doing this, also go do the following 2 pasos below in this same area:
08) "Stoley's Shipment": lootea the Stolen Cargo up en building 72.47.
09) "WANTED: Andre Firebeard": mata y lootea a Andre Firebeard /target en middle de cove 73.47.  Watch out this fight usually involves 3 adds.  (See Video).
10) Once all these are done (including "Southsea Shakedown" along with "Pirate Hats Ahoy!"), luego usa la piedra de hogar a Gadgetzan.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[105] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #17]], text = [[
01) Junto a Posada en windmill 52.28, entrega "Water Pouch Bounty" y "Wastewander Justice", acepta "More Wastewander Justice".
02) Ve oeste to Sandsorrow Watch y haz "Gadgetzan Water Survey": usa el/la Untapped Dowsing Widget misión item en pool 39.29.  Watch out, as soon as you fill the widget, a few high nivel bugs will spawn.  Either corre away or try to mata them.
03) Hearth (or go back este) to Gadgetzan y on top de hill, entrega "Gadgetzan Water Survey" 50.27, SKIP "Noxious Lair Investigation" (for now).
04) Farmea este to Steamwheedle Port y de the female goblin under the red tent, entrega "Pirate Hats Ahoy!" 67.22.  Luego you can get resupplied en hut junto a you.
05) At the other side de Port, en hut 67.24, entrega "Stoley's Shipment", acepta "Deliver to MacKinley".  Next to you, entrega "WANTED: Andre Firebeard", "Southsea Shakedown" y (if you have it) "Ship Schedules".
06) Ve SW hacia el Waterspring Field alrededor de 60.37 y haz "More Wastewander Justice" along with (if you still need to) "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting": mata the needed Wastewander humans y mata y lootea a Caliph Scorpidsting /target, he patrols alrededor de the area y has 2 rogues following him.  He usually spawns at 59.40.
07) Hearth (or corre back) to Gadgetzan y en windmill junto a Posada (52.29, #1 on map), entrega "More Wastewander Justice" y "WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting".
08) Entra en Bank junto a you 52.29 y put into it:  Kravel's Scheme, Stoley's Bottle, any Wastewander Water Pouches y if you have found the item called OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, put that in your bank también (y don't acepta the misión de it yet).
09) Ve a the Wind Rider Master (norte of Gadgetzan, 52.25) y vuela a Freewind Post, Thousand Needles.
10) Ve oeste into Feralas entrance 7.10...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[106] = {title = [[46 Feralas]], text = [[
01) Corre into Camp Mojache, make a right, luego acepta "A New Cloak's Sheen" 76.43.
02) Continue into the town y de Rok Orhan /target (she patrols back y forth en town), acepta "The Ogres of Feralas".
03) WOTLK, 2b) In the hut 76.44, acepta "Dark Heart" y "Vengeance on the Northspring".
04) De the goblin en small mound, acepta "Gordunni Cobalt" 76.44.
05) Flight Path, 3b) Get the FP junto a you 75.44.
06) Between the tents, acepta "War on the Woodpaw" 75.42.
07) In the big tent acepta "The Mark of Quality" 74.43.
08) Justo afuera de the big tent on your right (de Witch Doctor Uzer'i) acepta "A Strange Request" 74.43 y "The Sunken Temple".
09) Entra en Posada y make Camp Mojache your new home 75.45.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  If you turned nivel 45, remember to get the lvl 45 food/drink.
10) Ve just norte of Camp Mojache alrededor de 73.39 y haz "War on the Woodpaw": mata y lootea a the Woodpaw gnolls.
11) WOTLK, 8b) Ve just cruzando river over to Lariss Pavilion y entrega "A Strange Request" 77.38, acepta "Retrun to Witch Doctor Uzer'i".
12) Ve NE hacia el Gordunni Outpost entrance 75.35 y haz "The Ogres of Feralas" along with "Gordunni Cobalt": mata the needed Gordunni ogres y use Orwin's Shovel misión item en bluish haze de the ground, luego click en Gordunni Dirt Mounds para Gordunni Cobalt.  And lootea one de Gordunni Scrolls laying del suelo alrededor de the Outpost (there could be one junto a tree log 75.30), luego acepta "The Gordunni Scroll" de it.
13) WOTLK, 9b) Hearth (or vuelve) to Camp Mojache y junto a big tent de Witch Doctor Uzer'i 74.43, entrega "Retrun to Witch Doctor Uzer'i".  Wait a few seconds luego acepta "Testing the Vessel" y "Natural Materials".  NOTE:  We will turn the rest de misiones in a few pasos later.
14) Just norte alrededor de Camp Mojache alrededor de 72.43, do "Testing the Vessel": usa el/la Beast Muisek Vessel misión item en corpses of Ironfur Bears or Longtooth Runners (wolves).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[107] = {title = [[WOTLK, 00) Hearth (or vuelve) to Camp Mojache y junto a big tent de Witch Doctor Uzer'i 74.43, entrega "Testing the Vessel", acepta "Hippogryph Muisek".]], text = [[
01) Between the two tents, entrega "War on the Woodpaw" 75.42, acepta "Alpha Strike".
02) De the goblin en small mound, entrega "Gordunni Cobalt" 76.44.
03) De Rok Orhan /target (she patrols back y forth en town), entrega "The Ogres of Feralas" (acepta the next part) y "The Gordunni Scroll", acepta "Dark Ceremony".
04) NOTE: You can check the Alchemy Supplies vendedor for potions y vende la basura 76.43.
05) Ve sur to Woodpaw Hills y haz "Alpha Strike": mata 5 Woodpaw Alphas /target.  There is generally one Alpha at each de bigger camps en area, which include: 75.56 71.56 72.57 73.56 69.56 69.54 77.57.
06) Hearth (or vuelve) to Camp Mojache y between the two tents, entrega "Alpha Strike" (75.42, #1 on map), acepta "Woodpaw Investigation".
07) Vuelve a Woodpaw Hills y de the Woodpaw Battle Map scroll en crate 72.56 entrega "Woodpaw Investigation", acepta "The Battle Plans".
08) Hearth (or vuelve) Camp Mojache.
09) Between the two tents, entrega "The Battle Plans" (75.42, #1 on map).  Acepta "Zukk'ash Infestation" y "Stinglasher".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[108] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) Ve sur to The Writhing Deep y haz "Stinglasher" along with "Zukk'ash Infestation": mata y lootea a the Zukk'ash bugs y also mata y lootea a Stinglasher /target.  He is at la cueva entrance of either 77.61 or 74.64.
02) Ve NW y haz "Screecher Spirits": mata the Screecher enemigos, luego usa el/la Yeh'kinya's Bramble misión item en corpse, luego talk hacia el Screecher Spirit that spawns.  There are some Screechers alrededor de 59.51 y see map for more locations.  NOTES:  The Screechers have a spell silence attack.  Do the next paso in that same area while doing this:
03) Ve norte to la entrada of Dire Maul at 43.70 only to get it Discovered.  Simply discovering Dire Maul in this area will allow you to acepta a future misión.  You need to actually discover the zone, you will know when you achieved that when your general chat switches over to Dire Maul.
04) Ve a the Ruins of Isildien (starting at 61.56 y work your way sur) y haz "The Ogres of Feralas": mata the required amount of Gordunni ogres.  The Maulers are norte y the Shamans are sur.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
05) Do "Dark Ceremony": mata y lootea a the Gordunni Mage-Lords until you get the Gordunni Orb.  These enemigos are sur en Ruins of Isildien 61.95.
06) WOTLK, 5a) Ve just oeste to The High Wilderness alrededor de 55.66 y haz "Hippogryph Muisek": usa el/la Hippogryph Muisek Vessel misión item on any Frayfeather hippogryph corpses.  Also do part of "Natural Materials": mata y lootea a the Frayfeather enemigos (hippogryphs) para 20 Resilient Sinew y 40 Metallic Fragments.  Keep next paso in mind:
07) WOTLK, 5b) Sur de Hippogryphs along the cliffs alrededor de 58.76, lootea a Hippogryph Egg in one de nests.  This will be turned in at Tanaris for a later misión.  And remember to not sell this!
08) Ve NW hacia el Feral Scar Vale alrededor de 55.56 y haz "The Mark of Quality": mata y lootea a the Feral Scar yetis.  NOTE:  While questing in Feralas, you may come across an item called OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-22/FE!" y turn this in a través de small cueva at Feral Scar 53.56, but do NOT do the follow-up escolta a misión.  Also the yetis can be quite dangerous dentro de cueva so try to avoid that if you can.
09) WOTLK, 6b) Hearth (or vuelve) to Camp Mojache, luego junto a big tent de Witch Doctor Uzer'i 74.43, entrega "Hippogryph Muisek", acepta "Faerie Dragon Muisek".  REMINDER:  Do not sell your Hippogryph Egg.
10) In the big tent entrega "The Mark of Quality" 74.43.
11) Between the two tents, entrega "Zukk'ash Infestation" y "Stinglasher" 75.42.  Acepta "Zukk'ash Report".
12) De Rok Orhan /target (she patrols back y forth en town), entrega "Dark Ceremony" y "The Ogres of Feralas", acepta "The Gordunni Orb".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
13) WOTLK, 9a) Ve SW alrededor de 69.48 y haz "A New Cloak's Sheen" (mata y lootea a the Sprite Darters), y haz "Faerie Dragon Muisek" (usa el/la Faerie Dragon Muisek Vessel misión item on Sprite Darter corpses).  Also do part of "Natural Materials": mata y lootea a the Sprite Darters para 6 Encrusted Minerals.
14) WOTLK, 9b) Hearth (or vuelve) to Camp Mojache, y at Witch Doctor Uzer'i 74.43 entrega "Faerie Dragon Muisek", acepta "Treant Muisek".  Also entrega (if it's completa) "Natural Materials".
15) WOTLK, 9c) On the eastern side of Camp Mojache, entrega "A New Cloak's Sheen" 76.43, acepta "A Grim Discovery".
16) WOTLK, 9d) Do "Treant Muisek" y finish (if you still need to) "Natural Materials": mata y lootea a  Wandering Forest Walkers /target para 2 Splintered Logs y usa el/la Treant Muisek Vessel misión item on Wandering Forest Walker /target corpses.  There is several alrededor de 72.43.
17) WOTLK, 9e) Ve norte y haz "A Grim Discovery": mata y lootea a the Grimtotem taurens para horns alrededor de 67.46.  There's another camp of enemigos just norte alrededor de 69.40.
18) WOTLK, 9f) Hearth (or vuelve) to Camp Mojache, y at Witch Doctor Uzer'i 74.43 entrega "Treant Muisek", acepta "Mountain Giant Muisek".  And entrega (if you haven't yet) "Natural Materials".
19) WOTLK, 9g) On the eastern side of Camp Mojache, entrega "A Grim Discovery" 76.43, acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
20) WOTLK, 9h) Head oeste en main path all the way hacia el goblin 45.43 y acepta "Zapped Giants".
21) WOTLK, 9i) Ve norte (exit at 47.38) to Ruins of Ravenwind alrededor de 40.13 y haz "Vengeance on the Northspring": mata the needed Northspring harpies.  Also, keep grinding on harpies until the Horn of Hatetalon drops, luego use this item para next misión:
22) WOTLK, 9j) Up norte in Ruins of Ravenwind do "Dark Heart": usa el/la Horn of Hatetalon misión item en two big stones 41.9 to summon Edana Hatetalon (lvl 50), luego mata y lootea a her..
23) WOTLK, 9k) Ve just SW to The Twin Colossals alrededor de 39.24 y haz "Mountain Giant Muisek" along with "Zapped Giants": use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker misión item on any giant (this removes the elite status), luego usa el/la Mountain Giant Muisek Vessel misión item en corpses.
24) WOTLK, 9l) Ve sur hacia el goblin junto a dock y entrega "Zapped Giants" 45.43 (#9h on map).
25) WOTLK, 9m) Hearth (or vuelve) to Camp Mojache.
26) WOTLK, 9n) De Witch Doctor Uzer'i 74.43, entrega "Mountain Giant Muisek".  Acepta "Weapons of Spirit".  Luego instead of waiting para doc, just do the next paso:
27) WOTLK, 9o) At the other side of Camp Mojache under the hut 76.44, entrega "Dark Heart" y "Vengeance on the Northspring".
28) WOTLK, 9p) Vuelve a Witch Doctor Uzer'i 74.43 y entrega "Weapons of Spirit".
29) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 75.44 y vuela a Orgrimmar, Durotar.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[109] = {title = [[Orgrimmar]], text = [[
01) Ve a the Bank 50.69 y put en bank:  Hippogryph Egg, Yeh'kinya's Bramble.  And get the following items out de bank:  Jeweled Pendant.  Also (depending on what cloth donations you already turned in at Orgrimmar) get your Silk Cloth y Mageweave Cloth out of your bank or mailbox 51.70.  You would need 60 or 120 Silk Cloth y 60 or 120 Mageweave Cloth.  This is for Cloth Donation misiones you are about to entrega.
02) Ve a The Drag y up en hut, entrega "Zukk'ash Report" 56.47.
03) Drop down to Magar's Cloth Goods y entrega the cloth donations hacia el Orc's Horde Cloth Quartermaster 64.51.  Also, if you only have 60 Silk Cloth, save that para other Silk Cloth entrega later instead!
04) Ve in Droffers And Sons Salvage y acepta "Ripple Recovery" 60.37.  Next to you, turn that in y acepta the next part.
05) Ve este hacia el Valley of Honor at Belgrom Rockmaul 75.34 y entrega "Parts of the Swarm" y "A Grim Discovery".  Acepta "Betrayed".
06) GET NEW ABILITIES, 5b) If you need to, get new spells/abilities.
07) Ve a Grommash Hold in The Valley of Wisdom y entrega "Report to Zor" 39.38.  Acepta/Completa "Service to the Horde"
08) Ve a Darkbriar Lodge en Valley of Spirits y entrega "The Gordunni Orb" 39.86.
09) Next to you, entrega as much cloth as you can hacia el Horde Cloth Quartermaster 38.88 (para troll faction).
10) Get en zeppelin (51.14 in Durotar) to ve a The Undercity.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[110] = {title = [[The Undercity]], text = [[
01) Ve a the Bank en middle of The Undercity 66.44 y put the following items into the bank:  Sealed Letter to Ag'tor.  Get out (if you can) 60 Wool Cloth, luego 60 Silk Cloth, y luego 60 Mageweave Cloth (for cloth donation misiones).
02) N/A
03) Next to you, entrega any cloth you have hacia el Undead's Horde Cloth Quartermaster 72.29.
04) Ve oeste to The War Quarter hacia el Weapon Master 57.33 y if you have extra gold to spare, feel free to learn all the weapons de him.
05) Ve SW to The Apothecarium entrance 52.80 y acepta "Seeping Corruption" 49.71.
06) Next to you en same room, acepta "Errand for Apothecary Zinge" 50.68.
07) Out en other room, entrega "Errand for Apothecary Zinge" 59.55, acepta the next part.
08) Vuelve down en Apothecarium Quarter entrance 52.80 y entrega "Errand for Apothecary Zinge" (50.68, #5 on map), acepta "Into the Field".
09) 08b) Check the AH 71.47 for a Mithril Casing y if you are able to get it, store it in your bank for now for a later misión at Un'goro Crater.  If you can't get it now, you will be reminded twice more later to see if you can get this.
10) Ve a the Bank en middle of The Undercity (66.44, #1 on map) y put the following items into it:  Kravel's Scheme, Stoley's Bottle, Field Testing Kit y Box of Empty Vials.  Get the following items out:  (if you have one) Nada Speed Potion.
11) Sal de the UC y get en zeppelin to ve a Grom'gol, STV (62.59 in Tirisfal Glades).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[111] = {title = [[PLEASE READ With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you should already be either well into nivel 47 or nivel 48. Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into 47-47 Stranglethorn Vale section below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  However if you are in your 46s you should consider doing this section.  If you are NOT doing this section luego abandon "Testing the Vessel", "Lines of Communication".]], text = [[
01) 47 Hinterlands
02) Here are the prerequisites to this section:
03) -Acepta: "Lines of Communication" en UC (magic quarter)
04) -Acepta: "Grim Message" at Grom'gol (in STV)
05) Entra en Hinterlands (entrada en 87.29 in Hillsbrad Foothills).  NOTE:  Farmea on any Trained Razorbeaks or Wild Gryphons you see por el camino as they drop Long Elegant Feathers, you need 10 of these for a later misión, y remember to not sell these to a vendedor.
06) Ve up to Shindigger's Camp y entrega "Ripple Recovery" 27.49, acepta "A Sticky Situation".
07) Ve all the way to Revantusk Village y de the Blacksmithing Supplies vendedor, acepta "Vilebranch Hooligans" 78.80.
08) Up en hut (junto a carreta), de Mystic Yayo'jin, acepta "Cannibalistic Cousins" 79.78.
09) At the other hut junto a you, de Otho Moji'ko, acepta "Message to the Wildhammer" 79.79.
10) Next to you de the Stable Master 79.80, acepta "Stalking the Stalkers", "Hunt the Savages" y "Avenging the Fallen".
11) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  Before you go out y start questing make sure you stock up heavily on food/water/supplies because you won't be back to town for while.
12) Time to do the good ol' Hinterlands farmea!  Do the following 12 pasos below.  They don't need to be done in that specific order, but start doing the ones on top first.  Have fun!
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[112] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #26]], text = [[
01) At any time you find an item called OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-09/HL!".  If so, go turn this in en middle of el lago on top de hill 49.38, but do NOT do the escolta a yet!
02) "Stalking the Stalkers": mata Silvermane Stalkers (eastern side of Hinterlands ramp entrance 76.62) y Silvermane Howlers (middle of Hinterlands).
03) "Cannibalistic Cousins": mata Vilebranch Scalpers y Vilebranch Soothsayers (trolls).  There are several camps of these enemigos (starting at 71.48), another one alrededor de 66.45, 53.39, y 48.67.
04) "Testing the Vessel": usa el/la Wildkin Muisek Vessel misión item en corpse of any Owlbeast scattered alrededor de The Hinterlands.  These include the following Owlbeasts:  Marauding, Primitive, Savage, y Vicious.  Focusing en Savages /targetthe most (#4 on map), because de next paso:
05) "Hunt the Savages": mata Savage Owlbeasts.  There are only 11 mob spawns alrededor de the middle-eastern part of Hinterlands.  (this is also #4 on map)
06) "Vilebranch Hooligans": lootea Slagtree's Lost Tools.  There are 5 possible spawn locations (73.53, 71.49, 66.45, 57.43, or 53.39).
07) "A Sticky Situation": lootea the Horde Supply Crates in la cueva at Skull Rock (entrada en 58.40).  Once this is completed, keep the first 2 pasos in mind de the next section.
08) "Avenging the Fallen": mata y lootea a the Razorbeak Skylord /targetfor the Skylord Plume.  There are only two spawn locations.  One patrols alrededor de 54.50, y another one patrols alrededor de 68.53.
09) "Lines of Communication": at Quel'Danil Lodge, click en following 3 scrolls en ground:  The Highvale Records 32.47 en building.  The Highvale Notes 30.49 afuera by the well, barrel y lamppost.  The Highvale Report 29.46 under the gazebo.  While you are here, keep the next paso in mind:
10) "Message to the Wildhammer": mata the required amount of Highvale elves alrededor de Quel'Danil Lodge.
11) "Rin'ji is Trapped!": en building y de Rin'Ji en cage (31.47, #10 on map), acepta the escolta a de him y luego escolta a him out of  Quel'Danil Lodge.  TIP:  Clear out el camino frente a lodge first.
12) "Grim Message": mata y lootea a the Witherbark trolls to obtain 20 Witherbark Skulls.  There is one village 32.58 y another one 23.58.  Luego use Nimboya's Pike misión item en Hiri'watha village (32.58, #12 on map).  Usa it twice:  first to combine the skulls, luego to plant the pike en ground.  Also while doing this misión, acepta "Venom Bottles" de one of those little Venom Bottles en table (at either village).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[113] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #27]], text = [[
01) Ve a el camino (starting at 21.48)...
02) Sube por path to Shindigger's Camp y entrega "A Sticky Situation" 27.49.  Acepta "Ripple Delivery".
03) Ve este hacia el little island en sea (use a Nada Speed Potion if you have one) y click on Rin'ji's Secret tablet 86.59 to entrega "Rin'ji is Trapped!", acepta "Rin'ji's Secret".
04) Ve a Revantusk Village y de the Blacksmithing Supplies vendedor, entrega "Vilebranch Hooligans" 78.80.  NOTE:  Save 10 Long Elegant Feathers you have, as it is used for a later misión, y haz not sell them to a vendedor.
05) Up en hut (junto a carreta), de Mystic Yayo'jin, entrega "Cannibalistic Cousins" 79.78.
06) At the other hut junto a you, de Otho Moji'ko, entrega "Message to the Wildhammer" 79.79.  Only acepta y entrega "Another Message to the Wildhammer" if you have 10 Long Elegant Feathers with you luego SKIP "The Final Message to the Wildhammer" (for now).  If not, you will have another opportunity to turn this in later.
07) Next to you de the Stable Master 79.80, entrega "Stalking the Stalkers", "Hunt the Savages" y "Avenging the Fallen".
08) Ve a the end de docks y de the Wind Rider Master 82.82, vuela a Hammerfall, Arathi.
09) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 82.82 y vuela a Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad.
10) Entra en small house 61.19 y entrega "Venom Bottles", acepta "Undamaged Venom Sac".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[114] = {title = [[Undead - Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) Vuelve into the Hinterlands (don't fly) (entrada en 87.29 in Hillsbrad)...
02) Ve a Shadra'Alor entrance 36.64, go hasta lo alto de the temple (farmea enemigos por el camino), luego drop down y entrega "The Atal'ai Exile" 34.75 (See Video on where to find this dude at), acepta "Return to Fel'Zerul"
03) In the immediate area, do "Undamaged Venom Sac": mata y lootea a Witherbark Broodguards (spiders) para Undamaged Venom Sac (low drop rate).
04) REMINDER:  While questing, you may have found an item called OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-09/HL!".  If so, go turn this in en middle of el lago on top de hill 49.38, but do NOT do the escolta a yet!
05) Usa la piedra de hogar a Tarren Mill.
06) In the small house junto a Posada, entrega "Undamaged Venom Sac" (61.19 in Hillsbrad).  NOTE:  Only acepta "Consult Master Gadrin" if you still need to get a mount as a troll, as you turn it in en same spot, otherwise skip it.
07) Ve a the Bat Handler 60.19 y vuela a Undercity, Tirisfal.
08) Ve a the Bank 66.44 en middle de UC y get the following items out:  Kravel's Scheme y Stoley's Bottle.  And put en Bank:  Dran's Ripple Delivery, 10 Wildkin Muisek, Wildkin Muisek Vessel y your stack of Long Elegant Feathers (if you still need to entrega the misión for them).
09) If you still need to, ve a The Magic Quarter 72.29 y entrega "A Donation of Mageweave" (you need 60 Mageweave Cloth for this).
10) Next to you en Magic Quarter 73.33, entrega "Rin'ji's Secret" y "Lines of Communication".  Luego completa "Oran's Gratitude".
11) Check the AH 71.47 for a Mithril Casing y if you are able to get it, store it in your bank for now for a later misión at Un'goro Crater.  If you can't get it now, you will be reminded once more later to see if you can get this.
12) Sal de the UC y get en zeppelin to ve a Grom'gol (62.59 in Tirisfal Glades).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[115] = {title = [[47 Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) N/A
02) N/A
03) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 33.29 y vuela a Booty Bay, Stranglethorn.
04) When you land, junto a you de Fleet Master Seahorn acepta "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77.
05) Drop down en Posada y make BB your new home 27.77.
06) Next to you en Posada, entrega "Back to Booty Bay" 27.77.
07) Entra en cabin (junto a hanging shark) y entrega "Deliver to MacKinley" 28.77.
08) N/A
09) Ve cerca de end de docks y acepta "The Captain's Chest" 27.74.
10) Ve este hacia el shore y attempt to do "The Captain's Chest" (Elite): mata y lootea a Gorlash /target.  This lvl 42 elite giant patrols up y down the shore alrededor de 37.70.   You may need to group up with someone, if you cannot do it, it can be skipped.
11) Search the shores este of BB for Half-Buried Bottles until a Carefully Folded Note shows up, de it acepta "Message in a Bottle".
12) Ve a the island este of BB (use Nada Speed if you can), plus watch out para lvl 41 stealthed panthers there, luego entrega "Message in a Bottle" 39.81, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  If the Carefully Folded Note item remains in your inventory, you can destroy it.
13) Este en island do "Message in a Bottle": mata y lootea a King Mukla /target (lvl 42 big gorilla, at 41.84).
14) Back NW en island entrega "Message in a Bottle" (#12 on map, 39.81).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[116] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) Do "The Bloodsail Buccaneers": mata the 3 pirates in each de 3 ships.  Also find a scroll laying en ground (can be in any de 3 ships) called Cortello's Riddle, y de it acepta "Cortello's Riddle".  Sometimes this scroll can be en basement de ships, so search there too.  The first pirate to mata is Captain Stillwater down the first flight of stairs en ship 33.88.  See next pasos para other 2:
02) Mata Fleet Master Firallon down the first flight of stairs en middle ship 31.91.  Watch out for Ironpatch en room before Firallon, take him on alone first.
03) Mata Captain Keelhaul down the first flight of stairs en last ship 29.88.  Make sure you find the scroll that starts "Cortello's Riddle" before leaving this area.  NOTE:  After accepting "Cortello's Riddle" you can luego destroy the scroll that started the misión as it will no longer be used for anything.
04) Hearth to BB, if Hearthstone is still on a cooldown, die on purpose y res at spirit.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) Entrega (if you did it) "The Captain's Chest" (en end de docks 27.74).
06) Ve a the Bank 27.77 y get out 15 Silk Cloth de the bank, mailbox or AH, for a later misión.
07) Up en Posada, de Fleet Master Seahorn entrega "The Bloodsail Buccaneers" 27.77.
08) This is the last time my guide will tell you to entrega "The Green Hills of Stranglethorn" if it is completa.  This misión requires that you have the following pages: 1, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 14, 16, 18, 20, 21, 24, 25, 26, y 27.  You can also find these pages en AH or de other players.  If you have all of them, get them out now y ve a Nesingwary's Expedition 36.11 y turn this misión in.  If you do go turn it in, afterwards ve a Grom'gol's Wind Rider Master 33.29 y vuela a Kargath, Badlands.  Otherwise, skip to next paso:
09) Next to you en roof, ve a the Wind Rider Master 27.77 y vuela a Kargath, Badlands.
10) Ve SW into Searing Gorge (entrada en 1.63 in Badlands).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[117] = {title = [[48 Searing Gorge]], text = [[
01) Ve SE in Searing Gorge y de the Wooden Outhouse 66.62, acepta "Caught!".
02) At the Grimesilt Dig Site junto a you alrededor de 63.62, do "Caught!": mata 8 Dark Iron Geologists /target.  Also make sure you have 15 Silk Cloth (it can drop de the dwarves en Dig Site).  The Geologists are limited, so you will most likely need to farmea on enemigos until they respawn (or go norte for a few more).
03) Vuelve a the Wooden Outhouse (66.62, #1 on map), y entrega "Caught!", acepta "Ledger from Tanaris".  Luego pick up the Goodsteel Ledger (it drops en ground junto a outhouse).
04) Do part of "Ledger from Tanaris": mata y lootea a Glassweb Spiders /target para Leg Shafts.  These are scattered en eastern side of Searing Gorge starting alrededor de 61.70.
05) Ve up NW y de Kalaran Windblade 39.39 acepta "Divine Retribution", luego do it by simply talking to him.  Luego turn it in.  De him, acepta "The Flawless Flame".
06) Ve up to Thorium Point (entrada en 33.30)...
07) Acepta ALL misiones at Thorium Point:  De the WANTED/Missing/Lost & Found sign 38.26 acepta "WANTED: Overseer Maltorius", "STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass" y "JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition".
08) WOTLK, 7b) Next to you acepta "Kill 'Em With Sleep Deprivation" 38.28.
09) Next to you 39.28 acepta "Curse These Fat Fingers", "Fiery Menace!" y "Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It"
10) Next to you by the Forge acepta "What the Flux?" 39.29.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied by this NPC también.
11) Get the FP de the Wind Rider Master 35.31 at Thorium Point.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[118] = {title = [[NOTE  Do the Searing Gorge farmea!  Do this section all at once (in any order)]], text = [[
01) "The Flawless Flame": mata y lootea a Magma Elementals, Tempered War Golems, y Heavy War Golems para Golem Oil.  See next paso para Heart of Flame:
02) Mata y lootea a the fire elementals para Heart of Flame, these include:  Inferno Elementals, Blazing Elementals y Magma Elementals.
03) "Fiery Menace!": mata Greater Lava Spiders alrededor de the western side of Searing Gorge.
04) "Curse These Fat Fingers": mata Heavy War Golems alrededor de the middle of Searing Gorge.
05) "STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass": mata y lootea a Dark Iron Steamsmith para Smithing Tuyere alrededor de 40.50.  See next paso for where to find the Lookout's Spyglass:
06) Mata y lootea a Dark Iron Lookouts para Lookout's Spyglass, these enemigos are scattered alrededor de the watchtowers at Searing Gorge, there is a large amount alrededor de 53.59, see map for other locations.
07) Once "The Flawless Flame" is done, turn it in at Kalaran Windblade 39.39 y acepta "Forging the Shaft".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[119] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #33]], text = [[
01) "JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition": entra en one de caves down in The Cauldron (middle of Searing Gorge), I recommend going into the eastern most cueva entrance 49.45 y luego mata the required amount of Dark Iron dwarves in la cueva.
02) "What the Flux?" y "WANTED: Overseer Maltorius": lootea the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux 40.36 detrás de Overseer Maltorius (41.36 in la cueva). And mata y lootea a Overseer Maltorius (lvl 50).
03) WOTLK, 2b) In the hallways cruzando room alrededor de 45.31 do "Kill 'Em With Sleep Deprivation": lootea the pillows along side the walls where the beds are at.  Watch out groups of sleepy dwarves patrol this hall y an elite mob can spawn en middle of that hall, so be careful!  You can skip this if you don't want to wait para pillows to respawn or deal con enemigos that are en way.
04) "Forging the Shaft": mata y lootea a Dark Iron dwarves para Thorium Plated Daggers.  NOTES:  This misión requires "The Flawless Flame" to be finished y turned in first.  Save any Dark Iron Scraps you find, you will need 30 of them for a later misión, but you will also have another good chance to find a lot more later on en lvl 53-54 Burning Steppes section también.
05) "Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It": entra en la cueva (at 47.46) y mata 20 Incendosaurs.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[120] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #34]], text = [[
01) Ve a Kalaran Windblade 39.39 y entrega "Forging the Shaft", acepta "The Flame's Casing".
02) Ve up to Thorium Point (entrada en 33.30)...
03) Entrega "WANTED: Overseer Maltorius" 38.27.
04) WOTLK, 3b) Next to you, entrega (if you did it) "Kill 'Em With Sleep Deprivation" 38.28.
05) Next to you, entrega "Curse These Fat Fingers", "Fiery Menace!" y "Incendosaurs? Whateverosaur is More Like It" 39.28.
06) Next to you, entrega "STOLEN: Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass" y "JOB OPPORTUNITY: Culling the Competition" 39.28.
07) At the Forge junto a you entrega "What the Flux?" 39.29.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied de this NPC.
08) Ve oeste alrededor de 25.35 y haz "The Flame's Casing": mata y lootea a the Twilight enemigos until the Symbol of Ragnaros drops (low drop rate).
09) Ve este to Kalaran Windblade (39.39, #1 on map) y entrega "The Flame's Casing", acepta "The Torch of Retribution".
10) Wait a few seconds, luego entrega "The Torch of Retribution", acepta the next part.  Luego click en Torch of Retribution en air junto a you to entrega the next part of "The Torch of Retribution".  Acepta "Squire Maltrake".  Next to you, entrega "Squire Maltrake", acepta "Set Them Ablaze!".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[121] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #35]], text = [[
01) Do "Set Them Ablaze!": equip the Torch of Retribution misión item y en lo alto de the 4 watchtowers, click en Sentry Braziers.  The Northern Tower is at 33.54.  See next pasos para others:
02) The Western Tower is at 36.61.
03) The Southern Tower is at 44.61.
04) The Eastern Tower is at 50.55.  NOTE:  You must cross a bridge to get to it.
05) While doing the misiones associated with killing the Dark Iron dwarves, you should have obtained an item called Grimsite Outhouse Key, de it acepta "The Key to Freedom".  Luego ve SE y turn this in en Wooden Outhouse 66.62.
06) N/A
07) Ve NW to Kalaran Windblade 39.39 y entrega "Set Them Ablaze!".
08) Wait a minute (build up First Aid while waiting), luego click en Hoard de Black Dragonflight 39.39 cofre en ground junto a Kalaran Windblade y acepta "Trinkets...".  Luego click en cofre again to turn this in.  Lootea the cofre received.
09) NOTES:  Make sure you keep the Black Dragonflight Molt in your inventory as you will need it for a later misión.  Also make sure you have all 20 Solid Crystal Leg Shafts para misión "Ledger from Tanaris".
10) Head sur into Burning Steppes (entrada en 35.87 in Searing Gorge).  NOTE:  You have to go through Black Rock Mountains.
11) Once at Burning Steppes, first head to 25.53 just to discover Draco'dar for XP.
12) N/A
13) Sube por ramp into Flame Crest.  You can get repaired/resupplied en small cueva de the female goblin 66.22.
14) At the Wind Rider Master 66.24 vuela a Stonard, Swamp of Sorrows.  NOTE:  If you still have "What the Flux?" or "WANTED: Overseer Maltorius" they can be abandoned.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[122] = {title = [[49 Swamp of Sorrows]], text = [[
01) Entra en Posada y make Stonard your new home de the Innkeeper 45.57.
02) Ve SW en main path y de Fallen Hero de Horde 34.66 acepta "Fall From Grace".  Luego do it by simply talking hacia el NPC.  Turn it in y acepta "The Disgraced One".
03) Ve NW y click on A Soggy Scrolll under el puente 23.48 to entrega "Cortello's Riddle", acepta the next part.
04) Vuelve to Stonard.
05) N/A
06) Up en building 48.55, entrega "The Disgraced One", acepta "The Missing Orders".  And entrega (if you have it) "Return to Fel'Zerul", SKIP "The Temple of Atal'Hakkar" (Dungeon).
07) In the Posada entrega "The Missing Orders" (45.57, #1 on map), acepta "The Swamp Talker".
08) N/A
09) Ve oeste to Stagalbog Cave entrance 66.78 y haz "The Swamp Talker": back in la cueva mata y lootea a Swamp Talker 63.88 or at 64.80 /target para Warchief's Orders.  To get hacia el Swamp Talker take the middle path in la cueva y keep left.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[123] = {title = [[Contested - Stranglethorn Vale]], text = [[
01) At the middle de shore of SoS, do part of "Ledger from Tanaris": mata y lootea a Jarquia (alrededor de 95.52, /target), he drops the Goodsteel's Balanced Flameberge.
02) Hearth to Stonard.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Ve SW en main path y de Fallen Hero de Horde 34.66 entrega "The Swamp Talker", acepta y haz "A Tale of Sorrow" by simply talking hacia el NPC.  Luego turn it in, SKIP "The Stones That Bind Us" (for now).
04) Back at Stonard, ve a the Wind Rider Master 46.55 y vuela a Booty Bay, Stranglethorn...
05) Drop down en Posada at BB y acepta "Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog" 27.77.
06) Get en boat en end of docks 26.73 to ve a Ratchet.  NOTE:  If the boat is not there yet you can do the next paso at BB's Bank!
07) Once at Ratchet, ve a the Bank 63.37 y put the following items into it:  Torch of Retribution (can be used as a future light source), Black Dragonflight Molt, y any of Dark Iron Scraps or Core of Elements you may have.  Get out de bank: Yeh'kinya's Bramble, Wastewander Water Pouches y Hippogryph Egg.
08) Ve a the Flight Master at Ratchet 63.37 y vuela a Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[124] = {title = [[49 Dustwallow Marsh]], text = [[
01) Once at Brackenwall Village, entra en small cueva y acepta "The Brood of Onyxia" 37.33.
02) Ve SE hacia el crashed zeppelin y haz the last part of "Ledger from Tanaris": lootea the Damaged Crate 54.56 para Overdue Package.
03) Ve sur y haz "The Brood of Onyxia": look para red steam nests holding the Eggs of Onyxia y click on them to destroy them.  There is one at 54.73, y another one at 48.74.
04) Ve oeste to Bloodfen Burrow (small cueva) y click en Musty Scroll 31.66 to entrega "Cortello's Riddle", acepta the next part.
05) TBC, 4a) Ve a the Flight Master 43.72 at Mudsprocket y vuela a Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh.
06) Entra en small cueva y entrega "The Brood of Onyxia" (37.33, #1 on map).
07) GROUP 2+ Players:  De Overlord Mok'morokk by the Bonfire 36.31, acepta y haz "Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk" by beating him to a duel.  You only need to get his health down to 1/3 left.
08) Entrega (if you did it) "Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk" (en small cueva 37.33, #1 on map).
09) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 36.32 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[125] = {title = [[50 Tanaris]], text = [[
01) As you entra en Gadgetzan (junto a crane 52.27), acepta "Thistleshrub Valley".
02) 01a) Ve a the Egg-O-Matic machine 52.27 in Gadgetzan (junto a teleporter), y entrega your Hippogryph Egg for "The Super Egg-O-Matic" misión (additional eggs do not yield XP).  NOTE:  You can entrega different types of eggs en NPC junto a machine for a non-XP reward.
03) Behind the Posada, junto a Bonfire, acepta "The Dunemaul Compound" 53.27.
04) Entra en Posada y make Gadgetzan your new home 53.28.
05) Junto a Posada/Bank en windmill 52.29, entrega "Into the Field", acepta y completa "Slake That Thirst".  Do not acepta the misión de the item received yet, this will be done later.
06) Junto a AH, acepta "The Thirsty Goblin" 52.29.
07) Junto a Forge, entrega "Ledger from Tanaris" 51.29.
08) On the western side of Gadgetzan, up en hill, acepta "Noxious Lair Investigation" 50.27.
09) Ve sur hacia el Broken Pillar y entrega "The Sunken Temple" 53.46, acepta "The Stone Circle".  Also acepta "Gahz'ridian".
10) Ve SW y haz part of "The Dunemaul Compound": mata Gor'marok the Ravager (en small cueva 41.58).
11) Ve sur to Southmoon Ruins alrededor de 40.72 y haz "The Dunemaul Compound" along with "Gahz'ridian": mata 10 Dunemaul Brutes y 10 Dunemaul Enforcers.  Also lootea the Gahz'ridian de the ground.  TIP:  You can equip the Gahz'ridian Detector helm to help you see the Gahz'ridian en minimap.  Also, there is another area of enemigos, but with less Gahz'ridian, alrededor de 47.65.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[126] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #43]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste to The Noxious Lair alrededor de 35.48 y haz "Noxious Lair Investigation": mata y lootea a the Centipaar bugs, y any of them can drop the insect parts.
02) Ve sur to Thistleshrub Valley alrededor de 30.65 y haz "Thistleshrub Valley" along with "The Thirsty Goblin": mata 8 Gnarled Thistleshrubs y 8 Thistleshrub Rootshapers.  Also mata y lootea a the Thistleshrub Dew Collectors /target para Laden Dew Gland (low drop rate).
03) At the Thistleshrub Valley (32.74 or 29.63) acepta y haz the escolta a misión "Tooga's Quest": escolta a Tooga /target (turtle) NE to Torta (At next paso):
04) Once at Torta 67.26, entrega "Tooga's Quest".
05) Justo al norte de you at Steamwheedle port, entra en southern hut y acepta "Yuka Screwspigot" 67.24.
06) Norte at Steamwheedle Port entrega "Screecher Spirits" 67.22, SKIP "The Prophecy of Mosh'aru" (Zul'Farrak Dungeon).
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Gadgetzan.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
08) Junto a AH, entrega "The Thirsty Goblin" 52.29, acepta "In Good Taste".
09) At Sprinkle 51.27 (NW hut), entrega "In Good Taste", acepta "Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient".
10) In the hut junto a you, entrega "Noxious Lair Investigation" 51.27.
11) Junto a crane cerca de Gadgetzan entrance, entrega "Thistleshrub Valley" 52.27.
12) Behind the Posada, junto a Bonfire, entrega "The Dunemaul Compound" 53.27.
13) Ve a the Gadgetzan Bank 52.29 (SE hut) y get the following items out:  Field Testing Kit y (if you have it) OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon.
14) On the western side of Gadgetzan, up en hill, acepta "The Scrimshank Redemption" 50.27.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[127] = {title = [[50 Azshara]], text = [[
01) De the item Model 4711-FTZ Power Source in your inventory, acepta y haz "Tanaris Field Sampling": start killing beasts just sur of Gadgetzan.  You need to mata y lootea a any Basilisks, Hyenas, y Scorpids.  You will find these beasts all alrededor de the open fields of Tanaris.  You only have 2 hours to do this y the next few pasos, so work quickly.  While doing this, do the following 3 pasos también:
02) Farmea your way al sur hacia el Broken Pillar y entrega "Gahz'ridian" 53.46.
03) N/A
04) If you have the item OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, de it acepta "Find OOX-17/TN!".  Luego turn this in at 60.65. NOTE: The chicken escorts are skipped for TBC/SOM.
05) Make sure "Tanaris Field Sampling" is completa.  Luego ve SE to The Gaping Chasm y haz "The Scrimshank Redemption": entra en specific cueva entrance 56.69 y keep making right turns in la cueva, which will lead you hacia el item you need to lootea.
06) Hearth (if you can), or Die on purpose, luego head norte to get back to Gadgetzan.
07) Junto a Posada en windmill 52.29, entrega "Tanaris Field Sampling", acepta "Return to Apothecary Zinge".  You can luego destroy the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source item if it remains in your inventory.
08) On the western side of Gadgetzan, up en hill, entrega "The Scrimshank Redemption" 50.27, acepta "Insect Part Analysis".
09) In the hut NW in Gadgetzan, entrega "Insect Part Analysis" 51.27, acepta the next part.
10) Vuelve a the western side of Gadgetzan, up en hill (50.27, #8 on map) y entrega "Insect Part Analysis".  Acepta "Rise of the Silithid".
11) Asegúrate de ser nivel 50, farmea on any mob until you are.
12) Ve a the Wind Rider Master (norte of Gadgetzan 52.25) y vuela a Orgrimmar, Durotar.
13) Ve in Orgrimmar's Posada y make it your new home 54.68.  And de the Innkeeper, acepta "Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem".  Make sure you are resupplied.
14) Ve a the Bank 50.69 y get the following items out:  Sealed Letter to Ag'tor, Box of Empty Vials.
15) GET NEW ABILITIES, 14b) Get your nivel 50 spells/abilities.
16) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.
17) Sigue el camino principal este into Azshara entrance 95.48.
18) First Pick the Class you are playing top left of screen!!!
19) Along con Game Version you are playing on (Era, SoM, TBC or WotLK)
20) Head NE to Valormok, Azshara, y entrega "Betrayed" 22.51, SKIP the next part.
21) TBC, 1b) De Jediga acepta "Stealing Knowledge" 23.51.
22) Ve este hacia el Ruins of Eldarath alrededor de 37.53 y haz "Stealing Knowledge": lootea the 4 tablets, they are scattered alrededor de the ruins (see map for possible spawn locations).
23) Ve este to Southridge Beach y haz "Seeping Corruption": open your Box of Empty Vials to get your 4 Vials out, luego ve a the 4 tide pools y use your vials at each of them.  Fill Vial #1 at Tide Pool #1 48.61.  See next pasos para other three:
24) Ve norte to Tide Pool #2 to fill Vial #2 48.51.
25) Ve norte to Tide Pool #3 to fill Vial #3 49.48.
26) Ve norte to Tide Pool #4 to fill Vial #4 47.46.
27) Vuelve a Valormok at Jediga (23.51, #1 on map) y entrega "Stealing Knowledge".  Acepta ALL 4 Delivery misiones de her.
28) You can get resupplied at Valormok de Kurll 22.52.  Or repaired de Gruul Darkblade /target 22.51.
29) N/A
30) Ve este to Sanath Lim-yo (28.50, #2 on map) y entrega "A Meeting with the Master".  Luego click on him again to teleport you to see his master.  Once teleported, sube por path y go up in la torre to Archmage Xylem /target to entrega "Delivery to Archmage Xylem", acepta "Xylem's Payment to Jediga".
31) Drop down in la torre to sal de it y vuelve down el camino to Nyrill 26.46 y have him teleport you back down.
32) Ve oeste to Valormok y de Jediga entrega "Xylem's Payment to Jediga"(23.51, #1 on map).
33) Ve norte in Valormok hacia el Wind Rider Master 22.50 y vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[128] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #01]], text = [[
01) Ve a The Elder Rise y entrega "Delivery to Magatha" 70.31, acepta "Magatha's Payment to Jediga".
02) Ve just este en big tent y entrega "Assisting Arch Druid Runetotem" 79.29, SKIP "Un'Goro Soil" (for now).
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a Orgrimmar.
04) 03b) Check the AH 54.64 for a Mithril Casing y if you are able to get it, store it in your bank for now for a later misión at Un'goro Crater.
05) Ve a the Bank 50.69 y get the following items out:  Bundle of Atal'ai Artifacts.  Also get out (if you need to) 60 Silk Cloth y 60 Mageweave Cloth (for cloth donations hacia el Orc faction).
06) Ve a The Drag y up en hut entrega "Rise of the Silithid" 56.47.  Acepta "March of the Silithid".
07) Drop down to Magar's Cloth Goods y entrega the cloth donations you have hacia el Orc's Horde Cloth Quartermaster 64.51.
08) Norte in The Drag (up in Yelmak's Alchemy y Potions), entrega "Delivery to Jes'rimon" up 56.34, acepta "Jes'rimon's Payment to Jediga".  Also acepta "Bone-Bladed Weapons".
09) IF YOU HAVE IT: In Droffers And Sons Salvage, entrega "Ripple Delivery" 59.37 , SKIP "Necklace Recovery".
10) If you need to, get new spells/abilities.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[129] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) Sal de Orgrimmar sur y get en zeppelin (51.14 in Durotar) to ve a The Undercity.
02) Once en UC, head to The Apothecarium y entrega "Delivery to Andron Gant" 55.76, acepta "Andron's Payment to Jediga".
03) Ve down in The Apothecarium entrance 52.81 y entrega "Seeping Corruption" 49.71.  Wait a few seconds, y acepta the next part.  Luego right junto a you (en female tauren), entrega "Seeping Corruption".  Luego junto a you at Chemist Cuely, turn it in again.
04) In the same room, entrega "Return to Apothecary Zinge" 50.68.  Acepta "Vivian Lagrave".  NOTE:  After turning this in, if the Field Testing Kit remains in your inventory you can destroy it.
05) Across the same room de Chemist Fuely 47.73, acepta "A Sample of Slime..." y "... and a Batch of Ooze".
06) Ve a the Bat Handler 63.49 y vuela a Tarren Mill, Hillsbrad.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[130] = {title = [[51 Hinterlands]], text = [[
01) Entra en Hinterlands (entrada en 89.27 in Hillsbrad Foothills).
02) Ve up to Shindigger's Camp y entrega "Ripple Recovery" 27.49, SKIP "A Sticky Situation".
03) Ve sur to Shadra'Alor, hasta lo alto de the temple entrance 36.65, luego drop down y entrega "The Atal'ai Exile" 34.75 (See Video on where to find this dude at), SKIP "Return to Fel'Zerul".
04) Ve norte to Valorwind Lake 41.59 y haz "Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient": under the water lootea a Violet Tragan (mushroom).
05) N/A
06) Ve este to Revantusk Village y en docks acepta "Snapjaws, Mon!" y "Gammerita, Mon!" 80.82.
07) In the Posada acepta "Lard Lost His Lunch" 78.81.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  NOTE:  Maintain piedra de hogar with Orgrimmar!
08) Justo al norte de Revantusk Village along the shore, do "Snapjaws, Mon!" along with "Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog": mata Saltwater Snapjaws (turtles) y lootea the Pupellyverbos Port (blue bottles en ground).  Do the next paso también en same time as these:
09) Do "Gammerita, Mon!": mata y lootea a Gammerita /target.  This lvl 48 turtle patrols up y down the shore line.  He spawns just sur de waterfall/shore (underneath #6 on map).
10) Ve norte y right underneath the waterfall 81.47, lootea Cortello's Treasure cofre to entrega "Cortello's Riddle" (14 slot bag along with 6100 XP)!
11) Ve a the little island NE y haz "Lard Lost His Lunch": lootea Lard's Picnic Basket 84.41 y luego mata y lootea a the two lvl 49 trolls that spawn, you will get Lard's Lunch de the first one you lootea.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[131] = {title = [[Horde - The Barrens]], text = [[
01) Entra en Posada y entrega "Lard Lost His Lunch" 78.81.
02) On the docks, entrega "Snapjaws, Mon!" y "Gammerita, Mon!" 80.82.
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a Orgrimmar.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Valormok, Azshara.
05) Once at Valormok, Azshara, de Jediga 23.51 entrega the 3 Delivery misiones:  "Magatha's Payment to Jediga", "Jes'rimon's Payment to Jediga" y "Andron's Payment to Jediga".
06) Ve norte in Valormok hacia el Wind Rider Master 22.50 y vuela a Ratchet, The Barrens.
07) At Ratchet do "The Stone Circle": just right afuera of Liv Rizzlefix's hut (at la entrada 62.39), lootea Marvon's Chest.  Also, go in Liv Rizzlefix's hut y acepta "Volcanic Activity".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[132] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #07]], text = [[
01) Entra en Posada y make Ratchet your new home 62.39.
02) Stop at Ratchet's Bank 63.37 y put the following items into it:  stack of Pupellyverbos Port.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[133] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #08]], text = [[
01) 51 Blasted Lands
02) PLEASE READ: With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you will most likely be well into nivel 51+. Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into the section right before 51-53 Un'Goro Crator below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  However if for some reason you are still nivel 50 you can consider doing this section.  If you are NOT doing this section luego abandon (if you have any of them): "The Stones That Bind Us".
03) Ve up en Posada en roof y de the Wind Rider Master 27.77 vuela a Stonard, Swamp of Sorrows.
04) Sigue el camino principal SW y de the Fallen Hero de Horde 34.66 acepta "The Stones That Bind Us".
05) Head sur into Blasted Lands...
06) As you entra en Blasted Lands ve a the small misión hub at 51.14.  Acepta all 5 misiones there.  These 5 misiones requires the following total number of items to completa them.  The items needed can drop without needing to acepta the misiones.  The color codes below show where the enemigos are at en images y stars represent rare enemigos that may not be there. Work en rest of this section all at once):
07) Mob - Total Items Needed - After "The Decisive Striker" - And luego "Vulture's Vigor"
08) Vulture Gizzards     =14 - 12 - 2
09) Basilisk Brain         =11 - 11 - 11
10) Blasted Boar Lungs =6 - 5 - 5
11) Scorpok Pincers      =6 - 3 - 3
12) Snickerfang Jowls   =5 - 5 - 3
13) 2+ PLAYERS (or could be soloable): While grinding for these items, do "The Stones That Bind Us": drag the different servants close to their Stone of Binding crystal junto a each of them, luego mata them along with attacking the crystal también.  This allows you to actually mata the mob y get misión credit.  Each of these different servants are located at different parts de Blasted Lands.  See map for locations.  If for some reason you cannot solo this misión, it can be skipped.
14) While grinding make sure you get everything discovered for XP (including The Tainted Scar at 44.57).
15) As you get these items, you can turn the misiones in for a 60 min stat reward that will help you farmea faster in Blasted Lands or even para next section Un'Goro Crater (although they don't stack).  I recommend only showing the misiones on screen that you want the rewards first.  Ve a the misión hub (at 51.14, #1 on map) y entrega all 5 of these misiones:  "Snickerfang Jowls" (+25 Strength), "A Boar's Vitality" (+25 Stamina), "The Decisive Striker" (+25 Agility), "The Basilisk's Bite" (+25 Intellect) y "Vulture's Vigor" (+25 Spirit).  NOTE:  The follow up misiones do NOT yield XP: "Rage of Ages", "Spirit of the Boar", "Salt of the Scorpok", "Infallible Mind", y "Spiritual Domination".
16) While questing in Blasted Lands, you may have came across an item called Imperfect Draenethyst Fragment, turn these in at 52.36 para misión "Everything Counts In Large Amounts".  NOTE:  I have NEVER found a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere para misión "To Serve Kum'isha" ..good luck on that.  Also, the follow up misión "One Draenei's Junk" is repeatable but yields no XP.
17) Ve a the border of Blasted Lands y SoS, hacia el Fallen Hero de Horde (34.66 in SoS) y entrega (if you did it) "The Stones That Bind Us", SKIP "Kirith".  Acepta "Heroes of Old".
18) Next to you en other side of el camino, entrega (if you have it) "Heroes of Old" (33.66 in SoS), acepta the next part.  Luego click en Spectral Lockbox en ground junto a you to turn it in.
19) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ratchet.  NOTE:  If you did not do "The Stones That Bind Us", luego abandon the misión.
20) At Ratchet's Bank 63.37, get the following items out:  Violet Tragan y (if you have it) Stone Circle.
21) Ve into Ironzar's Imported Weaponry to get repaired/resupplied de Ironzar 62.37.  You can destroy any remaining unsellable Blasted Lands beast items you have (or bank them if you want).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[134] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #09]], text = [[
01) 53 Un'Goro Crater
02) Ve a the Flight Master 63.37 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
03) As you entra en Gadgetzan (junto a crane 52.27), acepta "Super Sticky".
04) At Sprinkle (by the NW hut 51.27), entrega "Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient".  Wait a few seconds (do next paso while waiting) luego acepta "Delivery for Marin".
05) In the hut junto a you, entrega "March of the Silithid" 51.27, acepta "Bungle in the Jungle".
06) Junto a AH, de Marin Noggenfogger 52.29, entrega "Delivery for Marin".  NOTE:  "Noggenfogger Elixir" can take up to a minute para NPC to make the item for you, it does not yeild any XP, so you can do this when you are not in a hurry (such as after nivel 60).  The Noggenfogger Elixir item is used for fun y can be stored en bank when you want to use it.
07) At the Bank 52.29, get out: (if you have it) Mithril Casing (this item may be in your mailbox 52.28), this is used for a misión in Un'Goro Crater, y remember to not sell this to a vendedor.  You can also check the neutral AH in Gadgetzan for it también.
08) Head sur hacia el Broken Pillar y entrega "The Stone Circle" 53.46.
09) Ve SW into Un'Goro Crater (entrada en 27.54 in Tanaris)...
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[135] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #10]], text = [[
01) At the bottom of el camino into Un'Goro Crater, sube por hill junto a waterfall 72.76 y acepta "The Apes of Un'Goro" y "The Fare of Lar'korwi".
02) WOTLK, 1b) Just down the hill a bit, acepta "Toxic Tolerance" 71.74.
03) Ve norte a bit y haz "The Fare of Lar'korwi": lootea the big Fresh Threshadon Carcass lying en ground 69.57.
04) Farmea norte to la entrada of Marshal's Refuge y acepta "Chasing A-Me 01" 46.13.  While de camino, also start collecting crystals (the red, blue, green y yellow) scattered everywhere.  Mata y lootea a oozes too!
05) Ve up into Marshal's Refuge y acepta ALL misiones there:  De the goblin on top de hill, acepta "Shizzle's Flyer" 44.12.
06) Move into Marshal's Refuge 44.8 y acepta "Lost!", (de the Wanted Sign Beware of Pterrordax) "Beware of Pterrordax".
07) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 43.8.
08) Next to you acepta "Roll the Bones" 43.7.
09) Next to you 44.7 acepta "Alien Ecology" y "Expedition Salvation".  NOTE:  If you have already found A Mangled Journal, acepta y entrega "Williden's Journal".
10) On the este side of Marshal's Refuge detrás de hill, acepta "Larion and Muigin" 46.9.
11) Time to do the Un'Goro Farmea! NOTES For the Farmea:
12) - Don't worry about looting the Un'Goro Dirt Piles, you will find enough Un'Goro Soil de mob drops.  Also do not sell the Un'Goro Soil to vendors, you will need these for misión turn-ins!
13) - Don't worry about looting the Bloodpetal Sprouts, as they are not turned in for any XP.
14) - The Dinosaur Bones you need para misión "Roll the Bones" will drop de many different enemigos as you do the other misiones.
15) - As your questing, mata y lootea a Oozes (slimes) you see, y collect15 Ooze samples (15 is the max you can hold for WOTLK), this is for "... and a Batch of Ooze".  These Oozes are scattered all alrededor de Un'Goro Crater.
16) - Also while questing, lootea 7 crystals of each color (red, blue, green, y yellow) for a later misión.  These crystals are scattered all alrededor de Un'Goro Crater.
17) - The Bloodpetel enemigos (plants) drop Savage Fronds, you could recoge 30 of these for a later misión at lvl 59.  As you are doing the Un'Goro misiones associated with these enemigos you should get about half, so farmea on these that you see por el camino y see what you can get before leaving Un'Goro Crater, y you could always check the AH for more of these, or just skip this entirely.
18) - Watch out para Elite Devilsaurs patrolling alrededor de this zone.  I highlighted them through out the images so you can be alerted if you are in a danger zone for them.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[136] = {title = [[LET THE GRIND BEGIN]], text = [[
01) Justo al sur de Marshal's Refuge alrededor de 46.16 do "Super Sticky": mata y lootea a the Tar enemigos alrededor de the tar pits.
02) Ve NE to Fungal Rock y start working on "The Apes of Un'Goro": mata y lootea a the apes (in y afuera of la cueva).  Also entra en cueva entrance 64.16 y luego make a right y entrega "Chasing A-Me 01" 68.17, luego if you have a Mithril Casing with you, acepta y entrega "Chasing A-Me 01".  Luego acepta y haz the escolta a "Chasing A-Me 01": escolta a A-Me 01 to Marshal's Refuge, y luego turn it in once you get there.
03) Start working on "Larion and Muigin": mata Bloodpetal Flayers alrededor de the norte-middle of Un'goro Crater.  NOTE:  These enemigos are also found sur-middle también, so you don't need to finish all of this now, work your way hacia el next paso..
04) Ve up en mountain ledge (ramp entrada en 55.12) y start working on "Shizzle's Flyer": mata y lootea a the Pterrordax /target.  There are only 6 mob spawns here, so clear the area once y move on hacia el next paso..
05) Make sure "The Apes of Un'Goro" is finished: mata y lootea a the apes (in y afuera of la cueva alrededor de 64.16, #2 on map).
06) Do the next part of "Larion and Muigin": mata Bloodpetal Lashers y Threshers alrededor de the NE side of Un'goro Crater.  Also, mata y lootea a any Dinosaurs you see for part of "Shizzle's Flyer" (don't need to finish it now though).  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
07) Ve SE y haz part of "Expedition Salvation": under the tent, lootea the Crate of Foodstuffs 69.37.
08) Finish up killing the Bloodpetal Flayers for "Larion and Muigin" by starting below el río alrededor de 61.48 y work you way sur.  Mata y lootea a any Diemetradon you see también for "Shizzle's Flyer".  NOTE:  Try to avoid the Raptors as you will be grinding them soon with more misiones associated with them.
09) Farmea your way SE to Torwa Pathfinder on top de hill by the waterfall y entrega "The Apes of Un'Goro" 72.76.  Acepta "The Mighty U'cha".  And entrega "The Fare of Lar'korwi", acepta "The Scent of Lar'korwi".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[137] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #12]], text = [[
01) Just hacia el oeste of you at The Marshlands do "Bone-Bladed Weapons" along with "The Scent of Lar'korwi": mata y lootea a raptors y to get the Ravasaur Pheromone Glands you need, corre cruzando egg nests (there is 5 total: 67.73 63.77 67.67 61.72 62.66) y luego mata y lootea a the Lar'korwi Mates that spawn in.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
02) WOTLK, 1b) Also more norte en raptor area alrededor de 69.53 do "Toxic Tolerance" by letting the Venomhide Ravasaurs /target (darker colored ones) spit poison on you 20 times.
03) At The Marshlands, en western most pond, norte on it's shore, click on A Wrecked Raft 63.69 to acepta "It's a Secret to Everybody".  Luego right junto a wrecked raft, under the water, click on A Small Pack to entrega "It's a Secret to Everybody", acepta the next part.  NOTE:  To free up bag space, do NOT lootea A Small Pack yet!
04) WOTLK, 2b) Just down the hill a bit, entrega "Toxic Tolerance" 71.74, acepta "Venomhide Eggs".
05) Ve este to Torwa Pathfinder on top de hill by the waterfall y entrega "The Scent of Lar'korwi" 72.76, acepta "The Bait for Lar'korwi".  NOTE:  To free up bag space, do NOT lootea A Small Pack yet!
06) WOTLK, 3b) Around the raptor area alrededor de 67.73 do "Venomhide Eggs": lootea 4 Venomhide Eggs (alrededor de the little nests as with previous misión), see Questie locations on map.
07) WOTLK, 3c) Entrega "Venomhide Eggs".  NOTE: "They Grow Up So Fast" can be done if you like, but requires items you would need to search alrededor de for, also costs 80 gold.  But this can reward you with a new epic Whistle de Venomhide Ravasaur mount.
08) Ve oeste to The Slithering Scar y haz "Alien Ecology" along with "Bungle in the Jungle": entra en la cueva entrance 50.81.  Gira a la izquierda in la cueva y luego use your Unused Scraping Vial misión item en mound en center de room.  And keep mata/looting the Gorishi bugs until you get the Gorishi Scent Gland (can drop de any of them, but has a low drop rate).  These bugs can be found in y afuera of la cueva.
09) Ve sur up en ledges alrededor de 56.90 to continue obtaining the Webbed Pterrordax Scales (you will be able to get more of these later) for "Shizzle's Flyer".  There is another spot of these enemigos alrededor de 45.90.
10) Farmea NW a bit hacia el old camp site 38.66 y haz the last part of "Expedition Salvation": lootea the Research Equipment (looks like a stack of brown boxes junto a a tent).
11) All alrededor de the western side of Un'Goro Crater, finish up "Larion and Muigin" (mata Bloodpetal Trappers) along with finishing up "Beware of Pterrordax", "Shizzle's Flyer" y "Roll the Bones" (mata y lootea a Frenzied Pterrordax).  The Dinosaur Bones can also drop de Elder Diemetradon y regular Diemetradon enemigos (found sur-middle).  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
12) At the Golakka Hot Springs (below the hotspring mountain), acepta "Finding the Source" 31.50.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[138] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #13]], text = [[
01) Do "Volcanic Activity" along with "Finding the Source".  First ve a the norte entrada en Fire Plume Ridge (spiky bridge entrada en 53.43).  Sigue el camino upwards hacia el top y use Krakle's Thermometer misión item en Fire Plume Ridge Hot Spot (the one at 50.46).  Watch out para lvl 56 Elite mob in la cueva en lo alto de the Ridge.  Also mata y lootea a the fire elementals alrededor de Fire Plume Ridge para 9 Un'Goro Ash y to start collecting Core of Elements for a future misión (I recommend at least getting about 10 for now).
02) Make sure all the misiones above are done, including obtaining 7 crystals of each color (red, blue, green, y yellow), luego ve a the small cueva en eastern side of Fire Plume Ridge y entrega "Lost!" 52.50.
03) Acepta y haz the escolta a "A Little Help From My Friends": escolta a Ringo /target back to Marshal's Refuge 44.9.  You will need to usa el/la misión item Spraggle's Canteen on Ringo to wake him up if he faints.
04) Entrega ALL misiones at Marshal's Refuge y acepta new ones:  Entrega "Shizzle's Flyer" (on top of hill 44.12).
05) entrega "A Little Help From My Friends" y "Beware of Pterrordax" 44.9.
06) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied 43.8.
07) Next to you entrega "Roll the Bones"43.7.
08) Next to you 44.7 entrega "Alien Ecology", "Expedition Salvation" y (if you haven't yet) acepta y entrega "Williden's Journal" de the item A Mangled Journal (this item/misión is obtained while killing any mob in Un'Goro Crater that should be in your inventory by now).
09) Entra en la cueva at Marshal's Refuge entrance 43.6 y en very end of la cueva acepta y entrega "Crystals of Power" 42.3.  Luego acepta the 3 Pylon misiones:  "The Northern Pylon", "The Eastern Pylon" y "The Western Pylon".  You can destroy any remaining crystals in your inventory (to free bag space).
10) Open y lootea A Small Pack in your inventory y luego ve a Linken (en middle of Marshal's Refuge detrás de some trees 45.8) y entrega "It's a Secret to Everybody", acepta the next part.  NOTE:  The Faded Photograph is not needed y will remain in your inventory forever unless you destroy or bank it.
11) At the eastern side of Marshal's Refuge detrás de hill, entrega "Larion and Muigin" 46.9, acepta "Marvon's Workshop".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[139] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #14]], text = [[
01) Ve este up en ledges y haz "The Northern Pylon": click en Northern Crystal Pylon 57.13.
02) Ve este to Fungal Rock y haz "The Mighty U'cha": entra en la cueva entrance 65.16, luego keep left in la cueva until you get to U'cha (lvl 55 red colored ape) y mata y lootea a him.
03) On the eastern side of Un'Goro Crater, go up en ledges y haz "The Eastern Pylon": click en Eastern Crystal Pylon 77.50.
04) Just hacia el este of you en mountain ledges there, do "The Bait for Lar'korwi": en old dinosaur bones, there is a gray flat rock en ground at 80.50.  At this spot open your Torwa's Pouch misión item y first usa el/la Preserved Threshadon Meat misión item, luego usa el/la Preserved Pheromone Mixture at this spot, luego mata y lootea a Lar'korwi that spawns in (See Video).
05) Ve sur to Torwa Pathfinder on top de hill by the waterfall 72.76 y entrega "The Bait for Lar'korwi" y "The Mighty U'cha".
06) Ve oeste (mata/looting oozes por el camino if you still need to get the 15 Slime samples) y up en mountain ledges do "The Western Pylon": click en Western Crystal Pylon 24.59.
07) Ve NE to Golakka Hot Springs (below the hotspring mountain) y entrega "Finding the Source" 31.50, acepta "The New Springs".
08) Farmea your way back norte to Marshal's Refuge entrance 46.13.  Make sure you get all 15 Un'goro Slime Samples por el camino by mata/looting oozes (slimes).  Also at this time see if you can obtain 30 Savage Fronds de the Bloodpetel enemigos (plants all alrededor de Un'Goro), 30 of these can be used for a later misión at lvl 59.  If you are still far detrás de on that luego don't worry about it, you may find more en AH (or just skip it).
09) Entra en la cueva at Marshal's Refuge entrance 43.6 y work your way hacia el end of la cueva y entrega "The Northern Pylon", "The Eastern Pylon" y "The Western Pylon".  Luego acepta y entrega "Making Sense of It".  NOTE:  The Crystal Pylon User's Manual can be destroyed or saved in your bank for later reference y you can always get a new one de this NPC in la cueva.
10) Sal de la cueva, asegúrate de reparar y reabastecerte en 43.8.
11) Ve up en eastern side of Marshal's Refuge, hacia el Flight Master 45.6 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[140] = {title = [[Tauren - Mulgore]], text = [[
01) As you entra en Gadgetzan (junto a crane) entrega "Super Sticky" 52.27.
02) In the NW hut, entrega "Bungle in the Jungle" 51.27.
03) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 52.25 (norte of Gadgetzan) y vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.
04) Ve a Elder Rise y de Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem, acepta "Un'goro Soil" 79.29.
05) On the norte side of Elder Rise, entrega "Un'goro Soil" 77.22.
06) Vuelve a Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem y acepta "Morrowgrain Research" (79.29, #4 on map).
07) Ve a Bashana Runetotem at Elder Rise en hut by el puente y entrega "Morrowgrain Research" 71.34, SKIP the next part.
08) WOTLK, 8b) If you need to, you can upgrade First Aid de the First Aid Trainer 30.21 on The Spirit Rise.  NOTE: Heavy Mageweave Bandage requires skill 240, Runecloth Bandage skill 260 y Heavy Runecloth Bandage skill 290.
09) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ratchet.
10) In Liv Rizzlefix's hut 62.39, entrega "Marvon's Workshop", SKIP "Zapper Fuel" (Dungeon misión).  Also entrega "Volcanic Activity".
11) NOTE:  IF the boat is already en docks luego do this paso at BB's Bank instead:  At the Ratchet Bank 63.37 get the following items out:  stack of Pupellyverbos Port, Black Dragonflight Molt y your stack of Dark Iron Scraps.  And put the following items en bank:  stack of Un'Goro soil, Un'goro Slime Samples, stack of Savage Fronds, Linken's Training Sword, 8 White Ravasaur Claws y any Core of Elements in there (to free up bag space).
12) Ve a the end de docks at Ratchet 64.39 to get en boat to ve a BB.
13) Once at BB, entra en Posada y entrega (if you haven't yet) "Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog" 27.77.
14) 13a) Ve up en Posada hacia el roof en Wind Rider Master 27.77 y vuela a Kargath, Badlands.
15) At Kargath, justo afuera de the Posada by the Bonfire, entrega "Vivian Lagrave" 3.48, SKIP "Lost Thunderbrew Recipe" (Dungeon).
16) Next to you, acepta "The Rise of the Machines".
17) Find Thal'trak Proudtusk /target, he patrols sur y este of Kargath (or could be chillin by the Bonfire).  De him acepta "Dreadmaul Rock".  NOTE: Sometimes you must wait until he stops patrolling y luego stands by the Bonfire 3.48 in order to acepta this.
18) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 4.45 y vuela a Flame Crest, Burning Steppes.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[141] = {title = [[53 Burning Steppes]], text = [[
01) Once at Flame Crest, under the red tent 65.24, acepta: "Broodling Essence" y "Tablet of the Seven".
02) Entra en small cueva y entrega "Yuka Screwspigot" 66.22, SKIP "Ribbly Screwspigot" (Dungeon).
03) Ve este alrededor de 80.29 y haz "Broodling Essence": usa el/la Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 misión item on Broodlings (dragon whelps), luego mata them y lootea the Broodling Essence crystal that drops.  Also throughout questing in Burning Steppes, mata any dragon whelps you see, they are squishy enemigos that die real fast.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
04) With the Black Dragonflight Molt with you, work your way este hacia el small cueva 95.32 luego acepta y entrega "A Taste of Flame" (you will need to talk to him first after getting the misión), SKIP the next part (Dungeon misión).
05) Ve up hasta lo alto de Dreadmaul Rock (bridge entrada en 76.38).  Once en top do "Dreadmaul Rock": click on Sha'ni Proudtusk's Remains 80.46 (laying en table between four pillars).  Luego de the ghost of Sha'ni Proudtusk that spawns, entrega "Dreadmaul Rock", acepta "Krom'Grul".
06) Do "Krom'Grul": find Krom'Grul /target dentro de one de three caves at Dreadmaul Rock y mata y lootea a him.  First check the small cueva junto a you en lo alto de Dreadmaul Rock 82.44.  If he is not there, luego check the other 2 caves SW entrance 77.47.  For la cueva en eastern side NE entrance 82.39, keep making right turns until you get to him.  ALSO:  Make sure you recoge a total of 30 Dark Iron Scraps, this will be used for a later misión.  All the Ogres in Burning Steppes can drop them.
07) Ve oeste to Ruins of Thaurissan alrededor de 67.38 y haz "The Rise of the Machines": mata y lootea a War Reavers.  Ten en cuenta el siguiente paso:
08) Do "Tablet of the Seven": lootea the Tablet de Seven 54.41 junto a dwarf statue.
09) Ve a Flame Crest y under the red tent 65.24, entrega "Broodling Essence", acepta "Felnok Steelspring".  Also entrega "Tablet of the Seven".
10) Ve a the Wind Rider Master at Flame Crest 66.24 y vuela a Kargath, Badlands.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[142] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) At Kargath, justo afuera de the Posada, entrega "The Rise of the Machines" 3.48, acepta the next part.  Find Thal'trak Proudtusk /target, he patrols sur y este of Kargath (or could be chillin by the Bonfire).  De him, entrega "Krom'Grul".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
02) Ve este to The Dustbowl en gnome y entrega "The Rise of the Machines" 26.45, SKIP the next part (Dungeon misión).
03) Usa la piedra de hogar a Ratchet.
04) Ve a the Ratchet Bank 63.37 y put the following items into it:  30+ Dark Iron Scraps, y any Core of Elements.  And get the following items out:  8 White Ravasaur Claws, Tinkee's Letter y Linken's Training Sword.  Also get out (if you have it) 60 Runecloth for cloth donation hacia el Orc faction coming up at Orgrimmar.
05) Ve a the Flight Master 63.37 at Ratchet y vuela a Orgrimmar, Durotar.
06) Entra en Posada at Orgrimmar y make it your new home 54.68.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[143] = {title = [[PLEASE READ With all the faster leveling changes, by the time you get to this section you already be nivel 54 (or really close to it). Because of this when following my guide, you should skip this entire section y go right into the section right before 54-54 Felwood below.  I will sal de this section for reference purposes only.  However if for some reason you are early into nivel 53 you can consider doing this section.  If you are NOT doing this section luego abandon (if you have it) "Betrayed".]], text = [[
01) 54 Azshara
02) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Valormok, Azshara.
03) Once at Valormok, acepta "Betrayed" 22.51.
04) Ve NE hacia el hill entrance 53.20...
05) Ve up hasta lo alto de the hill y acepta "Kim'jael Indeed!" 53.22.
06) Ve sur to Thalassian Base Camp y haz "Kim'jael Indeed!" along with "Betrayed": mata the needed Blood Elves, lootea Kim'jael's Equipment boxes en ground y to Find Magus Rimtori's camp (ve a 60.31).
07) At the same coordinates as previous paso (60.31, #4 on map), de the Kaldorei Tome of Summoning (book on pedestal), entrega "Betrayed", acepta the next part.
08) At that same spot, do the next part of "Betrayed": click on an Arcane Focusing Crystal to summon Magus Rimtori y mata y lootea a her.  You may need to face some guardias first so be prepared.
09) Ve norte hacia el hill entrance (53.20, #2 on map)...
10) Ve up hasta lo alto de the hill y entrega "Kim'jael Indeed!" 53.22.  Acepta "Kim'jael's "Missing" Equipment".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[144] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #19]], text = [[
01) Drop down to The Shattered Strand 51.36 (be careful, its a long drop), luego do "Kim'jael's "Missing" Equipment": mata y lootea a Spitelash naga until Some Rune drops (low drop rate).
02) Sal de The Shattered Strand, (an exit is at 46.38, see map for more exits)..
03) Ve a Valormok y entrega "Betrayed" 22.51, acepta the next part.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) Head este hacia el hill entrance 53.20...
05) Ve up hasta lo alto de the hill y entrega "Kim'jael's "Missing" Equipment" 53.22.
06) At this point you should almost be lvl 54.  Farmea the rest de way to nivel 54.5 (10 bars into 54) on Blood Elves alrededor de Thalassian Base Camp alrededor de 58.28.  NOTES:  Blood Elves are squishy enemigos (enemigos that have 30% fewer health/armor, than the average mob that nivel), so they die relatively fast y yield good XP/hour.  They also are a good granja spot for Runecloth, which you will need for cloth donations y First Aid.  OPTIONAL:  Instead de grinding, you could go do BRD instance instead.
07) Usa la piedra de hogar a Orgrimmar.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[145] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #20]], text = [[
01) 54 Felwood
02) N/A
03) Ve NE to Magar's Cloth Goods y entrega the 60 Runecloth hacia el Orc's Horde Cloth Quartermaster 64.51.
04) Ve norte to The Drag (up in Yelmak's Alchemy y Potions) y entrega "Bone-Bladed Weapons" 56.34.
05) N/A
06) If you need to, get new spells/abilities.    Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) Ve SW y up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Splintertree Post, Ashenvale.
08) Head norte to Felwood (entrada en 56.28 in Ashenvale)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[146] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #21]], text = [[
01) Ve norte a bit into Felwood to Emerald Sanctuary y get the FP de the Flight Master 52.82 (#1 on map).
02) Acepta "Forces of Jaedenar" 51.82.  And junto a you en tent, acepta "Verifying the Corruption" 51.82.
03) To the oeste just off de main path at Maybess Riverbreeze 47.83, acepta "Cleansing Felwood".
04) Start working on "A Sample of Slime...": clear the Cursed Ooze enemigos (slimes) en two green pools (one at alrededor de 41.72, y another one at alrededor de 42.68).  Eventually get 15 Felwood Slime Samples (once again, 15 is the max you can hold for WOTLK).  You don't need to get all of them now.
05) Ve norte a bit to Jaedenar entrance 40.58 y haz "Forces of Jaedenar": mata the required amount of Jaedenar enemigos en area.
06) Ve norte a bit alrededor de 40.56 y continue working on "A Sample of Slime...": mata y lootea a Tainted Oozes for getting at least 15 Felwood Slime Samples eventually.  You don't need to get all of them now.
07) Follow Bloodvenom River en middle of Felwood oeste to Bloodvenom Post 34.52 y acepta "Well of Corruption".  Luego at 35.53 "Wild Guardians" y "A Husband's Last Battle".
08) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master y get the FP there 34.54.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
09) Ve este y finish up collecting at least 15 Felwood Slime Samples for "A Sample of Slime..." by mata/looting the Tainted Oozes, alrededor de Bloodvenom Falls alrededor de 41.45 (#5 on map).
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[147] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #22]], text = [[
01) Ve al norte a bit en este side of el camino to Shatter Scar Vale alrededor de 41.42 y haz "Verifying the Corruption": walk across one de craters en Vale to get it explored, y mata the required amount of Entropic fire elementals.
02) Sigue el camino principal NE to Irontree Woods y haz "Cleansing Felwood": mata y lootea a the Warpwood elementals.  There is more enemigos en Irontree Cavern entrance 56.17.
03) N/A
04) Sigue el camino principal NE (right before the Timbermaw Hold entrance) y acepta "Deadwood of the North" 65.8.
05) Drop down oeste to Felpaw Village alrededor de 63.9 y haz "Deadwood of the North": mata the needed Deadwood furbolgs.
06) Vuelve up to Nafien by the Timbermaw Hold entrance (65.8, #4 on map) y entrega "Deadwood of the North".  Acepta "Speak to Salfa".  Also entrega any feathers you may have (repeatable misión to increase rep).  NOTE:  Becoming friendlier with Timbermaw Hold will allow you to entra en their cueva without them attacking you y allowing you to get additional misiones y items de them.
07) Entra en Timbermaw Hold junto a you entrance 65.7 y go a través de cueva, make a right en middle after el puente to entra en Moonglade al norte.
08) Once in Moonglade, make a left y get the FP de the Wind Rider Master 32.67.
09) Exit Moonglade back to Timbermaw Hold (entrance 35.75 in Moonglade).
10) In Timbermaw Hold, make a right after the stairs to go into Winterspring..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[148] = {title = [[55 Winterspring]], text = [[
01) Right afuera of la cueva, acepta "Winterfall Activity" (28.35 in Winterspring).  Also entrega "Speak to Salfa".
02) Sigue el camino principal sur to Donova Snowden 31.45 y acepta "Threat of the Winterfall".  Entrega "The New Springs", acepta "Strange Sources".  Also entrega "It's a Secret to Everybody", SKIP "The Videre Elixir".  NOTE:  You do not have to wait para NPC, just sal de..
03) Sigue el camino principal este y just to your left as you entra en Everlook acepta "Are We There, Yeti?" 61.38.
04) De Felnok Steelspring under the blue tent 62.39, entrega "Felnok Steelspring", SKIP "Chillwind Horns" (for now).
05) TBC, 4b) Back in Everlook by the cage 62.38, acepta "Ursius of the Shardtooth".
06) Sur in Everlook, entra en Posada y make Everlook your new home de the Innkeeper 61.39.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
07) Also en Posada acepta "The Everlook Report", "Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff" y "Sister Pamela".
08) Ve a Everlook's Bank 61.37 y put the following items in there:  15 Blood Amber, Felwood Slime Samples, Everlook Report, Studies in Spirit Speaking any Core of Elements y (if you have it) Deadwood Ritual Totem.
09) Sigue el camino principal sur to discover Darkwhisper Gorge at 60.74 para misión "Strange Sources".
10) Usa la piedra de hogar a Everlook.
11) TBC, 9b) As you go questing, keep an eye out for a bear named Ursius /target (he looks just like all other other ones), if so, mata him for "Ursius of the Shardtooth", but don't intentionally try to find him now:
12) Exit Everlook hacia el right, luego ve este to Winterfall Village alrededor de 67.35 y haz"Winterfall Activity": mata the required amount of Winterfall furbolgs.  NOTE:  This place is usually busy with lvl 60+ players farming Winterfall Firewater here.  If that's the case luego this misión can be skipped (there is no follow up).  You can also skip this if you are only nivel 53 right now as it is kind of a higher nivel misión.
13) Justo al norte de Everlook (alrededor de the mountains 61.33) do part of "Wild Guardians": mata 15 Raging Owlbeasts /target.  Also start working on "Are We There, Yeti?" by mata/looting Ice Thistle Yeti.  Also try to finish "Ursius of the Shardtooth" by finding y killing Ursius /target (white bear), he patrols alrededor de en mountains.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[149] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #24]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste starting alrededor de 54.37 y finish "Wild Guardians" (mata 15 Ragged Owlbeasts /target) y continue working on "Are We There, Yeti?" (mata y lootea a Rogue Ice Thistle yeti).  Also work en next paso también:
02) Do "Threat of the Winterfall": mata the required amount of Winterfall furbolgs.  There are two camps of these enemigos (one at alrededor de 42.43 y one at alrededor de 32.37).  While doing this misión you should find an item, which starts "Winterfall Firewater" (acepta it).
03) Ve SW to Donova Snowden 31.45 y entrega "Strange Sources", "Threat of the Winterfall" y "Winterfall Firewater", acepta "Falling to Corruption".
04) Hearth (or vuelve) to Everlook.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) TBC, 4b) IF YOU DID IT:  Back in Everlook by the cage 62.38, entrega "Ursius of the Shardtooth".
06) Ve SE a bit to Ice Thistle Hills alrededor de 66.42 (#7 on map) y finish "Are We There, Yeti?": mata y lootea a Yeti para Thick Yeti Fur.
07) Hearth (or vuelve) to Everlook y cerca de entrance junto a hut, entrega "Are We There, Yeti?" 61.38, acepta the next part.
08) Ve SE a bit back to Ice Thistle Hills alrededor de 66.42 y haz "Are We There, Yeti?": mata y lootea a Ice Thistle Matriarchs y Ice Thistle Patriarchs para 2 horns (low drop rate).  There is a higher concentration of these enemigos in la cueva entrance up at 68.42.
09) Hearth (or vuelve) to Everlook y entrega  "Are We There, Yeti?" 61.38, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  If you are deep in la cueva you can just die on purpose y res at spirit to get back to Everlook.
10) Do part of "Are We There, Yeti?": at Legacki 62.39 /target (junto a Posada), use Umi's Mechanical Yeti misión item to scare her.
11) Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
12) Ve a Everlook's Bank 61.37 y put the following items into it:  Umi's Mechanical Yeti y (if you have it) Winterfall Ritual Totem.  Get out de Bank: 15 Blood Amber.
13) Exit Everlook to your right y ve a the Wind Rider Master 60.36 to vuela a Bloodvenom Post, Felwood.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[150] = {title = [[56 Felwood]], text = [[
01) Once at Bloodvenom Post, entrega "Wild Guardians" 35.53, SKIP the next part (for now).
02) TBC, 1a) At the Wind Rider Master 34.54 vuela a Emerald Sanctuary.
03) At Emerald Sanctuary entrega "Forces of Jaedenar" 51.82, acepta "Collection of the Corrupt Water".  And junto a you en tent, entrega "Verifying the Corruption" 51.82.
04) Ve oeste to Maybess Riverbreeze y entrega "Cleansing Felwood" 47.83.  Luego click the NPC again y talk to her to get a Cenarion Beacon.
05) Just sur a bit junto a main path, de Grazle (furblog 51.85), acepta "Timbermaw Ally" (no exclamation mark).
06) Ve sur to Deadwood Village y haz "Timbermaw Ally" along with "A Husband's Last Battle": mata the required amount of Deadwood furbolgs y also mata y lootea a Overlord Ror (gray colored furbolg 48.94).
07) Ve norte a bit along the main path to Grazle /target (51.85, #4 on map) y entrega "Timbermaw Ally".  Acepta "Speak to Nafien".
08) Ve up NW in Ruins of Constellas y haz "Well of Corruption": use your Hardened Flasket misión item en green moonwell there 32.67.
09) Sigue el camino principal norte to entra en Jaedenar entrance 41.58..
10) Ve oeste in Jaedenar y haz "Collection of the Corrupt Water": use your Empty Canteen misión item en green moonwell 35.60.
11) Ve norte to Bloodvenom Post y entrega "Well of Corruption" (34.52, #1 on map).  Wait a few seconds (do next paso while waiting), luego acepta "Corrupted Sabers".
12) Also at Bloodvenom Post, entrega "A Husband's Last Battle" 35.53.  NOTE:  Do not sell your Corrupted Soul Shards to a vendedor.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
13) TBC, 12) At Bloodvenom Post, ve a the Wind Rider Master 34.54 y vuela a Emerald Sanctuary.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[151] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) At Emerald Sanctuary entrega "Collection of the Corrupt Water" 51.82, SKIP "Seeking Spiritual Aid".
02) Ve oeste to Maybess Riverbreeze y entrega "Salve Via Hunting" 47.83.  NOTES:  If for some reason you do not have the 6 Corrupted Soul Shards, farmea on any mob in Felwood until you get them.  The misión is repeatable, but doesn't yield additional XP.  The reward item Cenarion Plant Salve is used to cleanse the various corrupted plants alrededor de Felwood y the reward you get de them is decent (but no XP).
03) Ve NW in Ruins of Constellas y haz "Corrupted Sabers": use your Winna's Kitten Carrier misión item en green moonwell there 32.67.
04) Ve norte to Bloodvenom Post y once you get there talk hacia el Corrupted Saber that is following you, luego entrega "Corrupted Sabers" 34.52.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) Sigue el camino principal NE to Felpaw Village y clear the enemigos alrededor de the Deadwood Cauldron at 60.6, or distract the enemigos some how (See Video), luego click en Cauldron to entrega "Falling to Corruption", acepta "Mystery Goo".
06) Ve NE, right before the Timbermaw Hold entrance y entrega "Speak to Nafien" 65.8.  Also entrega any feathers you may have (repeatable misión to increase rep).
07) Ve a través de cueva to get to Winterspring y right afuera of la cueva, entrega "Winterfall Activity" (28.34 in Winterspring).
08) Sigue el camino principal sur to Donova Snowden 31.45 y entrega "Mystery Goo", acepta "Toxic Horrors".  Luego if you are not nivel 56, farmea on any mob until you are.
09) Usa la piedra de hogar a Everlook.
10) Exit Everlook to your right y ve a the Wind Rider Master 60.36 to vuela a Orgrimmar, Durotar.
11) Once at Orgrimmar, get your nivel 56 spells/abilities.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[152] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) Sal de Orgrimmar sur y get en zeppelin (51.14 in Durotar) to ve a The Undercity.
02) At the UC ve a the Innkeeper y make it your new home 68.38.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Ve a the Bank en middle de UC 66.44 y get the following items out:  Felwood Slime Samples, Un'goro Slime Samples, Everlook Report y Studies in Spirit Speaking.  And if you have 60 extra Runecloth (for cloth donation) get that out también.  Put the following items in your bank:  Cenarion Beacon, any Corrupted Soul Shards y any Cenarion Plant Salves.
04) Find Harbinger Balthazad /target, he patrols alrededor de the bank (wearing a white shirt with a lantern), once you find him, acepta "A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands!".
05) If you have the 60 extra Runecloth, ve a the Magic Quarter y entrega "A Donation of Runecloth" 72.29, for undead faction.
06) WOTLK, 5b) If you need to, you can upgrade First Aid de the First Aid Trainer 73.55 at Rogues' Quarter.  NOTE: Runecloth Bandage requires skill 260 y Heavy Runecloth Bandage skill 290.
07) Ve SW to The Apothecarium y junto a Chemist Fuely 48.73 usa el/la two Testing Equipments (both red y green) to turn your Slime Samples into the misión items you need.  Luego entrega "A Sample of Slime..." y "... and a Batch of Ooze".  Acepta "Melding of Influences".  NOTE:  You can destroy any remaining Slime Samples to free bag space.
08) Ve a the Bank en middle de UC (66.44, #3 on map) y put the following items into it:  Encased Corrupt Ooze.   Get out de bank:  Nada Speed Potions, (if you have all of them) 30+ Dark Iron Scraps y 30+ Savage Fronds.  And there is a misión in Eastern Plaguelands that wants these items:  2 Thorium Bar, Golden Rod, 8 Hi-Explosive Bomb, 8 Unstable Trigger (get these out, either de the AH or bank if you can get all of them).  You can luego mail these items (including the 30+ Dark Iron Scraps y 30+ Savage Fronds) to yourself y retrieve them de the mailbox at Light's Hope in EPL later.
09) Sal de The Undercity y go este in Tirisfal Glades hacia el The Bulwark (83.69 in Tirisfal Glades)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[153] = {title = [[56 Western Plaguelands]], text = [[
01) Gira a la izquierda en main path as you entra en The Bulwark y entrega "A Call To Arms: The Plaguelands!" (83.69 in Tirisfal Glades), acepta "Scarlet Diversions".  Luego junto a you lootea the Box of Incendiaries to obtain a Flame in a Bottle.
02) Next to you, entrega "The Everlook Report" 83.68.  De this same NPC, completa "Argent Dawn Commission".  NOTE:  The trinket received called Argent Dawn Commission will allow you to recoge Scourgestones de undead enemigos en Plaguelands (both eastern y western).  Right-click it in your inventory to wear it.  As long as you have it on, this will allow you to increase your rep with The Argent Dawn, which will allow you to compra items such as Enriched Manna Biscuits later.
03) WOTLK, 2a) Get the Flight Path de the Bat Handler 84.70.
04) Ve a the other side of The Bulwark, y detrás de bigger tent acepta "A Plague Upon Thee" 83.72.
05) Ve este into Western Plaguelands (WPL) to Felstone Field y up en house, acepta "Better Late Than Never" (38.54 in WPL).
06) Entra en barn junto a house y click on Janice's Parcel 39.55 to entrega "Better Late Than Never".  Luego click Janice's Parcel again to acepta the next part of "Better Late Than Never".
07) Ve just NE a bit hacia el small Scarlet camp 41.52 y haz "Scarlet Diversions": clear the enemigos en area (you need to work quickly to avoid respawns) luego click en Command Tent to burn it y luego usa el/la Scourge Banner misión item at el campamento. (See Video)
08) Vuelve a The Bulwark (make a right on el camino) y entrega "Scarlet Diversions" (83.69 in Tirisfal Glades, #1 on map).  Acepta "The Scourge Cauldrons".
09) Make sure you are resupplied 83.70.  NOTE:  Make sure you save all Bone Fragments you find, you will need 30 of them for a later misión.
10) Ve a the other side of The Bulwark y entrega "The Scourge Cauldrons" 83.72, acepta "Target: Felstone Field".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[154] = {title = [[Undead - Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) At Felstone Field, do "Target: Felstone Field": mata y lootea a Cauldron Lord Bilemaw /target 37.57.  Luego click en Scourge Cauldron to entrega "Target: Felstone Field", acepta "Return to the Bulwark".
02) Vuelve a The Bulwark y entrega "Return to the Bulwark" (83.72 in Tirisfal Glades), acepta "Target: Dalson's Tears".
03) At Dalson's Tears, do "Target: Dalson's Tears": mata y lootea a Cauldron Lord Malvinious /target 46.52.  Luego click en Scourge Cauldron to entrega "Target: Dalson's Tears", acepta "Return to the Bulwark".
04) There is a small misión chain here at this granja that yields good XP:  Entra en Barn at Dalson's Tears y click on Mrs. Dalson's Diary 48.51 laying en ground to completa "Mrs. Dalson's Diary".
05) Find y mata y lootea a the Wandering Skeleton /target.  This one skeleton wanders alrededor de the NE side of Dalson's Tears.  He circles alrededor de the barn también.
06) Click en Outhouse 48.50 detrás de barn to completa "Locked Away".  Luego Farmer Dalson will spawn junto a Outhouse, mata y lootea a this zombie.
07) Ve up en house (junto a barn) y click en Locked Cabinet 47.50 to entrega "Locked Away".  Quest chain completa.
08) Vuelve a The Bulwark y entrega "Return to the Bulwark" (83.72 in Tirisfal Glades, #2 on map), acepta "Target: Writhing Haunt".
09) At The Writhing Haunt, do "Target: Writhing Haunt": mata y lootea a Cauldron Lord Razarch /target 53.66.  Luego click en Scourge Cauldron to entrega "Target: Writhing Haunt", acepta "Return to the Bulwark".
10) Entra en small house at The Writhing Haunt y acepta "The Wildlife Suffers Too" 54.65.
11) Vuelve a The Bulwark y entrega "Return to the Bulwark" (83.72 in Tirisfal Glades, #2 on map), acepta "Target: Gahrron's Withering".  Make sure you are resupplied.
12) At Gahrron's Withering, do "Target: Gahrron's Withering": mata y lootea a Cauldron Lord Soulwrath /target 63.59.  Luego click en Scourge Cauldron to entrega "Target: Gahrron's Withering", acepta "Return to the Bulwark".   NOTE:  We will turn this in later.
13) Ve este into Eastern Plaguelands (follow path on map) 5.38 in EPL..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[155] = {title = [[57 Eastern Plaguelands]], text = [[
01) Ve norte along Thondoril River to Tiron Fordring 5.38 y acepta "Demon Dogs", "Blood Tinged Skies" y "Carrion Grubbage".
02) Farmea SE to The Marris Stead 23.68 y acepta "To Kill With Purpose", "Un-Life's Little Annoyances" y "The Ranger Lord's Behest".
03) Ve sur to The Undercroft y down en crypt, de the Torn Scroll 24.78 laying en ground, acepta "Hameya's Plea".
04) Farmea este to Darrowshire to Pamela Redpath y entrega "Sister Pamela" 32.84, acepta "Pamela's Doll".
05) At Darrowshire do "Pamela's Doll": find the 3 parts to Pamela's Doll:  the head, the left side y right side.  These parts have multiple spawn locations alrededor de Darrowshire in each de 3 buildings en area (excluding the building where Pamela is at).  They look like little yellow things.  Search the buildings para 3 parts: big house 34.85, torn down house 35.85, small house 35.83, luego click one of them to combine them to make Pamela's Doll.  (See Video)
06) Vuelve a Pamela Redpath at Darrowshire y entrega "Pamela's Doll" ( 32.84, #4 on map).  Acepta "Auntie Marlene" y "Uncle Carlin".
07) Around southern EPL alrededor de 36.76, finish "Blood Tinged Skies": mata 30 Plaguebats.  Also do part of "Demon Dogs": mata 20 Plaguehound Runts.  And start working on "Carrion Grubbage": mata y lootea a Carrion enemigos para worm meat.  All of these enemigos are found in southern Eastern Plaguelands y the Carrion worm enemigos are all over Eastern Plaguelands.  Once you are nearing completion, work your way este hacia el next paso:
08) Farmea to Light's Hope Chapel 74.58 y acepta "The Restless Souls" y "Zaeldarr the Outcast".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[156] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #32]], text = [[
01) Ve norte a bit y entrega "Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff" 76.54.  Also de this NPC, if you have at least 20 Minion's Scourgestones, completa a "Minion's Scourgestones" (y dont consume the item received).
02) Next to you, entrega "Uncle Carlin" 76.54.  Acepta "Defenders of Darrowshire".
03) Get resupplied/repaired de Craftsman Wilhelm 75.54 junto a Forge.  NOTE:  If for some reason you are already Friendly with The Argent Dawn, luego stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits de the female dwarf Miranda Breechlock 76.54 by the tent.
04) WOTLK, 3a) You should be friendly now with The Argent Dawn, if so:  Right frente a Posada's Entrance, ve a Rayne 75.53 y if you have the 30 Savage Fronds (en mailbox?) acepta y entrega "Savage Fronds".
05) WOTLK, 3b) Also (if you are friendly with The Argent Dawn):  Entra en Posada y en back de the human with black hair 76.52 , acepta y entrega "Binding the Dreadnaught" (requires the 30 Dark Iron Scraps, that could be in your mailbox).
06) At the other side de Posada, de the human en horse y with your one Argent Dawn Valor Token you might have, acepta y entrega "They Call Me "The Rooster" 75.52.  If you dont have it yet, do this when you can.
07) If you were able to obtain the items needed for "That's Asking A Lot", then turn it in (at the dwarf Smokey LaRue by the Campfire, 75.52 ), accept "When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent".
08) North in Light's Hope, get the FP there from the Bat Handler 74.51.
09) OPTIONAL: The quest "Bolstering Our Defenses" 74.52 is a PvP tower capture misión that is optional y up to you if you would like to do it or not, my guide will not cover it further.  I don't recommend doing this if you are trying to nivel quickly.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[157] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #33]], text = [[
01) Ve SW to Corin's Crossing alrededor de 55.62 y haz "To Kill With Purpose": mata y lootea a the undead enemigos there to obtain Living Rot (work fast they only last 10 min), luego use your Mortar y Pestle misión item to combine 7 of them to make the item you need.  Also start working on "Defenders of Darrowshire": mata Gibbering Ghouls y luego talk hacia el spirit that spawns (don't need to finish this now though).
02) Just norte alrededor de 56.50, do part of "Demon Dogs" y "Un-Life's Little Annoyances": mata 5 Plaguehounds /target y 20 Noxious Plaguebats.  These enemigos are found en middle-eastern side of Eastern Plaguelands.
03) Farmea norte to Zul'Mashar (ramp entrada en 59.19 )..
04) Ve up into Zul'Mashar y haz "Hameya's Plea": mata y lootea a Infiltrator Hameya /target.  This troll patrols alrededor de frente a temple 65.13.  Stay away de the dirt mounds frente a temple as undeads will spawn cerca de them, it's better to wait until Infiltrator Hameya patrols up front for you to take on alone.  Also he hits hard so be prepared.
05) Finish up "Carrion Grubbage", "Demon Dogs" y "Un-Life's Little Annoyances": mata y lootea a Carrion enemigos para worm meat, mata 5 Frenzied Plaguehounds y mata 10 Monstrous Plaguebats.  These enemigos are found NE alrededor de the open fields of Eastern Plaguelands alrededor de 56.50.  NOTE:  You can find some more spirits for "Defenders of Darrowshire" alrededor de 61.35 de the Diseased Flayers, y you can find more en later pasos también.
06) GROUP 2+ Players (or could be soloable): Ve norte to Quel'Lithien Lodge entrance 47.17 y try to do "The Ranger Lord's Behest": mata the needed blood elf enemigos y entra en lodge, make a right, luego lootea the Quel'Thalas Registry (book laying on a bench 48.14 ).  This misión may be hard to solo.  If you are almost lvl 57, luego farmea to it before doing this misión.  You may need to distract the enemigos en lodge, grab the book y corre out some how.  If you cannot solo this, or find help luego it can be skipped.
07) Ve oeste to Plaguewood (starting at 44.26 ) y haz the following 3 misiones together:
08) "A Plague Upon Thee": lootea the Large Termite Mounds, these are spaced all alrededor de Plaguewood (see map).
09) "Defenders of Darrowshire": continue working on this by killing Cannibal Ghouls y talk hacia el spirits that spawn.  You will have more opportunities later to finish this.
10) If you have it do "When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent": entra en various ziggurats alrededor de Plaguewood y use Smokey's Special Compound misión item dentro de buildings.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[158] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #34]], text = [[
01) Ve oeste to Terrordale y en hut entrega "The Restless Souls" 11.29, SKIP the next part (dungeon).  And junto a you, acepta "Augustus' Receipt Book".
02) Do "Augustus' Receipt Book": go NE a bit hacia el Terrordale Posada (the largest building en area entrance 14.28 ) y go up en Posada, make a right y between two split open barriles lootea Augustus' Receipt Book 14.26 en ground.  NOTE:  Mata y lootea a all Crypt Fiends you see to start obtaining Crypt Fiend Parts (used for a later misión).
03) Vuelve a the hut in Terrordale y entrega "Augustus' Receipt Book" ( 11.29 , #1 on map).  NOTE:  You can now get resupplied de this NPC.
04) OPTIONAL:  Farmea on Crypt Fiend enemigos all alrededor de Terrordale to recoge 30 Crypt Fiend Parts.  This can be used for a later misión.  There is more en next paso también (but watch out para Elite):
05) Ve a través de long cueva entrance 12.25.  NOTES:  This cueva journey is not easy.  There is a lvl 60 elite spider /target (with a 1 hour respawn) that patrols back y forth hacia el 2 entrances of this cueva.  Try to sneak past it if you can.  If this cueva is too hard for you, luego another possible quick alternative is to take the Tower Gryphon ride de the Plaguewood Tower 19.27 hacia el Crown Guard Tower, as long as the horde has control over the towers that is.  Try to get all 30 Crypt Fiend Parts before leaving this area.  If you are still far off de that, luego you can skip getting the remaining ones.
06) Once you get out hacia el other side of la cueva (or take la torre ride), norte along Thondoril River at Tiron Fordring 5.38 , entrega "Demon Dogs" "Blood Tinged Skies" y "Carrion Grubbage".  Acepta "Redemption".  Simply talk to Tiron Fordring to completa "Redemption", acepta "Of Forgotten Memories".
07) Farmea SE to The Marris Stead 23.68 y entrega "To Kill With Purpose", "Un-Life's Little Annoyances" y (if you did it) "The Ranger Lord's Behest".  Acepta "Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee..." y "The Corpulent One".
08) TBC, 7b) Do "Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...": mata y lootea a Duskwing /target.  This large lvl 60 bat patrols just norte y NE of The Marris Stead alrededor de 28.63.
09) TBC, 7c) Vuelve a The Marris Stead 23.68 y entrega "Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...".
10) Ve sur to The Undercroft, go down en crypt y luego do "Zaeldarr the Outcast": mata y lootea a Zaeldarr the Outcast 24.78.  (See Video)
11) Behind the crypt, junto a wooden carreta, click en Mound of Dirt 24.79 to entrega "Hameya's Plea".
12) Next to you, do "Of Forgotten Memories": click en Loose Dirt Mound 25.80 that is junto a Tirion Fordring's Grave, luego mata y lootea a Mercutio Filthgorger (he has 3 bodyguards).  IMPORTANT TIP:  These enemigos spawn between the two dirt mounds (de the previous paso).  Mercutio Filthgorger spawns in first, luego his bodyguards soon after.  So act fast y immediately pull Mercutio Filthgorger away de his spawn point to avoid fighting his guardias too, as this fight can be really tough to do solo without this tactic.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[159] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #35]], text = [[
01) Ve NW to Tiron Fordring 5.38 y entrega "Of Forgotten Memories", acepta "Of Lost Honor".
02) 1b) Ve NE to Corin's Crossing alrededor de 54.64 y continue working on (if you still need to) "Defenders of Darrowshire": mata any Gibbering Ghouls or Diseased Flayers y luego talk hacia el spirit that spawns!  You will have another opportunity later to finish this.
03) Ve a the sur side of Light's Hope Chapel, luego entrega "Zaeldarr the Outcast" 74.58.
04) Ve norte in Light's Hope Chapel y entrega (if it's finished) "Defenders of Darrowshire" 76.54.
05) Next to you at Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff /target 76.54, entrega any Scourgestones you have.  If you haven't yet, save at least one Argent Dawn Valor Token for a later misión.  You can consume the rest to increase rep with The Argent Dawn.
06) Get repaired/resupplied de Craftsman Wilhelm 75.54 junto a Forge.
07) In the Posada, if you have the 30 Crypt Fiend Parts, acepta y entrega "Cryptstalker Armor Doesn't Make Itself..." (de Huntsman Leopold).
08) Ve norte a bit more in Light's Hope Chapel y entrega (if you did it) "When Smokey Sings, I Get Violent" 75.52.  If you turned this in, you can luego destroy Smokey's Special Compound.
09) If you still need to:  Next to you en human en horse y with your Argent Dawn Valor Token, acepta y entrega "They Call Me "The Rooster" 75.52.
10) Go NE a bit around 70.46 and finish (if you still need to) "Defenders of Darrowshire": kill any Gibbering Ghouls or Diseased Flayers and then talk to the spirit that spawns.
11) Grind north to Northdale and do "Of Lost Honor": loot the Symbol of Lost Honor 66.29 (under the lake).
12) TBC, 11b) Do "The Corpulent One": kill/loot Borelgore /target (lvl 60 big yellow worm, around 50.27)
13) IF YOU STILL NEED TO: Go SE to Light's Hope Chapel and turn in "Defenders of Darrowshire" (#3 on map) 76.54.
14) TBC, 12b) Go back to The Marris Stead 23.68 and turn in "The Corpulent One".
15) Grind all the way back west to Tiron Fordring ( 5.38 , #1 on map) and turn in "Of Lost Honor", accept "Of Love y Family".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[160] = {title = [[Undead - Tirisfal Glades]], text = [[
01) Ve sur en island of Caer Darrow in Western Plaguelands (use a Nada Speed Potion) y entrega "Of Love and Family" 66.75 in WPL.  SKIP the next part (Dungeon).
02) Usa la piedra de hogar a UC.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) At the Bank en middle de UC, put the following items into it: any remaining Crypt Fiend Parts, Savage Fronds, any Core of Elements y any Insignias.
04) Drop down este to Guild Creation y entrega "Better Late Than Never" 70.43, acepta "The Jeremiah Blues".
05) Underneath the bank de the Cockroach Vendor 68.44, entrega "The Jeremiah Blues", acepta "Good Luck Charm".
06) Find Harbinger Balthazad /target, he patrols alrededor de the bank (wearing a white shirt with a lantern), once you find him, acepta "The New Frontier".
07) Also if you still need to entrega 60 extra Runecloth (for cloth donation), ve a the Magic Quarter y entrega "A Donation of Runecloth" 72.29, for undead faction.
08) Sal de The Undercity y go este in Tirisfal Glades to The Bulwark (83.71 in Tirisfal Glades)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[161] = {title = [[58 Western Plaguelands]], text = [[
01) Gira a la derecha at The Bulwark y entrega "Return to the Bulwark" 83.72.
02) Next to you detrás de tent, entrega "A Plague Upon Thee" 83.72, acepta the next part.  NOTE:  If you have any remaining Plagueland Termites in your inventory, you can destroy them.
03) TBC, 2a) De the male blood elf 83.71 acepta "The So-Called Mark of the Lightbringer".
04) At the other side of The Bulwark, completa "Mission Accomplished!" 83.69.  Also acepta "All Along the Watchtowers".
05) If you have turned Friendly with The Argent Dawn, luego you can stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits junto a you de Argent Quartermaster Hasana 83.68.  These biscuits will help you nivel faster by receiving mana faster de consuming these biscuits.
06) Ve into Western Plaguelands to Felstone Field y up en house, entrega "Good Luck Charm" 38.54, acepta "Two Halves Become One".
07) Ve sur of Felstone Field alrededor de 37.58 y haz "Two Halves Become One": mata y lootea a the Jabbering Ghoul /target (only one mob spawn that patrols alrededor de la granja).  This mob drops Good Luck Other-Half-Charm.  Right-click this item in your inventory.
08) Vuelve up en house at Felstone Field y entrega "Two Halves Become One" (38.54, #5 on map).
09) Ve norte to Northridge Lumber Camp y haz "A Plague Upon Thee": clear the enemigos en lumber camp, click en Northridge Lumber Mill Crate 48.32 to place the termite barrel.  Luego click en spawned Termite Barrel on top de crate to entrega "A Plague Upon Thee", acepta the next part.  (See Video)
10) Ve NE down a long slope in Northridge Lumber Camp y acepta "Unfinished Business" 52.28.
11) Ve sur a bit y haz "Unfinished Business": mata the required amount of Scarlet humans en area.  The mages y knights are alrededor de 51.41.  NOTE: They share spawns with each other.  See next paso para medics y hunters:
12) Ve sur a bit hacia el small Scarlet camp y mata the needed medics y hunters alrededor de 52.44.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[162] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #38]], text = [[
01) Vuelve up NE in Northridge Lumber Camp, down the long slope y entrega "Unfinished Business" 52.28, acepta the next part.
02) Ve este a bit y haz "Unfinished Business": mata Huntsman Radley 58.36 /target.  See next paso para other named mob to mata:
03) Mata Cavalier Durgen /target.  He patrols alrededor de in la torre 55.24.  Also go up this tower y haz "The So-Called Mark of the Lightbringer" by looting the Holy Coffer.
04) Vuelve down in Northridge Lumber Camp y entrega "Unfinished Business" (52.28, #1 on map), acepta the next part.
05) Ve norte to Hearthglen y haz the last part of "Unfinished Business": go hasta lo alto de the watchtower 46.18 to completa the misión.  Just mount up y avoid the enemigos.  Having a healing potion on hand helps.  (Watch This Video to see a shortcut y how to do this misión).
06) Vuelve down in Northridge Lumber Camp y entrega "Unfinished Business" (52.28, #1 on map).
07) Make sure "The Wildlife Suffers Too" is finished: mata 8 Diseased Wolves /target.  These wolves are found mostly above Dalson's Tears granja.  They share spawns con spiders en area, so mata them if not enough wolves.  Work your way hacia el next paso:
08) Ve sur hacia el small house at The Writhing Haunt y entrega "The Wildlife Suffers Too" 54.65, acepta the next part.
09) Do "The Wildlife Suffers Too" (part 2): mata 8 Diseased Grizzly /target.  These bears are found norte y este of The Writhing Haunt.  They share spawns con spiders, so mata spiders if not enough bears.
10) Vuelve a the small house at The Writhing Haunt y entrega "The Wildlife Suffers Too" (54.65, #8 on map).  Acepta "Glyphed Oaken Branch".
11) Ve SW to Sorrow Hill y en house (up or down in it) entrega "Auntie Marlene" 49.79, acepta "A Strange Historian".
12) Do "A Strange Historian": junto a house your at, lootea Joseph Redpath's Monument en graveyard 50.77.  (See Video)
13) Entra en Ruins of Andorhal (bridge entrada en 49.72)..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[163] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #39]], text = [[
01) Gira a la izquierda at la torre y haz part of "All Along the Watchtowers": usa el/la Beacon Torch misión item at Tower Four 47.71.
02) Ve oeste y haz part of "All Along the Watchtowers": usa el/la Beacon Torch misión item at Tower One 40.72.  NOTE: You must usa el/la torch item right en doorway of these towers in order for it to work, don't waste your charges!
03) Ve norte y entra en the Andorhal Posada entrance 40.68, go upstairs y entrega "A Strange Historian" 39.67, acepta "The Annals of Darrowshire".  Also acepta "A Matter of Time".
04) Entra en the City Hall building en middle of Andorhal entrance 44.69 y haz "The Annals of Darrowshire": lootea the Annals of Darrowshire (blue book).  The actual Annals of Darrowshire book looks different de the others, it has a lighter tint en top portion de pages en book, unlike the rest which has a darker tint en top portion de pages. (See Video)
05) Ve norte y haz part of "All Along the Watchtowers": usa el/la Beacon Torch misión item at Tower Two 42.66.
06) Ve NE y haz the last part of "All Along the Watchtowers": usa el/la Beacon Torch misión item at Tower Three 44.63.
07) Ve este a bit y haz "A Matter of Time": usa el/la Temporal Displacer misión item cerca de silos alrededor de 47.63 luego mata the Temporal Parasites that spawn.  NOTE: The misión item only works en silos emitting blue beams of light.
08) Ve oeste y entra en the Andorhal Posada (entrance 40.68, #3 on map), go upstairs y entrega "A Matter of Time" y "The Annals of Darrowshire".  Acepta "Counting Out Time" y "Brother Carlin".
09) All alrededor de Ruins of Andorhal do "Counting Out Time": lootea the Small Lockboxes all alrededor de the broken down houses.  There is usually one at each broken down house.
10) Entra en the Andorhal Posada (entrance 40.68, #3 on map), go upstairs y entrega "Counting Out Time".  NOTES:  This misión is repeatable, but you will not get additional XP de it.  The misión reward Attuned Dampener can only be used on Araj the Summoner en middle of Andorhal, y there will be misiones later associated with killing him.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[164] = {title = [[TBC, 00) Ve oeste y make a left at The Bulwark y entrega "The So-Called Mark of the Lightbringer" (83.71 in Tirisfal Glades, #1 on map).  Wait a few seconds luego acepta "Defiling Uther's Tomb".]], text = [[
01) Entrega "A Plague Upon Thee" 83.72 in Tirisfal.
02) At the other side of The Bulwark entrega "All Along the Watchtowers" 83.69.  Acepta "Scholomance".  You can luego destroy the Beacon Torch item.
03) Next to you at Argent Officer Garush 83.68, entrega any Scourgestones you may have.  Luego usa el/la Argent Dawn Valor Token's received to increase your rep with The Argent Dawn.
04) Make sure you are resupplied.  You can stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits junto a you de Argent Quartermaster Hasana 83.68.  These biscuits will help you nivel faster by receiving mana faster de eating/drinking.
05) At The Bulwark entrega "Scholomance" 83.69, acepta "Skeletal Fragments".
06) Vuelve a Ruins of Andorhal alrededor de 40.69 in WPL y haz "Skeletal Fragments": mata y lootea a skeleton enemigos para 15 Skeletal Fragments.  Also keep grinding until you have collected 30 Bone Fragments for a later misión.
07) TBC, 6a) Ve SE to Uther's Tomb 52.84 y haz "Defiling Uther's Tomb": equip the misión item Corrupted Mark de Lightbringer, luego use it en tomb.
08) Ve oeste y make a right at The Bulwark y entrega "Skeletal Fragments" (83.69 in Tirisfal Glades, #2 on map), SKIP "Mold Rhymes With...".
09) Next to you at Argent Officer Garush 83.68, entrega any Scourgestones you may have.
10) If you are a class that uses mana, luego stock up on Enriched Manna Biscuits 83.68.  NOTE:  I personally compra about 600 biscuits.
11) TBC, 9a) At the other side of The Bulwark entrega "Defiling Uther's Tomb" 83.71.
12) Ve oeste in Tirisfal Glades y get en zeppelin 61.59 to ve a Orgrimmar.  While waiting, build up First Aid.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[165] = {title = [[Tauren - Mulgore]], text = [[
01) In Orgrimmar, ve a the Posada y make Orgrimmar your new home de the Innkeeper 54.68.
02) Ve a the Bank 50.69 y put your Enriched Manna Biscuits in there so that you only have about 160 left in your inventory.  Also put into the bank:  your stack of 30+ Bone Fragments, any extra Scourgestones, Extended Annals of Darrowshire y Attuned Dampener.  And get the following items out de bank:  Umi's Mechanical Yeti, Encased Corrupt Ooze, y your current stack of Core of Elements.
03) Cloth Donations are turned in NE at Magar's Cloth Goods hacia el Orc's Horde Cloth Quartermaster 64.51.  You may have already turned en 60 Runecloth to them en past.
04) Sube por spiral ramp junto a you, luego ve get new spells/abilities.
05) Cloth Donations are also turned in at Darkbriar Lodge (Valley of Spirits) de the Troll's Horde Cloth Quartermaster 38.88.  Following the guide you would still need to entrega 60 Mageweave Cloth y 60 Runecloth to them.  NOTE:  The "Additional Runecloth" misiones do NOT yield XP (only rep).
06) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[166] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #42]], text = [[
01) Once at TB, ve a The Elder Rise at Nara Wildmane y entrega "Glyphed Oaken Branch" 76.32.
02) Next to you en same room, de Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem, entrega "The New Frontier" 79.29, acepta "Rabine Saturna".
03) NOTE:  If you have 60 extra Runecloth, get them out (bank is at 47.59) y turn them in for cloth donation, Tauren faction 43.43.
04) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 47.50 y vuela a Moonglade (al norte).
05) Once in Moonglade, ve a Nighthaven y entrega "Rabine Saturna" 52.45, acepta "Wasteland".  Also acepta "A Reliquary of Purity". NOTE:  In order to acepta the purity misión, you need to have been en Dire Maul zone in Feralas before talking to Rabine Saturna in order to unlock the dialog option (which you also need to read) in order to get this misión.  If you can't get it, you can just skip it y ignore any future notations of it.
06) Usa la piedra de hogar a Orgrimmar.
07) 06b) At Orgrimmar, down below acepta "Taking Back Silithus" 48.66.
08) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Gadgetzan, Tanaris.
09) N/A
10) NW in Gadgetzan, do part of "Are We There, Yeti?": use Umi's Mechanical Yeti misión item to scare Sprinkle /target 51.27.
11) Ve a the Wind Rider Master (norte of Gadgetzan, 52.25) y vuela a Marshal's Refuge, Un'Goro Crater.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[167] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #43]], text = [[
01) At Marshal's Refuge finish "Are We There, Yeti?": use Umi's Mechanical Yeti misión item to scare Quixxil /target 44.9.  See Image of his location.
02) Ve just oeste of Marshal's Refuge y haz "Melding of Influences": engage a Primal Ooze /target (there is one at 39.17) y luego usa el/la Encased Corrupt Ooze misión item, luego mata y lootea a the Gargantuan Ooze that spawns.  NOTE:  If there is no Primal Ooze there, luego there is another one at 46.24.
03) Ve into Silithus entrance 29.22..
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[168] = {title = [[59 Silithus]], text = [[
01) As you entra en Silithus ve a the small camp on your left (Valor's Rest) y entrega "Wasteland" 82.19, acepta "The Spirits of Southwind".
02) Sigue el camino principal oeste to Cenarion Hold y entrega "Taking Back Silithus" 51.38, acepta "Securing the Supply Lines".
03) Next to you en Wanted Poster: Deathclasp 51.38, acepta "Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands" (Elite).
04) Ve up en Posada junto a you y acepta "Deadly Desert Venom" 52.39.
05) Ve up in Cenarion Hold y acepta "The Twilight Mystery" 50.37.
06) Behind the moonwell, acepta "Secret Communication" 49.38.  And IF YOU ARE LVL 60 acepta: "Abyssal Contacts", y (junto a you) "Twilight Geolords".
07) Next to you, acepta "Report to General Kirika" 49.37.
08) At the Wind Rider Master 49.37 in Cenarion Hold, get the FP.
09) Entra en building junto a you y acepta "Dearest Natalia" 49.34.
10) Ve sur to Southwind Village alrededor de 62.52 y haz "The Spirits of Southwind" along with "A Reliquary of Purity": mata 8 Tortured Druids y 8 Tortured Sentinels alrededor de the village y work your way up en village into the building y lootea the Dusty Reliquary 63.55.
11) Farmea/lootea all enemigos as you go NE to Valor's Rest y entrega "The Spirits of Southwind" (82.19, #1 on map), acepta "Hive in the Tower".
12) Vuelve down SW to Southwind Village y haz "Hive in the Tower": go hasta lo alto de the swarming bug tower 60.53 y click en Hive'Ashi Pod, luego mata y lootea a the Hive'Ashi Ambushers until you get the Encrusted Silithid Object.  Also while doing Southwind Village misiones you should find an item (which drops de the bugs), which starts "Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter", acepta it.  And keep grinding until you get it.
13) Farmea NE to Valor's Rest y entrega "Hive in the Tower" (82.19, #1 on map), acepta "Umber, Archivist".
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[169] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #45]], text = [[
01) Ve a the small camp above Staghelm Point alrededor de 66.21and do "Secret Communication": mata y lootea a the Twilight enemigos.  NOTE:  IF YOU ARE LVL 60 the misión "Abyssal Contacts" can be done here y multiple times later in this zone but my guide will not cover it or the follow ups, but its worth doing.  And keep the next paso in mind:
02) All alrededor de NE Silithus do "Deadly Desert Venom" along with "Securing the Supply Lines": mata y lootea a Stonelash Scorpids (scorpids), mata y lootea a Sand Skitterers (spiders), y mata 15 Dredge Strikers (snakes).
03) Ve a Cenarion Hold y entrega "Securing the Supply Lines" 51.38, acepta "Stepping Up Security".
04) Next to you, go up en Posada y entrega "Deadly Desert Venom" 52.39.  Acepta "Noggle's Last Hope".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) Ve up in Cenarion Hold y detrás de moonwell, entrega "Secret Communication" 49.38.  NOTE:  The repeatable misión "Encrypted Twilight Texts" does not yield XP, only rep con Cenarion Circle.  But save your additional Encryped Twilight Texts for a future misión.
06) Ve a the NW end of Silithus alrededor de 27.15and do "The Twilight Mystery": lootea the tablets en ground.  And mata y lootea a Dust Stormers & Whirling Invaders (wind elementals) until you get a total of 30 Core of Elements (used for a later misión), however if you are far off de the 30, you can optionally skip this.
07) All alrededor de the middle of Silithus do "Stepping Up Security": mata 20 Dredge Crushers.  Also do part of "Noggle's Last Hope": mata y lootea a Stonelash Pincers.  Work your way hacia el next paso:
08) SE en small horde camp, entrega "Report to General Kirika" 51.70, acepta "Scouring the Desert".  NOTE:  For "Scouring the Desert", keep an eye out for a Silithyst Geyser which looks like a glowing red thing all alrededor de Silithuis, click on it y you will get a buff, maintain the buff while bringing it back hacia el PVP Horde base y stand en teleporter looking thing, luego turn the misión in for good XP!
09) Farmea sur to Bronzebeard Encampment y entrega "Brann Bronzebeard's Lost Letter" 41.88.  Also at this same NPC, talk to him to do part of "Dearest Natalia".
10) Next to you at Frankal Stonebridge 41.89(sitting down at a tent), finish "Dearest Natalia" by talking to this NPC.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[170] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #46]], text = [[
01) All alrededor de southern Silithus finish "Noggle's Last Hope": mata y lootea a Stonelash Flayers (scorpids) y Rock Stalker (spiders).
02) Farmea norte to Cenarion Hold y justo afuera de the Posada, entrega "Stepping Up Security" 51.38.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
03) Ve up en Posada junto a you y entrega "Noggle's Last Hope" 52.39.  Luego junto a you, acepta "Noggle's Lost Satchel".
04) Ve up in Cenarion Hold y entrega "The Twilight Mystery" 50.37, acepta "The Deserter".
05) Entra en building junto a you y entrega "Dearest Natalia" 49.34, SKIP "Into The Maw of Madness" (group misión).
06) Ve SE to Ortell's Hideout (small cueva) y entrega "The Deserter" 67.70, acepta "The Twilight Lexicon".
07) Farmea NW to Twilight Base Camp y haz "The Twilight Lexicon": mata y lootea a the 3 named enemigos.  First one is Twilight Keeper Havunth /target.  This orc patrols alrededor de the Twilight Base Camp 41.43.  Also start working on (if you have the lvl 60 misión) "Twilight Geolords" by killing the Twilight Geolords (y you will see more of these enemigos en next 2 camps coming up).  See next pasos para other two:
08) Farmea oeste to Twilight Post y mata y lootea a Twilight Keeper Mayna /target (female human 26.37).  NOTE:  Feel free to farmea en Twilight enemigos here to obtain Encryped Twilight Texts.  You will need 10 for a future misión y you will have one more opportunity en next paso to get some more:
09) Ve sur to Twilight Outpost y mata y lootea a Twilight Keeper Exeter /target (red armored human with fiery sword 16.86).  NOTES:  You can avoid Hive'Zora & the Alliance camp by hugging the oeste side of Silithus mountains.  Also keep grinding en Twilight enemigos until you get 10 Encryped Twilight Texts, this will be used for an easy entrega misión later.  And make sure "Twilight Geolords" is finished now.
10) Ve right detrás de Bronzebeard Encampment hacia el mountain entrance 43.90 y try to do "Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands" (Elite): mata y lootea a Deathclasp /target.  This nivel 59 Elite scorpid is soloable but could give you some troubles.  If you cannot solo it, or find a group to help you, luego it can be skipped.  (See Video)
11) Also en same area of Deathclasp, do "Noggle's Lost Satchel": lootea Noggle's Satchel (yellow sack on ground 45.91).  (See Video)
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[171] = {title = [[Orc/Troll - Durotar]], text = [[
01) Farmea este to Ortell's Hideout (small cueva) y entrega "The Twilight Lexicon" 67.70, acepta "A Terrible Purpose".  Also acepta, y luego entrega "True Believers".  Also this misión is repeatable, but no additional XP.
02) Farmea back to Cenarion Hold y up en Posada entrega "Noggle's Lost Satchel" 52.39.
03) Ve up in Cenarion Hold y en building, entrega "A Terrible Purpose" 49.34, SKIP "Into The Maw of Madness" (requires group).  Also, IF YOU ARE LVL 60 entrega "Twilight Geolords" (by the moonwell), NOTE: "Vyral the Vile" is a solable misión that can be done, but wont be covered here.
04) As you exit the building, make a left y go all the way hasta lo alto de la torre y entrega (if you did it) "Wanted - Deathclasp, Terror of the Sands" 51.34.
05) Hearth (or fly) to Orgrimmar.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
06) In Orgrimmar, ve a the Bank 50.69 y get the following items out:  Extended Annals of Darrowshire y your stack of 30+ Bone Fragments.  Also, (IF you still need to, y have them), get out: 30 Savage Fronds, 30 Dark Iron Scraps.  NOTE:  30 Core of Elements could already be in your inventory, if not get them out too (if you have them).  You can put into the bank any remaining Encrypted Twilight Text you may have.
07) Sal de Orgrimmar sur y get en zeppelin (51.14 in Durotar) to ve a The Undercity.
08) Once en UC, go down in The Apothecarium y entrega "Melding of Influences" 47.73.
09) Ve up hacia el Bat Handler 63.49 y vuela a Light's Hope Chapel, Eastern Plaguelands.
10) Once at Light's Hope Chapel, entra en Posada y de the female human 76.52 sitting en table, acepta y entrega The Elemental Equation.
11) Also en Posada de Rohan 76.53 (in purple standing cerca de entrance), acepta y entrega "Bonescythe Digs".
12) ONLY do the following 3 if you still need to:
13) Back en Posada de Korfax 76.52 (human with black hair), acepta y entrega "Binding the Dreadnaught".
14) Also en Posada de Huntsman Leopold 76.53 (balding male standing cerca de entrance), acepta y entrega "Cryptstalker Armor Doesn't Make Itself...".
15) Justo afuera de the Posada on your left, acepta y entrega "Savage Flora" 75.53.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[172] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #48]], text = [[
01) Outside en campfire / tent, entrega "Brother Carlin" 76.54, acepta "Villains of Darrowshire".  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.  NOTE:  "Heroes of Darrowshire" (y all follow up misiones) is a misión chain you could do if you have a group, y it's worth doing, especially later when you get the chance.
02) Ve oeste to Blackwood Lake y haz "Villains of Darrowshire": lootea Horgus' Skull under the water (look para purple glow 47.44).  See next paso para other item to lootea:
03) Ve sur to The Infectis Scar y lootea Shattered Sword of Marduk 49.60.  Look para pink glow.
04) Vuelve a Light's Hope Chapel en campfire / tent y entrega "Villains of Darrowshire" ( 76.54, #1 on map).
05) Ve SW to Corin's Crossing 55.62 y farmea en enemigos there until your Hearthstone cooldown is up, luego Usa la piedra de hogar a Orgrimmar.  Also, another decent grinding spot is The Noxious Glade 70.45.  ALTERNATIVELY:  If you did not do "The Ranger Lord's Behest", luego you could try that now:  Ve norte to Quel'Lithien Lodge entrance 47.17 y mata the needed blood elf enemigos y entra en lodge, make a right, luego lootea the Quel'Thalas Registry (book laying on a bench 48.14).  You may need to distract the enemigos en lodge, grab the book y corre out some how.  If you still cannot solo this, or find help luego it can be skipped. .  Also, you can do (if you still need to) "Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...": mata y lootea a Duskwing /target.  This lvl 60 bat patrols just above The Marris Stead.  And: "The Corpulent One", Borelgore /target (lvl 60, alrededor de 50.27).  These get accepted/turned in at The Marris Stead 23.68.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[173] = {title = [[60 Winterspring]], text = [[
01) After you have Hearthed to Orgrimmar, ve a the Bank 50.69 y put the following items into it:  any remaining Core of Elements, Bone Fragments, Savage Fronds, Dark Iron Scraps y any Insignias.
02) Ve up hacia el Wind Rider Master 45.64 y vuela a Bloodvenom Post, Felwood.
03) At Bloodvenom Post, acepta "Wild Guardians" 35.53.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
04) Ve NE to Irontree Woods (alrededor de 50.23 in Felwood) y haz "Toxic Horrors": mata y lootea a Toxic Horrors (green water elementals).
05) Ve through Timbermaw Hold entrance 65.7 y make a right en middle after el puente to entra en Moonglade al norte.
06) Once in Moonglade, ve a Nighthaven y at Umber, entrega "Umber, Archivist" 45.36 or could be at 48.40, acepta "Uncovering Past Secrets".
07) Ve into Nighthaven y entrega "A Reliquary of Purity" 52.45, SKIP "Shards of the Felvine" (Dungeon).  Also entrega "Uncovering Past Secrets".
08) Vuelve a Umber at Nighthaven y completa "Under the Chitin Was..." (48.40 or could be at 45.36, #6 on map).
09) Exit Moonglade en SW path to vuelve a Timbermaw Hold (36.72 in Moonglade).
10) In Timbermaw Hold, make a right after the stairs (NOT el puente) to go into Winterspring..
11) Ve sur to Donova Snowden (31.45 in Winterspring) y entrega "Toxic Horrors", acepta "Winterfall Runners".
12) Try to do "Winterfall Runners": try to find the pack of Winterfall Runners (three lvl 57s) that patrols the main path de the Timbermaw Hold cueva 28.34 to Winterfall Village 68.38 y mata y lootea a them para Winterfall Crate.  See map for exact patrol path.  If after making one pass y you cannot find these enemigos, luego this can be skipped for now.
13) If (or when ever) you have completed "Winterfall Runners", go oeste to Donova Snowden (31.45, #11 on map) y turn it in.  Acepta "High Chief Winterfall" .  NOTE:  My guide will not cover "High Chief Winterfall".
14) Sigue el camino principal este to Everlook.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[174] = {title = [[Guía de Leveo - Sección #50]], text = [[
01) Just to your left as you entra en Everlook (junto a hut) entrega "Are We There, Yeti?" 61.38.  Luego completa (if you have the engineering profession) "A Yeti of Your Own".
02) De Felnok Steelspring under the blue tent 62.39, acepta "Chillwind Horns".
03) Back in Everlook by the cage 62.38, acepta "Luck Be With You" (Elite) y (if you don't have it yet) "Ursius of the Shardtooth".
04) Entra en Posada y make Everlook your new home de the Innkeeper 61.39.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
05) Ve sur to Frostwhisper Gorge entrance 59.66 y start working on "Luck Be With You" (Elite): lootea Frostmaul Shards.   Just try to distract the giants to lootea the shards.  Try to sneak in y take as much as you can, you can return here later to get more.
06) Usa la piedra de hogar a Everlook.
07) Ve just norte of Everlook en mountain slopes (starting at 61.32) y haz (if you still need to) "Ursius of the Shardtooth": keep grinding on enemigos while working norte along the mountain slopes y luego mata Ursius /target (lvl 56 bear) when he shows up.  See map for his patrol path.
08) Hearth (or vuelve a Everlook), by the cage 62.38, y entrega (if its done) "Luck Be With You", luego acepta y entrega "Cache of Mau'ari".  Also entrega (if you still need to) "Ursius of the Shardtooth", acepta "Brumeran of the Chillwind".  NOTE:  The Cache of Mau'ari allows you to entrega E'kos for a temporary stat boost as long as the item remains in your bags.
09) Ve sur (starting alrededor de 55.47) y haz "Brumeran of the Chillwind": mata Brumeran /target (lvl 58 Chimera).  See map for his patrol path.
10) If you need to, finish "Luck Be With You": go sur to Frostwhisper Gorge (entrance 59.66, #5 on map) y lootea Frostmaul Shards.  Distract the elite giants y sneak in to lootea the shards.
        ]], }
SKquests_GuideES.Horde[175] = {title = [[Tauren - Mulgore]], text = [[
01) Ve este hacia el Owl Wing Thicket entrance 64.59 y haz "Wild Guardians": mata Moontouched Owlbeasts.
02) Once your Hearthstone cooldown is less than 5 minutes (keep grinding on owls until luego), vuelve a Everlook (Don't Hearth) y back by the cage, entrega "Brumeran of the Chillwind", SKIP "Shy-Rotam".  Also, entrega (if you still need to) "Luck Be With You".
03) Exit Everlook to your right y ve a the Wind Rider Master 60.36 y vuela a Bloodvenom Post, Felwood.
04) At Bloodvenom Post, entrega "Wild Guardians" 35.53, acepta the next part.
05) Usa la piedra de hogar a Everlook.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
06) Ve norte of Everlook alrededor de 65.21 y haz "Wild Guardians": mata 10 Berserk Owlbeasts.  While questing here you might find an called Blue-feathered Necklace, which starts "Guarding Secrets", acepta it.
07) Justo al oeste de you do "Chillwind Horns": mata y lootea a Chillwind Ravagers.  Once finished, keep grinding until your Hearthstone cooldown is less than 11 minutes.
08) Die on purpose to get back to Everlook.
09) Ve a the Wind Rider Master 60.36 y vuela a Bloodvenom Post, Felwood.
10) At Bloodvenom Post, entrega "Wild Guardians" 35.53.  Also entrega (if you found the item) "Guarding Secrets", acepta the next part.
11) At Bloodvenom Post, ve a the Wind Rider Master 34.54 y vuela a Thunder Bluff, Mulgore.
12) Once at TB, ve a The Elder Rise to Nara Wildmane 76.32 y entrega "Guarding Secrets".
13) Usa la piedra de hogar a Everlook.  Make sure you are repaired/resupplied.
14) In Everlook, de Felnok Steelspring under the blue tent 62.39, entrega "Chillwind Horns", acepta "Return to Tinkee".  NOTE:  You can turn this in next time you head to Burning Steppes.
15) At this point you should be very close to nivel 60.  I usually farmea the rest de way to nivel 60 en Owl Wing Thicket (entrance 64.59, #1 on map).  But here is a list of other things you could do instead de owl grinding:
        ]], }
